msgctxt "MsgDjinnInfoText"
msgid "03129"
msgstr ""
"The four elements are\n"
"the basic building\n"
"blocks of all matter.{page_break}"
"The elemental spirits\n"
"are called Djinn.{page_break}"
"The four elements are\n"
"Venus for Earth,\n"
"Mercury for Water,{page_break}"
"Mars for Fire, and\n"
"Jupiter for Wind.{page_break}"
"Each element has many\n"
"Djinn."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "03130"
msgstr ""
"When you set a Djinni, its\n"
"elemental power may\n"
"change your class{page_break}"
"or Psynergy. In battle,\n"
"you can unleash the\n"
"powers of set Djinn."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "03131"
msgstr ""
"When a Djinni is standing\n"
"by, you can use it\n"
"to summon in battle.{page_break}"
"To use a summon\n"
"immediately, put your\n"
"Djinn on standby before{page_break}"
"battle. But be careful,\n"
"because changing set\n"
"Djinn to standby changes{page_break}"
"your class and Psynergy."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "03132"
msgstr ""
"If you have a standby\n"
"Djinni in battle, you\n"
"can use it to summon.{page_break}"
"After summoning, the\n"
"Djinni will be in\n"
"recovery until it has{page_break}"
"recovered all its\n"
"power. Recovering Djinni\n"
"cannot be unleashed{page_break}"
"or used to summon."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "03133"
msgstr ""
"If a Djinni's power is\n"
"used to summon, the\n"
"Djinni enters recovery.{page_break}"
"After it has recovered\n"
"its power, it will set\n"
"itself once again."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "03134"
msgstr ""
"When a Djinni is set to\n"
"an Adept, its power\n"
"may change the Adept's{page_break}"
"class. Find your own\n"
"unique combinations of\n"
"Djinni to improve your{page_break}"
"characters' classes."

msgctxt "message"
msgid "03135"
msgstr ""
"Psynergy is a mental\n"
"power. People who wield\n"
"it are called Adepts.{page_break}"
"Psynergy can change\n"
"with class changes or\n"
"when you go up a level.{page_break}"
"Try changing your\n"
"class to earn new\n"
"Psynergy."

msgctxt "MsgDjinnTutorialGive"
msgid "03136"
msgstr ""
"To give your Djinni to\n"
"someone else, move it\n"
"like this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgDjinnTutorialSetAfterGive"
msgid "03137"
msgstr ""
"After choosing who will\n"
"take the Djinni, you\n"
"can set it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgDjinnTutorialClassPsynergy"
msgid "03138"
msgstr ""
"When your class changes,\n"
"the Psynergy you can use\n"
"may also change.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgDjinnTutorialSetChanges"
msgid "03139"
msgstr ""
"Setting a Djinni changes\n"
"your attributes and\n"
"maybe even your class.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgDjinnTutorialPowers"
msgid "03140"
msgstr ""
"Each Djinni has\n"
"different powers.{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgDjinnTutorialUnleash"
msgid "03141"
msgstr ""
"Once we are set, you\n"
"can unleash us to\n"
"use our powers.{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgDjinnTutorialDemonstrate"
msgid "03142"
msgstr ""
"So, let me demonstrate\n"
"the power of my attack,\n"
"{actor_name:1}.{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgTutorialUnleashed"
msgid "03143"
msgstr ""
"See! When you unleashed\n"
"me, I attacked with my\n"
"mighty stone-cleaver!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTutorialStandby"
msgid "03144"
msgstr ""
"After being unleashed,\n"
"we Djinn will then\n"
"stand by to be summoned...{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgDjinnTutorialSummon"
msgid "03145"
msgstr ""
"If you have standby\n"
"Djinn, you can summon\n"
"even greater powers!{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgDjinnTutorialUnleashCommand"
msgid "03146"
msgstr ""
"Choose this command\n"
"to unleash me in\n"
"battle, OK?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "03147"
msgstr ""
"Then you can summon\n"
"even greater powers!{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgDjinnTutorialRecovery"
msgid "03148"
msgstr ""
"After a Djinni has been\n"
"used to summon, it must\n"
"spend time in recovery.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgDjinnTutorialSetAgain"
msgid "03149"
msgstr ""
"And after we recover, we\n"
"will set ourselves again\n"
"and be ready to attack.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgDjinnUnleashHint"
msgid "03150"
msgstr ""
"That's all you have to do\n"
"to unleash a set Djinni!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgWorldMapOh"
msgid "03151"
msgstr "Oh!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "03152"
msgstr "A traveling warrior!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "03153"
msgstr ""
"And I see you're an\n"
