"when winter comes...{page_break}"
"But still...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeWhatWasThatAlchemyThatKraden"
msgid "07298"
msgstr ""
"What was that \"Alchemy\"\n"
"that Kraden was always\n"
"researching?{page_break}"
"I feel it was\n"
"something that was\n"
"better left alone...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeEarthquakesStillStrikeOnceInA"
msgid "07299"
msgstr ""
"Earthquakes still strike\n"
"once in a while...{page_break}"
"It gives me the\n"
"chills every time...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeEvenIfTheEruptionHadNo"
msgid "07300"
msgstr ""
"Even if the eruption\n"
"had no relation to\n"
"Alchemy...{page_break}"
"I still don't want\n"
"Kraden to come back\n"
"to the village.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeEveryTimeTheGroundShakesI"
msgid "07301"
msgstr ""
"Every time the ground\n"
"shakes, I worry there\n"
"will be another eruption.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeTheMountainIsApparentlyStillCasting"
msgid "07302"
msgstr ""
"The mountain is apparently\n"
"still casting Psynergy\n"
"Stones about.{page_break}"
"People who have been\n"
"beyond the gate say\n"
"they've seen them{page_break}"
"beside the roadside.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeIfThePsynergyStonesInThe"
msgid "07303"
msgstr ""
"If the Psynergy Stones\n"
"in the mountain\n"
"continue to be scattered...{page_break}"
"Mt. Aleph won't have\n"
"any Psynergy Stones left\n"
"someday.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeTheNorthwestFaceOfMtAleph"
msgid "07304"
msgstr ""
"The northwest face of Mt.\n"
"Aleph was all scorched by\n"
"a river of lava.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeTheySayTheLavaLookedLike"
msgid "07305"
msgstr ""
"They say the lava looked\n"
"like the bowels of the\n"
"earth had spilt forth.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeTheGreatHealersAreTooAfraid"
msgid "07306"
msgstr ""
"The Great Healers are\n"
"too afraid to go to Sol\n"
"Sanctum anymore.{page_break}"
"They have nothing to fear.\n"
"Their Psynergy should\n"
"protect them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeTheHealersAreSupposedToGuard"
msgid "07307"
msgstr ""
"The healers are supposed\n"
"to guard Sol Sanctum.\n"
"How can they not go in?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeWonderBeyondFence"
msgid "07308"
msgstr ""
"I can't stop wondering\n"
"what lies beyond\n"
"this fence.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeIsJennaBackYet"
msgid "07309"
msgstr ""
"Oh, {pause_20_skippable}it's {actor_name:1}, isn't it?\n"
"Is {pause_20_skippable}{actor_name:6}{pause_20_skippable} back "
"yet?{page_break}"
"Promise me, {actor_name:1}...\n"
"{pause_20_skippable}Promise me you'll bring {actor_name:6}\n"
"with you next time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValePromiseMeIsaacPromiseMeYoull"
msgid "07310"
msgstr ""
"Promise me, {actor_name:1}...\n"
"{pause_20_skippable}Promise me you'll bring\n"
"{actor_name:6} back home.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeYouDidntBringJennaWithYou"
msgid "07311"
msgstr ""
"You didn't bring\n"
"{actor_name:6} with you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeIUsedToPlayHere"
msgid "07312"
msgstr ""
"I still remember when\n"
"{actor_name:5} and I used to\n"
"play here...*Sniff*{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeFelixMustBeProtectingJennaIm"
msgid "07313"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} must be\n"
"protecting {actor_name:6}...\n"
"I'm sure of it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07314"
msgstr ""
"I was trying to catch that\n"
"fish, and you killed it.\n"
"Why did you do that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07315"
msgstr ""
"So there were\n"
"monstrous fishes\n"
"in this river?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeThePsynergyStoneIsGone"
msgid "07316"
msgstr ""
"Hey!{pause_20_skippable} Where'd that\n"
"Psynergy Stone go?\n"
"It's gone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07317"
msgstr ""
"All that's left is a\n"
"big hole in my roof.{page_break}"
"But the memory of the\n"
"eruption won't go away,\n"
"even once I've fixed it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeMemoriesOfThisCottage"
msgid "07318"
msgstr ""
"You must have so many\n"
"memories of this\n"
"cottage, don't you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07319"
msgstr ""
"I thought so. You\n"
"used to visit Kraden\n"
"a lot, {actor_name:1}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07320"
msgstr ""
"I understand. You\n"
"don't have time to\n"
"dwell on old memories...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeMtAlephsEruptionWasSoPowerful"
msgid "07321"
msgstr ""
"Mt. Aleph's eruption was\n"
"so powerful, it caused\n"
"the continent to crack!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeIFeltAnotherOne"
msgid "07322"
msgstr "Aghh!{pause_20_skippable} I felt another one!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07323"
msgstr ""
"They've been going on\n"
"for a while. I can't even\n"
"sleep at night!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeTheySayTheDangerIsGone"
msgid "07324"
msgstr ""
"They say the danger is\n"
"gone, even though the\n"
"earthquakes continue...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeNoTravelersSinceTheEruption"
msgid "07325"
msgstr ""
"I wonder why we haven't\n"
"seen any travelers\n"
"since the eruption...{page_break}"
"Do you know why,\n"
"{actor_name:1}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07326"
msgstr ""
"Oh, the bridge to the\n"
"south was ruined?\n"
"That explains it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07327"
msgstr ""
"You don't know either?\n"
"It's not like we banned\n"
"visitors after the eruption.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeAdventuresBeyondFence"
msgid "07328"
msgstr ""
"I have a feeling my\n"
"adventures will begin\n"
"once I pass this fence.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07329"
msgstr ""
"There are definitely\n"
"monstrous fish in this\n"
"river.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07330"
msgstr ""
"No ordinary fish could\n"
"make a splash like\n"
"that!{page_break}"
"That would take a\n"
"MONSTER FISH!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07331"
msgstr ""
"Aww.. I wish I could\n"
"show that fish to\n"
"everyone...{page_break}"
"Then I could prove to\n"
"everyone that I was\n"
"right!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07332"
msgstr ""
"You mean it wasn't just\n"
"monstrous, but was\n"
"actually a monster?{page_break}"
"\n"
"Wow! That's incredible.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeEruptionTooMuchForPeople"
msgid "07333"
msgstr ""
"The impact from the\n"
"eruption was too much for\n"
"the people of Vale.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeLonelyWithoutKraden"
msgid "07334"
msgstr ""
"I wonder why I feel so\n"
"lonely whenever I come\n"
"here...{page_break}"
"I wasn't even that\n"
"close to Kraden...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeTheEarthquakesArentCausedByEruptions"
msgid "07335"
msgstr ""
"The earthquakes aren't\n"
"caused by eruptions.{page_break}"
"I think they're from\n"
"the continent splitting\n"
"into two.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeAhhICantStandTheseEarthquakes"
msgid "07336"
msgstr ""
"Ahh... I can't stand\n"
"these earthquakes!\n"
"I wish they'd stop!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeTheSmokeFromMtAlephIsnt"
msgid "07337"
msgstr ""
"The smoke from Mt. Aleph\n"
"isn't thick at all.\n"
"It looks okay now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeHavingNoTravelersIsNoFun"
msgid "07338"
msgstr ""
"Having no travelers\n"
"is no fun at all...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultWarriorsWhoCaptured"
msgid "07339"
msgstr ""
"You! You're the warriors\n"
"who captured the thieves\n"
"a while back, aren't you?{page_break}"
"You've returned to Vault!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultYouveProbablyAlreadyHeardButThe"
msgid "07340"
msgstr ""
"You've probably already\n"
"heard, but the bridge\n"
"to Kalay has been fixed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultIWonderWhatHappenedToHammet"
msgid "07341"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what happened\n"
"to Hammet when he\n"
"went to Lunpa...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultRumorsThievesLunpa"
msgid "07342"
msgstr ""
"There have been rumors\n"
"of thieves from Lunpa\n"
"running wild,{page_break}"
"but we haven't been\n"
"paying them much mind.{page_break}"
"I wonder why those guys\n"
"have been so quiet\n"
"recently.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultTalkingMayorStrong"
msgid "07343"
msgstr ""
"Oh, it's you... I was just\n"
"talking about you with\n"
"our mayor.{page_break}"
"You're all really strong,\n"
"so I say, let those thieves\n"
"attack!{page_break}"
"They won't be able\n"
"to get past you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultVolcanoStaysCalm"
msgid "07344"
msgstr ""
"If the volcano stays calm\n"
"and the southern bridge\n"
"stays fixed,{page_break}"
"we won't have any\n"
"worries at all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultWarriorGuy"
msgid "07345"
msgstr ""
"Hey, it's that\n"
"warrior guy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07346"
msgstr "Yeah, and {actor_name:3}, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07347"
msgstr ""
"I'm so glad you\n"
"came back to Vault!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultWishVaultsElders"
msgid "07348"
msgstr ""
"I wish Vault's elders\n"
"were as brave as you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultGuysCheckJail"
msgid "07349"
msgstr ""
"Oh, so did you guys\n"
"check out the jail?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07350"
msgstr ""
"How did those thugs\n"
"break out of jail?{page_break}"
"The bars are\n"
"really strong.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07351"
msgstr ""
"The thieves broke out\n"
"of jail and got away.{page_break}"
"After you guys went\n"
"to all the trouble of\n"
"capturing them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultTheThievesEscapedButIThink"
msgid "07352"
msgstr ""
"The thieves escaped,\n"
"but I think it's all right.{page_break}"
"It's all part of a\n"
"divine plan.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07353"
msgstr "Bow wow wow wow!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultICantBelieveTheyreHereWhat"
msgid "07354"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe they're\n"
"here! What great timing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultWhenThoseGuysFromKalayCame"
msgid "07355"
msgstr ""
"When those guys from\n"
"Kalay came to fix the\n"
"bridge,{page_break}"
"they looked like\n"
"they were worried about\n"
"something.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultYeahSomeWarriorsFromKalayCame"
msgid "07356"
msgstr ""
"Yeah, some warriors from\n"
"Kalay came to Vault\n"
"asking about Hammet.{page_break}"
"Did Hammet get captured\n"
"after all?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultOnceDodonpaTook"
msgid "07357"
msgstr ""
"Once Dodonpa took over,\n"
"Lunpa's outlaws became no\n"
"better than thieves.{page_break}"
"There's gotta be a\n"
"reason those guys are\n"
"being so quiet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultThoseStupidThievesEscapedAndWe"
msgid "07358"
msgstr ""
"Those stupid thieves\n"
"escaped, and we don't\n"
"know where they are.{page_break}"
"They hated these kids\n"
"for capturing them.\n"
"I wonder if they'd...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultGreatEverythingSolved"
msgid "07359"
msgstr ""
"It would have been great\n"
"to have everything solved\n"
"before winter came.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultWatchingGuysMakes"
msgid "07360"
msgstr ""
"Watching you guys makes\n"
"me feel brave.{page_break}"
"I hope you'll tell\n"
"me all about your\n"
"travels sometime.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultGrownUpsAlways"
msgid "07361"
msgstr ""
"Grown-ups always get so\n"
"scared whenever anything\n"
"happens.{page_break}"
"I get so tired\n"
"of that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultNotLikeEasy"
msgid "07362"
msgstr ""
"It's not like it's\n"
"easy to grab the\n"
"key to that jail.{page_break}"
"They were able to get\n"
"the key out, so they know\n"
"the secret of the lock...{page_break}"
"That must have\n"
"been great!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultIKeepWonderingWasOurStatue"
msgid "07363"
msgstr ""
"I keep wondering... Was\n"
"our statue stolen because\n"
"my conduct was{pause_20_skippable}{pause_20_skippable} wrong?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultIfYouBringMeSomeBones"
msgid "07364"
msgstr ""
"If you bring me some\n"
"bones, I'll tell you\n"
"a secret.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07365"
msgstr "Owwwoooooh!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07366"
msgstr "Bow wow wow!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07367"
msgstr ""
"How did you know I\n"
"wanted one of these?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultWaahACatAteMyPrecious"
msgid "07368"
msgstr ""
"{text_effect:4}Waah! {reset_text_style}{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"A cat ate my\n"
"precious stone!{page_break}"
"That never should have\n"
"happened, but it's true.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultThoughtSawCatGetUp"
msgid "07369"
msgstr ""
"I thought I saw the\n"
"cat get up on the table\n"
"and paw that gemstone...{page_break}"
"and then our beloved\n"
"treasure was gone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultIfIdKnownThisWasGoing"
msgid "07370"
msgstr ""
"If I'd known this was\n"
"going to happen, I would\n"
"have sold it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultMyHusbandSaysMyCatAte"
msgid "07371"
msgstr ""
"My husband says my cat\n"
"ate the treasure, but I\n"
"don't believe him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultThePrisonersSaidTheyWantedTo"
msgid "07372"
msgstr ""
"The prisoners said they\n"
"wanted to break out of\n"
"jail before Colosso began.{page_break}"
"Colosso... Isn't that\n"
"the big festival in Tolbi?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultDodonpasHenchmenNeverAttackedUs"
msgid "07373"
msgstr ""
"Dodonpa's henchmen never\n"
"attacked us, did they?{page_break}"
"Maybe those thieves\n"
"weren't from Lunpa\n"
"after all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultWhyDoYouSupposeThoseThieves"
msgid "07374"
msgstr ""
"Why do you suppose those\n"
"thieves would be so\n"
"interested in Colosso?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultDaddyHasntBeenPayingAttentionSince"
msgid "07375"
msgstr ""
"Daddy hasn't been paying\n"
"attention, since Dodonpa's\n"
"men never attacked us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultItsNearTimeForColosso"
msgid "07376"
msgstr ""
"It's near time for Colosso\n"
"to start in Tolbi, isn't it?{page_break}"
"I'd like to go once\n"
"more before I die.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultTheWarriorsISawFightingAt"
msgid "07377"
msgstr ""
"The warriors I saw\n"
"fighting at Colosso were\n"
"so powerful...{page_break}"
"I couldn't take my\n"
"eyes off them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultWheneverMyWifeUsedToGo"
msgid "07378"
msgstr ""
"Whenever my wife used to\n"
"go to Tolbi for Colosso,{page_break}"
"she would always check\n"
"out the gladiators...{page_break}"
"That's why I won't\n"
"take her with me if\n"
"I go again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultLatelyMyHusbandsBeenGoingOn"
msgid "07379"
msgstr ""
"Lately, my husband's been\n"
"going on and on about\n"
"Colosso.{page_break}"
"I wonder if he might\n"
"take me this year...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultIsaacYouveComeBackVault"
msgid "07380"
msgstr ""
"Oh, {actor_name:1}!\n"
"You've come back\n"
"to Vault!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07381"
msgstr ""
"Ever since you left, all\n"
"sorts of crazy things\n"
"have been happening...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07382"
msgstr ""
"Those thieves you caught\n"
"have escaped from jail.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07383"
msgstr ""
"We were worried that\n"
"they might come after you.\n"
"Have you run into them?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07384"
msgstr ""
"If you see any suspicious\n"
"shadows, it might be them,\n"
"so watch out.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07385"
msgstr ""
"Well, that's good...\n"
"But be careful. There's no\n"
"telling what they might do.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultThoseGuysReallyWantedRevenge"
msgid "07386"
msgstr ""
"Those guys really wanted\n"
"revenge on you, so take\n"
"good care of yourselves.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultTheMayorsFamilyUrnIsOn"
msgid "07387"
msgstr ""
"The mayor's family urn\n"
"is on display now. You\n"
"ought to go see it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultThoseThievesYouGoToAll"
msgid "07388"
msgstr ""
"Those thieves!\n"
"You go to all that trouble\n"
"catching them,{page_break}"
"and then we let them\n"
"get away.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultIHearThatABigFestival"
msgid "07389"
msgstr ""
"I hear that a big\n"
"festival is about to start\n"
"in some faraway town.{page_break}"
"I'd sure like to see what\n"
"kind of festival it is\n"
"sometime.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultAsLongAsWeStayAlert"
msgid "07390"
msgstr ""
"As long as we stay alert,\n"
"those thieves won't\n"
"give us any trouble.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultWellBeSecuringItInA"
msgid "07391"
msgstr ""
"We'll be securing it in a\n"
"safe place soon, so I hope\n"
"they see it soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultItsJustEmbarrassingThatWeLet"
msgid "07392"
msgstr ""
"It's just embarrassing\n"
"that we let those\n"
"thieves get away.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultILoveFestivalsIllBetColosso"
msgid "07393"
msgstr ""
"I love festivals!\n"
"I'll bet Colosso is\n"
"just incredible.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultTheresRiverFireOnOther"
msgid "07394"
msgstr ""
"There's a river of fire\n"
"on the other side\n"
"of Mt. Aleph.{page_break}"
"Something big is happening.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultJustImagineHowTerribleItWould"
msgid "07395"
msgstr ""
"Just imagine how terrible\n"
"it would be if that had\n"
"happened over here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultTheySayVolcanoOnMt"
msgid "07396"
msgstr ""
"They say the volcano on\n"
"Mt. Aleph has torn our\n"
"continent in two!{page_break}"
"The eruption of Mt. Aleph\n"
"was incredible, big enough\n"
"to split the continent.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultItsAGoodThingThatGiant"
msgid "07397"
msgstr ""
"It's a good thing that\n"
"giant crevasse opened\n"
"up, though.{page_break}"
"Otherwise, the lava flow\n"
"would have spilled\n"
"directly into us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultWeHaventBeenGettingMany"
msgid "07398"
msgstr ""
"We haven't been getting\n"
"many customers lately.{page_break}"
"Maybe I'll close\n"
"early today.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultWhyKeepTheStoreOpenIf"
msgid "07399"
msgstr ""
"Why keep the store\n"
"open if we don't have\n"
"any customers?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSanctumMayWrongButLatelyThere"
msgid "07400"
msgstr ""
"I may be wrong, but lately,\n"
"there seem to be a lot of\n"
"earthquakes on Mt. Aleph.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSanctumPolishedGoldStatueReturnedUs"
msgid "07401"
msgstr ""
"I polished the gold\n"
"statue you returned\n"
"to us.{page_break}"
"It's so shiny, you won't\n"
"even recognize it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSanctumIHopeTheEarthquakesArentA"
msgid "07402"
msgstr ""
"I hope the earthquakes\n"
"aren't a sign of something\n"
"worse coming...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSanctumDirtyGoldenStatueCleanedUp"
msgid "07403"
msgstr ""
"That dirty golden statue\n"
"cleaned up pretty well.\n"
"Sure makes me feel good.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultMmmmNothingDoNothingDo"
msgid "07404"
msgstr ""
"Mmmm. Nothing to do,\n"
"nothing to do. I hate this!{page_break}"
"It's all because no one's\n"
"coming to the village, what\n"
"with the volcano and all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultWeDontGetALotOf"
msgid "07405"
msgstr ""
"We don't get a lot of\n"
"travelers in winter.{page_break}"
"Spring seems like such\n"
"a long way off,\n"
"you know?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultDidSomeCookingNowIve"
msgid "07406"
msgstr ""
"I did some cooking, so\n"
"now I've got all these\n"
"useless bones.{page_break}"
"...You want some?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07407"
msgstr ""
"Oh, you do? Really?\n"
"Help yourself, take as\n"
"many as you like.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07408"
msgstr ""
"You're right. You can't\n"
"just live on bones,\n"
"now can you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultThereYouSeeTheRoofRepairs"
msgid "07409"
msgstr ""
"There, you see? The roof\n"
"repairs are all finished.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultWontAnyoneComeStayTheNight"
msgid "07410"
msgstr ""
"Won't anyone come stay\n"
"the night here? It could\n"
"be a thief, for all I care.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultAfterYouveBeenInThisBusiness"
msgid "07411"
msgstr ""
"After you've been in this\n"
"business for a while, you\n"
"start to understand...{page_break}"
"After hard times, good\n"
"times will come again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultHeReallyLikesBonesWonder"
msgid "07412"
msgstr ""
"He really likes bones.\n"
"Hmm... I wonder if he's\n"
"got a calcium deficiency.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultThatsTheLastOfTheRoof"
msgid "07413"
msgstr ""
"That's the last of\n"
"the roof repairs.\n"
"What should I do next?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultPrisonerRegretsFight"
msgid "07414"
msgstr ""
"I hit somebody, so they\n"
"put me in here. What I\n"
"did was stupid, wasn't it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVaultPrisonerThoughts"
msgid "07415"
msgstr ""
"I need to learn to\n"
"control my temper.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayWantGoToTolbi"
msgid "07416"
msgstr ""
"Do you{pause_20_skippable} want\n"
"to go to Tolbi?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07417"
msgstr ""
"You can't go any further\n"
"along Silk Road.{page_break}"
"If you're going to Tolbi,\n"
"you have to cross\n"
"the Karagol Sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07418"
msgstr ""
"I see. {pause_20_skippable}Well then, how\n"
"about taking a long\n"
"look around the ship?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksWeCantTakeSilkRoadSo"
msgid "07419"
msgstr ""
"We can't take Silk\n"
"Road, so everyone's\n"
"in a pickle.{page_break}"
"It's too expensive\n"
"to get a ticket\n"
"on a ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksYouCantTakeSilkRoadMuch"
msgid "07420"
msgstr ""
"You can't take Silk\n"
"Road much further\n"
"than this.{page_break}"
"Everyone who goes to\n"
"check gives up and\n"
"comes back.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayGoingTakeShip"
msgid "07421"
msgstr ""
"Are you going to\n"
"take the ship?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayPassMessageDaughter"
msgid "07422"
msgstr ""
"When you reach Tolbi,\n"
"please pass a message\n"
"to my daughter.{page_break}"
"Her mother says that\n"
"tickets are too expensive\n"
"and she can't go there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07423"
msgstr ""
"Is that so? {pause_20_skippable}Well, then\n"
"I guess I'll ask\n"
"someone else then.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksWithSilkRoadClosedEveryoneWill"
msgid "07424"
msgstr ""
"With Silk Road\n"
"closed, everyone will\n"
"have to cross by ship.{page_break}"
"The captain stands to\n"
"make a lot of money.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksICantBelieveHowExpensiveTickets"
msgid "07425"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe how\n"
"expensive tickets are.{page_break}"
"We've come this far,\n"
"and we can't take\n"
"Silk Road.{page_break}"
"Well, it's too late\n"
"for us to turn back.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksWellIsntThisGreatWeCant"
msgid "07426"
msgstr ""
"Well, isn't this great!\n"
"We can't take Silk Road,\n"
"and Colosso is starting!{page_break}"
"My daughter left Tolbi\n"
"to meet us at the docks.\n"
"I'm really sad about this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksWeveSpentAYearPlanningThis"
msgid "07427"
msgstr ""
"We've spent a year\n"
"planning this trip,\n"
"and now this happens.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayLookingForTickets"
msgid "07428"
msgstr ""
"Are you looking for\n"
"tickets for boarding?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07429"
msgstr ""
"Please buy a ticket if\n"
"you're planning to\n"
"travel by ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07430"
msgstr ""
"Let's see...there are four\n"
"of you, so it will cost\n"
"{argument_signed_number} coins. Okay?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07431"
msgstr ""
"You're{pause_20_skippable} not going to do it?\n"
"If you don't get onboard,\n"
"you can't get to Tolbi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07432"
msgstr ""
"Uh oh...{pause_20_skippable} You don't have\n"
"enough money. I can't\n"
"sell you a ticket.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07433"
msgstr ""
"Uh oh...{pause_20_skippable} You've got too\n"
"much equipment{em_dash}I can't\n"
"give you your ticket.{page_break}"
"Please come back after\n"
"you've organized your\n"
"equipment.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07434"
msgstr ""
"All right then, please\n"
"take your ticket.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayHandInTicketPlank"
msgid "07435"
msgstr ""
"Hand in your ticket\n"
"at the ship's plank.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksHmmmThatsStrangeIsntTheReplacement"
msgid "07436"
msgstr ""
"Hmmm, that's strange.{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"Isn't the replacement ship\n"
"here yet?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksOnceWeveCrossedTheKaragolWell"
msgid "07437"
msgstr ""
"Once we've crossed the\n"
"Karagol, we'll reach Tolbi.\n"
"Ohh, I'm excited.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksIFeelSortOfBadThat"
msgid "07438"
msgstr ""
"I feel sort of bad that\n"
"I have to charge so much\n"
"for these tickets.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksIfYouveAlreadyBoughtYourTicket"
msgid "07439"
msgstr ""
"If you've already bought\n"
"your ticket, hurry up and\n"
"board the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksTheShipWontLeaveHereTill"
msgid "07440"
msgstr ""
"The ship won't leave here\n"
"till the next ship arrives.\n"
"That's how it works.{page_break}"
"I doubt that we'll set sail\n"
"before the other one\n"
"gets here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksLetsGetGoingImNotGetting"
msgid "07441"
msgstr ""
"Let's get going! I'm\n"
"not getting any younger...{page_break}"
"Or is my husband thinking\n"
"of giving up on\n"
"Colosso this year?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksTodayThereAreSupposedToBe"
msgid "07442"
msgstr ""
"Today there are supposed\n"
"to be lots of tourists\n"
"on the ship.{page_break}"
"We're not going to check\n"
"the tickets until the tour\n"
"group gets here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksTheShipWillBeOpenUntil"
msgid "07443"
msgstr ""
"The ship will be open\n"
"until the tourists arrive.\n"
"Feel free to look around.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksTheCaptainsInAGoodMood"
msgid "07444"
msgstr ""
"The captain's in a good\n"
"mood today because we\n"
"have so many passengers.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksTheCaptainsInAGoodMoodThats"
msgid "07445"
msgstr ""
"The captain's in a good\n"
"mood. That's why he\n"
"opened the ship up.{page_break}"
"Everything's going great.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTicketsPlease"
msgid "07446"
msgstr ""
"Tickets, please. Please\n"
"show your tickets.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07447"
msgstr ""
"You can't board the ship\n"
"without a ticket.{page_break}"
"Please go and purchase\n"
"a ticket.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07448"
msgstr ""
"Thank you very much.\n"
"Please board the ship,\n"
"and we'll set sail soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayAfterHandingOverTicket"
msgid "07449"
msgstr ""
"After handing over your\n"
"ticket, you may board the\n"
"ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07450"
msgstr ""
"We will be setting sail\n"
"shortly; please wait on\n"
"board.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayHaveTicketsGiveHim"
msgid "07451"
msgstr ""
"If you have tickets,\n"
"please give them to him\n"
"and board the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07452"
msgstr ""
"I don't know when we're\n"
"going to set sail.\n"
"Please ask the captain.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksSilkRoadIsBlockedSoThe"
msgid "07453"
msgstr ""
"Silk Road is blocked,\n"
"so the ship is pretty\n"
"full today.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksTheReplacementShipHasntArrivedSo"
msgid "07454"
msgstr ""
"The replacement ship\n"
"hasn't arrived, so we\n"
"still can't set sail.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayBoardWaitSetSail"
msgid "07455"
msgstr ""
"Please board the ship and\n"
"wait to set sail.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayWantGoAshore"
msgid "07456"
msgstr ""
"Do you want to\n"
"go ashore?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07457"
msgstr "Please pass through.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07458"
msgstr ""
"We'll be setting sail\n"
"soon, so please board\n"
"the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayFinishedOutHereBoardShip"
msgid "07459"
msgstr ""
"When you're finished\n"
"out here, please\n"
"board the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckThereAreALotOfPassengers"
msgid "07460"
msgstr ""
"There are a lot of\n"
"passengers... I wonder if\n"
"we'll be able to set sail.{page_break}"
"Really, it makes\n"
"me wonder.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckTheReplacementShipFromTolbiShould"
msgid "07461"
msgstr ""
"The replacement ship from\n"
"Tolbi should have been\n"
"here by now...{page_break}"
"Do you think something\n"
"happened while they were\n"
"crossing the Karagol?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipWonderCouldHaveHappened"
msgid "07462"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what could\n"
"have happened.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07463"
msgstr ""
"You mean you still intend\n"
"to cross this dangerous\n"
"sea?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07464"
msgstr ""
"It would be too big a loss\n"
"to let so many passengers\n"
"get away...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07465"
msgstr ""
"Say, Kaja, how are\n"
"the oarsmen doing?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07466"
msgstr ""
"They're fearless. There's\n"
"no problem there.{page_break}"
"It's just that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07467"
msgstr "\"It's just that\"...what?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07468"
msgstr ""
"If a whole bunch of...them\n"
"appear while we're\n"
"crossing the sea,{page_break}"
"I won't be able to\n"
"handle them alone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07469"
msgstr ""
"I'm sorry, but you'll have\n"
"to. I can't let anyone else\n"
"fight but you, Kaja.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07470"
msgstr ""
"Remember,{pause_20_skippable} the oarsmen\n"
"will have their hands full\n"
"rowing. They can't fight.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07471"
msgstr "Hmmm. What to do...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipItsTooLateHireMercenaries"
msgid "07472"
msgstr ""
"It's too late to hire\n"
"mercenaries now...\n"
"There's no time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipButWeCantSendShip"
msgid "07473"
msgstr ""
"But we can't send the\n"
"ship out without hiring\n"
"some warriors.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIWonderIfThereAreAny"
msgid "07474"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if there are\n"
"any other reliable\n"
"warriors around.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsThisIsAChanceToMake"
msgid "07475"
msgstr ""
"This is a chance to make\n"
"some money. It'd really be\n"
"a waste to pass it up.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsSendingOutAShipWhenIts"
msgid "07476"
msgstr ""
"Sending out a ship when\n"
"it's this dangerous... It's\n"
"like setting out to die.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIfWeDontSetSailNow"
msgid "07477"
msgstr ""
"If we don't set sail now,\n"
"you would be admitting\n"
"you were afraid, Kaja...{page_break}"
"That won't happen.\n"
"I won't let that happen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipToldWereLeavingSoonSet"
msgid "07478"
msgstr ""
"I told you, we're\n"
"leaving soon.{page_break}"
"We'll set sail when\n"
"our replacement arrives!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipIfWeDontLeaveSoon"
msgid "07479"
msgstr ""
"If we don't leave\n"
"soon, Colosso will\n"
"start without us!{page_break}"
"Will you accept full\n"
"responsibility for being\n"
"late to Colosso?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckIWonderWhatsGoingOnWeve"
msgid "07480"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what's going on.\n"
"We've been waiting an\n"
"awfully long time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckIWonderIfImTheOnly"
msgid "07481"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if I'm the only\n"
"one here who's going\n"
"to Tolbi to see Colosso...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckTheKaragolIsLikeAHumongous"
msgid "07482"
msgstr ""
"The Karagol is like a\n"
"humongous lake,\n"
"surrounded by land.{page_break}"
"So there are no waves,\n"
"but the water is salty,\n"
"just like a real ocean.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckWhenAreWeGoingWhenAre"
msgid "07483"
msgstr ""
"\"When are we going?\n"
"When are we going?\"\n"
"This guy's really pushy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckHmmmThisIsSoFrustratingWhy"
msgid "07484"
msgstr ""
"Hmmm. This is so\n"
"frustrating...{page_break}"
"Why won't anyone tell\n"
"me what's going on?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckTravelingByShipIsFasterThan"
msgid "07485"
msgstr ""
"Traveling by ship is\n"
"faster than walking;\n"
"there's no need to rush.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckMostOfThePeopleGoingTo"
msgid "07486"
msgstr ""
"Most of the people going\n"
"to Colosso set out a\n"
"long time ago.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckTheKaragolSeaIsPrettyFoggy"
msgid "07487"
msgstr ""
"The Karagol Sea is pretty\n"
"foggy today. Maybe that's\n"
"why I'm so uneasy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipTheresNothingWeCanDo"
msgid "07488"
msgstr ""
"There's nothing we can\n"
"do... Let's set sail!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07489"
msgstr ""
"Wha-{pause_20_skippable}What are you\n"
"talking about!{page_break}"
"If we set sail now,\n"
"we'll never make\n"
"it to Tolbi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07490"
msgstr ""
"We'll be fine...\n"
"We have a protective\n"
"amulet!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07491"
msgstr ""
"Amulet...{pause_20_skippable} Amulet, you say...\n"
"You mean that little\n"
"anchor charm?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07492"
msgstr ""
"The little anchor has\n"
"always protected us\n"
"from danger.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07493"
msgstr ""
"Captain, get ahold of\n"
"yourself! That's just\n"
"foolish superstition!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07494"
msgstr ""
"It's okay. We'll be fine.\n"
"Even if we can't find any\n"
"mercenaries,{page_break}"
"that little charm will\n"
"protect us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07495"
msgstr ""
"Now then, let's hurry up!\n"
"Prepare to set sail!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07496"
msgstr ""
"This is great...{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"We'll be setting sail soon!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07497"
msgstr ""
"(Not if I have anything\n"
"to say about it.){end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckWeApologizeForAnyTroubleThat"
msgid "07498"
msgstr ""
"We apologize for any\n"
"trouble that this\n"
"delay has caused.{page_break}"
"Please relax and enjoy\n"
"the trip. We will be\n"
"setting sail very shortly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07499"
msgstr ""
"If it were a legitimate\n"
"ship, we'd be leaving now.{page_break}"
"Who knows when we'll\n"
"reach Tolbi now...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckThereIsNothingToFearAs"
msgid "07500"
msgstr ""
"There is nothing to fear\n"
"as long as we have\n"
"our anchor charm.{page_break}"
"Are we still getting\n"
"ready to set sail?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07501"
msgstr ""
"There are monsters out\n"
"there... If we don't\n"
"prepare, we're doomed!{page_break}"
"Curses!\n"
"If only we had some\n"
"powerful warriors...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipLongerWeSitHereMore"
msgid "07502"
msgstr ""
"The longer we sit here,\n"
"the more time we\n"
"have to think.{page_break}"
"I wonder what happened...\n"
"with our participation\n"
"in Colosso.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsApparentlyWeCantTakeSilkRoad"
msgid "07503"
msgstr ""
"Apparently, we can't\n"
"take Silk Road like\n"
"we'd planned.{page_break}"
"So I guess we're the only\n"
"passengers who could\n"
"afford the tickets.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipTheresWholeBunchReallyMuscular"
msgid "07504"
msgstr ""
"There's a whole bunch of\n"
"really muscular men on\n"
"the floor below.{page_break}"
"Those people are rowing\n"
"the oars so the ship\n"
"moves, right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsYoureGoingToTolbiToSee"
msgid "07505"
msgstr ""
"You're going to Tolbi\n"
"to see Colosso,\n"
"too, right?{page_break}"
"Once you've seen\n"
"Colosso, you won't want to\n"
"go to a regular festival.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsMaybeIShouldJustForgetAbout"
msgid "07506"
msgstr ""
"Maybe I should\n"
"just forget about\n"
"going...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsTheyreJustTakingAdvantageOfUs"
msgid "07507"
msgstr ""
"They're just taking\n"
"advantage of us,{page_break}"
"selling those tickets\n"
"for so much money.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsMusclesRipplingEverywhereLooksGreatIf"
msgid "07508"
msgstr ""
"Muscles rippling\n"
"everywhere...\n"
"looks great!{page_break}"
"If we go to Colosso,\n"
"there'll be more guys\n"
"built like that, right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWeLeftTheOldLadyBack"
msgid "07509"
msgstr ""
"We left the old lady\n"
"back home. Now we can\n"
"take our time at Colosso.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipIfWeArentGoingSet"
msgid "07510"
msgstr ""
"If we aren't going to set\n"
"sail right away, I'm going\n"
"to go ashore!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07511"
msgstr ""
"Yeah, but...{pause_20_skippable}we're going\n"
"to set sail real soon,\n"
"so please be patient.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07512"
msgstr "When is \"real soon\"?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07513"
msgstr ""
"I'm asking how long real\n"
"soon is going to be!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07514"
msgstr ""
"You're wondering "
"when.{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"Well...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07515"
msgstr ""
"We're planning to go\n"
"see Colosso.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07516"
msgstr ""
"You know, my friend\n"
"Ouranos here is\n"
"scared of ships.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07517"
msgstr "Ouranos? But he's huge!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07518"
msgstr ""
"It's not that I'm\n"
"scared. I just can't\n"
"stand water...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07519"
msgstr ""
"I'd rather be bitten\n"
"by poisonous spiders\n"
"than sail across the sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07520"
msgstr ""
"Hmmm.{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"Spiders, huh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07521"
msgstr ""
"And even Ouranos is\n"
"ready to cross the\n"
"sea right now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07522"
msgstr ""
"Well, if we're not going\n"
"now, then when are we\n"
"going to set sail?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07523"
msgstr ""
"That's...{pause_20_skippable}not an\n"
"easy question.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07524"
msgstr ""
"You mean you wouldn't\n"
"know even if I asked?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07525"
msgstr "We're going, Ouranos.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07526"
msgstr "Going?{pause_20_skippable} Where?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07527"
msgstr ""
"Where else? To the\n"
"captain's quarters,\n"
"of course.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07528"
msgstr ""
"What do you think you're\n"
"going to do in the\n"
"captain's quarters?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07529"
msgstr "Make him set sail.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07530"
msgstr "And what if he refuses? {end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07531"
msgstr ""
"In that case, we'll just\n"
"have to do our best to\n"
"{pause_20_skippable}persuade{pause_20_skippable} him...{page_break}"
"Right, Ouranos?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07532"
msgstr "That sounds crazy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07533"
msgstr ""
"That sounds{pause_20_skippable} great!\n"
"Count me in.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07534"
msgstr ""
"I don't want any\n"
"violence!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipSomebodyStopThem"
msgid "07535"
msgstr "Somebody stop them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipTheyCantPlanningMutiny"
msgid "07536"
msgstr ""
"They can't be planning\n"
"a mutiny...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckThoseWarriorsGotTiredOfWaiting"
msgid "07537"
msgstr ""
"Those warriors got tired\n"
"of waiting, so they went\n"
"to see the captain. {end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckIWonderIfThoseTwoAre"
msgid "07538"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if those two\n"
"are planning on taking\n"
"over the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckHaHahThoseMercenariesAreGoing"
msgid "07539"
msgstr ""
"Ha hah! Those mercenaries\n"
"are going to yell at the\n"
"captain for us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckUsingForceToLaunchTheShip"
msgid "07540"
msgstr ""
"Using force to launch the\n"
"ship? That's going too\n"
"far...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckTheyWereJustAboutToLaunch"
msgid "07541"
msgstr ""
"They were just about to\n"
"launch the ship when...\n"
"They're awful.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckThoseThugsAreTooImpatientTrying"
msgid "07542"
msgstr ""
"Those thugs are too\n"
"impatient... Trying to\n"
"launch the ship by force.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckHeeHeeIfWeCanGet"
msgid "07543"
msgstr ""
"Hee hee. If we can get\n"
"moving, I don't care what\n"
"it takes. I say, go for it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckThoseGuysSeemPrettySureOf"
msgid "07544"
msgstr ""
"Those guys seem pretty\n"
"sure of their fighting\n"
"skills. They can do it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWeCanLeaveAsSoonAs"
msgid "07545"
msgstr ""
"We can leave as soon\n"
"as we get our orders.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsEveryoneRowsInTimeWithThis"
msgid "07546"
msgstr ""
"Everyone rows in time\n"
"with this drum.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsRowingIsAMansJob"
msgid "07547"
msgstr "Rowing is a man's job!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWereTheOnesWhoMakeThe"
msgid "07548"
msgstr ""
"We're the ones who make\n"
"the ship move.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsOnceWeCastOffYouJust"
msgid "07549"
msgstr ""
"Once we cast off,\n"
"you just leave the\n"
"rest to us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsYouCanOnlyDoHardWork"
msgid "07550"
msgstr ""
"You can only do hard\n"
"work like this while\n"
"you're young.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsHmmmIWonderWhenWereGoing"
msgid "07551"
msgstr ""
"Hmmm. I wonder when\n"
"we're going to launch...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsICantWaitUntilWeGet"
msgid "07552"
msgstr ""
"I can't wait until\n"
"we get to Tolbi and I\n"
"can stretch my wings.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIHearTheresAnIsleIn"
msgid "07553"
msgstr ""
"I hear there's an isle in\n"
"the middle of the Karagol,\n"
"but I've never seen it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsFromTheSeaItLooksLike"
msgid "07554"
msgstr ""
"From the sea, it looks\n"
"like Silk Road is\n"
"totally flooded.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsEnoughIsEnoughLetsSetOff"
msgid "07555"
msgstr ""
"Enough is enough!\n"
"Let's set off!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsILoveItWhenTheOars"
msgid "07556"
msgstr ""
"I love it when the\n"
"oars move in rhythm\n"
"to my drum.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsEveryoneDownHereGetsSoCompetitive"
msgid "07557"
msgstr ""
"Everyone down here\n"
"gets so competitive.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsTheseBigMusclesAreASign"
msgid "07558"
msgstr ""
"These big muscles are a\n"
"sign that we're oarsmen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWellSeeToItThatThey"
msgid "07559"
msgstr ""
"We'll see to it that they\n"
"all have a pleasant\n"
"voyage!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsYouveGotToSaveUpLots"
msgid "07560"
msgstr ""
"You've got to save up\n"
"lots of cash before you\n"
"get too old to row...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIDontFeelLikeRowingAll"
msgid "07561"
msgstr ""
"I don't feel like rowing\n"
"all the way to the coast\n"
"of Tolbi today.{page_break}"
"I wonder if this is what\n"
"a bad premonition feels\n"
"like.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsSpendYourMoneyWhileYoureYoung"
msgid "07562"
msgstr ""
"Spend your money while\n"
"you're young enough\n"
"to enjoy it!{page_break}"
"That's the manly\n"
"thing to do.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsItSeemsLikeThereWouldBe"
msgid "07563"
msgstr ""
"It seems like there would\n"
"be buried treasure... It's\n"
"that kind of island.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsHaHahIfYouWantTo"
msgid "07564"
msgstr ""
"Ha hah! If you want to go\n"
"to Tolbi, get on the ship!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDidntDoAnything"
msgid "07565"
msgstr "I didn't do anything...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07566"
msgstr "Really, I mean it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckOhAtTheRiskOfSounding"
msgid "07567"
msgstr ""
"Oh!{pause_20_skippable} At the risk of\n"
"sounding repetitive,\n"
"I didn't do anything!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckIHidTheAnchorCharmNo"
msgid "07568"
msgstr ""
"I hid the anchor charm...{page_break}"
"No one would ever look\n"
"on top of the mast.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipNowWantSeeCaptainToo"
msgid "07569"
msgstr ""
"Now what? You want to\n"
"see the captain too?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07570"
msgstr ""
"Well, you don't have\n"
"any business here then.\n"
"Off with you now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipYoureTryingLaunchShip"
msgid "07571"
msgstr ""
"You're trying to\n"
"launch the ship?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07572"
msgstr ""
"We can't set sail in\n"
"this dangerous sea!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07573"
msgstr "What was that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07574"
msgstr ""
"We don't care about that!{page_break}"
"We paid our money,\n"
"and now you have to\n"
"launch the ship!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07575"
msgstr ""
"But the captain decided\n"
"to set sail just a\n"
"second ago.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07576"
msgstr "So...we're taking off?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07577"
msgstr ""
"Yes.{pause_20_skippable} Preparations are\n"
"being made right now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07578"
msgstr ""
"Well...maybe we were a\n"
"bit rash, running up\n"
"here like that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07579"
msgstr ""
"Please,{pause_20_skippable} launch the ship\n"
"when you're ready.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07580"
msgstr "...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07581"
msgstr ""
"Dangerous sea... That's\n"
"what you said, isn't it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07582"
msgstr ""
"It's dangerous out there...\n"
"Is that why you wouldn't\n"
"launch the ship?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07583"
msgstr ""
"Yeah, I did... {pause_20_skippable}\n"
"The sea is dangerous now.\n"
"There are monsters...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07584"
msgstr "Monsters, you say?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07585"
msgstr ""
"Lately, we've been sighting\n"
"creatures never before\n"
"seen in the Karagol.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07586"
msgstr "Dangerous ones?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07587"
msgstr ""
"Actually, some even came\n"
"onboard the ship and\n"
"attacked the crew.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiTolbiShipThenTheyAreDangerous"
msgid "07588"
msgstr "That {text_effect:2}IS{reset_text_style} dangerous!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07589"
msgstr ""
"We suspect that our\n"
"replacement ship might\n"
"have been attacked.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07590"
msgstr ""
"With such dangerous\n"
"creatures around... You\n"
"might need warriors!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07591"
msgstr ""
"It is certainly dangerous,\n"
"but the ship is okay.\n"
"After all, we{em_dash}{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07592"
msgstr ""
"If there are monsters,\n"
"I'll be glad to\n"
"help out.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07593"
msgstr "Oh,{pause_20_skippable} really?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07594"
msgstr "Hey, Ouranos, I thought{em_dash}{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07595"
msgstr ""
"We have to make it to\n"
"Colosso...{pause_20_skippable} If we're late,\n"
"we can't enter.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07596"
msgstr "That's true, but...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07597"
msgstr ""
"Hey, maybe you can give\n"
"us a hand, too, Sean!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07598"
msgstr "Really?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07599"
msgstr ""
"Are you really going\n"
"to help out?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07600"
msgstr ""
"I'm a man of my word.\n"
"If I said I'll help,\n"
"I'll help.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07601"
msgstr ""
"With you guys helping me\n"
"to keep the deck safe,\n"
"the ship should be okay.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07602"
msgstr "So, can we set off now?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07603"
msgstr ""
"No... Now, we need\n"
"someone to protect the\n"
"oarsmen...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07604"
msgstr ""
"Protect the oarsmen, huh?{page_break}"
"You guys need some\n"
"warriors...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07605"
msgstr "You have an idea?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07606"
msgstr ""
"I saw some warriors in\n"
"among the passengers\n"
"belowdecks.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07607"
msgstr ""
"Do you think they'd\n"
"help us out?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07608"
msgstr ""
"If they're from Angara,\n"
"they will.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07609"
msgstr ""
"Hmmm... If they could help\n"
"out, we'd be unbeatable.{page_break}"
"And, of course, we still\n"
"have my lucky anchor...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07610"
msgstr "It's gone...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07611"
msgstr "It's vanished!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07612"
msgstr ""
"What!?{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"The captain's beloved\n"
"anchor!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07613"
msgstr ""
"The anchor...\n"
"Our good luck charm?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07614"
msgstr ""
"Oh, that? What's the big\n"
"deal? So what if that\n"
"old trinket's gone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07615"
msgstr ""
"What do you mean,\n"
"\"Oh, that\"!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07616"
msgstr ""
"That anchor's been\n"
"keeping my ship\n"
"safe for years!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07617"
msgstr ""
"It's just decorative,\n"
"right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07618"
msgstr ""
"Even if we find some\n"
"warriors, we won't make\n"
"it without that anchor.{page_break}"
"We're not leaving!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07619"
msgstr ""
"But you just said\n"
"we were leaving...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07620"
msgstr ""
"That was when I\n"
"thought we still\n"
"had the anchor!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07621"
msgstr ""
"Why all the fuss over\n"
"a little trinket?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07622"
msgstr ""
"\"Little trinket\"!?\n"
"Weren't you listening\n"
"to what he said?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07623"
msgstr ""
"It's not just a\n"
"decoration! It's a\n"
"good luck charm!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07624"
msgstr ""
"This ship doesn't leave\n"
"until we find it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07625"
msgstr ""
"(What's the problem?\n"
"We've got some warriors\n"
"to help us...){end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07626"
msgstr ""
"(Maybe we shouldn't\n"
"have taken it.){end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07627"
msgstr ""
"Hey!{pause_20_skippable} Hey, you!\n"
"What are you\n"
"doing here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07628"
msgstr ""
"You heard the captain{em_dash}\n"
"This ship goes nowhere!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipBadLuckLosingMyLucky"
msgid "07629"
msgstr ""
"Oh, of all the bad\n"
"luck...losing my\n"
"lucky charm!{page_break}"
"This ship can't leave\n"
"until we find it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsRightWhenWeFoundSomeWarriors"
msgid "07630"
msgstr ""
"Right when we found some\n"
"warriors to protect the\n"
"ship... Great...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsICantBelieveHimRefusingTo"
msgid "07631"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe him...\n"
"Refusing to leave\n"
"because of one charm?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIHadNoIdeaHeWas"
msgid "07632"
msgstr ""
"I had no idea he\n"
"was so superstitious.{page_break}"
"I thought he was joking...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipYouCameAskCaptainSet"
msgid "07633"
msgstr ""
"You came to ask the\n"
"captain to set\n"
"sail, right?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07634"
msgstr ""
"If we had worked\n"
"together, we'd be out\n"
"at sea right now.{page_break}"
"But it's too late now...\n"
"Because of that charm,\n"
"we're not going anywhere.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07635"
msgstr ""
"Heh heh... In that case,\n"
"why don't you take\n"
"a tour of the ship?{page_break}"
"I may need a hand from\n"
"you later. I hope you'll\n"
"help me out.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipIfShipFromTolbiHad"
msgid "07636"
msgstr ""
"If the ship from Tolbi\n"
"had come, I'd feel\n"
"differently,{page_break}"
"but at this point,\n"
"I'm not setting sail!{page_break}"
"Hmmm... I wonder where\n"
"that anchor charm went.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsTheShipWontLeaveDockUntil"
msgid "07637"
msgstr ""
"The ship won't leave dock\n"
"until we find that\n"
"anchor charm.{page_break}"
"Maybe we should forget\n"
"about setting off.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsThisIsRidiculousTheShipCant"
msgid "07638"
msgstr ""
"This is ridiculous... The\n"
"ship can't set sail because\n"
"of a good luck charm?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsThatThingCouldntHaveGottenLost"
msgid "07639"
msgstr ""
"That thing couldn't have\n"
"gotten lost on its own...\n"
"Did somebody hide it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIDontThinkAnyoneWouldSteal"
msgid "07640"
msgstr ""
"I don't think anyone would\n"
"steal that charm... I bet\n"
"we find it right away.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIfTheShipDoesntLeaveSoon"
msgid "07641"
msgstr ""
"If the ship doesn't\n"
"leave soon, we might\n"
"miss Colosso.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIWaitedTooLongIllGet"
msgid "07642"
msgstr ""
"I waited too long...\n"
"I'll get in trouble if\n"
"I don't come clean.{page_break}"
"I have to confess that I\n"
"hid it on top of the mast.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipItsMyLuckyAnchor"
msgid "07643"
msgstr ""
"Hey!\n"
"It's my lucky anchor!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07644"
msgstr ""
"Well, look at that!\n"
"Did you find our\n"
"charm for us?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07645"
msgstr ""
"It was atop the mast?\n"
"Why there, of all places?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07646"
msgstr ""
"I... I don't know what\n"
"to say... Thank you.\n"
"Now, we can set sail.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07647"
msgstr ""
"You climbed up the mast\n"
"to see the Crow's Nest,\n"
"and there it was?{page_break}"
"How on earth did it\n"
"get up there?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07648"
msgstr ""
"Thank you so much!\n"
"Now, I can finally launch\n"
"this ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07649"
msgstr ""
"Boy, that's a relief!\n"
"Now we can set sail.\n"
"Right, Captain?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07650"
msgstr "Mmm, not just yet...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07651"
msgstr ""
"Not yet? What's the\n"
"problem this time?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07652"
msgstr ""
"The Karagol Sea is\n"
"thick with monsters...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07653"
msgstr "But you don't...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07654"
msgstr ""
"Well, it's just like Sean\n"
"said. The best we can do\n"
"is protect the deck.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07655"
msgstr ""
"We need someone to\n"
"protect the oarsmen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07656"
msgstr ""
"Sean, you look like you\n"
"have someone in mind\n"
"to help us...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07657"
msgstr "Yeah.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07658"
msgstr ""
"Someone to help?\n"
"Who?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07659"
msgstr ""
"Those warriors,\n"
"that's who!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07660"
msgstr ""
"They may look young, but\n"
"each of them is a force\n"
"to be reckoned with.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07661"
msgstr ""
"When you put it that\n"
"way, sure. Why not?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07662"
msgstr "I can't argue with that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07663"
msgstr ""
"How about it? You want\n"
"to join forces with us\n"
"and help out the ship?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07664"
msgstr ""
"You lack confidence, but\n"
"Sean has a lot of faith\n"
"in you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07665"
msgstr ""
"With you at our side,\n"
"we'll be fine. I'm sure\n"
"you can protect the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07666"
msgstr ""
"If you want to reach\n"
"Tolbi, you'll give us a\n"
"hand so we can set sail.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07667"
msgstr ""
"So, you'll help us?\n"
"That means we can\n"
"finally set sail.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07668"
msgstr ""
"Oh, good! That means the\n"
"ship is taking off!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07669"
msgstr ""
"There's just one\n"
"thing left to do...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07670"
msgstr "Oh, no... Now what?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07671"
msgstr ""
"I need some volunteers to\n"
"help with the rowing...\n"
"just in case.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07672"
msgstr ""
"What? Are you going to\n"
"ask the passengers to\n"
"help row the ship?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07673"
msgstr ""
"The ship won't move\n"
"without oarsmen, so...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07674"
msgstr ""
"Don't worry{em_dash}we'll do\n"
"that, too!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07675"
msgstr ""
"Wa-{pause_20_skippable}Wait a minute...\n"
"You're supposed to\n"
"protect the ship!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07676"
msgstr ""
"We'll need to ask the\n"
"other passengers.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07677"
msgstr ""
"These passengers are part\n"
"of your tour, so why\n"
"don't you go ask them?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07678"
msgstr "This is crazy...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07679"
msgstr ""
"We need you to help\n"
"out. Even with the\n"
"crazy stuff.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07680"
msgstr ""
"Well then, let's all go\n"
"to our stations while we\n"
"wait for the launch.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07681"
msgstr ""
"Come to think of it,\n"
"I don't know your name.\n"
"You want to tell me?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07682"
msgstr ""
"Ah, {protagonist_name}.{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"Well then, {protagonist_name},{page_break}"
"I'm looking forward to\n"
"working with you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07683"
msgstr ""
"Well, I'll need to call\n"
"you something. Hmm... You\n"
"look like {protagonist_name}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07684"
msgstr "Well then, {protagonist_name}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07685"
msgstr ""
"Well, everybody, let's\n"
"get this ship to sea!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipWeDontKnowMightHappen"
msgid "07686"
msgstr ""
"We don't know what might\n"
"happen before we arrive.\n"
"Be ready for anything.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsAsLongAsWeHaveThe"
msgid "07687"
msgstr ""
"As long as we have the\n"
"anchor charm, we have\n"
"nothing to fear!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipNowWeHaveProtectShip"
msgid "07688"
msgstr ""
"Now that we have you to\n"
"protect the ship, we\n"
"ought to be leaving soon.{page_break}"
"But I think it might be\n"
"tough to get the other\n"
"passengers to row...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipHaveMakeThemPromiseHelp"
msgid "07689"
msgstr ""
"We'll have to make them\n"
"promise to help row\n"
"before we can set sail.{page_break}"
"Hopefully, it won't come\n"
"to that, though.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckIfWeJustPromiseToHelp"
msgid "07690"
msgstr ""
"If we just promise to\n"
"help row, the ship will\n"
"set sail, right?{page_break}"
"It's pretty easy to make\n"
"a promise.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckIllAgreeToAnythingEvenRowing"
msgid "07691"
msgstr ""
"I'll agree to anything,\n"
"even rowing the ship,{page_break}"
"if it means we'll finally\n"
"leave the dock!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckThatSeaDogKajaIsA"
msgid "07692"
msgstr ""
"That sea dog Kaja is a\n"
"little scary, so everyone\n"
"agreed to help row.{page_break}"
"But fighting up here suits\n"
"me better than rowing\n"
"down below!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckAreYouSeriousAboutSettingSail"
msgid "07693"
msgstr ""
"Are you serious about\n"
"setting sail?{page_break}"
"I heard a sailor say\n"
"he'd seen the shadows\n"
"of monsters in the water.{page_break}"
"Isn't this going to be\n"
"a little dangerous?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckItProbablyWontMakeAnyDifference"
msgid "07694"
msgstr ""
"It probably won't make\n"
"any difference if I make\n"
"them promise to row...{page_break}"
"I just hope we don't have\n"
"to refund their money\n"
"at the end of the trip.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckUltimatelyTheyreJustBeingThreatenedInto"
msgid "07695"
msgstr ""
"Ultimately, they're just\n"
"being threatened into\n"
"helping, right?{page_break}"
"No matter what happens,\n"
"I won't force the\n"
"passengers to work.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckBesidesRowingIsAMansJob"
msgid "07696"
msgstr ""
"Besides, rowing is a man's\n"
"job... Leave me out of it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckUsHelpWithTheRowingGet"
msgid "07697"
msgstr ""
"Us? Help with the rowing?\n"
"Get serious!{page_break}"
"There's no way we'd\n"
"ever do such hard work.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsYouAllAgreedToHelpOf"
msgid "07698"
msgstr ""
"You all agreed to help\n"
"of your own accord.{page_break}"
"That's why I'd like\n"
"your total cooperation\n"
"when the time comes!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipTheseProudWarriorsNotGoing"
msgid "07699"
msgstr ""
"These proud warriors are\n"
"not going to like being\n"
"told to row.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07700"
msgstr ""
"What do you think? You\n"
"guys wanna trade jobs?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07701"
msgstr ""
"You look so scary... You\n"
"say you want to trade,\n"
"but it's not that easy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07702"
msgstr ""
"I see. Sure, why don't\n"
"you take over the rowing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07703"
msgstr ""
"I figured you'd say that.\n"
"Fine. Rowing is fine\n"
"with me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsAllThatMoneyOnTicketsAnd"
msgid "07704"
msgstr ""
"All that money on tickets,\n"
"and now we have to row\n"
"the ship? Madness!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipYouGoingRow"
msgid "07705"
msgstr "Are you going to row? {end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07706"
msgstr ""
"Hmmm. So, you have to\n"
"row, even though you're\n"
"a fighter, huh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07707"
msgstr ""
"Oh. {pause_20_skippable}Helping to protect\n"
"the ship suits you\n"
"better, doesn't it?{page_break}"
"Oh well, it doesn't matter.\n"
"It's not going to happen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsINeverThoughtIdGetTo"
msgid "07708"
msgstr ""
"I never thought I'd get to\n"
"be this age and end up\n"
"having to row a boat!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIfSomethingHappensToOurOarsmen"
msgid "07709"
msgstr ""
"If something happens\n"
"to our oarsmen, we'll\n"
"need the help.{page_break}"
"If that happens, we'll\n"
"help out as warriors.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsDoTheyHonestlyThinkImGoing"
msgid "07710"
msgstr ""
"Do they honestly think\n"
"I'm going to help row\n"
"the ship?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsImSureItdBeEasierTo"
msgid "07711"
msgstr ""
"I'm sure it'd be easier\n"
"to protect the ship than\n"
"it would be to row.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWellShootMaybeWeShouldHave"
msgid "07712"
msgstr ""
"Well, shoot! Maybe\n"
"we should have just\n"
"stayed in Kalay.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsAskingThePassengersToHelpOut"
msgid "07713"
msgstr ""
"Asking the passengers to\n"
"help out with the rowing...{page_break}"
"This trip is going to\n"
"be plagued with problems.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07714"
msgstr ""
"O, Master of the Sea,\n"
"protect this ship...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipWatchSeasHelpKaja"
msgid "07715"
msgstr ""
"I'll watch the seas. You\n"
"guys help Kaja and his\n"
"crew with any monsters.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipHiddenAnchorDiscovered"
msgid "07716"
msgstr ""
"Yow! Those guys keep\n"
"staring at me...{page_break}"
"I wonder if they figured\n"
"out I was the one\n"
"who hid the anchor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipLookoutCannotRow"
msgid "07717"
msgstr ""
"So, some oarsmen were\n"
"injured, huh?{page_break}"
"No, no, I'm the lookout.\n"
"You need to ask someone\n"
"else.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipSeaTooVast"
msgid "07718"
msgstr ""
"The lookout? But the\n"
"sea is so vast, how can\n"
"you spot anything?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipOurReplacementNeverArrivedBut"
msgid "07719"
msgstr ""
"Our replacement never\n"
"arrived, but we're shoving\n"
"off just the same.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07720"
msgstr ""
"What about the sea\n"
"monsters? Who's going to\n"
"be protecting the ship?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07721"
msgstr ""
"That'll be me,\n"
"Ouranos, and Sean on\n"
"deck, and...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07722"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1} and his\n"
"friends protecting\n"
"you down here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07723"
msgstr ""
"Can we really depend\n"
"on them?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07724"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1} and his friends\n"
"have seen more combat\n"
"than even I have,{page_break}"
"so there's nothing\n"
"to worry about.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07725"
msgstr ""
"If you say so, Kaja.\n"
"We trust your judgment.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07726"
msgstr ""
"And what will you do if\n"
"any of you becomes\n"
"incapacitated?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07727"
msgstr ""
"We're not sure...\n"
"What happens then??{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07728"
msgstr ""
"Another passenger will\n"
"help row the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07729"
msgstr ""
"Don't worry about it!\n"
"I had a word with\n"
"the passengers.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07730"
msgstr ""
"Who will go and\n"
"give the order when\n"
"the time comes?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07731"
msgstr "Hmmm.{pause_20_skippable} Good point...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07732"
msgstr ""
"You should select a\n"
"replacement and bring\n"
"him here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07733"
msgstr ""
"Rowing requires teamwork.{page_break}"
"Be sure to balance the\n"
"two teams.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07734"
msgstr ""
"That's right. If we're not\n"
"balanced, we won't make\n"
"much progress.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07735"
msgstr ""
"Right. You have\n"
"your orders.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07736"
msgstr ""
"I trust you'll all\n"
"do your best.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipPreparationsReady"
msgid "07737"
msgstr "Preparations...{pause_20_skippable} Ready!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipShipsCourseClear"
msgid "07738"
msgstr "Ship's course...{pause_20_skippable} Clear!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipCastOff"
msgid "07739"
msgstr "All right. Cast off!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipRowThoseOars"
msgid "07740"
msgstr "Row those oars!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipWereOff"
msgid "07741"
msgstr "All right, we're off!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipAvast"
msgid "07742"
msgstr "Avast!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07743"
msgstr "Monsters sighted!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipMonsters"
msgid "07744"
msgstr "Monsters?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipAyeCaptainSeaMonsters"
msgid "07745"
msgstr ""
"Aye, Captain!\n"
"Sea monsters!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07746"
msgstr ""
"Captain, turn the rudder\n"
"hard to starboard!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipImTurning"
msgid "07747"
msgstr "All right, I'm turning!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipNoUseLate"
msgid "07748"
msgstr "It's no use. It's too late!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipArrgh"
msgid "07749"
msgstr "{text_effect:4}Arrgh!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipMonstersBelowdecks"
msgid "07750"
msgstr "Monsters belowdecks!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07751"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}! Take care of\n"
"these beasts and save\n"
"my mates!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipWhereGoingSlay"
msgid "07752"
msgstr ""
"Where are you going,\n"
"{actor_name:1}? Slay the beasts\n"
"and save my mates!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipMonsters2"
msgid "07753"
msgstr "Monsters!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsMonstersFromTheDeepAreAttacking"
msgid "07754"
msgstr ""
"Monsters from the deep\n"
"are attacking, just as the\n"
"captain feared!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsCurseThoseBeastsTheyGotOne"
msgid "07755"
msgstr ""
"Curse those beasts!\n"
"They got one of our\n"
"oarsmen!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWeOarsmenMayBeStrongBut"
msgid "07756"
msgstr ""
"We oarsmen may be\n"
"strong, but we're no\n"
"match for sea monsters!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsFightingOffTheMonstersIsYour"
msgid "07757"
msgstr ""
"Fighting off the monsters\n"
"is your job. Hurry up\n"
"and take care of 'em!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsFoulBeastIMayBeTrembling"
msgid "07758"
msgstr ""
"{text_effect:4}Foul beast! I may be\n"
"trembling...{page_break}"
"{text_effect:4}But I'm trembling with\n"
"anticipation!\n"
"Go get 'em, {actor_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIfIWerentSoTiredId"
msgid "07759"
msgstr ""
"If I weren't so tired, I'd\n"
"beat down those monsters\n"
"without breaking a sweat!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsCursesIWantToSmackThat"
msgid "07760"
msgstr ""
"Curses! I want to smack\n"
"that monster with my oar.{page_break}"
"...But if my oar breaks,\n"
"I won't be able to row...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWhoIsThatThingGoingTo"
msgid "07761"
msgstr ""
"Who is that thing\n"
"going to grab next?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIfYouDontDoABetter"
msgid "07762"
msgstr ""
"If you don't do a better\n"
"job protecting us, there\n"
"won't be any oarsmen left!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWhyArentYouDoingAnythingTo"
msgid "07763"
msgstr ""
"Why aren't you doing\n"
"anything to stop that\n"
"monster?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIfWeLoseAnyMoreOarsmen"
msgid "07764"
msgstr ""
"If we lose any more\n"
"oarsmen, it will slow\n"
"the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWeDontEvenKnowIfAttacking"
msgid "07765"
msgstr ""
"We don't even know if\n"
"attacking the beasts will\n"
"do any good.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIfTheSeaMonstersGetUs"
msgid "07766"
msgstr ""
"If the sea monsters get\n"
"us, we won't be able to\n"
"keep rowing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsImScaredThoseSeaMonstersAre"
msgid "07767"
msgstr ""
"I'm scared. Those sea\n"
"monsters are\n"
"terrifying.{pause_20_skippable} {text_effect:4}Mommy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsFightingSeaMonstersIsForWarriors"
msgid "07768"
msgstr ""
"Fighting sea monsters is\n"
"for warriors. I want\n"
"nothing to do with it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsTheSeaMonstersAreSoTough"
msgid "07769"
msgstr ""
"The sea monsters are so\n"
"tough, a blow from an oar\n"
"wouldn't leave a mark.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIDontCareWhoElseThe"
msgid "07770"
msgstr ""
"I don't care who else the\n"
"monster gets...\n"
"Just save me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsPleaseJustStayHereAndProtect"
msgid "07771"
msgstr ""
"Please! Just stay here\n"
"and protect me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWereSurroundedByDangerOnAll"
msgid "07772"
msgstr ""
"{text_effect:4}We're surrounded by\n"
"danger on all sides, but\n"
"they still make us row!{page_break}"
"Please! Finish these vile\n"
"beasts off!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsAhhhhSeaMonstersRealLiveSea"
msgid "07773"
msgstr ""
"{text_effect:4}Ahhhh! Sea monsters!\n"
"Real, live sea monsters!{page_break}"
"I thought I'd seen every\n"
"type of monster there is,\n"
"but this one's new to me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWhaHeyYouThisIsNo"
msgid "07774"
msgstr ""
"{text_effect:4}Wha{em_dash}{pause_20_skippable} Hey, you! This is\n"
"no time to start a\n"
"conversation!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsAahIHaveToRowThis"
msgid "07775"
msgstr ""
"{text_effect:4}Aah! {pause_20_skippable} I have to row this\n"
"ship because of you!{page_break}"
"And now a sea monster\n"
"is going to eat me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsHHeyIsaacShouldntYouBe"
msgid "07776"
msgstr ""
"{text_effect:4}H{pause_20_skippable}-Hey, {actor_name:1}, shouldn't\n"
"you be moving a\n"
"bit faster?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsYaaahhhIImNotAfraidOf"
msgid "07777"
msgstr ""
"{text_effect:4}Yaaahhh! I-I'm not afraid\n"
"of monsters one bit!{page_break}"
"But I'm just an oarsman,\n"
"now, not a warrior!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsTheOarsmenAreInDireStraights"
msgid "07778"
msgstr ""
"{text_effect:4}The oarsmen are in dire\n"
"straights! Stomp and kick\n"
"those monsters!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIICantDoThisFighting"
msgid "07779"
msgstr ""
"{text_effect:4}I{pause_20_skippable}-I can't do this! Fighting\n"
"off sea monsters isn't\n"
"in my job description!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIDontCareWhatHappensNow"
msgid "07780"
msgstr ""
"{text_effect:4}I don't care what happens\n"
"now. I just want to quit\n"
"rowing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsSeaMonstersAreTerriblyFerocious"
msgid "07781"
msgstr ""
"Sea monsters are\n"
"terribly ferocious!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIfIWereAWarriorI"
msgid "07782"
msgstr ""
"If I were a warrior,\n"
"I wouldn't let a monster\n"
"like this take over!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIWonderIfThisWarriorHas"
msgid "07783"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if this warrior\n"
"has enough confidence to\n"
"defeat a monster.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWereSureInAFixSay"
msgid "07784"
msgstr ""
"We're sure in a fix.\n"
"Say, you're going to row\n"
"next, aren't you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsImSoOutOfMyWits"
msgid "07785"
msgstr ""
"I'm so out of my wits,\n"
"I don't even know how\n"
"frightened I am.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsTheseSeaMonstersLookAwfullyStrong"
msgid "07786"
msgstr ""
"These sea monsters look\n"
"awfully strong!{page_break}"
"I'd rather be an\n"
"oarsman than have\n"
"to fight them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsPleaseOhPleaseLetMeMake"
msgid "07787"
msgstr ""
"Please, oh please, let\n"
"me make it out\n"
"of this alive!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWhyDidSeaMonstersHaveTo"
msgid "07788"
msgstr ""
"Why did sea monsters\n"
"have to appear just when\n"
"I get on board?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIdRatherBeEatenByA"
msgid "07789"
msgstr ""
"I'd rather be eaten by\n"
"a sea monster than have\n"
"to row this ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipHeyAreYouOk"
msgid "07790"
msgstr "Hey, are you OK?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07791"
msgstr ""
"Looks like you took care\n"
"of those sea monsters.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07792"
msgstr "We're missing an oarsman!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07793"
msgstr "Oh no!{pause_20_skippable} He's unconscious!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07794"
msgstr ""
"It looks like the sea\n"
"monsters got one\n"
"of our rowers...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07795"
msgstr ""
"There's no way\n"
"around it...{page_break}"
"{actor_name:1}{pause_20_skippable}, go ask one of\n"
"the passengers to row,\n"
"OK?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07796"
msgstr "Hop to it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07797"
msgstr ""
"Look, I know you don't\n"
"want to have to do this,\n"
"but you promised...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07798"
msgstr ""
"Now, bring a passenger\n"
"who can help row.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckYouMustFeelAwfullyImportantOrdering"
msgid "07799"
msgstr ""
"You must feel awfully\n"
"important, ordering people\n"
"around like this!{page_break}"
"I have a job to do.\n"
"I can't row!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipNoooooNotGoing"
msgid "07800"
msgstr ""
"{text_effect:4}Nooooo!{pause_20_skippable}{reset_text_style} You're not "
"going\n"
"to make me row, are you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07801"
msgstr ""
"I've never done much\n"
"physical labor, but if I\n"
"must{pause_20_skippable}, then I guess I must.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07802"
msgstr ""
"I'm just a businessman.\n"
"I'm not strong enough\n"
"to be of any use.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipJokingWantRow"
msgid "07803"
msgstr ""
"You...{pause_20_skippable} You must be joking.\n"
"You want me to row?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07804"
msgstr ""
"You jerk! What do you\n"
"have against me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07805"
msgstr ""
"Ye{pause_20_skippable}-Yeah. Besides, a\n"
"spatula suits me\n"
"better than an oar.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDontTellGoing"
msgid "07806"
msgstr ""
"Don't tell me{pause_20_skippable} you're going\n"
"to ask a lady to row?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07807"
msgstr ""
"What?{pause_20_skippable} I don't believe this.{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"You're evil! A monster!\n"
"I won't forget this!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07808"
msgstr ""
"You startled me, sir.\n"
"Don't frighten me\n"
"like that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipOhhhhNooooGoingMakeMe"
msgid "07809"
msgstr ""
"What? {text_effect:4}Ohhhh, noooo...{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"{reset_text_style}Are you going to\n"
"make me row?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07810"
msgstr ""
"Huh?{pause_20_skippable} You DO want me\n"
"to row?{page_break}"
"Okay, okay. I'm going\n"
"already. But I'm not gonna\n"
"forget this! You...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07811"
msgstr ""
"What?{pause_20_skippable} You're not going\n"
"to pick me? You really\n"
"are a nice guy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipHaHaHaRowingFeel"
msgid "07812"
msgstr ""
"Ha ha ha. Rowing, right?\n"
"Feel free to choose\n"
"whomever you like.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07813"
msgstr ""
"What?{pause_20_skippable} Me? You must be\n"
"joking! Really?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07814"
msgstr ""
"{text_effect:4}Awwwww!{pause_20_skippable}{reset_text_style} Oh, this is\n"
"just too much to\n"
"handle.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07815"
msgstr ""
"Phew! Don't frighten me\n"
"like that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipNotThinkingMaking"
msgid "07816"
msgstr ""
"Hey!{pause_20_skippable} You're not thinking\n"
"of making me an oarsman,\n"
"are you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07817"
msgstr ""
"Grrr...{pause_20_skippable} I can't believe\n"
"this guy is actually\n"
"choosing me.{page_break}"
"Assigning such menial work\n"
"to a proud person like\n"
"me is going too far!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07818"
msgstr ""
"Heh-heh!{pause_20_skippable} Not picking\n"
"me is a smart choice,\n"
"buddy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipOarsmanGiveBreak"
msgid "07819"
msgstr ""
"What?{pause_20_skippable} Me? An oarsman?\n"
"Give me a break!\n"
"Seriously?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07820"
msgstr ""
"Oh, you are serious...\n"
"Fine! I'll do it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07821"
msgstr ""
"Hahhh... {pause_20_skippable}You scared me so\n"
"bad, my heart nearly\n"
"stopped!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipPoorOarsmanFeel"
msgid "07822"
msgstr ""
"That poor oarsman. I feel\n"
"so sorry for him.{page_break}"
"What?{pause_20_skippable} You want me to\n"
"take his place?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07823"
msgstr ""
"How can you ask a young\n"
"lady to take his place?\n"
"It's not fair!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07824"
msgstr ""
"That's right... You can't\n"
"ask a proper lady to\n"
"do such a filthy job!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipPeopleAskingFrail"
msgid "07825"
msgstr ""
"Out of all these people,\n"
"you're asking a frail old\n"
"man like me to row?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07826"
msgstr ""
"You'll regret this when\n"
"I collapse from\n"
"exhaustion or something!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07827"
msgstr ""
"Th... {pause_20_skippable}That's right...\n"
"Nobody would ever\n"
"choose me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckAnOarsmanWasInjuredByA"
msgid "07828"
msgstr ""
"An oarsman was injured\n"
"by a sea monster?{page_break}"
"I'm just glad I'm not\n"
"the one who has to\n"
"take his place!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsNobodyWouldChooseMeAfterAll"
msgid "07829"
msgstr ""
"Nobody would choose me...\n"
"After all, I'm the tour\n"
"group's guide!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsHeyLooksLikeTheyNeedSomeone"
msgid "07830"
msgstr ""
"Hey! Looks like they need\n"
"someone to help row...\n"
"Don't look over here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsRowingIsAToughJobIsnt"
msgid "07831"
msgstr ""
"Rowing is a tough job,{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"isn't it?{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"It's not for me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsHeyThisGuysBeenStaringAt"
msgid "07832"
msgstr ""
"Hey! This guy's been\n"
"staring at me the whole\n"
"trip... Maybe he likes me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsOhOhNoHesNotComing"
msgid "07833"
msgstr ""
"Oh!{pause_20_skippable} Oh, no! He's not\n"
"coming to ask me to\n"
"row, is he?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsPleasePleaseImBeggingJustDont"
msgid "07834"
msgstr ""
"Please, please... {pause_20_skippable}\n"
"I'm begging! Just don't\n"
"let him choose me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWhatsWithYouGoBotherThe"
msgid "07835"
msgstr ""
"What's with you!? Go\n"
"bother the men, why don't\n"
"you? Tsk!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWhyAmIGettingSoWorked"
msgid "07836"
msgstr ""
"Why am I getting so\n"
"worked up over this?{page_break}"
"There's no way he'd\n"
"choose a decrepit old man\n"
"like me, is there?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWeHadEnoughTroubleJustGetting"
msgid "07837"
msgstr ""
"We had enough trouble\n"
"just getting passengers!{page_break}"
"It's not like we have\n"
"extra oarsmen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipLooksLikeYouveBeenChosen"
msgid "07838"
msgstr ""
"Looks like you've been\n"
"chosen to help row,\n"
"doesn't it?{page_break}"
"So, get on with\n"
"the rowing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipHaHaHaChosenOarsman"
msgid "07839"
msgstr ""
"Ha ha ha!{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"Chosen to be an\n"
"oarsman, huh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipYouFinallyPickedSomeoneDidnt"
msgid "07840"
msgstr ""
"So you finally picked\n"
"someone, didn't you?\n"
"Show your stuff!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipGivesMeChillsThinkCould"
msgid "07841"
msgstr ""
"It gives me chills to\n"
"think that could have\n"
"been me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipIsaacYouveGotGoodEye"
msgid "07842"
msgstr ""
"Hey, {actor_name:1}. You've got\n"
"a good eye!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipThatsWhoYouPickedOarsman"
msgid "07843"
msgstr ""
"That's who you picked\n"
"to be an oarsman?{page_break}"
"Good choice!\n"
"...Looks very...oarsman{pause_20_skippable}ly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipIfYouveChosenOarsmanLets"
msgid "07844"
msgstr ""
"If you've chosen an\n"
"oarsman, let's get\n"
"to rowing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipYouveBeenChosenAsOarsman"
msgid "07845"
msgstr ""
"You've been chosen as\n"
"an oarsman? Aye, now\n"
"that's an honor!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipHoHoPersonGoingGet"
msgid "07846"
msgstr ""
"Ho ho! Is that person\n"
"going to get us to Tolbi?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsYouMakeMeNervousJustStanding"
msgid "07847"
msgstr ""
"You make me nervous\n"
"just standing there,\n"
"looking for oarsmen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIveBeenInAColdSweat"
msgid "07848"
msgstr ""
"I've been in a cold sweat\n"
"thinking they were going\n"
"to choose me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsOhThisPoorSapLooksSad"
msgid "07849"
msgstr ""
"Oh, this poor sap looks\n"
"sad enough to break out\n"
"in tears right here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsOhNoNoWhenOurEyes"
msgid "07850"
msgstr ""
"Oh, no. No...\n"
"When our eyes met, I\n"
"knew that was it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsItsOnlyNaturalThatINot"
msgid "07851"
msgstr ""
"It's only natural that I\n"
"not be chosen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsISnuckByThisTimeBut"
msgid "07852"
msgstr ""
"I snuck by this time...\n"
"But what about next time?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWowThisWarriorIsntGonnaLet"
msgid "07853"
msgstr ""
"Wow... This warrior isn't\n"
"gonna let anyone off easy!\n"
"I'm glad it's not me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsYouCanJustMoveRightAlong"
msgid "07854"
msgstr ""
"You can just move\n"
"right along with that\n"
"person.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsCarefulNowWatchOutDontMake"
msgid "07855"
msgstr ""
"Careful now, watch out...{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"Don't make eye contact.\n"
"Turn the other way.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckItLooksLikeAnotherOarsmanWas"
msgid "07856"
msgstr ""
"It looks like another\n"
"oarsman was injured...{page_break}"
"We have to pick a\n"
"replacement from among\n"
"the passengers.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckIFeelSorryForTheOarsmen"
msgid "07857"
msgstr ""
"I feel sorry for the\n"
"oarsmen who were\n"
"injured.{page_break}"
"Let's see to it that\n"
"no one else gets\n"
"hurt, OK, {actor_name:1}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipOarsmanWasInjured"
msgid "07858"
msgstr "An oarsman was injured?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07859"
msgstr ""
"There's no time to worry.\n"
"We must escape the\n"
"waters of the Karagol!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckWeHaveNoIdeaWhenThose"
msgid "07860"
msgstr ""
"We have no idea when\n"
"those sea monsters\n"
"might attack again.{page_break}"
"Curses! I won't let them\n"
"have their way with us\n"
"any longer!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckUhnnnWhenILookAtThe"
msgid "07861"
msgstr ""
"Uhnnn. When I look at\n"
"the water, I feel sick.{page_break}"
"I wonder how long I can\n"
"fight in this condition...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWeKnewTheRisksWhenWe"
msgid "07862"
msgstr ""
"We knew the risks when\n"
"we set out...{page_break}"
"But it always hurts\n"
"to see a crewman get\n"
"injured.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipBack"
msgid "07863"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}, you're back.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07864"
msgstr ""
"Hey!{pause_20_skippable} Where's the\n"
"replacement for our\n"
"injured oarsman?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07865"
msgstr ""
"What? You didn't choose\n"
"an oarsman?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07866"
msgstr ""
"This ship won't go\n"
"anywhere without\n"
"enough oarsmen!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07867"
msgstr ""
"I'm sorry, but you're\n"
"going to have to choose\n"
"someone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipBackBroughtOarsman"
msgid "07868"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}, you're back!\n"
"And you brought an\n"
"oarsman with you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07869"
msgstr ""
"Well, you're going to\n"
"have to row for us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07870"
msgstr ""
"All right. Take your\n"
"place.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07871"
msgstr ""
"Now, we'll need you to\n"
"protect this area\n"
"again, {actor_name:1}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07872"
msgstr ""
"If we don't leave\n"
"soon...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipWonderWhatsWrongShipShouldnt"
msgid "07873"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what's wrong...{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"The ship shouldn't be\n"
"rocking this badly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07874"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07875"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}, up on deck!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07876"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}, there's a\n"
"huge sea monster on\n"
"the ship!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07877"
msgstr ""
"If we don't do something...\n"
"we'll sink! You have\n"
"to help us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07878"
msgstr ""
"If this ship sinks,\n"
"everything we've done\n"
"will mean nothing...{page_break}"
"Let's go bag us some\n"
"sea monsters.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsImagineTheSizeOfThatBeast"
msgid "07879"
msgstr ""
"Imagine the size of that\n"
"beast!{page_break}"
"Is it even possible\n"
"to slay such a thing?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsHowCanTheseSeaMonstersKeep"
msgid "07880"
msgstr ""
"How can these sea\n"
"monsters keep coming one\n"
"after the other.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsJudgingFromKajasReactionItMust"
msgid "07881"
msgstr ""
"Judging from Kaja's\n"
"reaction, it must be\n"
"a fearsome beast...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsKajaWouldntAskForHelpUnless"
msgid "07882"
msgstr ""
"Kaja wouldn't ask for\n"
"help unless it was\n"
"serious.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsTheWholeShipIsRockingThat"
msgid "07883"
msgstr ""
"The whole ship is rocking!\n"
"That monster must be\n"
"gigantic!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWereOkayWithYouHereWe"
msgid "07884"
msgstr ""
"We're okay. With you\n"
"here, we can handle\n"
"anything.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIfTheShipSinksWereFinished"
msgid "07885"
msgstr ""
"If the ship sinks,\n"
"we're finished.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipThingHasKajaHisMen"
msgid "07886"
msgstr ""
"That thing has Kaja and\n"
"his men worried. It's\n"
"going to be a tough fight.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipMonstersEverywhereImStuckRowing"
msgid "07887"
msgstr ""
"Monsters everywhere, and\n"
"I'm stuck rowing... I\n"
"should have stayed home!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipShipStartingListIfWe"
msgid "07888"
msgstr ""
"The ship is starting to\n"
"list... If we don't do\n"
"something, she'll sink!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipHowManyMonstersOutThere"
msgid "07889"
msgstr ""
"How many monsters are\n"
"out there?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipAnotherMonsterIsntFirstClass"
msgid "07890"
msgstr ""
"Another monster? This\n"
"isn't the first-class\n"
"passage I paid for!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsOwwwMyHandsAreRawFrom"
msgid "07891"
msgstr ""
"Owww! My hands are\n"
"raw from rowing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWhyIsHeDownHereShouldnt"
msgid "07892"
msgstr ""
"Why is he down here?\n"
"Shouldn't he be fighting\n"
"the monsters on deck?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWhatTheHowManyMonstersDoes"
msgid "07893"
msgstr ""
"What the...? How many\n"
"monsters does this make?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWhatKindOfMonsterIsRocking"
msgid "07894"
msgstr ""
"What kind of monster is\n"
"rocking this ship? I really\n"
"want to go take a look...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWereRunningLowOnOarsmenAnd"
msgid "07895"
msgstr ""
"We're running low on\n"
"oarsmen, and I'm\n"
"getting nervous.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsImTakingALittleBreakUntil"
msgid "07896"
msgstr ""
"I'm taking a little break\n"
"until they've defeated\n"
"the sea monsters.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsGoodThingWeHaveSomeStrong"
msgid "07897"
msgstr ""
"Good thing we have\n"
"some strong fighters\n"
"on this ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIWonderIfTheMonsterIs"
msgid "07898"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if the monster\n"
"is big enough to sink\n"
"the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDontCareTakesJustHurry"
msgid "07899"
msgstr ""
"I don't care what it\n"
"takes, just hurry up\n"
"and slay that beast!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipIfThoseMonstersComeBack"
msgid "07900"
msgstr ""
"If those monsters come\n"
"back...go teach\n"
"'em another lesson!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipBoatsRockingMuchImCertain"
msgid "07901"
msgstr ""
"The boat's rocking so\n"
"much. I'm certain\n"
"we're doomed!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipHadIdeaThereWereMany"
msgid "07902"
msgstr ""
"I had no idea there were\n"
"so many monsters out\n"
"at sea...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipWereSurroundedByMonstersStill"
msgid "07903"
msgstr ""
"We're surrounded by\n"
"monsters, and still there's\n"
"no sign of land!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIWonderIfTheyllMakeUs"
msgid "07904"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if they'll make\n"
"us row again once they've\n"
"taken care of that beast.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipThankIsaacDidGoodAgainst"
msgid "07905"
msgstr ""
"Thank you, {actor_name:1}.\n"
"You did good against\n"
"that Kraken.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07906"
msgstr ""
"We lost another\n"
"oarsman, though.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07907"
msgstr ""
"I need to check the hull.\n"
"Go find someone to\n"
"row the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipLandHo"
msgid "07908"
msgstr "Land ho!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipCanSeeLand"
msgid "07909"
msgstr "Hey,{pause_20_skippable} I can see land!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07910"
msgstr "It looks like we made it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipMadeFinallyLucky"
msgid "07911"
msgstr ""
"We made it?{pause_20_skippable} Finally!\n"
"We're lucky to be alive\n"
"after all those attacks!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipOtherPassengersAlready"
msgid "07912"
msgstr ""
"The other passengers have\n"
"already disembarked...\n"
"Didn't even say good-bye.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDontRowAnymore"
msgid "07913"
msgstr ""
"We don't have to row\n"
"anymore? Oh, what a\n"
"relief!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipOhhhHaventWorkout"
msgid "07914"
msgstr ""
"Ohhh! I haven't had a\n"
"workout like that in\n"
"years!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipRowingShipMore"
msgid "07915"
msgstr ""
"Rowing the ship was more\n"
"fun than I expected!\n"
"I'm pretty buff now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipTotallyLostOcean"
msgid "07916"
msgstr ""
"I totally lost out... An\n"
"ocean cruise, and I didn't\n"
"get to enjoy the view!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipMakeOldMan"
msgid "07917"
msgstr ""
"You make an old man\n"
"row the ship, then you\n"
"try to beat him onshore?{page_break}"
"That's pretty pathetic.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipThanksHardWork"
msgid "07918"
msgstr ""
"Thanks for all\n"
"your hard work.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07919"
msgstr ""
"Your efforts got this\n"
"ship to shore.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07920"
msgstr "I thank you again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07921"
msgstr ""
"Hurry, everyone! Colosso\n"
"is already underway\n"
"in Tolbi!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07922"
msgstr ""
"You'd better get moving\n"
"to Tolbi, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIDontThinkAnyoneWillBe"
msgid "07923"
msgstr ""
"I don't think anyone\n"
"will be crossing the\n"
"Karagol for a while...{page_break}"
"The oarsmen won't work\n"
"for us anymore.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsYouFolksReallyFoughtWell"
msgid "07924"
msgstr ""
"You folks really\n"
"fought well.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsALotOfOarsmenWereInjured"
msgid "07925"
msgstr ""
"A lot of oarsmen were\n"
"injured on this\n"
"voyage.{page_break}"
"Nobody's going to want to\n"
"row until things calm\n"
"down in the Karagol Sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsAreWeSafeItsAllBecause"
msgid "07926"
msgstr ""
"Are we safe? It's all\n"
"because you defeated\n"
"those monsters!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIveBeenAnOarsmanAllMy"
msgid "07927"
msgstr ""
"I've been an oarsman all\n"
"my life, but this last job\n"
"was the worst ever!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsYouGoOnAheadJustWhen"
msgid "07928"
msgstr ""
"You go on ahead. Just\n"
"when it looked like\n"
"everything was all right,{page_break}"
"my back went out, and\n"
"now I can't move.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWeCantFindAnyoneToReplace"
msgid "07929"
msgstr ""
"We can't find anyone to\n"
"replace our old oarsmen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsImJustGladTheKrakenDidnt"
msgid "07930"
msgstr ""
"I'm just glad the Kraken\n"
"didn't hurt me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsSureThePaysGoodButIt"
msgid "07931"
msgstr ""
"Sure, the pay's good, but\n"
"it doesn't mean a thing if\n"
"you get hurt on the job.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIsaacAndHisPalsWereSo"
msgid "07932"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1} and his pals\n"
"we're so daring,\n"
"fighting back there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIFeelBetterNowIWas"
msgid "07933"
msgstr ""
"I feel better now. I was\n"
"just so scared when I\n"
"was rowing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsImInNoRushAnywayThis"
msgid "07934"
msgstr ""
"I'm in no rush, anyway...\n"
"This might be the last\n"
"time I get on a ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckYouLookinForSeanAndOuranos"
msgid "07935"
msgstr ""
"You lookin' for Sean and\n"
"Ouranos? They left for\n"
"Tolbi with that tour.{page_break}"
"I figure they're headed\n"
"for Colosso.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipHeadedColosso"
msgid "07936"
msgstr ""
"Are you headed for\n"
"Colosso, too?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07937"
msgstr ""
"I thought so. Most people\n"
"coming at this time of\n"
"year usually are.{page_break}"
"There was this group of\n"
"six we ferried across\n"
"a while back.{page_break}"
"Now they were strange.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07938"
msgstr ""
"You came all this way,\n"
"and you're not going\n"
"to Colosso?{page_break}"
"That old guy's group,\n"
"those six weirdos, and\n"
"now you...{page_break}"
"You guys are strange!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckThisGroupThatCameOnOur"
msgid "07939"
msgstr ""
"This group that came on\n"
"our last voyage pulled\n"
"some strange stunts.{page_break}"
"Actually, I was sorta\n"
"spying on them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckIWantSeanAndOuranosTo"
msgid "07940"
msgstr ""
"I want Sean and Ouranos\n"
"to do well at Colosso\n"
"this year,{page_break}"
"but they don't stand a\n"
"chance if {actor_name:1}\n"
"enters the contest.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckImJustGoingToHangOut"
msgid "07941"
msgstr ""
"I'm just going to hang out\n"
"in Tolbi and enjoy myself\n"
"for a while.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckIWonderWhatHappenedToThat"
msgid "07942"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what happened\n"
"to that strange group\n"
"that went on to Tolbi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWhenTheWatersAreThisDangerous"
msgid "07943"
msgstr ""
"When the waters are this\n"
"dangerous, you just can't\n"
"take to the seas.{page_break}"
"I think I'll check out\n"
"Colosso while we think\n"
"about what to do next.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsSeeOurShipSurvivedAnAttack"
msgid "07944"
msgstr ""
"See? Our ship survived\n"
"an attack and crossed\n"
"the sea safely.{page_break}"
"It just proves how\n"
"effective that lucky\n"
"anchor really is!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayHearScaryTrip"
msgid "07945"
msgstr ""
"I hear you had a scary\n"
"trip. You even got\n"
"attacked by a monster!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07946"
msgstr ""
"I wonder why the sea is\n"
"so dangerous all of\n"
"a sudden...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07947"
msgstr ""
"And you fought off all\n"
"those monsters alone?\n"
"...No way!{page_break}"
"Everyone knows that Kaja\n"
"was the one who killed\n"
"the Kraken!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksSighIThinkWereDoneSailing"
msgid "07948"
msgstr ""
"Sigh...{pause_20_skippable} I think we're\n"
"done sailing for a while.{page_break}"
"We've already lost one\n"
"ship... What else can\n"
"we do?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksIGuessWeWontBeSeeing"
msgid "07949"
msgstr ""
"I guess we won't be\n"
"seeing anyone back home\n"
"in Angara for a while.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksIThinkThatMissingShipMust"
msgid "07950"
msgstr ""
"I think that missing ship\n"
"must have run into the\n"
"Kraken...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksImSorryButWeJustCant"
msgid "07951"
msgstr ""
"I'm sorry, but we just\n"
"can't sell any tickets\n"
"right now.{page_break}"
"The sea is too dangerous,\n"
"so we've had to cancel\n"
"all crossings.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksWeRentedOutOurHouseFor"
msgid "07952"
msgstr ""
"We rented out our house\n"
"for Colosso, and now the\n"
"ship's not launching!{page_break}"
"If the ship isn't crossing,\n"
"we can't take our trip!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksWeRentedOutOurHouseIf"
msgid "07953"
msgstr ""
"We rented out our house.\n"
"If the ship won't sail,\n"
"where will we sleep?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksSighWeCouldHaveMadeLots"
msgid "07954"
msgstr ""
"Sigh. We could have made\n"
"lots of money on those\n"
"tickets. Bad luck, I guess.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksMaybeWellStayHereUntilThe"
msgid "07955"
msgstr ""
"Maybe we'll stay here\n"
"until the ship leaves.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksAreWeSupposedToSleepOn"
msgid "07956"
msgstr ""
"Are we supposed to\n"
"sleep on the floor until\n"
"they set sail again?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTouristsLookUpset"
msgid "07957"
msgstr ""
"The tourists look a\n"
"little upset. Did they\n"
"get seasick?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07958"
msgstr ""
"The sea was calm, but\n"
"that monster sure gave\n"
"them a rough ride.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07959"
msgstr ""
"The ship was attacked by\n"
"monsters? It came within\n"
"inches of sinking? Wow!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalaySilkRoadBlocked"
msgid "07960"
msgstr ""
"Silk Road was blocked,\n"
"so I thought my parents\n"
"might come by ship.{page_break}"
"I don't see them\n"
"anywhere, though...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07961"
msgstr ""
"What's that?{pause_20_skippable} You have\n"
"a message for me from\n"
"my parents?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07962"
msgstr ""
"Oh, they couldn't make\n"
"it because the tickets\n"
"were too expensive?{page_break}"
"Thank you for letting\n"
"me know!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07963"
msgstr ""
"Oh... I hope nothing\n"
"awful's happened to\n"
"them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayThanksMessageParents"
msgid "07964"
msgstr ""
"Thank you for giving\n"
"me the message\n"
"from my parents.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksIfYoureGoingToTolbiKeep"
msgid "07965"
msgstr ""
"If you're going to Tolbi,\n"
"keep heading west.\n"
"It's not too far.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksItsBeenQuiteSomeTimeSince"
msgid "07966"
msgstr ""
"It's been quite some time\n"
"since the Colosso Tour\n"
"passengers left for Tolbi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksAfterSeeingTheLooksOnThe"
msgid "07967"
msgstr ""
"After seeing the looks on\n"
"the passengers' faces,{page_break}"
"I don't feel like\n"
"waiting for my ship\n"
"anymore.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksItWasAHardCrossingVery"
msgid "07968"
msgstr ""
"It was a hard crossing...\n"
"Very risky. I'm glad\n"
"they didn't come...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksIGetTheFeelingThatIt"
msgid "07969"
msgstr ""
"I get the feeling that it\n"
"will be a long time before\n"
"the next sea crossing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksYouCrossedTheSeaJustFor"
msgid "07970"
msgstr ""
"You crossed the sea just\n"
"for Colosso? ...That was\n"
"a big undertaking!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipFinallyReachedTolbi"
msgid "07971"
msgstr ""
"Hmm... {pause_20_skippable} So we've finally\n"
"reached Tolbi, huh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07972"
msgstr ""
"Umm... No.{page_break}"
"That doesn't look like\n"
"Tolbi's coast.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07973"
msgstr ""
"We must be off course.\n"
"I don't recognize this\n"
"place.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07974"
msgstr ""
"You're right...\n"
"That looks like an island.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07975"
msgstr ""
"Hmm... Maybe we should\n"
"stop for a minute.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07976"
msgstr ""
"We need time to check\n"
"the ship's position...{page_break}"
"Let's head for that\n"
"island and get our\n"
"bearings.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipReachedIslandRowers"
msgid "07977"
msgstr ""
"We've reached the island!{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"Rowers, rest those\n"
"weary arms!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07978"
msgstr ""
"Island? Isn't this\n"
"Tolbi?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07979"
msgstr ""
"What do you mean, island?\n"
"Aren't we in Tolbi?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07980"
msgstr ""
"Uh... Tolbi's not an island,\n"
"is it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipShipWentOff"
msgid "07981"
msgstr ""
"The ship went off course,\n"
"and we're... Well, we're\n"
"not sure where we are.{page_break}"
"We've come to this\n"
"island so we can get our\n"
"bearings.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07982"
msgstr ""
"Raise your oars and rest\n"
"for a little while.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07983"
msgstr ""
"I'm going to check on\n"
"the other passengers.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07984"
msgstr ""
"If the ship isn't going\n"
"anywhere, I'm not\n"
"waiting down here.{page_break}"
"Let's take a break\n"
"out front.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07985"
msgstr ""
"If I'm not rowing,\n"
"I ain't staying here.{page_break}"
"I'm gonna go take\n"
"my break out front.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "07986"
msgstr ""
"As long as we're stopping,\n"
"I don't have to stay\n"
"in here.{page_break}"
"It's time for my break.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIveBeenSailingForManyYears"
msgid "07987"
msgstr ""
"I've been sailing for\n"
"many years, and I've\n"
"never seen this island!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWowIHaveABlisterOn"
msgid "07988"
msgstr ""
"Wow!{pause_20_skippable} I have a blister\n"
"on my drumming hand...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIWonderIfItsOkayTo"
msgid "07989"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if it's okay to\n"
"leave the ship here...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsStoppingAgainAndAgainLikeThis"
msgid "07990"
msgstr ""
"Stopping again and again\n"
"like this is harder than\n"
"rowing all day long.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsLetsSeeIslandsInTheKaragol"
msgid "07991"
msgstr ""
"Let's see, islands in\n"
"the Karagol Sea...{pause_20_skippable}{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"Hmmm...just thinking.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWhenWereRowingWeCanJust"
msgid "07992"
msgstr ""
"When we're rowing, we\n"
"can just sit and\n"
"space out, but...{page_break}"
"It makes me nervous,\n"
"just sitting here\n"
"and not rowing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsItsCrazyToHaveInexperiencedPassengers"
msgid "07993"
msgstr ""
"It's crazy to have\n"
"inexperienced passengers\n"
"rowing the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsItWasHardForMeAll"
msgid "07994"
msgstr ""
"It was hard for me all\n"
"the way across the sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsISureHopeAnotherMonsterDoesnt"
msgid "07995"
msgstr ""
"I sure hope another\n"
"monster doesn't attack...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsLooksLikeImGoingToHave"
msgid "07996"
msgstr ""
"Looks like I'm going to\n"
"have sore muscles for the\n"
"first time in a while...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsCouldThisBeThatIslandThats"
msgid "07997"
msgstr ""
"Could this be that island{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"that's rumored to have\n"
"buried treasure?{page_break}"
"Even if it is, I'm too\n"
"scared of monsters to\n"
"leave the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsMaybeItsTimeForMeTo"
msgid "07998"
msgstr ""
"Maybe it's time for\n"
"me to retire...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsYouCantGoOntoTheIsland"
msgid "07999"
msgstr ""
"You can't go onto the\n"
"island! It's too dangerous!{page_break}"
"What if there are\n"
"monsters?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsButThereWereMonstersAtSea"
msgid "08000"
msgstr ""
"But there were monsters\n"
"at sea, so shouldn't it\n"
"be safer on land?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWeveBeenCoopedUpOnThat"
msgid "08001"
msgstr ""
"We've been cooped up\n"
"on that ship too long.{page_break}"
"We're near land, so let\n"
"us stretch our legs!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsThereCouldBeMonstersHereSo"
msgid "08002"
msgstr ""
"There could be monsters\n"
"here, so leaving the\n"
"ship might be dangerous.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsTheShipKeepsShakingSheCant"
msgid "08003"
msgstr ""
"The ship keeps shaking...\n"
"She can't take much more!{page_break}"
"I want to plant my feet\n"
"firmly on land!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWhyShouldWeHaveToWait"
msgid "08004"
msgstr ""
"Why should we have to\n"
"wait on this tiny boat?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIfThereAreMonstersImNot"
msgid "08005"
msgstr ""
"If there are monsters,\n"
"I'm not going anywhere.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIDontHearThePassengersScreaming"
msgid "08006"
msgstr ""
"I don't hear the\n"
"passengers screaming to\n"
"get off the boat.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDontFeelDontTalkMe"
msgid "08007"
msgstr ""
"I don't feel so well..\n"
"Don't talk to me...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipHateArguing"
msgid "08008"
msgstr "I hate arguing...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWhatToDoImWorriedAbout"
msgid "08009"
msgstr ""
"What to do...\n"
"I'm worried about the\n"
"passenger's safety,{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsButWhyShouldWeStayOnboard"
msgid "08010"
msgstr ""
"but why should we stay\n"
"onboard when there's land\n"
"right in front of us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsImSickOfThisShipIm"
msgid "08011"
msgstr ""
"I'm sick of this ship...\n"
"I'm going ashore.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsLandMonstersICanHandleSea"
msgid "08012"
msgstr ""
"Land monsters, I can\n"
"handle; sea monsters are\n"
"all slimy and icky...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIveBeenWobblingOnThisBoat"
msgid "08013"
msgstr ""
"I've been wobbling on\n"
"this boat for so long I\n"
"can hardly stand!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsGoAheadTryAndStopMe"
msgid "08014"
msgstr ""
"Go ahead, try and stop\n"
"me! I'm going ashore!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsJustDontMakeMeFaceThat"
msgid "08015"
msgstr ""
"Just don't make me face\n"
"that disgusting Kraken\n"
"again...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsSoAnyoneKnowIfThereAre"
msgid "08016"
msgstr ""
"So...anyone know if\n"
"there are any monsters\n"
"out there?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsOhhThatsCreepy"
msgid "08017"
msgstr "Ohh, that's creepy...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsInAPerfectWorldThereWouldnt"
msgid "08018"
msgstr ""
"In a perfect world, there\n"
"wouldn't be any monsters\n"
"waiting to pounce on me...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipIsaacDontTalkLikeShouldnt"
msgid "08019"
msgstr ""
"{protagonist_name}, don't talk\n"
"like that.{pause_20_skippable} Shouldn't we\n"
"listen to them?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckKajaAndTheCaptainAreProfessionals"
msgid "08020"
msgstr ""
"Kaja and the captain are\n"
"professionals.{page_break}"
"We ought to trust them\n"
"and wait, like they said.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipIsaacTalkedPassengersDidntTour"
msgid "08021"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}, you talked\n"
"to the passengers,\n"
"didn't you?{page_break}"
"The tour group is arguing\n"
"about whether they should\n"
"leave the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08022"
msgstr ""
"We'd like to go ashore\n"
"and see if it's safe\n"
"out there...{page_break}"
"But we promised we'd\n"
"protect the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08023"
msgstr ""
"...That's it! {pause_20_skippable} {actor_name:1}!{page_break}"
"Can you go check out the\n"
"island and see if there\n"
"are any monsters?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08024"
msgstr ""
"The passengers all seem\n"
"to be upset, so let's try\n"
"to do as they ask.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08025"
msgstr ""
"That's right. We have to\n"
"do something, or there'll\n"
"be no resolving this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08026"
msgstr ""
"It would be fun to\n"
"explore the island!\n"
"What do you say, {actor_name:1}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipSeeYoureGoingGoFor"
msgid "08027"
msgstr ""
"I see, you're going to go\n"
"for me, aren't you?{page_break}"
"I'm sure no one will\n"
"complain if we scout out\n"
"the island.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckTheresNoTellingWhatKindOf"
msgid "08028"
msgstr ""
"There's no telling what\n"
"kind of monsters are\n"
"lurking on this island...{page_break}"
"Be extremely careful!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckWeveDoneAGoodJobOf"
msgid "08029"
msgstr ""
"We've done a good job\n"
"of keeping the ship\n"
"safe so far!{page_break}"
"{actor_name:1}, you can\n"
"leave everything to us\n"
"while you're away.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckIWantToBeASailor"
msgid "08030"
msgstr ""
"I want to be a sailor\n"
"like Kaja, reading the\n"
"wind and the waves...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckIGiveUpWhatAreWe"
msgid "08031"
msgstr ""
"I give up! What are\n"
"we supposed to do?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckThatsEnoughBickering"
msgid "08032"
msgstr "That's enough bickering...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckThisIslandGivesMeTheCreeps"
msgid "08033"
msgstr ""
"This island gives me the\n"
"creeps...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipDeckWhatWeCanDoNowIs"
msgid "08034"
msgstr ""
"What we can do now\n"
"is to protect this ship...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipMonstersAnywhereAroundHere"
msgid "08035"
msgstr ""
"Be careful{em_dash}there\n"
"could be monsters\n"
"anywhere around here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipIslandTreasures"
msgid "08036"
msgstr ""
"You'd be surprised, the\n"
"kinds of treasure you can\n"
"find on islands like these.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWeMayHaveTakenTheWrong"
msgid "08037"
msgstr ""
"We may have taken the\n"
"wrong route, but we've\n"
"made a lot of progress.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWereLookingIntoTheShipsPosition"
msgid "08038"
msgstr ""
"We're looking into the\n"
"ship's position. It'll be\n"
"a bit longer.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsImReallySurprisedThatThereIs"
msgid "08039"
msgstr ""
"I'm really surprised that\n"
"there is an island like\n"
"this in the Karagol Sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsTheWindsDirectionAndTheHigh"
msgid "08040"
msgstr ""
"The wind's direction and\n"
"the high seas... We've\n"
"got to be close to Tolbi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipHowWasIsaacDidExplore"
msgid "08041"
msgstr ""
"How was it, {actor_name:1}?{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"Did you explore the\n"
"island thoroughly?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08042"
msgstr ""
"If we don't decide if we\n"
"can go ashore, they'll\n"
"never stop whining.{page_break}"
"...I hate to ask you, but\n"
"would you go exploring\n"
"one more time?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08043"
msgstr ""
"Well...{pause_20_skippable} Did you see any\n"
"monsters out there?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08044"
msgstr ""
"...I see.{pause_20_skippable} Then we can't\n"
"let the tourists go\n"
"ashore after all?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08045"
msgstr ""
"If there aren't any\n"
"monsters,{pause_20_skippable} I guess we can\n"
"let the tourists out!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08046"
msgstr ""
"The passengers are going\n"
"stir crazy! They're out\n"
"of control!{page_break}"
"You're going to have\n"
"to let the passengers\n"
"go ashore.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08047"
msgstr "There's no need for that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08048"
msgstr ""
"We figured out the\n"
"course to Tolbi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08049"
msgstr "Really? We can go?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08050"
msgstr ""
"Let's go to Tolbi before\n"
"the sea gets any rougher.{page_break}"
"Tell our tourists they\n"
"can enjoy a nice, long\n"
"break after we arrive.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08051"
msgstr ""
"It's too late...\n"
"Nothing we can say will\n"
"calm them down.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08052"
msgstr ""
"If we hurry, we can make\n"
"it to Colosso in time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08053"
msgstr ""
"I see!{pause_20_skippable} If we can get\n"
"them to Colosso, they'll\n"
"all be happy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08054"
msgstr ""
"All right then, go and\n"
"tell the tourists.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08055"
msgstr ""
"It's not much farther.\n"
"I'll ask the oarsmen to\n"
"work 'til the very end.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipSorryEveryoneButWeNeed"
msgid "08056"
msgstr ""
"Sorry, everyone{pause_20_skippable}, but\n"
"we need to switch the\n"
"left and right teams!{page_break}"
"We've strayed off\n"
"course because the left\n"
"team's timing is off.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08057"
msgstr ""
"One last push should\n"
"get us there. Give it\n"
"all you've got, people!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08058"
msgstr ""
"All right!{pause_20_skippable} Let's aim for\n"
"Tolbi and set off one\n"
"last time!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipImSpreadingGoodwillWhereverTravel"
msgid "08059"
msgstr ""
"I'm spreading goodwill\n"
"wherever I travel.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsEvenThoughImOpposedToViolence"
msgid "08060"
msgstr ""
"Even though I'm opposed\n"
"to violence, I'm looking\n"
"forward to Colosso.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipShipsCrewReadyForAnything"
msgid "08061"
msgstr ""
"The ship's crew is ready\n"
"for anything, and I'll\n"
"be right here for them.{page_break}"
"Ask the others to do\n"
"the rowing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsICantRowButIAm"
msgid "08062"
msgstr ""
"I can't row, but I am\n"
"hoping for the ship's\n"
"safe arrival.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipShipsCrewReadyAnything"
msgid "08063"
msgstr ""
"The ship's crew is ready\n"
"for anything, and I'll\n"
"be right here for them.{page_break}"
"Ask the others to do\n"
"the rowing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsIsThisCruelOrdealPartOf"
msgid "08064"
msgstr ""
"Is this cruel ordeal\n"
"part of some plan fate\n"
"has in store for me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipGoodShipHasArrivedSafely"
msgid "08065"
msgstr ""
"It is good that the ship\n"
"has arrived safely.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipInteriorsWeMadeItToColossoIn"
msgid "08066"
msgstr ""
"We made it to Colosso\n"
"in time... That's good.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksTheShipWontBeLeavingHere"
msgid "08067"
msgstr ""
"The ship won't be leaving\n"
"here... There are too\n"
"many monsters at sea.{page_break}"
"This ship isn't going\n"
"anywhere for a while.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksAhhhImBoredWhenAreWe"
msgid "08068"
msgstr ""
"Ahhh. I'm bored...{pause_20_skippable} When\n"
"are we going out\n"
"to sea again?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksTheShipHasntReturnedSoWe"
msgid "08069"
msgstr ""
"The ship hasn't returned,\n"
"so we couldn't set off\n"
"even if we wanted to.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksOhHoHoWithoutAShip"
msgid "08070"
msgstr ""
"Oh ho ho! Without a ship,\n"
"we can't do any business...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksImGladIOnlyWorkOn"
msgid "08071"
msgstr ""
"I'm glad I only work on\n"
"the docks...but I am\n"
"worried about the others.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksIWonderIfMonstersGotEveryone"
msgid "08072"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if monsters\n"
"got everyone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayIncredibleOcean"
msgid "08073"
msgstr ""
"Incredible! So this is the\n"
"ocean Kraden was talking\n"
"about!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08074"
msgstr ""
"The Karagol is surrounded\n"
"by land,{pause_20_skippable} so technically,\n"
"it's not a real ocean.{page_break}"
"A true ocean is\n"
"totally open.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08075"
msgstr ""
"What? But this looks\n"
"just the way Kraden\n"
"described it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08076"
msgstr ""
"Someday, I want\n"
"to see a real\n"
"ocean, {actor_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiTolbisAlwaysReallyBustlingDuringColosso"
msgid "08077"
msgstr ""
"Tolbi's always really\n"
"bustling during Colosso.{page_break}"
"This festival only happens\n"
"once a year, so I'm\n"
"really excited.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiColossoIsHeldInTheColosseum"
msgid "08078"
msgstr ""
"Colosso is held in the\n"
"colosseum in the heart\n"
"of Tolbi.{page_break}"
"If we don't go right now,\n"
"we won't get good seats!\n"
"That won't be any fun!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiTryoutsStartedAtTheColosseumToday"
msgid "08079"
msgstr ""
"Tryouts started at the\n"
"colosseum today.{page_break}"
"I'm planning to go\n"
"watch the finals.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiColossoShouldHaveStartedTodayWhat"
msgid "08080"
msgstr ""
"Colosso should have\n"
"started today. What\n"
"on earth is going on?{page_break}"
"I saw Babi's bodyguards\n"
"wandering around.{page_break}"
"What if something's\n"
"happened to our leader?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiBabiWasAlreadyPrettyOldBack"
msgid "08081"
msgstr ""
"Babi was already pretty\n"
"old back about the time\n"
"I was born.{page_break}"
"I'm 65 years old now,\n"
"so just imagine how old\n"
"Babi must be!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiSomeoneLiveMore"
msgid "08082"
msgstr ""
"Can someone live to be\n"
"more than 100 years old?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08083"
msgstr ""
"Hmmm. Still, I'm pretty\n"
"sure Babi is a lot\n"
"older than 100...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08084"
msgstr ""
"You could be right. But\n"
"then, what about Tolbi's\n"
"ruler, Babi?{page_break}"
"He's supposedly at least\n"
"50 years older than I am!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiWheeFestivalColosso"
msgid "08085"
msgstr ""
"Whee! It's a festival!\n"
"It's the Colosso Festival!{page_break}"
"What'll I buy with all\n"
"the money Mama gave\n"
"me? I can't decide!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiWaahSaidMoney"
msgid "08086"
msgstr ""
"Waah! She said that money\n"
"was for both of us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiGetYourColossoSouvenirsTheyMake"
msgid "08087"
msgstr ""
"Get your Colosso\n"
"souvenirs! They make\n"
"great gifts!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiGetYourSnacksAndDrinksBefore"
msgid "08088"
msgstr ""
"Get your snacks and\n"
"drinks before you get\n"
"in the colosseum!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiIveDecidedNotToFightAt"
msgid "08089"
msgstr ""
"I've decided not to fight\n"
"at Colosso after all.{page_break}"
"Have you seen the\n"
"contestants? They're\n"
"HUGE!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiWowTolbisFestivalIsHumongousJust"
msgid "08090"
msgstr ""
"Wow, Tolbi's festival is\n"
"humongous! Just seeing all\n"
"this is so exciting!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiRatsWeOversleptAndNowThe"
msgid "08091"
msgstr ""
"Rats! We overslept, and\n"
"now the colosseum is\n"
"full!{page_break}"
"There's nothing we can\n"
"do, so we've just been\n"
"wandering around Tolbi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiSpringYeahThatDiceGameLooksKinda"
msgid "08092"
msgstr ""
"Yeah. That dice game\n"
"looks kinda fun.{page_break}"
"If you can enjoy playing\n"
"a game AND win prizes,\n"
"why not give it a try?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiChildrenLoveSouvenirs"
msgid "08093"
msgstr ""
"Children really do love\n"
"souvenirs, don't they?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08094"
msgstr ""
"I'll bet you like them, too.\n"
"Don't try to hide it! I\n"
"used to love souvenirs...{page_break}"
"But the wife doesn't\n"
"go in for that sort\n"
"of thing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08095"
msgstr ""
"Hmph! You're only saying\n"
"that because your parents\n"
"never bought you any!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiPatientLittleGuy"
msgid "08096"
msgstr "Be patient, little guy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08097"
msgstr ""
"I'll buy you better\n"
"sweets than those\n"
"later on.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiWaahBuySweets"
msgid "08098"
msgstr ""
"{text_effect:4}Waah!{reset_text_style} Buy me some\n"
"sweets! I said buy me\n"
"some sweets!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInnsFullStaying"
msgid "08099"
msgstr ""
"The inns are all full, so\n"
"I'm staying here.{page_break}"
"This archway keeps the\n"
"rain off of me, so\n"
"it's as good as any inn.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiTouristsArentTheOnlyOnesWho"
msgid "08100"
msgstr ""
"Tourists aren't the\n"
"only ones who love\n"
"Colosso! It's the best!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiTheTrialsAreStartingAtThe"
msgid "08101"
msgstr ""
"The trials are starting at\n"
"the colosseum today.{page_break}"
"If you win there, you\n"
"advance to the finals.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiTheTrialsAreOkayButThe"
msgid "08102"
msgstr ""
"The trials are okay, but\n"
"the finals are the real\n"
"fun at Colosso.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiItsNotLikeThereHaveBeen"
msgid "08103"
msgstr ""
"It's not like there have\n"
"been any problems\n"
"lately...{page_break}"
"I wonder what's\n"
"happened to set Babi's\n"
"soldiers in motion.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiEveryYearIGetOlderAnd"
msgid "08104"
msgstr ""
"Every year, I get older\n"
"and older, while Babi\n"
"just stays the same.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiWhatIfBabiIsActuallyA"
msgid "08105"
msgstr ""
"What if Babi is actually\n"
"a totally different\n"
"person now,{page_break}"
"and we just don't\n"
"know it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiOldestShouldntShare"
msgid "08106"
msgstr ""
"I'm the oldest, so I\n"
"shouldn't have to\n"
"share my allowance.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiMamaToldShare"
msgid "08107"
msgstr ""
"Mama told us to share\n"
"the money. Doesn't\n"
"my brother remember?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiWeHaveToSellAllOf"
msgid "08108"
msgstr ""
"We have to sell all of\n"
"these Colosso souvenirs\n"
"before Colosso ends.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiTheyreSellingTheseAtTheColosseum"
msgid "08109"
msgstr ""
"They're selling these at\n"
"the colosseum, too, but\n"
"they're cheaper here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiISawThePeopleWhoAre"
msgid "08110"
msgstr ""
"I saw the people who are\n"
"going to fight. They look\n"
"so intimidating!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiTolbiIsNotLikeXianIt"
msgid "08111"
msgstr ""
"Tolbi is not like Xian.\n"
"It is very lively here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiICantSayAnythingCauseIt"
msgid "08112"
msgstr ""
"I can't say anything,\n"
"'cause it sounds bad,{page_break}"
"but I suddenly got too\n"
"scared to watch Colosso,\n"
"so I overslept on purpose!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiSpringILikePlayingLuckyDiceBut"
msgid "08113"
msgstr ""
"I like playing Lucky Dice,\n"
"but if I'm not careful,\n"
"I'll spend all my money!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiTheStuffTheyreSellingAtThe"
msgid "08114"
msgstr ""
"The stuff they're selling\n"
"at the stalls along the\n"
"street looks so tasty!{page_break}"
"If my kids buy some, I'd\n"
"be able to eat too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiWhyDoKidsWantSuchAwful"
msgid "08115"
msgstr ""
"Why do kids want such\n"
"awful stuff?{page_break}"
"I'm not ever buying you\n"
"that! No matter what!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiThoseSweetsSmellGreatImNot"
msgid "08116"
msgstr ""
"Those sweets smell great.\n"
"I'm not moving until\n"
"you buy me some.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiIveBeenGuardingOurSpotBut"
msgid "08117"
msgstr ""
"I've been guarding our\n"
"spot, but it's not\n"
"really worth it.{page_break}"
"I wonder if my friends\n"
"will get here soon...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiSeenAnyoneWho"
msgid "08118"
msgstr ""
"Hey, have you seen anyone\n"
"who looks like this?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08119"
msgstr "Babi must be nearby!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08120"
msgstr ""
"Where's Babi!? He\n"
"doesn't seem to be here.\n"
"Let's look over there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08121"
msgstr "Missing Person"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsTolbiIsPackedWithTouristsDuring"
msgid "08122"
msgstr ""
"Tolbi is packed with\n"
"tourists during Colosso,\n"
"so the inns are all full.{page_break}"
"Me, I just line up some\n"
"beds, and presto!\n"
"I'm an innkeeper!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiWantStay"
msgid "08123"
msgstr ""
"Do you want to\n"
"stay with us?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08124"
msgstr ""
"Actually, I'm sorry, but\n"
"we're already full, and I\n"
"don't have room for you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08125"
msgstr ""
"That's good... Our place\n"
"is already full, anyway.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsICouldntSleepAtAllLast"
msgid "08126"
msgstr ""
"I couldn't sleep at all last\n"
"night. The guy next to me\n"
"snored the whole time!{page_break}"
"I'm so tired... I'm just\n"
"not ready for Colosso!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsTheCrowdsAtTheColosseumMade"
msgid "08127"
msgstr ""
"The crowds at the\n"
"colosseum made me feel\n"
"sick, so I came back!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsOnceColossoStartsWereGoingTo"
msgid "08128"
msgstr ""
"Once Colosso starts,\n"
"we're going to make so\n"
"much money. I love this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsItsTooLateToStartLooking"
msgid "08129"
msgstr ""
"It's too late to start\n"
"looking now. They'll never\n"
"find a place to stay!{page_break}"
"People fighting at Colosso\n"
"all stay at Babi's Palace.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIfICouldHaveSleptLast"
msgid "08130"
msgstr ""
"If I could have slept last\n"
"night, I would have had a\n"
"great time at Colosso.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsHuhUhCrowdsAreADefinite"
msgid "08131"
msgstr ""
"Huh-uh. Crowds are a\n"
"definite no-no.{page_break}"
"Say, why wasn't Tolbi's\n"
"ruler{em_dash}Babi, or whatever\n"
"his name is{em_dash}there?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsWePaidGoodMoneyToRent"
msgid "08132"
msgstr ""
"We paid good money to\n"
"rent this house during the\n"
"festival, so get out!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsWeGetToStayHereUntil"
msgid "08133"
msgstr ""
"We get to stay here until\n"
"the owners come back.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIReallyWantToSeeColosso"
msgid "08134"
msgstr ""
"I really want to see\n"
"Colosso, too!{page_break}"
"But the colosseum gets\n"
"too crowded, so I'm just\n"
"going to watch the finals.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsWahhhIWantToSeeColosso"
msgid "08135"
msgstr ""
"Wahhh! I want to see\n"
"Colosso, but no one\n"
"will take me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIWasStubbornISaidIm"
msgid "08136"
msgstr ""
"I was stubborn; I said,\n"
"\"I'm not going to see\n"
"any of the tryouts!\"{page_break}"
"But now, I wish I'd gone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIKeepOnCryingButDaddy"
msgid "08137"
msgstr ""
"I keep on crying, but\n"
"Daddy still won't take\n"
"me to Colosso!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIWonderIfTheyReallyCant"
msgid "08138"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if they really\n"
"can't find Babi...{page_break}"
"If it is true, what\n"
"will happen to\n"
"Colosso?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsBabiWasntAtColossoAccordingTo"
msgid "08139"
msgstr ""
"Babi wasn't at Colosso\n"
"according to all\n"
"the spectators...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsItsStrangeThatBabisSoldiersAre"
msgid "08140"
msgstr ""
"It's strange that Babi's\n"
"soldiers are hanging out\n"
"all around town.{page_break}"
"Those bodyguards we saw\n"
"were probably looking\n"
"for Babi, right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsItsStrangeBabiLovesColossoBut"
msgid "08141"
msgstr ""
"It's strange... Babi loves\n"
"Colosso, but he's not\n"
"at the colosseum...{page_break}"
"I wonder if what that\n"
"boy said is true. Could\n"
"Babi be missing?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsWereGoingToMakeSomeMoney"
msgid "08142"
msgstr ""
"We're going to make some\n"
"money at Colosso.{page_break}"
"But of course, Babi\n"
"always makes the most.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIHeardBabiIsUsingThe"
msgid "08143"
msgstr ""
"I heard Babi is using the\n"
"money he made to build\n"
"a lighthouse in Gondowan.{page_break}"
"Everyone calls it\n"
"Babi Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsHeJustTakesACutOf"
msgid "08144"
msgstr ""
"He just takes a cut of\n"
"all the money we earn.\n"
"That's how to make money!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsNamingTheLighthouseHeBuiltAfter"
msgid "08145"
msgstr ""
"Naming the lighthouse he\n"
"built after himself is\n"
"a little vain, you think?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiLookStrongGo"
msgid "08146"
msgstr ""
"You look strong...\n"
"Go fight at Colosso!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08147"
msgstr ""
"Hang on! Now that I think\n"
"about it, the tryouts\n"
"have already started!{page_break}"
"So, even if I wanted to\n"
"fight in Colosso, it's\n"
"too late to sign up?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIGuessINeverWouldHave"
msgid "08148"
msgstr ""
"I guess I never would\n"
"have made it to the\n"
"finals anyway.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiFirstTimeTolbi"
msgid "08149"
msgstr ""
"Is this your first\n"
"time to Tolbi?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08150"
msgstr ""
"Tolbi offers many chances\n"
"to powerful warriors.{page_break}"
"Colosso, especially, offers\n"
"them a great chance.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08151"
msgstr ""
"Tolbi is a fun place,\n"
"no matter how many\n"
"times you visit!{page_break}"
"You ought to go and\n"
"enjoy yourself at Colosso.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsTheyHaveSomeNiceThingsFor"
msgid "08152"
msgstr ""
"They have some nice\n"
"things for sale in Tolbi,\n"
"so go shopping!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiIfCanMakeNameFor"
msgid "08153"
msgstr ""
"If you can make a name\n"
"for yourself at\n"
"Colosso, you might get{page_break}"
"to become one of\n"
"Babi's guards.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsBabiChoosesColossosVictorsToBe"
msgid "08154"
msgstr ""
"Babi chooses Colosso's\n"
"victors to be his soldiers\n"
"because of their prowess.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsWereFullyBookedWithReservationsDuring"
msgid "08155"
msgstr ""
"We're fully booked with\n"
"reservations during\n"
"Colosso.{page_break}"
"You're going to have a\n"
"hard time finding a place\n"
"to stay now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsColossoIsTheBusiestTimeOf"
msgid "08156"
msgstr ""
"Colosso is the busiest\n"
"time of year in Tolbi.{page_break}"
"In fact, you should make\n"
"reservations now for\n"
"next year's Colosso.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsWereSoBusyRunningTheInn"
msgid "08157"
msgstr ""
"We're so busy running\n"
"the inn we can't go to\n"
"Colosso. It's so boring.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsATourGroupCameFromKalay"
msgid "08158"
msgstr ""
"A tour group came from\n"
"Kalay this year.{page_break}"
"They only reserved two\n"
"rooms, but they have so\n"
"many people in them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsWeArentGoingToGetTo"
msgid "08159"
msgstr ""
"We aren't going to get\n"
"to see any of Colosso\n"
"this year.{page_break}"
"We have to start cooking\n"
"our guests' dinners first\n"
"thing in the morning.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsImNotVeryInterestedInColosso"
msgid "08160"
msgstr ""
"I'm not very interested\n"
"in Colosso. It's so\n"
"barbaric.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsOhNoWeBarelyMadeIt"
msgid "08161"
msgstr ""
"Oh, no! We barely made it\n"
"to Tolbi, and now we can't\n"
"even enter Colosso.{page_break}"
"Why did we even bother\n"
"coming out to Tolbi!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIfWedGottenHereJustA"
msgid "08162"
msgstr ""
"If we'd gotten here just\n"
"a little earlier, we could\n"
"have entered Colosso.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsTheTourGroupIsFeelingCramped"
msgid "08163"
msgstr ""
"The tour group is feeling\n"
"cramped in their quarters.{page_break}"
"Maybe we should build a\n"
"bigger inn for next\n"
"year.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsWeCantHandleTooManyMore"
msgid "08164"
msgstr ""
"We can't handle too\n"
"many more guests than\n"
"this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsImGoingToGoToThe"
msgid "08165"
msgstr ""
"I'm going to go to\n"
"the Colosso finals,\n"
"no matter what!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsThereArentEnoughBedsForThe"
msgid "08166"
msgstr ""
"There aren't enough beds\n"
"for the tour group from\n"
"Kalay.{page_break}"
"Where will they sleep?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsTheInnkeeperToldMeToCook"
msgid "08167"
msgstr ""
"The innkeeper told me to\n"
"cook a gourmet meal, but\n"
"he's asking the impossible.{page_break}"
"Just making enough food\n"
"for so many guests is a\n"
"big job unto itself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIHaveAHeadacheJustThinking"
msgid "08168"
msgstr ""
"I have a headache just\n"
"thinking about how busy\n"
"these guests will make me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsEvenThoughICantEnterColosso"
msgid "08169"
msgstr ""
"Even though I can't enter\n"
"Colosso, I stayed at the\n"
"inn thinking I'll go watch.{page_break}"
"I've come all this way,\n"
"so I may as well see\n"
"what I can.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIfWeCouldHaveEnteredColosso"
msgid "08170"
msgstr ""
"If we could have entered\n"
"Colosso, victory would\n"
"have been ours. Sheesh!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiWasteStuckHereWhenSuch"
msgid "08171"
msgstr ""
"What a waste to be stuck\n"
"here when such a big\n"
"festival's going on.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIWonderHowTheTryoutsAre"
msgid "08172"
msgstr ""
"I wonder how the tryouts\n"
"are going... Hmmm,\n"
"it's really on my mind.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceNormallyNoOnesAllowedIntoBabis"
msgid "08173"
msgstr ""
"Normally, no one's allowed\n"
"into Babi's Palace, but\n"
"during Colosso,{page_break}"
"visitors are free\n"
"to enter.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceSomeOfTheRoomsInThe"
msgid "08174"
msgstr ""
"Some of the rooms in the\n"
"palace are available\n"
"to Colosso entrants.{page_break}"
"You should be thankful\n"
"Lord Babi is such a\n"
"gracious host.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceShouldThePalaceReallyBeOpen"
msgid "08175"
msgstr ""
"Should the palace really\n"
"be open to the public\n"
"in such circumstances?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceIWonderHowManyPeopleWill"
msgid "08176"
msgstr ""
"I wonder how many people\n"
"will stay here at Babi\n"
"Palace after Colosso...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiRunBabisSoldiers"
msgid "08177"
msgstr ""
"Did you run into any of\n"
"Babi's soldiers in Town?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08178"
msgstr ""
"That means they must not\n"
"have found him yet...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08179"
msgstr ""
"Hmph! I told them to\n"
"search every nook and\n"
"cranny of this town...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceIfYoureEnteringColossoHurryAlong"
msgid "08180"
msgstr ""
"If you're entering Colosso,\n"
"hurry along to the\n"
"colosseum.{page_break}"
"But even if you leave\n"
"now, you may be too\n"
"late for the trials...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceIWonderHowDiligentlyBabisSoldiers"
msgid "08181"
msgstr ""
"I wonder how diligently\n"
"Babi's soldiers are\n"
"looking for him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceWarriorsAreNotAllowedToStay"
msgid "08182"
msgstr ""
"Warriors are not allowed\n"
"to stay in the palace if\n"
"they don't enter Colosso!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiWeHaveJustEnoughExtra"
msgid "08183"
msgstr ""
"We have just enough\n"
"extra beds in this\n"
"room for everybody.{page_break}"
"Please follow me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiUseFourBeds"
msgid "08184"
msgstr ""
"You may use these four\n"
"beds.{page_break}"
"Will you be going right\n"
"to sleep?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08185"
msgstr "Then, enjoy your rest.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08186"
msgstr ""
"Well, if you do get tired,\n"
"feel free to sleep here\n"
"anytime you like.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiLikeSleep"
msgid "08187"
msgstr ""
"Would you like\n"
"to sleep now?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08188"
msgstr "Ohh, I'm so tired...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08189"
msgstr ""
"I didn't think we'd ever\n"
"find a place to stay. What\n"
"a relief!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08190"
msgstr ""
"Let's rest up\n"
"for tomorrow.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08191"
msgstr "Good night.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08192"
msgstr "G'night.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08193"
msgstr "Sleep well.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08194"
msgstr "Morning.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08195"
msgstr "Good morning.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08196"
msgstr "Good morning.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08197"
msgstr ""
"All right, {actor_name:1}! We've\n"
"got another hard day\n"
"of work ahead of us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiPlanningEnterColosso"
msgid "08198"
msgstr ""
"Are you planning to\n"
"enter Colosso?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08199"
msgstr ""
"You'd better leave\n"
"right away, then!{page_break}"
"The trials are already\n"
"underway. Go on to\n"
"the colosseum!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08200"
msgstr ""
"So, did you guys get\n"
"injured, too?{page_break}"
"Getting injured just\n"
"before the trials begin\n"
"is the worst.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiCantFightBecauseLittleIndigestion"
msgid "08201"
msgstr ""
"I can't fight because\n"
"of a little indigestion?\n"
"That's pathetic!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08202"
msgstr ""
"Maybe I can shrug off\n"
"this pain in my gut...\n"
"I have to enter Colosso...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08203"
msgstr ""
"It's no use! My stomach\n"
"really hurts!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceIWantToWatchTheColosso"
msgid "08204"
msgstr ""
"I want to watch the\n"
"Colosso matches, too.{page_break}"
"But my job is just to\n"
"encourage the warriors\n"
"to do their best.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceIGetSoAngrySeeingAll"
msgid "08205"
msgstr ""
"I get so angry seeing\n"
"all the warriors going\n"
"off to fight in Colosso.{page_break}"
"I hurt my back during\n"
"my training, and now I\n"
"can't move at all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceMaybeIShouldntHaveEatenQuite"
msgid "08206"
msgstr ""
"Maybe I shouldn't have\n"
"eaten quite so much\n"
"yesterday...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceOnlyWarriorsWhoFightWellIn"
msgid "08207"
msgstr ""
"Only warriors who fight\n"
"well in Colosso's finals\n"
"can become soldiers here.{page_break}"
"All the warriors enter\n"
"Colosso because they\n"
"want to join our ranks.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceLordBabiIsBuildingTheLighthouse"
msgid "08208"
msgstr ""
"Lord Babi is building the\n"
"lighthouse as a display\n"
"of his power.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceBabisNameIsRidingOnThe"
msgid "08209"
msgstr ""
"Babi's name is riding on\n"
"the construction of his\n"
"lighthouse. It's a huge{page_break}"
"undertaking, which is why\n"
"the guard around the\n"
"lighthouse is so tight.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceEvenIfLordBabiDoesntReturn"
msgid "08210"
msgstr ""
"Even if Lord Babi doesn't\n"
"return, the campaign to\n"
"build Babi Lighthouse{page_break}"
"will go on... I won't be\n"
"able to relax until we\n"
"know where Babi is.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceMyFirstColossoWasSoExciting"
msgid "08211"
msgstr ""
"My first Colosso was\n"
"so exciting!{page_break}"
"I bet the battles will get\n"
"pretty heated this year.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceOnceTheLighthouseIsCompleteBabis"
msgid "08212"
msgstr ""
"Once the lighthouse is\n"
"complete, Babi's name\n"
"will live forever.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceWedNeverGetNearTheLighthouse"
msgid "08213"
msgstr ""
"We'd never get near the\n"
"lighthouse without these\n"
"passes from Iodem.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceIHearThatGirlIsGoing"
msgid "08214"
msgstr ""
"I hear that girl is going\n"
"on the next campaign.\n"
"What could it mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiOriginallyThereWereAncientRuinsAt"
msgid "08215"
msgstr ""
"Originally, there were\n"
"ancient ruins at the site\n"
"of Babi Lighthouse.{page_break}"
"There's said to be an\n"
"extremely long tunnel\n"
"beneath those ruins.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiNoMatterHowManyTimesI"
msgid "08216"
msgstr ""
"No matter how many times\n"
"I run the experiment,\n"
"I never get the results{page_break}"
"I want! My Alchemy skills\n"
"have weakened, as Kraden\n"
"warned me they would.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiItIsSaidThatLongAgo"
msgid "08217"
msgstr ""
"It is said that long ago,\n"
"the power of Alchemy\n"
"was sealed away.{page_break}"
"But why would it have\n"
"been sealed away?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiOriginallyTheAncientVenusRuinsLay"
msgid "08218"
msgstr ""
"Originally, the ancient\n"
"Venus Ruins lay buried\n"
"under Babi Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiBabiMakesHisScholarsPerformAll"
msgid "08219"
msgstr ""
"Babi makes his scholars\n"
"perform all sorts of\n"
"research.{page_break}"
"I wonder where Babi's\n"
"favorite scholar, Kraden,\n"
"is now?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiNoOneHasEverReachedThe"
msgid "08220"
msgstr ""
"No one has ever reached\n"
"the end of the tunnel in\n"
"the ancient ruins...{page_break}"
"I'd sure like to know\n"
"what's at the end of\n"
"that tunnel.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiStillMyExperimentsInAlchemyAre"
msgid "08221"
msgstr ""
"Still, my experiments in\n"
"Alchemy are progressing\n"
"better than before.{page_break}"
"Maybe Kraden's research\n"
"is meeting with success...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiKradensJourneyWasMeantToRevive"
msgid "08222"
msgstr ""
"Kraden's journey was\n"
"meant to revive the lost\n"
"art of Alchemy.{page_break}"
"We hope, of course, that\n"
"he can explain why it had\n"
"been sealed away, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiTheVenusRuinsAreTheRemnants"
msgid "08223"
msgstr ""
"The Venus Ruins are the\n"
"remnants of a magnificent\n"
"ancient civilization.{page_break}"
"The lighthouse is being\n"
"built on the foundation\n"
"of the Venus Ruins.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLordBabiExpectedGreatResultsFrom"
msgid "08224"
msgstr ""
"Lord Babi expected\n"
"great results from\n"
"Kraden's journey.{page_break}"
"I wonder what he\n"
"expected Kraden to learn\n"
"from that research.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiIodemIodem"
msgid "08225"
msgstr "Iodem, Iodem!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08226"
msgstr ""
"We went to Altmiller\n"
"Cave, as you commanded.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08227"
msgstr ""
"And what have you?\n"
"What news is there\n"
"of Babi?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08228"
msgstr "{pause_20_skippable}This is futile...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08229"
msgstr ""
"Iodem, why did you send\n"
"us to look for Babi in a\n"
"place like that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08230"
msgstr ""
"Why would Lord Babi\n"
"enter such a dangerous\n"
"cave alone? It's...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08231"
msgstr ""
"Inconceivable?\n"
"Is that what you were\n"
"going to say?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08232"
msgstr ""
"Altmiller Cave is an\n"
"evil place.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08233"
msgstr ""
"If Babi went there alone,\n"
"a monster might have...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08234"
msgstr ""
"I'm aware of Altmiller\n"
"Cave's.{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}eccentr"
"icities.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08235"
msgstr ""
"You knew? Then why\n"
"would you send us\n"
"in there, Iodem?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08236"
msgstr ""
"Lord Babi has left in\n"
"secret before...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08237"
msgstr ""
"You mean, this isn't the\n"
"first time Lord Babi has\n"
"disappeared, Iodem?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08238"
msgstr ""
"Do you know where\n"
"he went before?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08239"
msgstr ""
"I followed Lord\n"
"Babi once...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08240"
msgstr ""
"I was certain he had\n"
"gone into Altmiller\n"
"Cave...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08241"
msgstr ""
"Did you ever investigate\n"
"the cave, Iodem?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08242"
msgstr ""
"What was he doing\n"
"in the cave?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08243"
msgstr ""
"Once he entered the cave,\n"
"Lord Babi vanished{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"before my very eyes.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08244"
msgstr "Vanished?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08245"
msgstr ""
"You mean you lost sight\n"
"of Lord Babi. Is that it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08246"
msgstr ""
"After he entered the\n"
"mouth of the cave,\n"
"I followed him...{page_break}"
"but he had vanished,\n"
"leaving no trace.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08247"
msgstr ""
"I tried following him\n"
"several times after that.{page_break}"
"Each time, he vanished\n"
"within seconds of entering\n"
"the cave's mouth.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08248"
msgstr ""
"And you think that's\n"
"where Lord Babi went\n"
"this morning, Iodem?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08249"
msgstr ""
"But if he always\n"
"returned from Altmiller\n"
"Cave before...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08250"
msgstr ""
"Then he should be\n"
"back soon, right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08251"
msgstr ""
"No. This time is\n"
"different. Something\n"
"puzzles me...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08252"
msgstr "What do you mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08253"
msgstr ""
"It is certainly strange\n"
"that Lord Babi should go\n"
"right before Colosso.{page_break}"
"But there's something\n"
"else...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08254"
msgstr "What is it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08255"
msgstr ""
"Lord Babi's bedding was\n"
"not disturbed this\n"
"morning.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08256"
msgstr ""
"What's unusual\n"
"about that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08257"
msgstr ""
"Last night, Lord Babi did\n"
"not use his bed.\n"
"That is the problem.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08258"
msgstr ""
"Lord Babi has, in fact,\n"
"been missing since\n"
"last night.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08259"
msgstr ""
"And that is why I am\n"
"so worried. He has\n"
"never done this before.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08260"
msgstr ""
"We didn't know he'd been\n"
"missing so long...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08261"
msgstr ""
"You don't think Lord\n"
"Babi's been ki{em_dash}{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08262"
msgstr ""
"Speak no such foolishness!\n"
"I am sure Lord Babi is\n"
"alive and well somewhere!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08263"
msgstr "Ah, yes, of course.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08264"
msgstr ""
"I will go to the colosseum\n"
"in Lord Babi's stead.\n"
"You must find him...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08265"
msgstr ""
"We will all conduct\n"
"another round of\n"
"searches.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08266"
msgstr ""
"Lord Babi, where\n"
"have you gone?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceItLooksLikeLordBabiDidnt"
msgid "08267"
msgstr ""
"It looks like Lord Babi\n"
"didn't use his bed\n"
"this morning.{page_break}"
"What does it mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceIGuessLordBabiDidNot"
msgid "08268"
msgstr ""
"I guess Lord Babi did\n"
"not go to sleep\n"
"last night.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceActorHasBeenStayingAsLord"
msgid "08269"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} has been staying\n"
"as Lord Babi's guest\n"
"for some time.{page_break}"
"She comes from the\n"
"town of Lalivero, on the\n"
"Gondowan continent.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceActorWasReveredAsAChild"
msgid "08270"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} was revered\n"
"as a child of the gods\n"
"in her hometown...{page_break}"
"But she looks like an\n"
"average child to me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceBabiIsHoldingMeHostageIn"
msgid "08271"
msgstr ""
"Babi is holding me hostage\n"
"in order to complete his\n"
"lighthouse in Lalivero.{page_break}"
"When shall I ever be\n"
"able to return to my\n"
"homeland?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceActorWasTakenHostageToForce"
msgid "08272"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} was taken hostage\n"
"to force the Laliverans\n"
"to build Babi Lighthouse.{page_break}"
"It is heartbreaking to see\n"
"her tears and hear her\n"
"pleas to be released.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceActorIsNotPermittedToLeave"
msgid "08273"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} is not permitted\n"
"to leave this room. Child\n"
"of the gods or not,{page_break}"
"I do not think she\n"
"could make it to\n"
"Gondowan alone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiEvenIfEscapedBabiPalace"
msgid "08274"
msgstr ""
"Even if I escaped Babi\n"
"Palace, my power could\n"
"not get me to Lalivero.{page_break}"
"It would be impossible\n"
"for me to make it through\n"
"the deadly Suhalla alone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08275"
msgstr "Did you just...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08276"
msgstr "No, it is nothing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceTheyreHoldingThePreliminaryColossoHeats"
msgid "08277"
msgstr ""
"They're holding the\n"
"preliminary Colosso\n"
"heats right now.{page_break}"
"The winners of the\n"
"trials will advance\n"
"to the finals.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceSighTheColosseumIsPackedWith"
msgid "08278"
msgstr ""
"Sigh... The colosseum is\n"
"packed with people. I'll\n"
"never get in there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumHopingGetInSeeColosso"
msgid "08279"
msgstr ""
"Are you hoping to get\n"
"in to see Colosso now?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08280"
msgstr ""
"First-timers all make\n"
"that mistake.{page_break}"
"If you want to see\n"
"Colosso, you have to get\n"
"to the colosseum early.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08281"
msgstr ""
"Good choice... If you want\n"
"in, you should come back\n"
"early tomorrow morning.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceIfYouHitItBigIn"
msgid "08282"
msgstr ""
"If you hit it big in the\n"
"Lucky Guess, you can win\n"
"a pretty penny.{page_break}"
"You have to watch the\n"
"trials closely to decide\n"
"who you'll root for.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceIveBeenBettingOnTheLucky"
msgid "08283"
msgstr ""
"I've been betting on the\n"
"Lucky Guess for many\n"
"years, but I've never won.{page_break}"
"I'd like to hit it big\n"
"just once in my life.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumColossosLuckyGuessMakesBattles"
msgid "08284"
msgstr ""
"Colosso's Lucky Guess\n"
"makes the battles in\n"
"the colosseum better.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumWantWinBigPutOn"
msgid "08285"
msgstr ""
"I want to win big, so I\n"
"put it all on a warrior\n"
"no one else has picked.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumDoKnowLuckyGuess"
msgid "08286"
msgstr ""
"Do you know what the\n"
"Lucky Guess is?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08287"
msgstr ""
"Entrants can't pick their\n"
"own team members.{page_break}"
"That way, the matches\n"
"won't be fixed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08288"
msgstr ""
"It's a game where you try\n"
"to guess which warrior\n"
"will win the finals.{page_break}"
"If you hit it right,\n"
"you can win fabulous\n"
"prizes.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceIWonderWhichWarriorWillBe"
msgid "08289"
msgstr ""
"I wonder which warrior\n"
"will be the one to\n"
"advance to the finals?{page_break}"
"Oh, I can't wait!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceHavingToArriveSoEarlyJust"
msgid "08290"
msgstr ""
"Having to arrive so early\n"
"just to get into the\n"
"colosseum is awful.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceThereAreSoManyPeopleWho"
msgid "08291"
msgstr ""
"There are so many people\n"
"who arrive late and\n"
"can't get in.{page_break}"
"I suppose everyone\n"
"will come here early\n"
"tomorrow.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceImGoingToPickTheBiggest"
msgid "08292"
msgstr ""
"I'm going to pick the\n"
"biggest, strongest\n"
"warrior to win.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceImFeelingConfidentThisTimeIm"
msgid "08293"
msgstr ""
"I'm feeling confident\n"
"this time. I'm sure I'll\n"
"get it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceEveryoneKeepsRiskingMoreAndMore"
msgid "08294"
msgstr ""
"Everyone keeps risking\n"
"more and more, so the\n"
"prize is huge!{page_break}"
"If a warrior that few\n"
"people picked wins,\n"
"they'll win big!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceEveryYearIGoAfterA"
msgid "08295"
msgstr ""
"Every year, I go after a\n"
"big win, knowing that\n"
"it's a mistake.{page_break}"
"This is the one vice\n"
"I can't give up.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceOnceTheTrialsAreOverIts"
msgid "08296"
msgstr ""
"Once the trials are over,\n"
"it's going to get busy,\n"
"just like every year.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceGoForItThatsItIm"
msgid "08297"
msgstr ""
"Go for it! That's it!\n"
"I'm cheering for you,\n"
"little guy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceWatchingTheTrialsMakesMeReally"
msgid "08298"
msgstr ""
"Watching the trials makes\n"
"me really excited. The\n"
"battles are incredible!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceWatchingSuchProudSkilledWarriorsIn"
msgid "08299"
msgstr ""
"Watching such proud,\n"
"skilled warriors in\n"
"battle is so enchanting.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceIveWaitedAWholeYearTo"
msgid "08300"
msgstr ""
"I've waited a whole year\n"
"to see Colosso. I can't\n"
"wait for the finals!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumSilence"
msgid "08301"
msgstr "!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumHaveMakeThroughCountlessMatches"
msgid "08302"
msgstr ""
"You have to make it\n"
"through countless matches\n"
"to reach the finals.{page_break}"
"That warrior failed\n"
"his trial, so he's\n"
"disqualified here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumHavePerfectTechniquesLikeThose"
msgid "08303"
msgstr ""
"You have to perfect\n"
"techniques like those\n"
"to reach the finals.{page_break}"
"That warrior cleared\n"
"this trial, but I doubt\n"
"he'll make the finals.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceEvenTheSmallerWarriorsCanWin"
msgid "08304"
msgstr ""
"Even the smaller warriors\n"
"can win if they have\n"
"enough spirit!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceTheseTrialsAreBasedOnPersonal"
msgid "08305"
msgstr ""
"These trials are based\n"
"on personal challenges.\n"
"I get excited watching.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceWhatFantasticPhysiquesWhyIfI"
msgid "08306"
msgstr ""
"What fantastic physiques!\n"
"Why, if I were\n"
"younger...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoDidntThinkBattles"
msgid "08307"
msgstr ""
"I didn't think the battles\n"
"in the trials would be\n"
"so fierce...{page_break}"
"I can't even imagine\n"
"what kind of battles\n"
"the finals will have!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceNoMatterHowGoodAWarrior"
msgid "08308"
msgstr ""
"No matter how good a\n"
"warrior is, there's always\n"
"someone who's better.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIsaacCheckedTheSignInnFull"
msgid "08309"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1} checked the sign.{page_break}"
"Inn Full\n"
"No Vacancies{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoStageFirstFinalsMatch"
msgid "08310"
msgstr ""
"This is stage {argument_signed_number}\n"
"of the first finals\n"
"match.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08311"
msgstr ""
"This is stage {argument_signed_number}\n"
"of the first finals\n"
"match.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoStageSecondFinalsMatch"
msgid "08312"
msgstr ""
"This is stage {argument_signed_number}\n"
"of the second finals\n"
"match.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08313"
msgstr ""
"This is stage {argument_signed_number}\n"
"of the second finals\n"
"match.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoStageThirdFinalsMatch"
msgid "08314"
msgstr ""
"This is stage {argument_signed_number}\n"
"of the third finals\n"
"match.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08315"
msgstr ""
"This is stage {argument_signed_number}\n"
"of the third finals\n"
"match.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoWouldYouLikeHearDescription"
msgid "08316"
msgstr ""
"Would you like to hear\n"
"a description of this\n"
"stage?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoWouldLikeFriendCheerFor"
msgid "08317"
msgstr ""
"Would you like a friend\n"
"to cheer for you here?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoIfKnowWhoWantCheer"
msgid "08318"
msgstr ""
"If you know who you want\n"
"to cheer you on,\n"
"please let me know!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoIsaacWillCheerForWay"
msgid "08319"
msgstr ""
"{argument_actor_name:1} will cheer\n"
"for you? This way,\n"
"please.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTalkChoice"
msgid "08320"
msgstr "Descriptions"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08321"
msgstr "Cheer"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08322"
msgstr "Nothing"

msgctxt "MsgColossoDoYourBest"
msgid "08323"
msgstr "All right, do your best!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoUnfortunatelyWeHaveFullHouse"
msgid "08324"
msgstr ""
"Unfortunately, we have a\n"
"full house. Please cheer\n"
"somewhere else.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoMatchAboutBeginPleaseTake"
msgid "08325"
msgstr ""
"The match is about to\n"
"begin. Please take your\n"
"places.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoCheering"
msgid "08326"
msgstr ""
"Huh? Are you done\n"
"cheering?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08327"
msgstr ""
"Then please wait here\n"
"until the match begins.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08328"
msgstr ""
"Then cheer as best\n"
"you can!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoCheeringChoices"
msgid "08329"
msgstr "Yeah"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08330"
msgstr "Nope"

msgctxt "MsgColossoObjectiveStageClear"
msgid "08331"
msgstr ""
"The objective in this\n"
"stage is to clear a path\n"
"as quickly as you can.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoCallRockChallenge"
msgid "08332"
msgstr ""
"They call this the\n"
"Rock Challenge.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08333"
msgstr ""
"Warriors must create\n"
"steps they can use\n"
"to get through here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08334"
msgstr ""
"Warriors must use only\n"
"the objects in this stage,\n"
"along with their own{page_break}"
"strength and wit, to\n"
"reach the next stage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoObjectiveMakeGood"
msgid "08335"
msgstr ""
"The objective here is to\n"
"make good use of the\n"
"scales.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoAreaCalledPipeworks"
msgid "08336"
msgstr ""
"This area is called the\n"
"Pipeworks.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08337"
msgstr ""
"See the water pipes?\n"
"They actually form a\n"
"kind of scale.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08338"
msgstr ""
"When one side lowers,\n"
"the other side rises.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08339"
msgstr ""
"Using this premise, you\n"
"must find a way to\n"
"reach the next stage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoOperatorBridgeWillAlsoCheer"
msgid "08340"
msgstr ""
"The operator of the\n"
"bridge will also cheer\n"
"for you in this stage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoTheyCallBrokenBridge"
msgid "08341"
msgstr ""
"They call this the\n"
"Broken Bridge.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08342"
msgstr ""
"Carefully time your\n"
"bridge crossings to\n"
"reach the next stage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08343"
msgstr ""
"If your timing is off,\n"
"you'll fall down, which\n"
"will cost you time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoLogsKeyClearingStage"
msgid "08344"
msgstr ""
"The logs are the key\n"
"to clearing this stage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoPlaceNormallyCalledLumberWater"
msgid "08345"
msgstr ""
"This place is normally\n"
"called the Lumber\n"
"Water Crossing Area.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08346"
msgstr ""
"The obstacle at this stage\n"
"is that large water tank.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08347"
msgstr ""
"If you can get all the\n"
"way across in one go,\n"
"you don't have to{page_break}"
"give it that much\n"
"thought.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08348"
msgstr ""
"But if you want to reach\n"
"the treasure box, it'll\n"
"take a little planning.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoMainThingStage"
msgid "08349"
msgstr ""
"The main thing with this\n"
"stage is to proceed\n"
"through the maze...{page_break}"
"without panicking\n"
"or getting lost.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoStageDubbedMini"
msgid "08350"
msgstr ""
"This stage is dubbed\n"
"the Mini-Maze.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08351"
msgstr ""
"The rules are simple:\n"
"get through the maze\n"
"as quickly as you can.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08352"
msgstr ""
"But you'll have to think\n"
"on your feet and act\n"
"quickly to win.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoOperatorLiftsWillCheerFor"
msgid "08353"
msgstr ""
"The operator of the\n"
"lifts will cheer for\n"
"you here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoShiftingFloorStage"
msgid "08354"
msgstr ""
"This is the shifting\n"
"floor stage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08355"
msgstr ""
"Step skillfully across\n"
"the floor as it moves\n"
"around.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08356"
msgstr ""
"If you don't time your\n"
"steps right, you'll lose\n"
"valuable time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoHereYourObjectiveRideLogs"
msgid "08357"
msgstr ""
"Here, your objective is\n"
"to ride the logs as\n"
"quickly as possible.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoLogRollingStage"
msgid "08358"
msgstr ""
"This is the Log-\n"
"Rolling Stage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08359"
msgstr ""
"Ride the logs across\n"
"the water to get to\n"
"the other side.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08360"
msgstr ""
"Try to reach the opposite\n"
"shore and head for the\n"
"next stage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoScalingWallQuickly"
msgid "08361"
msgstr ""
"Scaling the wall quickly\n"
"is priority one in\n"
"this stage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoFansJustCallWall"
msgid "08362"
msgstr ""
"The fans just call this\n"
"The Wall.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08363"
msgstr ""
"Scale the wall first,\n"
"then get your nerve\n"
"up and jump!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08364"
msgstr ""
"Look for spots where you\n"
"can drop off the\n"
"wall quickly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoFocusRollingLogs"
msgid "08365"
msgstr ""
"Your focus here will be\n"
"rolling the logs to\n"
"form a path.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoPlaceCalledBoard"
msgid "08366"
msgstr ""
"This place is called\n"
"the Board Walk.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08367"
msgstr ""
"The logs here are\n"
"positioned to\n"
"block your path.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08368"
msgstr ""
"Roll those logs to open\n"
"a path and follow\n"
"it to the next stage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoObjectiveGetAcross"
msgid "08369"
msgstr ""
"Here your objective is to\n"
"get across the gaps\n"
"as quickly as you can.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoStageCalledScales"
msgid "08370"
msgstr ""
"This stage is called\n"
"the Scales of\n"
"Justice.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08371"
msgstr ""
"There are two ledges\n"
"that actually form\n"
"a scale.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08372"
msgstr ""
"When one ledge rises,\n"
"the other falls.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08373"
msgstr ""
"Use the scales to\n"
"cross the gaps and\n"
"race to the next stage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoYourGoalInStageSimple"
msgid "08374"
msgstr ""
"Your goal in this stage\n"
"is simple: find the\n"
"shortest path.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoSteppingStoneStage"
msgid "08375"
msgstr ""
"This is the Stepping-\n"
"Stone Stage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08376"
msgstr ""
"You can reach the next\n"
"stage by jumping from\n"
"stone to stone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08377"
msgstr ""
"Study the placement of\n"
"the stones, then choose\n"
"the shortest path.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoOperatorWallsCheer"
msgid "08378"
msgstr ""
"The operator of the\n"
"walls will cheer for\n"
"you on this stage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoPlaceCalledWall"
msgid "08379"
msgstr ""
"This place is called\n"
"the Wall Wedge.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08380"
msgstr ""
"The pistons move back and\n"
"forth. Avoid them to{page_break}"
"reach the next stage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08381"
msgstr ""
"If your timing is off,\n"
"a piston might knock you\n"
"off the ledge.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoClearStageMustAbleChange"
msgid "08382"
msgstr ""
"To clear this stage, you\n"
"must be able to change\n"
"directions while climbing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoPlaceNormallyCalledFreeClimb"
msgid "08383"
msgstr ""
"This place is normally\n"
"called the Free-\n"
"Climb Area.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08384"
msgstr ""
"This sheer wall has\n"
"a bumpy surface.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08385"
msgstr ""
"Using those bumps, feel\n"
"your way up the wall and\n"
"climb to the next stage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoInStageMustTryOutpace"
msgid "08386"
msgstr ""
"In this stage, you must\n"
"try to outpace the\n"
"conveyor belt.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoCalledMovingSidewalkStage"
msgid "08387"
msgstr ""
"This is called the Moving\n"
"Sidewalk Stage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08388"
msgstr ""
"The conveyor belt moves\n"
"opposite the direction\n"
"you need to go.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08389"
msgstr ""
"Race against it to\n"
"reach the next stage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoHereMustFigureOutHow"
msgid "08390"
msgstr ""
"Here you must figure out\n"
"how the logs and stones\n"
"need to be moved.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoAnotherLogRollingArea"
msgid "08391"
msgstr ""
"This is another\n"
"log-rolling area.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08392"
msgstr ""
"The obstacle in this stage\n"
"is the water tank at\n"
"the exit.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08393"
msgstr ""
"To get across the tank,\n"
"you'll need to roll\n"
"the logs.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08394"
msgstr ""
"You can get through\n"
"quickly by moving the\n"
"logs and stones.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoSiteFirstFinalsBattle"
msgid "08395"
msgstr ""
"This is the site of the\n"
"first finals battle.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08396"
msgstr ""
"So this is where warriors\n"
"test their mettle\n"
"against each other.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08397"
msgstr ""
"Well, no... It's actually\n"
"more than that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08398"
msgstr "What else is involved?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08399"
msgstr ""
"The warriors are racing\n"
"to get here first and\n"
"get the best equipment.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08400"
msgstr ""
"So there's an advantage\n"
"to getting here first?\n"
"That's quite a test!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08401"
msgstr ""
"That's too hard for\n"
"{actor_name:1}. We must support\n"
"him as well we can...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08402"
msgstr ""
"Um, don't you want to\n"
"hear my explanation?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08403"
msgstr ""
"All right. Then let\n"
"me explain in detail...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoAskAttendantsForExplanationsStages"
msgid "08404"
msgstr ""
"Ask the attendants for\n"
"explanations of the\n"
"stages.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoWarriorsEnterFinalsWithoutAny"
msgid "08405"
msgstr ""
"Warriors enter the finals\n"
"without any of their\n"
"own equipment.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08406"
msgstr "Please look over there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08407"
msgstr ""
"That is the starting\n"
"point of the first\n"
"stage of the finals.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08408"
msgstr ""
"You must get through\n"
"several stages before\n"
"you reach the arena.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08409"
msgstr ""
"The chests along the way\n"
"contain items that may\n"
"be useful in battle.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08410"
msgstr ""
"This is the battle arena.\n"
"After getting here,\n"
"the warriors do battle.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08411"
msgstr ""
"You can get weapons in\n"
"the arena, too, but one is\n"
"weaker than the other.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08412"
msgstr ""
"So you'll have the\n"
"advantage if you get\n"
"here first.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08413"
msgstr ""
"Also, you can use the\n"
"equipment you get here\n"
"in your next match.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08414"
msgstr ""
"What do you think, {actor_name:1}?\n"
"Do you understand the\n"
"rules for the finals?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08415"
msgstr ""
"You'll notice that each\n"
"stage has its own\n"
"attendant.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08416"
msgstr ""
"...Then I will explain it\n"
"to you once more.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoIsaacYoureContestantInFinals"
msgid "08417"
msgstr ""
"...{actor_name:1}, you're a\n"
"contestant in the finals.\n"
"Do not forget that.{page_break}"
"I'll be right here, so\n"
"come see me when you're\n"
"done looking things over.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08418"
msgstr ""
"Hey, where do we cheer\n"
"from?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08419"
msgstr ""
"Would you like to visit\n"
"the stages and hear a\n"
"description for each one?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08420"
msgstr ""
"Yes. We'll decide where\n"
"to cheer for {actor_name:1} after\n"
"hearing the descriptions.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoIsaacDidGetGoodLook"
msgid "08421"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}, did you get\n"
"a good look around?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08422"
msgstr ""
"Let's head\n"
"back, then.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08423"
msgstr ""
"Let me know when you're\n"
"done looking around.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoWaitShouldntDecideWhereBest"
msgid "08424"
msgstr ""
"Wait, shouldn't you decide\n"
"where the best place to\n"
"cheer for {actor_name:1} is?{page_break}"
"You can cheer from up\n"
"close at any stage, so\n"
"it's a tough call.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoSiteSecondFinals"
msgid "08425"
msgstr ""
"This is the site of the\n"
"second finals match.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08426"
msgstr ""
"As I explained earlier,\n"
"each stage has its own\n"
"attendant.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08427"
msgstr ""
"Please ask the attendants\n"
"directly for descriptions\n"
"of each stage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08428"
msgstr ""
"...{actor_name:1}, that first\n"
"match was terrific.{page_break}"
"I'll be right here,\n"
"so tell me when you're\n"
"done looking around.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoSiteThirdFinals"
msgid "08429"
msgstr ""
"This is the site of the\n"
"third finals match.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08430"
msgstr ""
"By now, you know that\n"
"each stage has its\n"
"own attendant.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08431"
msgstr ""
"Ask the attendants\n"
"descriptions of\n"
"the stages.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08432"
msgstr ""
"Honestly, {actor_name:1}, I\n"
"didn't think you'd\n"
"make it this far!{page_break}"
"I'll be right here,\n"
"so tell me when you're\n"
"done looking around.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoIsaac"
msgid "08433"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08434"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08435"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08436"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08437"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08438"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08439"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumIsaacOnlyOneEnteringFinals"
msgid "08440"
msgstr ""
"Huh?{pause_20_skippable} {actor_name:1}'s the\n"
"only one entering\n"
"the finals?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08441"
msgstr ""
"The warriors entered\n"
"in the finals must go\n"
"in alone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08442"
msgstr "But why {actor_name:1}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08443"
msgstr ""
"That is what Babi\n"
"wanted...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08444"
msgstr ""
"But I wanted to\n"
"enter, too!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08445"
msgstr ""
"We aren't accepting\n"
"any more entries.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08446"
msgstr ""
"Well, Master {actor_name:1},\n"
"please prepare yourself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08447"
msgstr ""
"I guess all you can "
"do.{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"is get it over with,\n"
"{actor_name:1}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08448"
msgstr ""
"I know you want to enter,\n"
"too, {actor_name:2}, but there's\n"
"nothing we can do.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08449"
msgstr ""
"This is crazy! {actor_name:1}\n"
"won't survive against\n"
"those Colosso warriors!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08450"
msgstr ""
"If {actor_name:1} wants to win,\n"
"he'll have to use\n"
"Psynergy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08451"
msgstr ""
"Well, Babi does seem very\n"
"interested in his\n"
"Psynergy...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08452"
msgstr ""
"Even so, how's he\n"
"supposed to use\n"
"it here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08453"
msgstr ""
"What did Babi say we're\n"
"supposed to do while\n"
"{actor_name:1} is competing?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08454"
msgstr ""
"We've made a slight\n"
"exception. You can cheer\n"
"him on from the stage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08455"
msgstr ""
"You'll be able to see\n"
"from right up close.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08456"
msgstr ""
"This is the first time it\n"
"has ever been permitted!\n"
"You should thank Babi{page_break}"
"for the chance to sit\n"
"in these special seats.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08457"
msgstr ""
"If everything is settled,\n"
"I shall take you there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08458"
msgstr ""
"Umm{pause_20_skippable}, can't {actor_name:1} go\n"
"to see the finals\n"
"stages, too?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08459"
msgstr ""
"I bet you want to learn\n"
"as much as you can about\n"
"the finals, eh, {actor_name:1}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08460"
msgstr ""
"Of course, we won't\n"
"argue if you don't, but\n"
"if you can, you should.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08461"
msgstr ""
"Come on, you can make\n"
"another exception,\n"
"can't you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08462"
msgstr ""
"...I don't see the\n"
"harm in it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08463"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe {actor_name:1}\n"
"is entering midway\n"
"through Colosso!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08464"
msgstr ""
"This is a first!\n"
"Totally unheard of!\n"
"...Like I said earlier.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08465"
msgstr ""
"Are we ready? I'll\n"
"give you a tour of\n"
"the arena. Let's go.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumPrepareYourselvesContestantsFinalsWill"
msgid "08466"
msgstr ""
"Prepare yourselves,\n"
"contestants! The finals\n"
"will begin shortly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceIAmMorganIAmThe"
msgid "08467"
msgstr ""
"I am Morgan. I am the\n"
"highest-ranked warrior.{page_break}"
"I am going to win\n"
"the finals! And don't\n"
"you forget it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumImRatedAsSecondBest"
msgid "08468"
msgstr ""
"I'm rated as the second-\n"
"best, but I'll prove them\n"
"wrong. The name's Azart.{page_break}"
"Don't tell me YOU'RE the\n"
"one Babi handpicked to\n"
"be in the finals!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08469"
msgstr ""
"I'm not going to lose\n"
"to someone who didn't\n"
"even clear the trials.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumWaahDontFrightenMe"
msgid "08470"
msgstr "{text_effect:4}Waah!{reset_text_style} Don't frighten me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08471"
msgstr ""
"I'm incredibly nervous.\n"
"Wha? Me? I... I'm Galahad,\n"
"the third-seeded fighter.{page_break}"
"I can't wait any longer...\n"
"When do we start?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumWhoHaveComeQuestionMe"
msgid "08472"
msgstr ""
"...You who have come to\n"
"question me...\n"
"You are...{pause_20_skippable}{actor_name:1}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08473"
msgstr ""
"I had closed my eyes...\n"
"to focus my mind\n"
"before battle.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08474"
msgstr ""
"My name is Satrage.\n"
"I'm the fourth-ranked\n"
"warrior.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumDekkaMustWinFinalsDekka"
msgid "08475"
msgstr ""
"Dekka must win the finals.\n"
"Dekka.{pause_20_skippable} Dekka...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08476"
msgstr ""
"He won't answer, no\n"
"matter how much you\n"
"speak to him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08477"
msgstr ""
"He's trying to get himself\n"
"psyched up for the battle.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08478"
msgstr ""
"The finals can't be\n"
"won that easily!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumAmNavampaGondowanSixthRanked"
msgid "08479"
msgstr ""
"I am Navampa of\n"
"Gondowan, the sixth-\n"
"ranked warrior.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08480"
msgstr ""
"You're the warrior Babi\n"
"selected? The one they're\n"
"all talking about?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08481"
msgstr ""
"I heard rumors that you\n"
"were a huge, hulking man.\n"
"I guess they were wrong.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumImBufordSeventhSeed"
msgid "08482"
msgstr ""
"I'm Buford, the seventh\n"
"seed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08483"
msgstr ""
"All who cleared the\n"
"trials are powerful\n"
"warriors...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08484"
msgstr ""
"This is a balanced\n"
"match{em_dash}anyone\n"
"could win today!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumYouReadyForFinals"
msgid "08485"
msgstr ""
"Are you ready for the\n"
"finals? {end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08486"
msgstr ""
"Then please wait in\n"
"the eighth circle.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08487"
msgstr ""
"We'll be starting soon,\n"
"so you'd better get\n"
"ready fast!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceYouCannotLeaveUntilTheFinals"
msgid "08488"
msgstr ""
"You cannot leave until\n"
"the finals are over.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceIFeelWeveBeenWaitingForever"
msgid "08489"
msgstr ""
"I feel we've been waiting\n"
"forever for the finals\n"
"to begin.{page_break}"
"You know, I had this\n"
"same problem at my first\n"
"Colosso.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceWhenTheGongSoundsTheFinals"
msgid "08490"
msgstr ""
"When the gong sounds,{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"the finals will begin.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumDayTiredWaiting"
msgid "08491"
msgstr ""
"Hey, any day now! We're\n"
"tired of waiting! Let's\n"
"get this thing started!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08492"
msgstr ""
"I agree... Let the\n"
"finals begin already.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08493"
msgstr ""
"Um... Yeah. I'll show you...\n"
"We're here to win the\n"
"finals.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08494"
msgstr ""
"Hey, what's the matter...\n"
"Hurry up and start!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08495"
msgstr ""
"Line up starting with\n"
"the top-ranked warrior,\n"
"and await the signal!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08496"
msgstr ""
"Now then, chosen warriors.\n"
"Let the finals begin!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08497"
msgstr ""
"Curses!\n"
"Let's do it again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08498"
msgstr ""
"So, you're all set,\n"
"right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08499"
msgstr ""
"All right! Let the\n"
"games begin!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumSeeYouveMadeThroughYour"
msgid "08500"
msgstr ""
"I see you've made it\n"
"through your first\n"
"match.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08501"
msgstr ""
"Winning your first match\n"
"after jumping right into\n"
"the finals is awesome!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08502"
msgstr ""
"I should have expected\n"
"as much from a warrior\n"
"selected by Babi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08503"
msgstr ""
"Now, we can go have a\n"
"look at the next series\n"
"of stages...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumWonBothMatches"
msgid "08504"
msgstr ""
"You've managed to win\n"
"both of your matches.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08505"
msgstr ""
"You're incredible, {actor_name:1}!\n"
"If you win the next one,\n"
"you'll be the champion!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08506"
msgstr ""
"A fantastic performance,\n"
"just as Babi expected...{page_break}"
"I won't underestimate\n"
"you again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08507"
msgstr ""
"Let me take you to the\n"
"next group of stages.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoRiverThisYearsFinalsAreIncredibleThis"
msgid "08508"
msgstr ""
"This year's finals are\n"
"incredible. This atmosphere\n"
"can't be beat!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoRiverMovingSuchAHugeRockMust"
msgid "08509"
msgstr ""
"Moving such a huge rock\n"
"must be a real\n"
"workout.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoRiverTheresOnlyOneFinalAndThis"
msgid "08510"
msgstr ""
"There's only one final, and\n"
"this is it. We're so\n"
"lucky to be here for it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoRiverDidYouSeeHisMovesOut"
msgid "08511"
msgstr ""
"Did you see his moves\n"
"out there on that\n"
"rickety bridge?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoRiverHowManyWarriorsHaveSwallowedTheir"
msgid "08512"
msgstr ""
"How many warriors have\n"
"swallowed their pain to\n"
"get this chest?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoWallICantBelieveAnybodyEverGets"
msgid "08513"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe\n"
"anybody ever gets\n"
"lost in that maze...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoWallHowDoTheyMakeThatFloor"
msgid "08514"
msgstr ""
"How do they make that\n"
"floor move like that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoWallImAmazedPeopleCanActuallyCross"
msgid "08515"
msgstr ""
"I'm amazed people can\n"
"actually cross the logs\n"
"without falling in!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoWallBoyThatBitOverThereMust"
msgid "08516"
msgstr ""
"Boy, that bit over there\n"
"must make their legs\n"
"feel like rubber.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoWallIHeardBabiGotTheLog"
msgid "08517"
msgstr ""
"I heard Babi got the log-\n"
"rolling idea from his\n"
"trip to Kolima Forest.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoLogTheStreetVendorsCornOnThe"
msgid "08518"
msgstr ""
"The street vendors' corn\n"
"on the cob looked sooo\n"
"good... Oh, I'm hungry!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoLogICantSeeAnythingWhenIm"
msgid "08519"
msgstr ""
"I can't see anything\n"
"when I'm facing\n"
"backward!{page_break}"
"I only took this\n"
"job so I could see\n"
"the finals!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoLogItsNotVeryExcitingWorkBut"
msgid "08520"
msgstr ""
"It's not very exciting\n"
"work, but in my own\n"
"way, I do my best.{page_break}"
"Isn't there anyone\n"
"to cheer for me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoLogStandingForLongPeriodsOfTime"
msgid "08521"
msgstr ""
"Standing for long periods\n"
"of time can really\n"
"wear you out...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoLogIWasUpAllNightTrying"
msgid "08522"
msgstr ""
"I was up all night trying\n"
"to memorize these stage\n"
"descriptions.{page_break}"
"I've got 'em down pat!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoLogSomeTouristToldMeILook"
msgid "08523"
msgstr ""
"Some tourist told me I\n"
"look like the guy working\n"
"next door... The nerve!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColossoIsaacFellAsleep"
msgid "08524"
msgstr "{actor_name:1} fell asleep...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08525"
msgstr "He must be exhausted.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08526"
msgstr ""
"Let's leave him to\n"
"sleep for now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerSee"
msgid "08527"
msgstr ""
"You...{pause_20_skippable} You can {pause_20_skippable}see me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08528"
msgstr "Someone's there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08529"
msgstr ""
"Wrapped in Psynergetic\n"
"light... Who could it be?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08530"
msgstr ""
"You know about Psynergy?\n"
"And you can see me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08531"
msgstr ""
"Come on, mister!\n"
"Don't hide{em_dash}show\n"
"yourself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08532"
msgstr ""
"Even if I wanted to show\n"
"myself... As you can\n"
"see, I cannot move.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08533"
msgstr ""
"What do you mean,\n"
"\"as you can see\"?\n"
"You're invisible!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08534"
msgstr "Oh... That's right.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08535"
msgstr ""
"You say you can't\n"
"move... What happened?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08536"
msgstr ""
"Hmmm, yes. I ran out of\n"
"my draught and collapsed\n"
"here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08537"
msgstr "Draught?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08538"
msgstr ""
"Exactly what kind of\n"
"draught is it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08539"
msgstr ""
"You couldn't even begin\n"
"to comprehend if I\n"
"tried to tell you. {text_effect:4}Cough.{reset_text_style}{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08540"
msgstr ""
"You seem to be in a lot\n"
"of pain. Your life depends\n"
"on that draught, huh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08541"
msgstr ""
"It does. Could you do\n"
"me a favor?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08542"
msgstr "A favor? What is it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08543"
msgstr ""
"I'd like you to get\n"
"my draught for me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08544"
msgstr "Get it? Where is it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08545"
msgstr "Deep in this cave...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08546"
msgstr ""
"What, is there a\n"
"pharmacy down there?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08547"
msgstr ""
"Witty, aren't we? I'll\n"
"have to tell you how to\n"
"find it.{page_break}"
"Can you do this for me?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerKiddingHaventActually"
msgid "08548"
msgstr ""
"Are you kidding, {actor_name:1}?\n"
"We haven't even actually\n"
"seen this guy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerSaidCouldntMove"
msgid "08549"
msgstr ""
"He said he couldn't move\n"
"even if he wanted to,\n"
"right?{page_break}"
"Someone is in trouble!\n"
"It's only natural to\n"
"want to help.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08550"
msgstr ""
"I agree with {actor_name:3}{em_dash}\n"
"whoever he is, he\n"
"needs our help.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08551"
msgstr ""
"Fine! Okay! We should help\n"
"people in need.\n"
"Is that better!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerDontTrustAnyone"
msgid "08552"
msgstr ""
"I'm with you, {actor_name:1}. I\n"
"don't trust anyone who's\n"
"afraid to show himself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08553"
msgstr ""
"He said he couldn't\n"
"even move, didn't he?{page_break}"
"Someone is in trouble!\n"
"It's only natural\n"
"to want to help.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08554"
msgstr ""
"I agree with {actor_name:3}{possessive_suffix}\n"
"line of thinking.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08555"
msgstr ""
"Fine! Whatever! We'll\n"
"help everybody who needs\n"
"help. Is that better?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08556"
msgstr ""
"Will you get\n"
"it for me?!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08557"
msgstr ""
"What do we have to do\n"
"to get your draught?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08558"
msgstr ""
"First, you'll have to go\n"
"deep into the cave.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08559"
msgstr ""
"You'll find five rocks\n"
"sticking up out of the\n"
"ground.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08560"
msgstr ""
"Rotate the rocks on the\n"
"left and right sides.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08561"
msgstr ""
"When you turn the rocks\n"
"in the right order, five\n"
"colored lights will appear.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08562"
msgstr ""
"Colored lights!?\n"
"This sounds weird.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08563"
msgstr ""
"That's right. Lights will\n"
"appear on the wall.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08564"
msgstr ""
"There will be five colors:\n"
"blue, green, white,\n"
"yellow, and red.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08565"
msgstr ""
"Turn the five rocks in\n"
"accordance with those\n"
"colors.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08566"
msgstr ""
"Riiight... Spin the rocks\n"
"in accordance with\n"
"the color of the light...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08567"
msgstr ""
"The blue light corresponds\n"
"to the rock farthest\n"
"to the left.{page_break}"
"In order, the other\n"
"rocks are green, white,\n"
"yellow, and red.{page_break}"
"When you see the light,\n"
"rotate the corresponding\n"
"rock.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08568"
msgstr ""
"So, in order, left to\n"
"right, the colors are blue,\n"
"green, white, yellow, red?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08569"
msgstr ""
"Correct. If you do this\n"
"correctly, a hidden\n"
"door will open.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08570"
msgstr ""
"A door? Somewhere deep\n"
"in a cave? Who put it\n"
"there?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08571"
msgstr ""
"An ancient civilization,\n"
"long since vanished.\n"
"{text_effect:4}Ohhh!{reset_text_style} Please hurry!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08572"
msgstr ""
"He seems to be in a lot\n"
"of pain. We'd better find\n"
"that cave, {actor_name:1}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerWait"
msgid "08573"
msgstr "Wait...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08574"
msgstr ""
"The draught is...\n"
"on a table behind\n"
"the door.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerForgetOrderRock"
msgid "08575"
msgstr ""
"Did you forget the order\n"
"of rock colors?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08576"
msgstr ""
"From the left, it's blue,\n"
"green, white, yellow,\n"
"and red.{page_break}"
"Match the colors to\n"
"the rocks in order to\n"
"open the door.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08577"
msgstr ""
"Deep in the cave are five\n"
"rocks. Turn the ones on\n"
"the ends first.{page_break}"
"When the lights appear,\n"
"turn the rocks that\n"
"correspond to the colors.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerNeedDraught"
msgid "08578"
msgstr ""
"If they don't get\n"
"me that draught,\n"
"I{pause_20_skippable}... I'll...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerCameBackPleaseDraughtQuickly"
msgid "08579"
msgstr ""
"You... You came back...\n"
"Please, the draught{em_dash}\n"
"quickly.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08580"
msgstr ""
"Oh, thank you!\n"
"You've saved my life.{page_break}"
"{pause_20_skippable}Squeak... {pause_20_skippable}{text_effect:4}Glug glug "
"glug...{reset_text_style}{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08581"
msgstr ""
"Thank you for your\n"
"help. I'll be okay now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08582"
msgstr "Look! It's a man!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08583"
msgstr ""
"What are you talking\n"
"about? What did you\n"
"expect?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08584"
msgstr ""
"Well, I mean, we couldn't\n"
"see who was talking...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08585"
msgstr ""
"My sudden appearance\n"
"seems to have\n"
"startled you.{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerWouldHaveRevealedMyselfSooner"
msgid "08586"
msgstr ""
"I would have revealed\n"
"myself sooner, but I could\n"
"not even move...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerMustTraveledIndeedIfDidnt"
msgid "08587"
msgstr ""
"You must be well\n"
"traveled indeed if\n"
"that didn't shock you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerHowDidBecomeParalyzedWhile"
msgid "08588"
msgstr ""
"How did you become\n"
"paralyzed while you\n"
"were invisible?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08589"
msgstr ""
"And that ability to conceal\n"
"yourself... Are you\n"
"an Adept?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08590"
msgstr ""
"An Adept? What are you\n"
"talking about?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08591"
msgstr ""
"You used Psynergy to\n"
"conceal yourself,\n"
"didn't you?{page_break}"
"Only an Adept could\n"
"do that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08592"
msgstr ""
"Oh, um... Yes, I{pause_20_skippable} was{pause_20_skippable} using\n"
"Psynergy to conceal\n"
"myself...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08593"
msgstr ""
"Something in his\n"
"tale doesn't sound\n"
"right...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08594"
msgstr ""
"I shall peer into\n"
"his heart.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08595"
msgstr "What's the matter, {actor_name:3}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08596"
msgstr ""
"This is Babi, the ruler\n"
"of Tolbi!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08597"
msgstr ""
"And that {text_effect:2}wasn't{reset_text_style} Psynergy\n"
"he was using to conceal\n"
"himself...{page_break}"
"It was the power of an\n"
"ancient civilization!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08598"
msgstr ""
"I said nothing of the\n"
"kind! How can you\n"
"know that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08599"
msgstr ""
"So, I guess that would\n"
"make you Adepts...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08600"
msgstr ""
"Does that mean...{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"Have I finally\n"
"found true Lemurians!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08601"
msgstr ""
"That's what I've been\n"
"saying! We're Adepts.\n"
"...But{pause_20_skippable} what's Lemuria?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08602"
msgstr ""
"Yes, what is\n"
"this \"Lemuria\"?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08603"
msgstr ""
"What? You're Adepts...\n"
"but not Lemurians?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08604"
msgstr "So I was wrong...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08605"
msgstr ""
"Are you searching for\n"
"these Lemurians, Babi?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08606"
msgstr ""
"Babi, you're the ruler of\n"
"Tolbi... You can have\n"
"anything you want.{page_break}"
"Why would you want\n"
"to find these\n"
"Lemurians?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08607"
msgstr ""
"Even the ruler of Tolbi\n"
"has his limitations.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08608"
msgstr ""
"Every year, I grow\n"
"older and more frail...\n"
"This body's had it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08609"
msgstr ""
"And you regret\n"
"growing older?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08610"
msgstr ""
"I understand your\n"
"desire to remain young,{page_break}"
"but there's nothing\n"
"anyone can do about it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08611"
msgstr ""
"Wait a sec, {actor_name:1}!\n"
"Do you remember when\n"
"we were in Sol Sanctum?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerThatsKradenSaidAlchemyCould"
msgid "08612"
msgstr ""
"That's right! Kraden said\n"
"Alchemy could thwart\n"
"death itself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerForgotKradenSaidAlchemyCould"
msgid "08613"
msgstr ""
"You forgot? Kraden said\n"
"Alchemy could be used to\n"
"thwart death.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerWhatWasThat"
msgid "08614"
msgstr "What was that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08615"
msgstr ""
"Did you say you\n"
"know Kraden?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerBabi"
msgid "08616"
msgstr "Babi!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08617"
msgstr ""
"We've been searching\n"
"everywhere for you,\n"
"Babi!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08618"
msgstr ""
"Iodem said we would\n"
"find you in Altmiller\n"
"Cave!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08619"
msgstr ""
"You're...not glad\n"
"we found you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08620"
msgstr "No, it's not that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08621"
msgstr ""
"What are you doing in\n"
"a cave such as this,\n"
"my lord?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08622"
msgstr "I have my reasons...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08623"
msgstr ""
"Everyone in Tolbi has\n"
"been in a panic over\n"
"your absence.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08624"
msgstr ""
"I did not mean to\n"
"cause anyone any\n"
"undue concern.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08625"
msgstr ""
"We're just happy we\n"
"found you before the\n"
"finals began.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08626"
msgstr ""
"The trials have\n"
"already ended?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08627"
msgstr ""
"Why have you been in\n"
"this cave for so long?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08628"
msgstr ""
"I had{pause_20_skippable}{pause_20_skippable} an important\n"
"errand, but it has been\n"
"taken care of.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08629"
msgstr ""
"Splendid! Then you can\n"
"attend the finals.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08630"
msgstr ""
"I must speak more with\n"
"these people.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08631"
msgstr "Who are they?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08632"
msgstr ""
"I{pause_20_skippable}{pause_20_skippable} owe my life\n"
"to them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08633"
msgstr ""
"Pardon our rudeness.\n"
"You have our gratitude\n"
"for saving Babi's life.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08634"
msgstr ""
"We must have Iodem\n"
"grant them a reward.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08635"
msgstr ""
"You can speak with them\n"
"again after the\n"
"finals are finished.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08636"
msgstr ""
"Oh. I see...\n"
"If that's what we\n"
"have to do, then...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08637"
msgstr ""
"I have not heard\n"
"your names yet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08638"
msgstr "I'm {actor_name:2}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08639"
msgstr "This is {actor_name:1}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08640"
msgstr "I am {actor_name:3}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08641"
msgstr "My name is {actor_name:4}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08642"
msgstr ""
"Come see me at my\n"
"palace once the finals\n"
"have ended.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08643"
msgstr ""
"I would like to speak\n"
"with you further.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08644"
msgstr ""
"Say, I have an idea...\n"
"Why don't you enter\n"
"the finals?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08645"
msgstr ""
"You have some\n"
"interesting\n"
"powers.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08646"
msgstr ""
"But, Lord Babi, they\n"
"have not cleared\n"
"the trials.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08647"
msgstr ""
"Only warriors who clear\n"
"the trials can appear\n"
"in the finals.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08648"
msgstr ""
"And you don't think that\n"
"saving my life qualifies\n"
"as a suitable trial?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08649"
msgstr ""
"I look forward to\n"
"seeing you battle!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08650"
msgstr ""
"He's asking us to\n"
"appear in Colosso,\n"
"isn't he?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08651"
msgstr "Is he serious?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08652"
msgstr ""
"He wants to see us fight\n"
"using our Psynergy...\n"
"That's what it is.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08653"
msgstr ""
"The finals...\n"
"Should we do it?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerSoWellDoIt"
msgid "08654"
msgstr "So we'll do it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerDontWantEitherDo"
msgid "08655"
msgstr ""
"You don't want to\n"
"either, do you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerEitherWayWereStuckHere"
msgid "08656"
msgstr ""
"Either way, we're stuck\n"
"here in Tolbi until\n"
"Colosso is over.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08657"
msgstr ""
"Babi said that he wanted\n"
"to talk to us, didn't he?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08658"
msgstr ""
"He seemed to\n"
"know Kraden.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08659"
msgstr ""
"What could be the\n"
"connection between\n"
"Lemuria and Adepts?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08660"
msgstr ""
"I suspect he knows\n"
"quite a bit about what's\n"
"going on with us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08661"
msgstr ""
"I guess all we can do is\n"
"wait around until Colosso\n"
"is over...{page_break}"
"I hate just waiting\n"
"around...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08662"
msgstr ""
"Come on, let's\n"
"enter Colosso!\n"
"Can we do it?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerGreatItsDecidedJustHave"
msgid "08663"
msgstr ""
"Great! It's decided.\n"
"We'll just have to\n"
"do our best!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08664"
msgstr ""
"If you want to do it,\n"
"{actor_name:1}, we'll go along\n"
"with you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerDontLetMeDownLike"
msgid "08665"
msgstr ""
"What? Don't let me\n"
"down like this!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08666"
msgstr ""
"I guess we'll just wait\n"
"until we reach Tolbi and\n"
"let {actor_name:1} decide there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgAltmillerRotatedRock"
msgid "08667"
msgstr ""
"{protagonist_name} rotated\n"
"the rock.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiColossoWillReachItsApexAny"
msgid "08668"
msgstr ""
"Colosso will reach its\n"
"apex any minute now.{page_break}"
"Let's hurry to the\n"
"colosseum so we can see\n"
"the gladiators fighting!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiAreYouPlanningToWatchThe"
msgid "08669"
msgstr ""
"Are you planning to\n"
"watch the finals? They\n"
"may have already started!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiMyFamilySavedMeASeat"
msgid "08670"
msgstr ""
"My family saved me a\n"
"seat at the colosseum,\n"
"so I'm set.{page_break}"
"Still, we should\n"
"head to Colosso soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiIThoughtSomethingHappenedToBabi"
msgid "08671"
msgstr ""
"I thought something\n"
"happened to Babi...{page_break}"
"He made an appearance at\n"
"the finals, though, so I\n"
"guess it was nothing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiTheColosseumWasSoFullThat"
msgid "08672"
msgstr ""
"The colosseum was so full\n"
"that I couldn't get in. I\n"
"only did the Lucky Guess.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiNobodyElseHasNoticedButThis"
msgid "08673"
msgstr ""
"Nobody else has noticed,\n"
"but this year's festival\n"
"seems a little long.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiHoorayFinalsSeven"
msgid "08674"
msgstr ""
"Hooray! It's the finals!\n"
"Seven warriors remain!\n"
"Only one final winner!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiWaahBigBrother"
msgid "08675"
msgstr ""
"Waah! My big brother\n"
"spent all our souvenir\n"
"money on Lucky Guess!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiHowAboutSomeColossoSouvenirsThis"
msgid "08676"
msgstr ""
"How about some Colosso\n"
"souvenirs? This is your\n"
"last chance! 30% off!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiTheFinalsAreSoLongIts"
msgid "08677"
msgstr ""
"The finals are so long,\n"
"it's a good idea to buy\n"
"some food to take along!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiTheTrialsWereSoRivetingThe"
msgid "08678"
msgstr ""
"The trials were so\n"
"riveting!{page_break}"
"The finals are even more\n"
"incredible.\n"
"I can't wait!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiIHaveSeatsToTheFinals"
msgid "08679"
msgstr ""
"I have seats to the finals.\n"
"They cost money. It is\n"
"too much.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiIOversleptAgainSoICant"
msgid "08680"
msgstr ""
"I overslept again, so I\n"
"can't get into the\n"
"colosseum!{page_break}"
"Maybe I should buy\n"
"good seats from\n"
"a scalper...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiSpringOhThereAreAlwaysScalpersAt"
msgid "08681"
msgstr ""
"Oh, there are always\n"
"scalpers at the\n"
"Colosso finals!{page_break}"
"I think scalpers only try\n"
"to cheat folks coming in\n"
"from the countryside.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08682"
msgstr ""
"The finals are about to\n"
"start. It's kind\n"
"of sad.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08683"
msgstr ""
"Just wait until Colosso\n"
"ends, like a good\n"
"kid.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08684"
msgstr ""
"The prices drop once\n"
"Colosso ends, so buying\n"
"now would be foolish!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08685"
msgstr ""
"They said they'd buy it\n"
"after Colosso ended, but\n"
"I wonder...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiTheFinalsStartTodayIWonder"
msgid "08686"
msgstr ""
"The finals start today.\n"
"I wonder if my buddy\n"
"is doing all right.{page_break}"
"If you need a seat,\n"
"buy a ticket from\n"
"my buddy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiIveGotToGetToThe"
msgid "08687"
msgstr ""
"I've got to get to the\n"
"colosseum...{page_break}"
"What'll I do if I miss\n"
"the height of the \n"
"battle!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiABattleToTheDeathWith"
msgid "08688"
msgstr ""
"A battle to the death with\n"
"7 strapping warriors...\n"
"Oh, it's so exciting!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiTheFinalsStartOnBabisSignal"
msgid "08689"
msgstr ""
"The finals start on\n"
"Babi's signal.\n"
"I love that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiSoWhyWereTheSoldiersAll"
msgid "08690"
msgstr ""
"So why were the soldiers\n"
"all distraught if nothing\n"
"was wrong with Babi?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiICouldStillBuySeatsFrom"
msgid "08691"
msgstr ""
"I could still buy seats\n"
"from a scalper, but I\n"
"hate doing that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiNoMatterHowIAddIt"
msgid "08692"
msgstr ""
"No matter how I add it\n"
"up, this year's\n"
"festival is longer!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiWinBigUsed"
msgid "08693"
msgstr ""
"We could win big if we\n"
"used our allowance to\n"
"enter the Lucky Guess.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiMamaWhyListen"
msgid "08694"
msgstr ""
"Mama, why did you\n"
"listen to my brother?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiWeCantSellAnythingOnceThe"
msgid "08695"
msgstr ""
"We can't sell anything\n"
"once the finals end. We\n"
"have to sell it now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiThisIsTheFinalPushAnything"
msgid "08696"
msgstr ""
"This is the final push!\n"
"Anything that isn't sold\n"
"will go to waste!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiFightingInColossoRequiresALot"
msgid "08697"
msgstr ""
"Fighting in Colosso\n"
"requires a lot of power.\n"
"I couldn't do it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiTheyreSellingFinalsSeatsRightAt"
msgid "08698"
msgstr ""
"They're selling finals seats\n"
"right at the colosseum\n"
"entrance. It's too much!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiItsSupposedToBeFreeHaving"
msgid "08699"
msgstr ""
"It's supposed to be free...\n"
"Having to buy seats from\n"
"scalpers is annoying.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiSpringTheresNoWayPoorSoldiersLike"
msgid "08700"
msgstr ""
"There's no way poor\n"
"soldiers like us can\n"
"afford scalped tickets!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiOnceColossoEndsOurLivesCan"
msgid "08701"
msgstr ""
"Once Colosso ends, our\n"
"lives can go back to\n"
"normal.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiFestivalsAreSoExpensiveMyWallets"
msgid "08702"
msgstr ""
"Festivals are so\n"
"expensive.  My wallet's\n"
"empty!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiMomYouSaidYouWereAll"
msgid "08703"
msgstr ""
"Mom, you said you were\n"
"all out of money, but\n"
"you're not!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiTodayIsABigDayFor"
msgid "08704"
msgstr ""
"Today is a big day for\n"
"us scalpers. What do you\n"
"say, buddy?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsSoColossoHasAlreadyReachedThe"
msgid "08705"
msgstr ""
"So, Colosso has already\n"
"reached the finals.{page_break}"
"We have only a few\n"
"more days to make\n"
"some money.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsTheFestivalScheduleWasDelayedFor"
msgid "08706"
msgstr ""
"The festival schedule was\n"
"delayed for some\n"
"reason.{page_break}"
"Thanks to that, we\n"
"made more money than\n"
"usual.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsThatsStrangeIWonderWhatHappened"
msgid "08707"
msgstr ""
"That's strange... I wonder\n"
"what happened to all\n"
"my money.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIJustSawBabiTheTowns"
msgid "08708"
msgstr ""
"I just saw Babi, the\n"
"town's ruler!{page_break}"
"He is very energetic\n"
"for someone his age,\n"
"isn't he?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsAreWeMakingMoreMoneyNow"
msgid "08709"
msgstr ""
"Are we making more\n"
"money now that the\n"
"festival is longer?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsSoTheyDidExtendTheFestival"
msgid "08710"
msgstr ""
"So they did extend the\n"
"festival? I didn't hear\n"
"anything about it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsICantAffordToStayHere"
msgid "08711"
msgstr ""
"I can't afford to stay\n"
"here.{page_break}"
"I wonder when I should\n"
"tell the owner that I\n"
"don't have any money.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsTheAirInTheColosseumIs"
msgid "08712"
msgstr ""
"The air in the\n"
"colosseum is so\n"
"tense when Babi's there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsHereIAmInTolbiFor"
msgid "08713"
msgstr ""
"Here I am in Tolbi\n"
"for the finals, but\n"
"I'm stuck housesitting!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIfSomebodyElseWouldWatchThe"
msgid "08714"
msgstr ""
"If somebody else would\n"
"watch the house for me,\n"
"I could see the festival.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsImGoingToWatchTheFinals"
msgid "08715"
msgstr ""
"I'm going to watch the\n"
"finals now... Please come\n"
"another time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsHoorayWereGoingToColossoNow"
msgid "08716"
msgstr ""
"Hooray! We're going\n"
"to Colosso now!\n"
"It's the finals!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsColossoIsAlreadyAtTheFinals"
msgid "08717"
msgstr ""
"Colosso is already\n"
"at the finals!{page_break}"
"Hurry! You gotta see\n"
"the fighting at the\n"
"colosseum.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsSinceWeDidntGetToSee"
msgid "08718"
msgstr ""
"Since we didn't get to see\n"
"the trials, we're really\n"
"charged up for this!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsBabiShowedHimselfAtFinals"
msgid "08719"
msgstr ""
"Babi showed himself at\n"
"the finals.{page_break}"
"So was that whole thing\n"
"about him being missing\n"
"just a misunderstanding?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsWellIGuessSoSinceHes"
msgid "08720"
msgstr ""
"Well, I guess so, since\n"
"he's in the colosseum\n"
"now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsHuhThenTheyFoundHimIn"
msgid "08721"
msgstr ""
"Huh? Then they found him\n"
"in time for the finals?{page_break}"
"That sounds ludicrous!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsBabiDecidedShowUpForFinals"
msgid "08722"
msgstr ""
"What's up? Babi decided\n"
"to show up for the\n"
"finals?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsSoWhatWereBabisSoldiersDoing"
msgid "08723"
msgstr ""
"So what were Babi's\n"
"soldiers doing searching\n"
"through town?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsMaybeWatchingTheTrialsIsToo"
msgid "08724"
msgstr ""
"Maybe watching the trials\n"
"is too much for Babi now\n"
"that he's older.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsBabiApparentlyHasSomeReasonFor"
msgid "08725"
msgstr ""
"Babi apparently has some\n"
"reason for building\n"
"the lighthouse.{page_break}"
"But we have no way of\n"
"knowing what sort of\n"
"reason that might be.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIHeardBabiIsSearchingFor"
msgid "08726"
msgstr ""
"I heard Babi is searching\n"
"for something at sea!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsBeforeHeStartedTheLighthouseBabi"
msgid "08727"
msgstr ""
"Before he started the\n"
"lighthouse, Babi sent many\n"
"soldiers to sea.{page_break}"
"I wonder if his reason\n"
"for building the lighthouse\n"
"is related to the sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsBabiHasBeenMakingStrangeReferences"
msgid "08728"
msgstr ""
"Babi has been making\n"
"strange references to\n"
"his time approaching.{page_break}"
"He sounds willing to\n"
"risk his life to find\n"
"what he's looking for.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiColossoFinalsFinally"
msgid "08729"
msgstr ""
"So, the Colosso finals\n"
"are finally here!{page_break}"
"Once Colosso ends, it will\n"
"be our chance to\n"
"make some money!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsTheTouristsAllBuyWeaponsAnd"
msgid "08730"
msgstr ""
"The tourists all buy\n"
"weapons and gear when\n"
"they leave. It's great!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiRequireLotHealing"
msgid "08731"
msgstr ""
"They require a lot of\n"
"healing herbs once the\n"
"finals begin.{page_break}"
"It just goes to show\n"
"you how harsh the final\n"
"battles are.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsYouCouldSayTheWarriorsIn"
msgid "08732"
msgstr ""
"You could say the\n"
"warriors in the finals\n"
"are supermen.{page_break}"
"They get their strength\n"
"back faster than\n"
"anyone I've seen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiMaybeCloseShop"
msgid "08733"
msgstr ""
"Hmm... Maybe I'll close\n"
"the shop so I can go\n"
"watch the finals.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIfMomFindsOutIWent"
msgid "08734"
msgstr ""
"If Mom finds out I\n"
"went to watch the finals,\n"
"she's gonna ground me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsOnceTheFinalsBeginEveryoneTries"
msgid "08735"
msgstr ""
"Once the finals begin,\n"
"everyone tries to\n"
"ditch out on work.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsThisYearImNotLettingAnyone"
msgid "08736"
msgstr ""
"This year I'm not letting\n"
"anyone skip work for\n"
"Colosso!{page_break}"
"No one's gotten\n"
"away so far...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsTheWifeHasACloseEye"
msgid "08737"
msgstr ""
"The wife has a close\n"
"eye on me, so I can't\n"
"go see Colosso.{page_break}"
"But if I don't soon,\n"
"the finals will start\n"
"without me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08738"
msgstr ""
"Do you want to see\n"
"the finals so badly\n"
"you'd skip work to do it?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08739"
msgstr ""
"Isn't it strange that\n"
"something so barbaric\n"
"is so much fun?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsHmmIThoughtAllMenLoved"
msgid "08740"
msgstr ""
"Hmm, I thought all men\n"
"loved those battles.{page_break}"
"To each their own,\n"
"I suppose.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsTheMomentIHearTheFinals"
msgid "08741"
msgstr ""
"The moment I hear the\n"
"finals are starting, I\n"
"want to go watch. Weird.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsSoColossoIsEndingSoonIts"
msgid "08742"
msgstr ""
"So, Colosso is ending\n"
"soon... It's kind of\n"
"sad.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsTheColossoFinalsAreStartingSoon"
msgid "08743"
msgstr ""
"The Colosso finals are\n"
"starting soon. Shall we\n"
"go to the colosseum?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsMaybeIllDoSomeResearchOn"
msgid "08744"
msgstr ""
"Maybe I'll do some\n"
"research on the finals\n"
"for next year's Colosso.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsImTheOneWhoReallyWants"
msgid "08745"
msgstr ""
"I'm the one who really\n"
"wants to skip work to\n"
"watch the finals!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsOnceThingsSettleDownImSure"
msgid "08746"
msgstr ""
"Once things settle down,\n"
"I'm sure these folks will\n"
"go to the colosseum, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIfTheMasterSlipsOutThe"
msgid "08747"
msgstr ""
"If the master slips out,\n"
"the lady will be upset.\n"
"That's our chance!{page_break}"
"What's with the master?\n"
"He'd better go soon!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsWeWomenAreTheOnlyOnes"
msgid "08748"
msgstr ""
"We women are the only\n"
"ones who aren't hoping\n"
"to sneak out.{page_break}"
"But this is no joke! We'll\n"
"have to do all the work\n"
"if they leave!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsHasntTheMasterGoneToColosso"
msgid "08749"
msgstr ""
"Hasn't the master gone\n"
"to Colosso yet?{page_break}"
"The lady must be keeping\n"
"tight watch this year. It's\n"
"hard to fool her.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIDontHaveAnyParticularInterest"
msgid "08750"
msgstr ""
"I don't have any\n"
"particular interest in the\n"
"fighting at Colosso.{page_break}"
"But I am a little sad\n"
"the festival is going\n"
"to end...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIWantToSeeTheFinals"
msgid "08751"
msgstr ""
"I want to see the finals,\n"
"but not all the praising\n"
"of the winner.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsTheTrialBattlesWerentQuiteLike"
msgid "08752"
msgstr ""
"The trial battles weren't\n"
"quite like I imagined...{page_break}"
"It's probably a good\n"
"idea to watch the\n"
"finals too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiMissFinalsTolbis"
msgid "08753"
msgstr ""
"If you miss the finals at\n"
"Tolbi's Festival,\n"
"you'll regret it.{page_break}"
"Why don't you hurry on\n"
"to the colosseum for\n"
"the very moving finale.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIfYoureNotInterestedInThe"
msgid "08754"
msgstr ""
"If you're not interested\n"
"in the final battles, can\n"
"we trade spots?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiArent"
msgid "08755"
msgstr ""
"You're {actor_name:1},\n"
"aren't you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08756"
msgstr ""
"Babi left word that\n"
"he would be waiting for\n"
"you at the colosseum.{page_break}"
"Don't go to the palace.\n"
"Go directly to the\n"
"colosseum.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08757"
msgstr ""
"Oh, I guess I was\n"
"mistaken...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08758"
msgstr ""
"No, I'm certain it\n"
"was you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08759"
msgstr ""
"Babi left word that\n"
"he would be waiting for\n"
"you at the colosseum.{page_break}"
"Don't go to the palace.\n"
"Go directly to the\n"
"colosseum.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceBabiWantsYouToGoStraight"
msgid "08760"
msgstr ""
"Babi wants you to go\n"
"straight to the\n"
"colosseum.{page_break}"
"Don't even bother\n"
"going to the palace.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiIsaacIdReallyLikeThank"
msgid "08761"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}, I'd really\n"
"like to thank you for\n"
"saving Babi.{page_break}"
"He is waiting for you\n"
"now at the colosseum.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiBabiWaitingForAtColosseum"
msgid "08762"
msgstr ""
"Babi is waiting for you at\n"
"the colosseum. He wants\n"
"you to go straight there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceSureTheySavedBabiButIm"
msgid "08763"
msgstr ""
"Sure, they saved Babi, but\n"
"I'm still not convinced\n"
"they belong in the finals.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceBabiIsADeliberateManHe"
msgid "08764"
msgstr ""
"Babi is a deliberate\n"
"man{em_dash}he wouldn't play\n"
"favorites like that!{page_break}"
"What could these\n"
"warriors possibly have\n"
"that Babi wants?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceBabisSoldiersHaveGoneToSee"
msgid "08765"
msgstr ""
"Babi's soldiers have\n"
"gone to see the sights\n"
"at Colosso.{page_break}"
"They're warriors, too, \n"
"so that ought to\n"
"get them pumped up!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceWhatAreYouDoingHurryOver"
msgid "08766"
msgstr ""
"What are you doing?\n"
"Hurry over to\n"
"the colosseum!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceThoseGuysLookReallyConfidentAbout"
msgid "08767"
msgstr ""
"Those guys look really\n"
"confident about fighting!{page_break}"
"I wonder what would\n"
"happen if they fought\n"
"at Colosso?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceTheFinalsAreAllThatsLeft"
msgid "08768"
msgstr ""
"The finals are all\n"
"that's left of this\n"
"year's Colosso...{page_break}"
"I can't wait to see what\n"
"kind of battles there\n"
"will be!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiCameRestBefore"
msgid "08769"
msgstr ""
"You all came to rest up\n"
"before the match,\n"
"didn't you?{page_break}"
"Would you like to sleep\n"
"right now?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08770"
msgstr ""
"Here you are.\n"
"Have a nice rest!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08771"
msgstr ""
"If you're tired,\n"
"please feel free to\n"
"get some rest.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08772"
msgstr "Do you want to rest?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiTiredFeelFreeRest"
msgid "08773"
msgstr ""
"Well, if you're tired,\n"
"please feel free to get\n"
"some rest.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceIHopeYoullAllDoWell"
msgid "08774"
msgstr ""
"I hope you'll all do\n"
"well in the finals!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceBabiHasReturnedAndTheFinals"
msgid "08775"
msgstr ""
"Babi has returned and the\n"
"finals are set to begin!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceWhenBabiReturnedHeHeadedOff"
msgid "08776"
msgstr ""
"When Babi returned, he\n"
"headed off to the festival\n"
"without even resting.{page_break}"
"The finals this year\n"
"must have some sort of\n"
"significance for him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceWhatsGoingOnActorIsLooking"
msgid "08777"
msgstr ""
"What's going on? {actor_name:7}\n"
"is looking\n"
"much happier.{page_break}"
"I wonder what happened\n"
"to make that girl smile.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceTheSoldiersCameToSeeActor"
msgid "08778"
msgstr ""
"The soldiers came to see\n"
"{actor_name:7}. She's been in a\n"
"great mood ever since.{page_break}"
"Those soldiers didn't\n"
"say anything that might\n"
"make me smile...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceHmphIWishColossoWouldHurry"
msgid "08779"
msgstr ""
"Hmph! I wish Colosso\n"
"would hurry up and\n"
"end!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceASmileOnAPrettyGirl"
msgid "08780"
msgstr ""
"A smile on a pretty girl\n"
"is much nicer than tears!{page_break}"
"When I see {actor_name:7} in a\n"
"good mood, it makes me\n"
"feel happy too!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceActorIsAGoodGirlBut"
msgid "08781"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} is a good girl,\n"
"but she has a few quirks\n"
"that are all her own.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceIDontHaveTheLeastInterest"
msgid "08782"
msgstr ""
"I don't have the least\n"
"interest in Colosso.{page_break}"
"But when it's over,\n"
"something really good\n"
"will happen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceTheFinalsAreFinallyHereI"
msgid "08783"
msgstr ""
"The finals are finally\n"
"here! I can't wait to see\n"
"how the battles turn out!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceIHeardBabiHasPickedSome"
msgid "08784"
msgstr ""
"I heard Babi has picked\n"
"some warriors for this\n"
"year's finals himself!{page_break}"
"I'm anxious to see how\n"
"tough those warriors\n"
"are!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumColosseumAlreadyFullIfReally"
msgid "08785"
msgstr ""
"The colosseum is already\n"
"full!{page_break}"
"If you really want to\n"
"watch, buy a ticket\n"
"from those scalpers.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceAWarriorNamedIsaacWasSelected"
msgid "08786"
msgstr ""
"A warrior named {actor_name:1}\n"
"was selected for the\n"
"finals by Babi.{page_break}"
"Maybe I should put a\n"
"little money on Babi's\n"
"special warrior...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceHavingAWarriorWhoWasntIn"
msgid "08787"
msgstr ""
"Having a warrior who\n"
"wasn't in the trials\n"
"appear in the finals{page_break}"
"is really going to\n"
"mess things up.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumWantWatchFinalsFromGood"
msgid "08788"
msgstr ""
"I want to watch the finals\n"
"from a good spot{pause_20_skippable},\n"
"but it costs too much!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08789"
msgstr ""
"It was hard for me to\n"
"get seats too... Come on\n"
"make up your mind!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumHoldOnSecond"
msgid "08790"
msgstr "Hey, hold on a second!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08791"
msgstr "You want seats?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08792"
msgstr ""
"I've got a customer I'm\n"
"talking to here!{page_break}"
"Catch me later.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08793"
msgstr ""
"Then, what? You got a\n"
"problem? I'm busy. I don't\n"
"need any distractions!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumWantTryOutLuckyGuess"
msgid "08794"
msgstr ""
"Want to try out the\n"
"Lucky Guess?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08795"
msgstr ""
"Let me know if you want\n"
"to play, okay?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08796"
msgstr ""
"Aren't you {actor_name:1}? The\n"
"one handpicked by\n"
"Babi?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08797"
msgstr ""
"You can't fool me...\n"
"You fit the features\n"
"I've heard about exactly!{page_break}"
"Sorry, but warriors who\n"
"are actually fighting\n"
"can't play.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumLookImSorryButWe"
msgid "08798"
msgstr ""
"Look, I'm sorry, but we\n"
"have some rules to help\n"
"keep things legit.{page_break}"
"Warriors who made the\n"
"finals, and their team\n"
"members, can't play.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceTheRealBattlesAreAboutTo"
msgid "08799"
msgstr ""
"The real battles are about\n"
"to begin at the colosseum!{page_break}"
"The strongest warrior\n"
"will be determined by\n"
"these battles.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceTheWarriorNamedIsaacIsSure"
msgid "08800"
msgstr ""
"The warrior named\n"
"{actor_name:1} is sure to\n"
"be an incredible fighter.{page_break}"
"I picked {actor_name:1} in the\n"
"Lucky Guess.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceOfCourseItsTheRichWho"
msgid "08801"
msgstr ""
"Of course it's the\n"
"rich who have the money\n"
"to buy seats at the finals.{page_break}"
"They always get to have\n"
"all the fun without\n"
"having to work hard!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceThereCanBeUpsetsInThe"
msgid "08802"
msgstr ""
"There can be upsets\n"
"in the Colosso finals,\n"
"you know.{page_break}"
"There's no guarantee\n"
"the warrior chosen\n"
"by Babi will win.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceWhatKindOfWarriorIsThat"
msgid "08803"
msgstr ""
"What kind of warrior\n"
"is that {actor_name:1} guy\n"
"who Babi chose?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceMaybeIWillBuyASeat"
msgid "08804"
msgstr ""
"Maybe I will buy a\n"
"seat... I don't know\n"
"what to do!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceImGoingToBeInTrouble"
msgid "08805"
msgstr ""
"I'm going to be in trouble\n"
"if I get stuck with any\n"
"unsold seats...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceAllOfTheProfitsFromThe"
msgid "08806"
msgstr ""
"All of the profits from\n"
"the Lucky Guess go to\n"
"Babi.{page_break}"
"If it weren't for that,\n"
"we'd make a killing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumHeyYouRe"
msgid "08807"
msgstr "Hey, you're {actor_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08808"
msgstr ""
"You're kidding... That's\n"
"{actor_name:1}? The one Babi\n"
"picked?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08809"
msgstr ""
"Yeah{pause_20_skippable}, there's no\n"
"mistaking it...\n"
"He's {actor_name:1}, for sure.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08810"
msgstr ""
"He's just a kid!\n"
"What does Babi think\n"
"Colosso is? A playground?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08811"
msgstr ""
"Putting him in the finals\n"
"is an insult to everyone\n"
"who cleared the trials!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08812"
msgstr ""
"Don't you people\n"
"have faith in Babi?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08813"
msgstr ""
"Babi wouldn't let him into\n"
"the finals just to repay\n"
"a favor!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08814"
msgstr ""
"I guess Babi wouldn't\n"
"let {actor_name:1} in if he\n"
"weren't a good match.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08815"
msgstr ""
"We've been waiting for\n"
"you and your friends,\n"
"{actor_name:1}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08816"
msgstr ""
"All of the Colosso\n"
"participants go to the\n"
"waiting room, OK?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08817"
msgstr ""
"All right, this way\n"
"please.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08818"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}! You can't just\n"
"{text_effect:2}watch{reset_text_style} the finals!\n"
"You're fighting in them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08819"
msgstr ""
"Babi is looking forward\n"
"to seeing your battles.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08820"
msgstr ""
"He'll be angry if you just\n"
"watch from the sidelines.\n"
"Trust me on that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08821"
msgstr ""
"We were told to make\n"
"sure you appear in the\n"
"finals, no matter what.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08822"
msgstr ""
"Really, you might as well\n"
"get used to the idea.{page_break}"
"You're competing\n"
"in the finals.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08823"
msgstr ""
"Well, it seems we have no\n"
"choice{em_dash}we have to\n"
"fight in the finals!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08824"
msgstr ""
"Would it cause problems\n"
"for everyone if we\n"
"didn't do this?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08825"
msgstr ""
"I don't want to be the\n"
"source of any trouble.\n"
"Let's fight.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08826"
msgstr ""
"We're in a fix, {actor_name:1}.\n"
"We have to do it,\n"
"don't you think?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08827"
msgstr ""
"We appreciate this,\n"
"{actor_name:1}. Well, come this\n"
"way, please.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08828"
msgstr ""
"Why do you have to be so\n"
"stubborn at a time like\n"
"this?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08829"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:2}, why don't you\n"
"pretend to be\n"
"our leader...{page_break}"
"just until we're in the\n"
"participants' room?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08830"
msgstr ""
"Yes. Maybe once we get\n"
"that far, {actor_name:1} will\n"
"have a better mindset.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08831"
msgstr ""
"All right, guys!\n"
"Lead on!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiGetUp"
msgid "08832"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}!{page_break}"
"Get up, {actor_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08833"
msgstr ""
"Are you okay? You were\n"
"having nightmares for\n"
"quite a while...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08834"
msgstr ""
"What's the matter,\n"
"{actor_name:1}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08835"
msgstr ""
"What? You entered\n"
"and fought in the finals?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08836"
msgstr ""
"How could you? You\n"
"haven't even been to the\n"
"colosseum yet, {actor_name:1}!{page_break}"
"You came here to get a\n"
"little rest before\n"
"the finals.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08837"
msgstr ""
"Sounds like you've been\n"
"dreaming, {actor_name:1}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08838"
msgstr ""
"You're so exhausted, it's\n"
"giving you nightmares. Are\n"
"you okay now, {actor_name:1}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08839"
msgstr ""
"You think you can manage?{page_break}"
"I understand, but don't\n"
"overdo it, OK, {actor_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08840"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}'s awake now,\n"
"so let's head over to\n"
"the colosseum.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08841"
msgstr ""
"Okay! We're off to\n"
"the colosseum!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08842"
msgstr ""
"If you're tired,\n"
"please feel free\n"
"to rest.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08843"
msgstr ""
"I hope you all perform\n"
"well in the finals.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiCallsName"
msgid "08844"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08845"
msgstr "Huh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08846"
msgstr "You've awakened.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08847"
msgstr ""
"Colosso? Duh! That ended\n"
"long ago!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08848"
msgstr ""
"You fell into a\n"
"deep sleep...\n"
"Don't you remember?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08849"
msgstr ""
"Oh, gimme a break.\n"
"You were out cold! You\n"
"don't remember a thing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08850"
msgstr ""
"Of course he doesn't!\n"
"He was out cold!\n"
"...You had us worried!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08851"
msgstr ""
"I'm sorry for shouting\n"
"at you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08852"
msgstr ""
"You fought brilliantly\n"
"to the end, {actor_name:1}.{page_break}"
"Babi was singing\n"
"your praises.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08853"
msgstr ""
"Are you okay now?\n"
"In body and mind?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08854"
msgstr ""
"He'd better be all right,\n"
"after sleeping this\n"
"long. Sheesh!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08855"
msgstr ""
"If you feel out of sorts,{page_break}"
"it's probably because\n"
"you slept too long!\n"
"Sheesh!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08856"
msgstr ""
"I'm sorry for shouting\n"
"again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08857"
msgstr ""
"Babi said he wanted to\n"
"see you when you came\n"
"to, {actor_name:1}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08858"
msgstr ""
"If you're okay,\n"
"shall we go see Babi?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08859"
msgstr ""
"You're fine!\n"
"Aren't you, {actor_name:1}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08860"
msgstr ""
"I'm not sure {actor_name:1}'s\n"
"up to it just yet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08861"
msgstr ""
"What is it? Feeling weak?\n"
"Fresh air and a walk\n"
"will fix that, right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08862"
msgstr ""
"I'm more worried\n"
"about what Babi wants.\n"
"Let's get going!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08863"
msgstr ""
"Are you sure you should\n"
"be getting up so\n"
"suddenly like that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08864"
msgstr ""
"He's fine.\n"
"He doesn't want to\n"
"lounge around all day!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08865"
msgstr ""
"I see. Let's go see\n"
"Babi then.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceIveLostAllMyEnthusiasmSince"
msgid "08866"
msgstr ""
"I've lost all my enthusiasm\n"
"since Colosso ended.{page_break}"
"I can't wait until\n"
"next year's festival!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiWarriorsWhoStayed"
msgid "08867"
msgstr ""
"All the warriors who\n"
"stayed in the palace left\n"
"when Colosso ended.{page_break}"
"Are you folks leaving\n"
"too?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08868"
msgstr ""
"Oh, that's too bad. I bet\n"
"we could have had a\n"
"good time together.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08869"
msgstr ""
"Huh? I thought for sure\n"
"you'd be going, too.\n"
"I guess not...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceTheEndOfAFestivalIs"
msgid "08870"
msgstr ""
"The end of a festival\n"
"is always the loneliest\n"
"time of year.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceAllTheHeroicWarriorsWhoTook"
msgid "08871"
msgstr ""
"All the heroic warriors\n"
"who took part in Colosso\n"
"should remain in Tolbi.{page_break}"
"Finding warriors like\n"
"that is why Babi holds\n"
"Colosso in the first place!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiMeetBabi"
msgid "08872"
msgstr "Did you meet with Babi?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08873"
msgstr ""
"Please lend Babi your\n"
"assistance.{page_break}"
"Babi is counting on\n"
"your help.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08874"
msgstr ""
"Why aren't you going to\n"
"meet with Babi to\n"
"discuss things?{page_break}"
"He wants to talk to\n"
"you before you leave.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiEasternShoresKaragol"
msgid "08875"
msgstr ""
"So, you're all from the\n"
"eastern shores of the\n"
"Karagol Sea, huh?{page_break}"
"Do you want to go\n"
"back already?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08876"
msgstr ""
"Oh, that's too bad.{pause_20_skippable}..that\n"
"no one will set sail on\n"
"the Karagol Sea, I mean.{page_break}"
"Why don't you let Babi\n"
"take care of you until\n"
"your ship sails?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08877"
msgstr ""
"You don't? That's great!\n"
"Babi will be very happy\n"
"to hear it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceIHaventSeenMuchOfBabi"
msgid "08878"
msgstr ""
"I haven't seen much of\n"
"Babi lately. It's as if he's\n"
"afraid of something.{page_break}"
"What in the world\n"
"could frighten him?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceItWouldBeAWasteTo"
msgid "08879"
msgstr ""
"It would be a waste to\n"
"let you leave, {actor_name:1}.{page_break}"
"I certainly will not\n"
"tell you how to return\n"
"to the east.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceNoOnesGoingToSleepIn"
msgid "08880"
msgstr ""
"No one's going to sleep\n"
"in this big bedroom\n"
"until the next Colosso!{page_break}"
"Even so, we still have to\n"
"keep it cleaned up.\n"
"I hate that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceWouldThisRoomGetVeryDusty"
msgid "08881"
msgstr ""
"Would this room get very\n"
"dusty if I didn't clean\n"
"it all year?{page_break}"
"Yeah, that won't do.\n"
"I guess I'll just have\n"
"to tidy up.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceBabiWasFoundSafeAndSound"
msgid "08882"
msgstr ""
"Babi was found safe and\n"
"sound, and Colosso ended\n"
"without incident.{page_break}"
"We're relieved\n"
"everything went so well.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceNowThatColossoIsOverIm"
msgid "08883"
msgstr ""
"Now that Colosso is over,\n"
"I'm going to Gondowan to\n"
"build Babi Lighthouse!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceTheSouthernContinentIsADangerous"
msgid "08884"
msgstr ""
"The southern continent\n"
"is a dangerous place.\n"
"If you ever go there,{page_break}"
"you'll know why I prefer\n"
"Angara. There truly is\n"
"no more peaceful land.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceIWasHopingIdBeThe"
msgid "08885"
msgstr ""
"I was hoping I'd be the\n"
"one to find Babi! Oh well,\n"
"it's too late now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceColossoHasEndedSoWeHave"
msgid "08886"
msgstr ""
"Colosso has ended, so we\n"
"have to go back to\n"
"building the lighthouse.{page_break}"
"{pause_20_skippable}I still don't get\n"
"why Babi wants it\n"
"finished so soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceIWantThatLighthouseFinishedQuickly"
msgid "08887"
msgstr ""
"I want that lighthouse\n"
"finished quickly, so I can\n"
"say good-bye to Gondowan.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiOnceBabiLighthouseIsCompleteId"
msgid "08888"
msgstr ""
"Once Babi Lighthouse is\n"
"complete, I'd like to\n"
"move there!{page_break}"
"I'll spend my time\n"
"poring over the\n"
"Venus Ruins.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgValeFolksSeemKnow"
msgid "08889"
msgstr ""
"You folks seem to know\n"
"quite a bit about Kraden,\n"
"don't you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08890"
msgstr ""
"We haven't heard from\n"
"him in years... To think\n"
"he was in your village!{page_break}"
"I wonder if he ever\n"
"found the legendary\n"
"Elemental Stars?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08891"
msgstr ""
"I'm shocked to hear no\n"
"one knew he was from\n"
"here.{page_break}"
"I wonder why Kraden\n"
"never told anyone in Vale\n"
"about Tolbi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiAlchemyTeachesThatTheFourElements"
msgid "08892"
msgstr ""
"Alchemy teaches that the\n"
"four elements, earth,\n"
"water, fire, and wind...{page_break}"
"form the basis for\n"
"everything.{page_break}"
"You can create\n"
"anything by combining\n"
"those elements...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiIfTheRiddleOfTheVenus"
msgid "08893"
msgstr ""
"If the riddle of the\n"
"Venus Ruins were solved,\n"
"we wouldn't have to{page_break}"
"build Babi Lighthouse.\n"
"We continue to study, but\n"
"we make little progress.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiImSureKradenWouldStopBy"
msgid "08894"
msgstr ""
"I'm sure Kraden would\n"
"stop by if he ever came\n"
"through here again.{page_break}"
"Babi took very good\n"
"care of Kraden...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiTheRelationshipBetweenAlchemyAndThe"
msgid "08895"
msgstr ""
"The relationship between\n"
"Alchemy and the Venus\n"
"Ruins seems strong.{page_break}"
"I'll solve the riddle\n"
"of the lighthouse and\n"
"show them all!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiIWantToSeeKradenAnd"
msgid "08896"
msgstr ""
"I want to see Kraden\n"
"and reveal something\n"
"about Alchemy to him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiTheresGotToBeAGood"
msgid "08897"
msgstr ""
"There's got to be a\n"
"good reason for calling\n"
"the four Elementals...{page_break}"
"the Four Great Bases. If\n"
"we can find out why, we\n"
"might turn lead into gold!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiWhatSortOfUnfathomableRiddlesAre"
msgid "08898"
msgstr ""
"What sort of unfathomable\n"
"riddles are hiding in\n"
"the Venus Ruins?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiThereMustBeAReasonWhy"
msgid "08899"
msgstr ""
"There must be a reason\n"
"why Kraden has not\n"
"returned to Tolbi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiWaitingCompanions"
msgid "08900"
msgstr ""
"I've been waiting for\n"
"you and your companions,\n"
"{actor_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08901"
msgstr ""
"I've been waiting here\n"
"because I wanted to\n"
"speak with you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08902"
msgstr ""
"It's hard to talk when \n"
"you're so far away...\n"
"Come over here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08903"
msgstr ""
"The battles at Colosso\n"
"were spectacular!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08904"
msgstr ""
"It was most rewarding\n"
"to see Babi's favored\n"
"warrior steal the day.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08905"
msgstr ""
"Iodem, bring him the\n"
"victor's prize.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08906"
msgstr "Yes, sir, right away.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08907"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1} received\n"
"{argument_item_name:2}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08908"
msgstr ""
"Incidentally, {actor_name:1},\n"
"are you feeling better\n"
"now?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08909"
msgstr ""
"It was wonderful to see\n"
"Babi's handpicked\n"
"warrior make it so far!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08910"
msgstr ""
"Incidentally, {actor_name:1},\n"
"are you feeling better\n"
"now?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08911"
msgstr ""
"Ah, the recuperative\n"
"powers of youth...and\n"
"after such fierce battles!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08912"
msgstr ""
"You must be exhausted.\n"
"I'm amazed to see you on\n"
"your feet after Colosso.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08913"
msgstr ""
"Who could expect less\n"
"from the warriors who\n"
"rescued me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08914"
msgstr ""
"Enough with the flattery.\n"
"Let's get to the point:\n"
"why were we summoned?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08915"
msgstr ""
"Such insolence! Who\n"
"do you think you are,\n"
"to speak to Babi so?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08916"
msgstr ""
"Let it be, Iodem. There\n"
"are other ways to\n"
"judge a man.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08917"
msgstr ""
"What is it you said you\n"
"were called?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08918"
msgstr ""
"He's talking to\n"
"you, {actor_name:2}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08919"
msgstr ""
"That's right, {actor_name:2}.\n"
"We shall explain all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08920"
msgstr ""
"We intended to thank you\n"
"and your companions for\n"
"saving Babi, {actor_name:1}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08921"
msgstr ""
"But it would seem that\n"
"gratitude is not enough...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08922"
msgstr ""
"I have disclosed\n"
"everything to Iodem.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08923"
msgstr ""
"What do you mean\n"
"by everything?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08924"
msgstr ""
"You do wish to know\n"
"more about Lemuria,\n"
"correct?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08925"
msgstr ""
"Yes, indeed... Your desire\n"
"is as plain as day.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08926"
msgstr ""
"You can't hide your\n"
"interest from me. It is\n"
"written on your faces.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08927"
msgstr ""
"I have just seen Psynergy\n"
"for the first time...\n"
"It is an awesome power...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08928"
msgstr ""
"I used my Cloak Ball\n"
"to show him Psynergy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08929"
msgstr ""
"No one else could see\n"
"it, but I knew {actor_name:1}'s\n"
"tournament was strange.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08930"
msgstr ""
"I thought it unlikely\n"
"that you would fight\n"
"using such power...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08931"
msgstr ""
"No need to be ashamed,\n"
"{actor_name:1}. Psynergy\n"
"is also a warrior's power.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08932"
msgstr ""
"When I first learned\n"
"of your power, I was\n"
"shocked.{page_break}"
"I thought you might\n"
"be Lemurians.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08933"
msgstr ""
"You have mentioned\n"
"Lemuria many times,\n"
"Babi. What is it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08934"
msgstr ""
"It is the city of an\n"
"ancient people, lying far\n"
"out at sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08935"
msgstr ""
"Many years ago, about the\n"
"time of the great flood,\n"
"Babi went to Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08936"
msgstr "I see...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08937"
msgstr ""
"The great flood struck\n"
"while I was traveling\n"
"with Lunpa.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08938"
msgstr ""
"Lunpa... You mean\n"
"Lunpa the thief?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08939"
msgstr ""
"I know it is hard to\n"
"believe... It happened a\n"
"hundred years ago.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08940"
msgstr ""
"You mean...those rumors\n"
"about you are...true?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08941"
msgstr ""
"Kraden once mentioned the\n"
"Stone of Sages. Do you\n"
"think that's what did it?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08942"
msgstr ""
"So the stone that grants\n"
"immortality came from\n"
"Lemuria?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08943"
msgstr ""
"Huh? Don't tell me\n"
"you forgot about\n"
"the Stone of Sages...{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08944"
msgstr ""
"It rules all, can change\n"
"anything into gold, grants\n"
"immortality.{pause_20_skippable} Ring a bell?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08945"
msgstr ""
"I can't think of anything\n"
"else that would let him\n"
"live for so long.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08946"
msgstr ""
"So you've even heard of\n"
"the Stone of Sages... I'm\n"
"afraid I don't have it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08947"
msgstr ""
"It is the draught of\n"
"Lemuria that has allowed\n"
"me to live for so long.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08948"
msgstr ""
"The draught of\n"
"Lemuria?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08949"
msgstr ""
"It is a magical draught\n"
"once taken by those\n"
"who lived in Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08950"
msgstr ""
"And just drinking stops\n"
"you from aging?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08951"
msgstr "Is that what it does?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08952"
msgstr ""
"Hmmm...{pause_20_skippable} It would be\n"
"more accurate to say it\n"
"slows the aging process.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08953"
msgstr ""
"There is death in\n"
"Lemuria...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08954"
msgstr ""
"But it only comes to those\n"
"whose senses have failed\n"
"from centuries of use.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08955"
msgstr ""
"Do the people of Lemuria\n"
"use Psynergy, like we do?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08956"
msgstr ""
"You have that draught,\n"
"Babi... That's why you've\n"
"lived so long.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08957"
msgstr ""
"And become wealthy\n"
"enough to rule Tolbi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08958"
msgstr ""
"What are you\n"
"getting at?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08959"
msgstr ""
"What is your purpose\n"
"in making everyone\n"
"study Alchemy?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08960"
msgstr ""
"I'm starting to wonder\n"
"myself. What do you hope\n"
"to gain, Babi?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08961"
msgstr ""
"Ah. If I had attained\n"
"true immortality...{page_break}"
"There would be\n"
"no need for all\n"
"this research.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08962"
msgstr "I'm not sure I understand.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08963"
msgstr ""
"I had precious little\n"
"draught, and now I\n"
"am running out.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08964"
msgstr ""
"You all saw it. There\n"
"was but little left in\n"
"the cave...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08965"
msgstr ""
"How long will it last?\n"
"And what will happen\n"
"when it runs out?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08966"
msgstr ""
"It will run out any day\n"
"now. And when it does,\n"
"my life is at its end...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08967"
msgstr ""
"Why didn't you tell us\n"
"sooner? We must hurry\n"
"to Lemuria!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08968"
msgstr "It is pointless...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08969"
msgstr ""
"What on earth do you\n"
"mean, pointless?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08970"
msgstr ""
"We cannot find\n"
"Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08971"
msgstr ""
"But you just said that\n"
"it lies far out at\n"
"sea...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08972"
msgstr ""
"If we search the seas,\n"
"we're sure to find it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08973"
msgstr ""
"I've sent so many ships\n"
"in the past in\n"
"search of Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08974"
msgstr ""
"This must have been long\n"
"before I joined you... But\n"
"still you failed?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08975"
msgstr ""
"I needed more Lemurian\n"
"draught, but I couldn't\n"
"find Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08976"
msgstr ""
"Why did you collapse\n"
"in the cave if you\n"
"still had more draught?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08977"
msgstr ""
"I have been rationing it,\n"
"but this time, I waited\n"
"too long between drinks.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08978"
msgstr ""
"You were trying to make\n"
"it last longer...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08979"
msgstr ""
"I overexerted myself\n"
"trying to find Lemuria\n"
"before it ran out.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08980"
msgstr ""
"And your reason for\n"
"calling us here has\n"
"to do with Lemuria?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08981"
msgstr ""
"Exactly. I want you\n"
"to find Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08982"
msgstr ""
"I have not been able\n"
"to locate Lemuria by\n"
"sea, but perhaps by air...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08983"
msgstr ""
"I can hide it no longer...{page_break}"
"I have built Babi\n"
"Lighthouse to see if I can\n"
"find Lemuria at sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08984"
msgstr ""
"What? That's why you're\n"
"building the lighthouse?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08985"
msgstr ""
"No, there's more to\n"
"it than that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08986"
msgstr ""
"We've  spotted something\n"
"in the ocean southeast\n"
"of the lighthouse.{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}.{page_break}"
"where Lemuria\n"
"should be.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08987"
msgstr ""
"Something dangerous, no\n"
"doubt. What, monsters?\n"
"We can handle 'em...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08988"
msgstr ""
"That may be...\n"
"However, something else\n"
"troubles me more.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08989"
msgstr "What is it, my lord?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08990"
msgstr ""
"No sailor has been able\n"
"to keep his bearings\n"
"at sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08991"
msgstr ""
"You're kidding! You mean\n"
"they can't even keep a\n"
"straight course?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08992"
msgstr ""
"Is there something that\n"
"distorts distance or\n"
"direction or something?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08993"
msgstr ""
"The currents shift there,\n"
"subtly changing a ship's\n"
"direction.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08994"
msgstr ""
"So the lighthouse will\n"
"help the ships keep\n"
"their bearings...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08995"
msgstr ""
"So, how exactly did you\n"
"get away from Lemuria\n"
"after the flood, Babi?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08996"
msgstr ""
"That is the thing,\n"
"{actor_name:2}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08997"
msgstr ""
"I crossed the sea in a\n"
"Lemurian ship. I am hoping\n"
"you can sail it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08998"
msgstr ""
"But why us, when you\n"
"have so many powerful\n"
"soldiers at your disposal?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "08999"
msgstr ""
"None of them have the\n"
"ability to use Psynergy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09000"
msgstr ""
"One must have Psynergy\n"
"to sail this ship!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09001"
msgstr ""
"Then that would mean\n"
"that Babi is an Adept,\n"
"wouldn't it?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09002"
msgstr ""
"That must be it. No\n"
"normal person could use\n"
"that Cloak Ball.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09003"
msgstr ""
"But, {actor_name:1}, no normal\n"
"person could master\n"
"the Cloak Ball!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09004"
msgstr ""
"I learned to use a little\n"
"Psynergy during my stay\n"
"in Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09005"
msgstr ""
"With what little I'd\n"
"learned, I was able\n"
"to guide the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09006"
msgstr ""
"In that case, perhaps...\n"
"I could sail the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09007"
msgstr "No. It must be an Adept.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09008"
msgstr ""
"What should we do,\n"
"{actor_name:1}? Will you do\n"
"what he wants?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09009"
msgstr ""
"If you do, I will\n"
"grant you whatever\n"
"you wish.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09010"
msgstr ""
"You shouldn't make vows\n"
"you will later find\n"
"you cannot keep...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09011"
msgstr ""
"I haven't even\n"
"considered my own\n"
"wishes lately.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09012"
msgstr ""
"In that case, I could\n"
"provide you with a wealth\n"
"of items you might like.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09013"
msgstr ""
"Babi's offer is very\n"
"generous... You will\n"
"consider going, won't you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09014"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}, we have to\n"
"beat {actor_name:5} and the\n"
"others to the lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09015"
msgstr ""
"Not this time. We have to\n"
"beat {actor_name:5} and the\n"
"others to the lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09016"
msgstr "The lighthouse!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09017"
msgstr ""
"Do you mean Venus\n"
"Lighthouse?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09018"
msgstr ""
"Well then, our paths are\n"
"intertwined. I, too, must\n"
"go to Venus Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09019"
msgstr ""
"But we cannot get to\n"
"the top of Venus\n"
"Lighthouse, can we?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09020"
msgstr ""
"These Adepts may be able\n"
"to solve the riddle\n"
"that blocks us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09021"
msgstr ""
"Ah, I see... The thought\n"
"hadn't occurred to me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09022"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}! You shall go\n"
"to Venus Lighthouse\n"
"with Iodem.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09023"
msgstr ""
"Do not worry...{page_break}"
"You can take care of\n"
"your own business\n"
"first.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09024"
msgstr ""
"I see... If they can solve\n"
"the riddle of the\n"
"lighthouse...{page_break}"
"then our own wishes\n"
"will have been fulfilled.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09025"
msgstr ""
"So, we can search for\n"
"Lemuria after they\n"
"complete their own quest...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09026"
msgstr "Is that acceptable?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09027"
msgstr ""
"Ah, you will undertake\n"
"this quest! I am most\n"
"grateful!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09028"
msgstr ""
"If you need time to make\n"
"up your mind, then\n"
"please do so.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09029"
msgstr ""
"In any case, you will\n"
"need my assistance to\n"
"reach the lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09030"
msgstr ""
"I'll make preparations\n"
"so that I am ready to\n"
"leave at any time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09031"
msgstr ""
"I take my leave now\n"
"to make preparations.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09032"
msgstr ""
"Then you can all meet\n"
"at Gondowan Passage...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09033"
msgstr "That's a brilliant idea!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09034"
msgstr ""
"One more thing. I'd like\n"
"you to think about a\n"
"suitable reward.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09035"
msgstr ""
"Yes. I will take care\n"
"of that immediately,\n"
"as well.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09036"
msgstr ""
"I shall be waiting for\n"
"you at the passage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09037"
msgstr ""
"Your first task shall be\n"
"the riddles of Venus\n"
"Lighthouse.{page_break}"
"I am counting on\n"
"you, {actor_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceSleepingALotHelpsToDelay"
msgid "09038"
msgstr ""
"Sleeping a lot helps\n"
"to delay the need to\n"
"drink more draught.{page_break}"
"If you find Lemuria and\n"
"return with more draught,\n"
"I won't have to do this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceBabisFaceIsVeryPaleLike"
msgid "09039"
msgstr ""
"Babi's face is very\n"
"pale, like that of\n"
"a dead man.{page_break}"
"It's no use worrying,\n"
"though. There's nothing\n"
"we can do about it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceIWishIHadMetYou"
msgid "09040"
msgstr ""
"I wish I had met you and\n"
"your companions sooner,\n"
"{actor_name:1}.{page_break}"
"But I suppose it was\n"
"not fated to be...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceIfSomethingHappensToBabiWhat"
msgid "09041"
msgstr ""
"If something happens to\n"
"Babi, what will become of\n"
"Tolbi?{page_break}"
"Just thinking about\n"
"it frightens me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiFoundCloakBall"
msgid "09042"
msgstr ""
"You found the\n"
"Cloak Ball.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09043"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}! Is that Cloak\n"
"Ball what you desire?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09044"
msgstr ""
"Then please leave the\n"
"Cloak Ball alone.{page_break}"
"Do not worry about\n"
"your reward. Iodem has\n"
"prepared it for you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09045"
msgstr ""
"That Cloak Ball is very\n"
"precious to me.\n"
"I can't just give it away.{page_break}"
"But perhaps you could\n"
"borrow it. Take it with\n"
"you on your quest.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09046"
msgstr "You got the Cloak Ball.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceIfYouUseTheCloakBall"
msgid "09047"
msgstr ""
"If you use the Cloak Ball\n"
"in the shadows, monsters\n"
"won't be able to see you.{page_break}"
"That's how I was able\n"
"to get through\n"
"Altmiller Cave.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceWhyWouldAnAdeptLikeYou"
msgid "09048"
msgstr ""
"Why would an Adept like\n"
"you need the Cloak Ball,\n"
"{actor_name:1}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceTheGirlFromLaliveroIsNo"
msgid "09049"
msgstr ""
"The girl from Lalivero\n"
"is no longer here.{page_break}"
"She has left for Lalivero\n"
"with the soldiers going\n"
"to Babi Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceIAmSurprisedActorWasAllowed"
msgid "09050"
msgstr ""
"I am surprised {actor_name:7} was\n"
"allowed to return to\n"
"Lalivero like that.{page_break}"
"At least she won't be\n"
"homesick any longer.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceItSeemedOnlyNaturalThatActor"
msgid "09051"
msgstr ""
"It seemed only natural\n"
"that {actor_name:7} should\n"
"return to Lalivero...{page_break}"
"But who ordered it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiPalaceIAmSoRelievedActorHas"
msgid "09052"
msgstr ""
"I am so relieved {actor_name:7}\n"
"has returned to her\n"
"hometown.{page_break}"
"But now that she's\n"
"gone, I find I miss\n"
"her a little.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiWellThisYearsColossoHasEnded"
msgid "09053"
msgstr ""
"Well, this year's Colosso\n"
"has ended.{page_break}"
"Be sure to come to Tolbi\n"
"again for next year's\n"
"festival, okay?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiItsBackToOurNormalQuiet"
msgid "09054"
msgstr ""
"It's back to our normal\n"
"quiet lives, now that\n"
"Colosso is over?{page_break}"
"Oh, man! I'm bored!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiFinalsWerent"
msgid "09055"
msgstr ""
"You were in the finals,\n"
"weren't you?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09056"
msgstr ""
"I was moved by how you\n"
"were so determined,\n"
"despite your size.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09057"
msgstr ""
"What? You weren't?\n"
"You know, you look just\n"
"like that warrior.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiWithAllThoseRevelersGoneThe"
msgid "09058"
msgstr ""
"With all those revelers\n"
"gone, the town sure feels\n"
"empty...{page_break}"
"The period right after\n"
"the festival is unbearably\n"
"lonesome, huh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiIHadNoLuckInThe"
msgid "09059"
msgstr ""
"I had no luck in\n"
"the Lucky Guess. Maybe\n"
"next year will go better.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiItsSoQuietTheHustleAnd"
msgid "09060"
msgstr ""
"It's so quiet! The hustle\n"
"and bustle of Colosso\n"
"seems like a dream!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiYayEasyRun"
msgid "09061"
msgstr ""
"Yay! It's really easy\n"
"to run with no one\n"
"around.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiHaHaHa"
msgid "09062"
msgstr ""
"Ha ha ha ha. This is\n"
"fun! My big brother is\n"
"being nice to me again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiIllBeBackToDoBusiness"
msgid "09063"
msgstr ""
"I'll be back to do\n"
"business in Tolbi\n"
"again next year.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiLeftovers"
msgid "09064"
msgstr ""
"Hey there, these are\n"
"leftovers, but have some!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09065"
msgstr "You got some corn.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiFestivalLongerUsual"
msgid "09066"
msgstr ""
"The festival was longer\n"
"than usual this year,\n"
"so I made more money.{page_break}"
"I hope it's long again\n"
"next year.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiTheSpectatorsHaveAllLeftSo"
msgid "09067"
msgstr ""
"The spectators have all\n"
"left, so we have to clean.\n"
"What a pain!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiThinkHowFunItWouldBe"
msgid "09068"
msgstr ""
"Think how fun it would\n"
"be to have Colosso all\n"
"year long!{page_break}"
"Whew! That would be\n"
"a lot of work for us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiAllTheWarriorsWhoGainFame"
msgid "09069"
msgstr ""
"All the warriors who\n"
"gain fame in the finals\n"
"become Babi's soldiers.{page_break}"
"That's why Babi's\n"
"soldiers are so\n"
"powerful.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiComeToThinkOfItNo"
msgid "09070"
msgstr ""
"Come to think of it,\n"
"no ships are sailing\n"
"in the Karagol, are they?{page_break}"
"How are all the tourists\n"
"going to get home?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiHmmSinceColossoEndedSoDramatically"
msgid "09071"
msgstr ""
"Hmm... Since Colosso\n"
"ended so dramatically, the\n"
"Lucky Guess goes to...{page_break}"
"Dang. Just a bit more\n"
"luck, and I could've been\n"
"a very wealthy man...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiTheCalmAfterTheStormIs"
msgid "09072"
msgstr ""
"The calm after the storm\n"
"is pretty nice too,\n"
"don't you think?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiMainStreetTolbi"
msgid "09073"
msgstr ""
"The main street in Tolbi\n"
"is so wide open!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiBrotherMeanDuring"
msgid "09074"
msgstr ""
"My brother was mean to\n"
"me during the festival.\n"
"He changed completely!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiEveryYearITryToSell"
msgid "09075"
msgstr ""
"Every year I try to sell\n"
"everything, but I always\n"
"have stuff left over.{page_break}"
"How am I supposed to\n"
"carry all this stuff\n"
"home?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiHowCanWeGetHomeIf"
msgid "09076"
msgstr ""
"How can we get home if\n"
"sea monsters are\n"
"blocking the crossing?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsNowThatColossoIsOverWeve"
msgid "09077"
msgstr ""
"Now that Colosso is over,\n"
"we've closed our\n"
"makeshift inn.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsWeHadALotOfGuests"
msgid "09078"
msgstr ""
"We had a lot of guests\n"
"again this year.{page_break}"
"Maybe we'll take a\n"
"trip with all the\n"
"money we made.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsSighMakingTheBedsHasWorn"
msgid "09079"
msgstr ""
"Sigh... Making the beds\n"
"has worn me out!{page_break}"
"I'm going to enjoy myself\n"
"for a while with\n"
"the money I made.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIdLoveAVacationButWhere"
msgid "09080"
msgstr ""
"I'd love a vacation,\n"
"but where should\n"
"we go?{page_break}"
"We can't get to Kalay,\n"
"and there's nothing\n"
"to see in Gondowan!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIRentedMyHouseToA"
msgid "09081"
msgstr ""
"I rented my house to a\n"
"rich family and tried\n"
"to head east...{page_break}"
"but Silk Road is blocked,\n"
"and nobody's taking people\n"
"across the Karagol!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsTheTouristsAreAllInA"
msgid "09082"
msgstr ""
"The tourists are all in\n"
"a fix, because the ships\n"
"aren't sailing.{page_break}"
"If we just had a few\n"
"Colosso warriors, we\n"
"could make it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsOnceTheShipsStartSailingAgain"
msgid "09083"
msgstr ""
"Once the ships start\n"
"sailing again, I think\n"
"we'll go to Kalay.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIHeardOfACaveThat"
msgid "09084"
msgstr ""
"I heard of a cave that\n"
"leads to the Karagol's\n"
"far shore somewhere.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIWasSoMovedByThis"
msgid "09085"
msgstr ""
"I was so moved by\n"
"this year's Colosso!{page_break}"
"I already can't wait for\n"
"next year's Colosso!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsThatLittleGuyJumpedStraightInto"
msgid "09086"
msgstr ""
"That little guy jumped\n"
"straight into battle with\n"
"those huge gladiators!{page_break}"
"It was amazing!\n"
"This was the best\n"
"Colosso ever!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsTheWarriorsWhoFoughtInThe"
msgid "09087"
msgstr ""
"The warriors who fought\n"
"in the finals were\n"
"incredible!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsDaringAndBraveryAreNiceAnd"
msgid "09088"
msgstr ""
"Daring and bravery are\n"
"nice and all{pause_20_skippable}, but I'll\n"
"leave it to the warriors.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsDidYouKnowMtAlephErupted"
msgid "09089"
msgstr ""
"Did you know Mt. Aleph\n"
"erupted? It wreaked\n"
"havoc across the land.{page_break}"
"Maybe that's why Colosso\n"
"had so few spectators\n"
"this year.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsMaybeAlephsEruptionCausedThoseSea"
msgid "09090"
msgstr ""
"Maybe Aleph's eruption\n"
"caused those sea monsters\n"
"to appear in the Karagol.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsTheSparklingStonesThatRainedFrom"
msgid "09091"
msgstr ""
"The sparkling stones that\n"
"rained from the sky...{page_break}"
"They couldn't have\n"
"been volcanic rock,\n"
"could they?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIllBetTheMonstersWereFrightened"
msgid "09092"
msgstr ""
"I'll bet the monsters were\n"
"frightened by the eruption\n"
"and went wild.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsTheWarriorsSaidTheyWouldRush"
msgid "09093"
msgstr ""
"The warriors said they\n"
"would rush to finish the\n"
"lighthouse after Colosso.{page_break}"
"I'd love to see it\n"
"once it's finished.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsThereWontBeManyCustomersUntil"
msgid "09094"
msgstr ""
"There won't be many\n"
"customers until next\n"
"year's festival,{page_break}"
"so I'll be traveling\n"
"around selling my wares\n"
"until then.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsItBothersMeABitThat"
msgid "09095"
msgstr ""
"It bothers me a bit\n"
"that they're building the\n"
"lighthouse in Gondowan.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsThereArentManyMerchantsAtThe"
msgid "09096"
msgstr ""
"There aren't many\n"
"merchants at the\n"
"lighthouse yet.{page_break}"
"I'm sure I can make a\n"
"tidy sum there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiComeWayKalay"
msgid "09097"
msgstr ""
"Did you come all the\n"
"way from Kalay?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09098"
msgstr ""
"It's too bad you can't\n"
"go back...{page_break}"
"Looks like you're stuck\n"
"until the road is\n"
"repaired.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09099"
msgstr ""
"The people visiting from\n"
"the east are all stuck at\n"
"Karagol Sea Port.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsEvenWithoutTheShipsICould"
msgid "09100"
msgstr ""
"Even without the ships,\n"
"I could still break even\n"
"if they just fix the road.{page_break}"
"I would give just\n"
"about anything for\n"
"that to happen!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiRightOneWell"
msgid "09101"
msgstr ""
"You're {actor_name:1}, right?\n"
"The one that did so well\n"
"in the finals!{page_break}"
"I'm amazed someone as\n"
"skinny as you could\n"
"do that well!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsDidAllTheWarriorsWhoFought"
msgid "09102"
msgstr ""
"Did all the warriors who\n"
"fought in the finals\n"
"become Babi's soldiers?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiWasntAbleWatch"
msgid "09103"
msgstr ""
"I wasn't able to watch\n"
"the finals this year!{page_break}"
"My mother says that\n"
"a new warrior named\n"
"{actor_name:1} did really well.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsImGonnaWatchTheFinalsNext"
msgid "09104"
msgstr ""
"I'm gonna watch the\n"
"finals next year\n"
"for sure!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIThoughtWedHaveSomeFree"
msgid "09105"
msgstr ""
"I thought we'd have some\n"
"free time once Colosso\n"
"ended, but no!{page_break}"
"The spectators from Kalay\n"
"are back because they\n"
"can't get back home.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsTheSpectatorsFromTheEastCant"
msgid "09106"
msgstr ""
"The spectators from the\n"
"east can't go back home...\n"
"It's just awful.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsItsBusyAllDayEveryDay"
msgid "09107"
msgstr ""
"It's busy all day,\n"
"every day! I'm so busy\n"
"my head is spinning!{page_break}"
"Sheesh! I thought\n"
"we'd get to take it\n"
"easy after Colosso!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiHeyWhatsThis"
msgid "09108"
msgstr "Hey, what's this?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09109"
msgstr "Uh-oh.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09110"
msgstr "I didn't find anything!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09111"
msgstr ""
"I was just doing some\n"
"work I...had to do.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09112"
msgstr ""
"It's rude to startle\n"
"people!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiHeeHeeLook"
msgid "09113"
msgstr ""
"Hee hee! Do I look like\n"
"I'm that excited?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09114"
msgstr ""
"I see. That must be\n"
"because the weather\n"
"is nice.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09115"
msgstr ""
"Yeah! I'm the same\n"
"as always.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiHello"
msgid "09116"
msgstr "Oh... Hello!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiHoHumFine"
msgid "09117"
msgstr ""
"Ho hum. I'm fine.\n"
"It's nothing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiLookLikeWarrior"
msgid "09118"
msgstr ""
"You look like a warrior,\n"
"but you were watching\n"
"Colosso, right?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09119"
msgstr ""
"Tsk! Just watching\n"
"doesn't make you any\n"
"better than the next guy!{page_break}"
"If you're a warrior,\n"
"you ought to fight\n"
"next time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09120"
msgstr ""
"Oh? Didn't even watch?{page_break}"
"What are you, crazy?\n"
"Colosso is the best\n"
"thing ever!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiGrrrChefInBadMood"
msgid "09121"
msgstr ""
"Grrr! The chef is in a\n"
"bad mood because he\n"
"didn't get to see Colosso!{page_break}"
"Taking that out on\n"
"us isn't very mature!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIWentToThePortBut"
msgid "09122"
msgstr ""
"I went to the port, but\n"
"they said the ships aren't\n"
"sailing, so I came back.{page_break}"
"We made it to Tolbi\n"
"with your help. Maybe\n"
"we could make it back...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsColossoHasEndedButWeStill"
msgid "09123"
msgstr ""
"Colosso has ended, but\n"
"we still can't get\n"
"across the Karagol.{page_break}"
"Maybe they'll row us\n"
"home if we agree\n"
"to help out again...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiHeWontSailShipEven"
msgid "09124"
msgstr ""
"He won't sail the ship,\n"
"even though we agreed\n"
"to do whatever it takes?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09125"
msgstr ""
"Co{pause_20_skippable}-Correct. The ships\n"
"cannot go out for\n"
"any reason.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09126"
msgstr ""
"What kind of person\n"
"would refuse such an\n"
"offer?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09127"
msgstr ""
"You tell the captain\n"
"again that he needs to\n"
"set sail tomorrow.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiGrrrScamWhyWontThey"
msgid "09128"
msgstr ""
"Grrr! What a scam! Why\n"
"won't they let the ships\n"
"sail out after Colosso!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsOnceThisGuyGetsMadTheres"
msgid "09129"
msgstr ""
"Once this guy gets\n"
"mad, there's no\n"
"controlling him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIWonderIfThisReallyIs"
msgid "09130"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if this\n"
"really is the best\n"
"room in the place.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsTolbiGetsSoBoringOnceThe"
msgid "09131"
msgstr ""
"Tolbi gets so boring\n"
"once the festival ends!\n"
"I wanna go home!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiWarriorRemember"
msgid "09132"
msgstr ""
"Hey! You're the would-be\n"
"warrior! Do you\n"
"remember me?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09133"
msgstr ""
"You do? Wow! That's\n"
"great!{page_break}"
"Neither of us can get\n"
"back to Kalay... We're\n"
"stuck, aren't we!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09134"
msgstr ""
"It's me! We rode the\n"
"same ship from Kalay!\n"
"I guess you forgot.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIGotToSeeColossoSo"
msgid "09135"
msgstr ""
"I got to see Colosso, so\n"
"I don't care if I can't\n"
"get across the Karagol.{page_break}"
"Those warriors who\n"
"fought in Colosso were\n"
"incredibly built.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsSinceTheShipsArentSailingThe"
msgid "09136"
msgstr ""
"Since the ships aren't\n"
"sailing, the port is\n"
"full of stranded tourists.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsHeeHeeItsGreatTheInns"
msgid "09137"
msgstr ""
"Hee hee. It's great! The\n"
"inns are still full\n"
"even after Colosso.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsEveryoneIsWorkingOnBabiLighthouse"
msgid "09138"
msgstr ""
"Everyone is working on\n"
"Babi Lighthouse, so\n"
"there's no one to rebuild{page_break}"
"the road! Looks like the\n"
"inns will be full for\n"
"quite a while!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiHehHehSheJustHid"
msgid "09139"
msgstr ""
"Heh heh! She just hid\n"
"that thing she found\n"
"behind that trash pile.{page_break}"
"Nobody will ever know\n"
"it's there...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiThingFoundDefinitelySameAs"
msgid "09140"
msgstr ""
"That thing I found is\n"
"definitely the same as the\n"
"one that man showed me.{page_break}"
"But he wouldn't{pause_20_skippable} ask me\n"
"to return it, would he?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsGrrrIDidntGetToSee"
msgid "09141"
msgstr ""
"Grrr! I didn't get to\n"
"see any of Colosso!{page_break}"
"Sigh. I'm trying not to\n"
"think about it, but...I get\n"
"so mad, it makes me sick.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsHeyChefSoWhatIfYou"
msgid "09142"
msgstr ""
"Hey, Chef! So what if\n"
"you missed it again?\n"
"Grow up, you big baby!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsITriedGoingToTheEastern"
msgid "09143"
msgstr ""
"I tried going to the\n"
"eastern cave, but it's\n"
"impossible to get through.{page_break}"
"It was just like the\n"
"guards at the gate\n"
"told us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsYoudThinkYouCouldGetThrough"
msgid "09144"
msgstr ""
"You'd think you could\n"
"get through the cave east\n"
"of Gondowan Passage...{page_break}"
"but you can't. Not unless\n"
"you can lift boulders,\n"
"at any rate.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsYoureSayingIfWeRowWe"
msgid "09145"
msgstr ""
"You're saying if we row,\n"
"we can set sail? If that's\n"
"a joke, it's not funny.{page_break}"
"Making passengers row\n"
"their own cruise ship is\n"
"unprecedented!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsTheCrewIsSayingThatIf"
msgid "09146"
msgstr ""
"The crew is saying that\n"
"if we all row, the ship\n"
"can depart.{page_break}"
"My husband's pretty\n"
"mad about it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsImSickOfStayingAtThis"
msgid "09147"
msgstr ""
"I'm sick of staying at\n"
"this miserable inn!{page_break}"
"I'm willing to pay\n"
"extra if I can stay\n"
"at Babi Palace!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsIfMomHadJustBoughtMe"
msgid "09148"
msgstr ""
"If Mom had just bought\n"
"me some souvenirs, this\n"
"would be more fun.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsThatVoyageAcrossTheSeaWas"
msgid "09149"
msgstr ""
"That voyage across the\n"
"sea was frightful!\n"
"I've learned my lesson.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsNoMatterWhatHappensImComing"
msgid "09150"
msgstr ""
"No matter what happens,\n"
"I'm coming to see Colosso\n"
"next year for sure!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiShipsArentGoing"
msgid "09151"
msgstr ""
"If the ships aren't going,\n"
"why not forget heading\n"
"east and enjoy Tolbi?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTolbiInteriorsYouAllGotToSeeColosso"
msgid "09152"
msgstr ""
"You all got to see\n"
"Colosso, so quit griping!{page_break}"
"I wanted to go, too,\n"
"but I missed the\n"
"whole blasted thing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceColossoIsOverAndTheColosseum"
msgid "09153"
msgstr ""
"Colosso is over and the\n"
"colosseum will be\n"
"closed until next year.{page_break}"
"Since you've come all\n"
"this way, take a long look\n"
"at the beautiful gates!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09154"
msgstr ""
"Did you come to get\n"
"your Lucky Guess prize\n"
"money?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09155"
msgstr ""
"I'm pretty sure that\n"
"{argument_actor_name:1}, the guy\n"
"you bet on, won!{page_break}"
"Here are your winnings.\n"
"Please take them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09156"
msgstr ""
"It takes a great deal of\n"
"luck to win at\n"
"Lucky Guess!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09157"
msgstr ""
"Really? But we already\n"
"paid out all the prize\n"
"money to the winners.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09158"
msgstr "You got {argument_signed_number} coin{plural_suffix}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09159"
msgstr ""
"You didn't? Well, the\n"
"colosseum is closed\n"
"until next year.{page_break}"
"If you want to look\n"
"inside, you'll have\n"
"to wait until then.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceTheColosseumIsClosedUntilNext"
msgid "09160"
msgstr ""
"The colosseum is closed\n"
"until next year.{page_break}"
"If you want to look\n"
"inside, you'll have to\n"
"come back then.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceWhenTheColosseumGatesFinallyShut"
msgid "09161"
msgstr ""
"When the colosseum gates\n"
"finally shut, that truly\n"
"marks the end of Colosso.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09162"
msgstr ""
"I'm waiting here 'cause\n"
"he told me to give him\n"
"his Lucky Guess winnings,{page_break}"
"but that warrior still\n"
"hasn't shown up.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgColosseumEntranceTheFightingAtThisYearsColosso"
msgid "09163"
msgstr ""
"The fighting at this\n"
"year's Colosso was\n"
"incredible!{page_break}"
"Standing in front of\n"
"this lonely gate makes\n"
"me kind of sad.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKaragolDoYouWishCrossInto"
msgid "09164"
msgstr ""
"Do you wish to cross\n"
"into Gondowan?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgDebugWontStopYou"
msgid "09165"
msgstr ""
"I won't stop you, but\n"
"I wouldn't go unless\n"
"I had business there.{page_break}"
"I'd go to Tolbi and watch\n"
"Colosso. That's what\n"
"I'd do.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09166"
msgstr ""
"That's a good idea. They\n"
"wouldn't let you into\n"
"Babi Lighthouse, anyway.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgGondowanCaveUsWereTheSoldiersWhoGuard"
msgid "09167"
msgstr ""
"Us? We're the soldiers\n"
"who guard the bridge\n"
"to Gondowan.{page_break}"
"It's not like anyone's\n"
"ever going to attack\n"
"this bridge, though,{page_break}"
"so there's not\n"
"much sense in\n"
"guarding it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgGondowanCaveEvenIfYouHeadEastYou"
msgid "09168"
msgstr ""
"Even if you head east,\n"
"you can't get to Kalay\n"
"from here, even!{page_break}"
"A few reckless warriors\n"
"have tried, but none have\n"
"ever returned!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgGondowanCaveThoseWhoGoToGondowanRarely"
msgid "09169"
msgstr ""
"Those who go to Gondowan\n"
"rarely go knowing what\n"
"it will be like.{page_break}"
"I wouldn't even\n"
"think of going there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKaragolWarriorsHaveBeenFightingWhile"
msgid "09170"
msgstr ""
"The warriors have been\n"
"fighting while we've\n"
"been guarding this{page_break}"
"bridge. Being on duty\n"
"at a time like this is\n"
"plain old bad luck!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgGondowanCaveYoudThinkYouCouldGetThrough"
msgid "09171"
msgstr ""
"You'd think you could\n"
"get through the cave\n"
"to the east...{page_break}"
"But it's absolutely\n"
"impossible to get\n"
"through that cave.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09172"
msgstr ""
"I won't stop you, but\n"
"I wouldn't go unless\n"
"I had business there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKaragolWeMissedColossoBecauseWe"
msgid "09173"
msgstr ""
"We missed all of Colosso\n"
"because we were stuck\n"
"guarding this bridge.{page_break}"
"Sheesh... Talk about\n"
"unlucky!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgGondowanCaveWhyWouldIodemChooseToWait"
msgid "09174"
msgstr ""
"Why would Iodem choose\n"
"to wait for us in a\n"
"place like this?{page_break}"
"I get nervous when\n"
"I feel like I'm\n"
"being watched.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgGondowanCaveWeHaventSeenAnybodyUnusualCrossing"
msgid "09175"
msgstr ""
"We haven't seen anybody\n"
"unusual crossing the\n"
"bridge today.{page_break}"
"Come to think of it,\n"
"there was a group of six\n"
"strange-looking folk...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgGondowanCaveEvenIfYouGoEastFrom"
msgid "09176"
msgstr ""
"Even if you go east\n"
"from here, you won't\n"
"end up in Kalay!{page_break}"
"A few reckless warriors\n"
"have tried, but none{page_break}"
"ever came back!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKaragolIveBeenWaitingForIsaac"
msgid "09177"
msgstr ""
"I've been waiting for you,\n"
"{actor_name:1}! We should go to\n"
"Babi Lighthouse soon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKaragolWhyGoingBackIsaacDo"
msgid "09178"
msgstr ""
"Why are you going back,\n"
"{actor_name:1}?{page_break}"
"Do you need to get\n"
"something you left\n"
"behind?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09179"
msgstr ""
"I see... In that case,\n"
"I shall wait here for\n"
"you to return.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09180"
msgstr ""
"Then we should continue\n"
"on our way to the\n"
"lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgGondowanCaveIodemIsGoingToBabiLighthouse"
msgid "09181"
msgstr ""
"Iodem is going to Babi\n"
"Lighthouse? It must be\n"
"very near completion.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgGondowanCaveItsALotOfStressBut"
msgid "09182"
msgstr ""
"It's a lot of stress, but\n"
"I'm a diligent worker, so\n"
"I can handle it.{page_break}"
"Just act natural and\n"
"ignore Iodem... There's\n"
"nothing to worry about.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgGondowanCaveEveryoneComesDownThisWayWhen"
msgid "09183"
msgstr ""
"Everyone comes down this\n"
"way when they find they\n"
"can't cross the Karagol.{page_break}"
"They all have to try the\n"
"cave themselves, despite\n"
"what I tell them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgGondowanCaveWeHaveToHeadForThe"
msgid "09184"
msgstr ""
"We have to head for the\n"
"lighthouse quickly so we\n"
"can save Babi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksThereAreManyHereWhoWant"
msgid "09185"
msgstr ""
"There are many here who\n"
"want to return to Kalay\n"
"since Colosso is over.{page_break}"
"But the ships won't\n"
"sail without the captain's\n"
"order.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksHangingAroundHereLikeThisAnd"
msgid "09186"
msgstr ""
"Hanging around here like\n"
"this and staring out at\n"
"the sea is boring!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksIfBothTheCaptainAndKaja"
msgid "09187"
msgstr ""
"If both the captain and\n"
"Kaja say the ship's not\n"
"sailing, it's not.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksIfKajaAndTheOthersSay"
msgid "09188"
msgstr ""
"If Kaja and the others\n"
"say it's okay, I'd like to\n"
"head out to sea again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksImStuckIWantToCross"
msgid "09189"
msgstr ""
"I'm stuck... I want to\n"
"cross the Karagol, but\n"
"the ships won't set sail.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksYeahTheShipsNotGoingAnywhere"
msgid "09190"
msgstr ""
"Yeah...the ship's not\n"
"going anywhere for\n"
"now.{page_break}"
"Some rich guy was here\n"
"throwing money around,\n"
"but they still said no.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksTheKaragolSeaLooksSoCalm"
msgid "09191"
msgstr ""
"The Karagol Sea looks so\n"
"calm from here. How can\n"
"it be dangerous?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksWeveGotPassengersButNobodysSailing"
msgid "09192"
msgstr ""
"We've got passengers, but\n"
"nobody's sailing. How can\n"
"we sell any tickets?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksTheCaptainMustBeAStubborn"
msgid "09193"
msgstr ""
"The captain must be a\n"
"stubborn man. With so\n"
"much money to be made,{page_break}"
"I can't believe he won't\n"
"sail... Who cares how\n"
"dangerous it is?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksTheMarineBlueKaragolSeaIs"
msgid "09194"
msgstr ""
"The marine-blue Karagol\n"
"Sea is such a romantic\n"
"sight to behold!{page_break}"
"It really takes me back,\n"
"and I get all sentimental.\n"
"{text_effect:4}Sniff...{reset_text_style}{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayReturnedTicketCost"
msgid "09195"
msgstr ""
"I returned the cost of\n"
"your ticket to you.\n"
"Let's leave it at that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09196"
msgstr ""
"Why should I, when all\n"
"you did was give me\n"
"what's mine!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09197"
msgstr ""
"Isn't the tour group\n"
"responsible for getting\n"
"us back to Kalay?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09198"
msgstr ""
"With the road blocked and\n"
"the ships stuck here, we\n"
"have no way to get home.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09199"
msgstr ""
"You brought us all here!\n"
"Take responsibility for\n"
"it! Responsibility!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09200"
msgstr ""
"Must you really resort\n"
"to violence?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09201"
msgstr "What are you{em_dash}{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09202"
msgstr ""
"I was hired for just\n"
"this sort of thing...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09203"
msgstr ""
"You mean, you hired\n"
"{pause_20_skippable}a bodyguard?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09204"
msgstr ""
"Yeah! Because of rabble-\n"
"rousing customers like\n"
"you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09205"
msgstr ""
"We've asked this nice man\n"
"to act as a guard...for\n"
"everyone's safety.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09206"
msgstr ""
"What are you talking\n"
"about?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09207"
msgstr ""
"I wouldn't go any\n"
"farther than that if I\n"
"were you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09208"
msgstr "Ge{pause_20_skippable}-Get outta my way!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09209"
msgstr ""
"Sorry, but I was hired\n"
"to BE in your way!\n"
"Please. Let it go...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09210"
msgstr "This is ridiculous!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09211"
msgstr ""
"I know... And after I\n"
"asked him so nicely...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09212"
msgstr ""
"You're wasting time on\n"
"this!? Why don't you find\n"
"a way to get us home?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksTourGroupsShouldTakeCareOf"
msgid "09213"
msgstr ""
"Tour groups should take\n"
"care of you from start\n"
"to finish, but...{page_break}"
"it's not our fault the\n"
"ship won't sail, so we\n"
"can't offer any refunds.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksToHeckWithYouImStaying"
msgid "09214"
msgstr ""
"To heck with you! I'm\n"
"staying right here until\n"
"the ship leaves!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksSighIWonderWhenWellBe"
msgid "09215"
msgstr ""
"Sigh. I wonder when\n"
"we'll be able to\n"
"return to Kalay.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksWellBeCountingOnYouIf"
msgid "09216"
msgstr ""
"We'll be counting on you\n"
"if something comes up\n"
"again, Master.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksAsLongAsWereStuckHere"
msgid "09217"
msgstr ""
"As long as we're stuck\n"
"here, I might as well make\n"
"some cash as a bodyguard.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksSighIfIKnewItWould"
msgid "09218"
msgstr ""
"Sigh. If I knew it would\n"
"turn out like this, we\n"
"wouldn't have come.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksIfTheydJustLetTheShip"
msgid "09219"
msgstr ""
"If they'd just let the ship\n"
"sail, the passengers\n"
"would stop complaining.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksIfImGoingToBeStuck"
msgid "09220"
msgstr ""
"If I'm going to be stuck\n"
"here, I should find work\n"
"and make some money.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksGrrrWhyDontYouGetUp"
msgid "09221"
msgstr ""
"Grrr! Why don't you get\n"
"up off your back and do\n"
"something!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksAsLongAsYoureHereWe"
msgid "09222"
msgstr ""
"As long as you're here,\n"
"we can stay without being\n"
"yelled at!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksThisTourWasntWellOrganizedThats"
msgid "09223"
msgstr ""
"This tour wasn't well\n"
"organized. That's why I\n"
"have to provide security.{page_break}"
"I have conflicting\n"
"feelings about protecting\n"
"them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTolbiDocksIWonderIfGrandmaIsDoing"
msgid "09224"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if Grandma is\n"
"doing okay now...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaGuardsCatchParty"
msgid "09225"
msgstr "Hey, hey! Who are you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09226"
msgstr ""
"That's strange. I've been\n"
"on watch this whole time,\n"
"so how did you get here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09227"
msgstr ""
"Regardless, no one\n"
"is allowed in!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09228"
msgstr ""
"That's right. No one is\n"
"allowed in! Off with you\n"
"now! Off, I say!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaWho2"
msgid "09229"
msgstr "Who are you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09230"
msgstr "How did you get in here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09231"
msgstr ""
"No matter! You're on\n"
"your way out now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaGuardForbidsReturn"
msgid "09232"
msgstr "And don't come back!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaLeftGuardHearsSomeone"
msgid "09233"
msgstr ""
"Huh? I could swear I\n"
"just heard someone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaRightGuardFeelsCreepy"
msgid "09234"
msgstr ""
"You're crazy! Still, this\n"
"place {text_effect:2}is{reset_text_style} kind of creepy.\n"
"I never did like it here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09235"
msgstr ""
"Ain't nobody gettin' in!{page_break}"
"I don't even know why\n"
"we have to stay on guard\n"
"all the time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaHammetGreatMerchant"
msgid "09236"
msgstr ""
"Hammet, the great\n"
"merchant of Kalay, is our\n"
"best source of income.{page_break}"
"I will keep you safe\n"
"no matter what happens.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaZZZ"
msgid "09237"
msgstr ""
"Z-z-z-z Z-z-z-z-z...\n"
"It's so warm today! My\n"
"eyes are getting heavy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaDodonpasOrdersAbsolute"
msgid "09238"
msgstr ""
"Dodonpa's orders are\n"
"absolute!{page_break}"
"No one will ever get\n"
"by me and into the\n"
"fortress!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaSighBadCouldnt"
msgid "09239"
msgstr ""
"Sigh. It's too bad I\n"
"couldn't go to Tolbi\n"
"this year.{page_break}"
"I wonder how Colosso\n"
"turned out.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaStrangeSwearSomeone"
msgid "09240"
msgstr ""
"That's strange!? I could\n"
"swear there's someone\n"
"right nearby...!{page_break}"
"Maybe it's just\n"
"'cause I'm so tired.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaTakeCareAnybody"
msgid "09241"
msgstr ""
"I'll take care of\n"
"anybody that might\n"
"show up!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaToldStandGuard"
msgid "09242"
msgstr ""
"I was told to stand\n"
"guard, so I am{pause_20_skippable}, but I'm\n"
"actually a coward!{page_break}"
"I'm serious! I just\n"
"hope no one shows\n"
"up on my watch.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaWhoDisruptingSleep"
msgid "09243"
msgstr ""
"Who is disrupting\n"
"my sleep???{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09244"
msgstr ""
"Who is disrupting\n"
"my sleep???{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09245"
msgstr ""
"Who is disrupting\n"
"my sleep???{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaIntruder"
msgid "09246"
msgstr "Hey! Intruder!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09247"
msgstr ""
"You think you're\n"
"going any farther?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09248"
msgstr ""
"Sorry, but you're gonna\n"
"have to fight your\n"
"way through.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaGuardWhosThat"
msgid "09249"
msgstr "Huh? Who's that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09250"
msgstr ""
"You're pretty bold to\n"
"come charging into\n"
"a den of thieves.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09251"
msgstr ""
"But your luck ran out\n"
"when you ran into me!\n"
"Show me your stuff!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaShiftAlready"
msgid "09252"
msgstr ""
"Is my shift up\n"
"already?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09253"
msgstr ""
"...Wait a minute!\n"
"Who are you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09254"
msgstr ""
"I've never seen you\n"
"before! Intruder!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09255"
msgstr ""
"Come on! You'll have\n"
"to deal with me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaScoundrel"
msgid "09256"
msgstr "You scoundrel!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09257"
msgstr ""
"Dodonpa always said you'd\n"
"come, and here you are!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09258"
msgstr ""
"If I stop you here,\n"
"Dodonpa will finally\n"
"reward me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09259"
msgstr ""
"What a stroke of luck!\n"
"My time has finally come!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaDonpaExhausted"
msgid "09260"
msgstr ""
"Poor, poor Donpa.\n"
"Dodonpa's behavior is\n"
"driving him into despair.{page_break}"
"Donpa can't last much\n"
"longer like this...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaWomenWantHome"
msgid "09261"
msgstr ""
"Nearly all of these women\n"
"were brought here\n"
"against their will, like me.{page_break}"
"Sigh. I want to go back\n"
"to my hometown just\n"
"one more time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaWhWhWho"
msgid "09262"
msgstr "Wh{pause_20_skippable}-Wh{pause_20_skippable}-Who goes there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09263"
msgstr "Wh{pause_20_skippable}-Who are you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaDontLookNearly"
msgid "09264"
msgstr ""
"You don't look nearly\n"
"as mean as the thieves\n"
"in the fortress.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09265"
msgstr ""
"Did you sneak into Lunpa\n"
"Fortress in search of\n"
"something?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09266"
msgstr ""
"The great merchant\n"
"Hammet? I'd tell you\n"
"if I knew, but I don't.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09267"
msgstr ""
"Who would sneak into\n"
"such a dangerous\n"
"place just for fun?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaWontTellAnyone"
msgid "09268"
msgstr ""
"I won't tell anyone, but\n"
"you should leave before\n"
"the guards find you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaMaybeMerchantReason"
msgid "09269"
msgstr ""
"Maybe that merchant is\n"
"the reason they've closed\n"
"off the lower caves...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaFearWithoutDonpa"
msgid "09270"
msgstr ""
"If Donpa dies, Dodonpa\n"
"will be even more...{page_break}"
"I get scared just\n"
"thinking about it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaHopeDonpaRecovers"
msgid "09271"
msgstr ""
"I know Donpa would let\n"
"us go if he were well...{page_break}"
"I hope he gets\n"
"better soon!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaWho3"
msgid "09272"
msgstr "Who are you!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09273"
msgstr ""
"Could this be the guy\n"
"who's come to get\n"
"Hammet back?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09274"
msgstr "Yeah! I bet he is!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09275"
msgstr "What a bold rascal!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09276"
msgstr ""
"Dodonpa will be livid\n"
"if we lose Hammet!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09277"
msgstr ""
"We're really going to be\n"
"in for it if we let\n"
"these kids get away.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09278"
msgstr ""
"You're not going any\n"
"farther! Not without some\n"
"serious bruises, anyway!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaGuysTougherThought"
msgid "09279"
msgstr ""
"You guys are tougher than\n"
"we thought{em_dash}we'll let\n"
"you go this time.{page_break}"
"Get outta here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaRightRightGive"
msgid "09280"
msgstr ""
"All right, all right.\n"
"We give up! If you're\n"
"here for Hammet,{page_break}"
"he's down in the\n"
"cave! Go get\n"
"him already!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaOwwwDontHurt"
msgid "09281"
msgstr ""
"Owww! Hey! Don't hurt\n"
"me again, you\n"
"thieving scoundrel!{page_break}"
"I hate your guts. Go down\n"
"to the cave and save\n"
"your precious Hammet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaShouldNotHaveFought"
msgid "09282"
msgstr ""
"Who'd have thought they'd\n"
"be so tough? We never\n"
"shoulda fought 'em.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaHammetInCave"
msgid "09283"
msgstr ""
"Hammet's down in that\n"
"treacherous cave.{page_break}"
"They won't be able\n"
"to save him, though...\n"
"They'll see.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaHiddenDoorSwitch"
msgid "09284"
msgstr ""
"At least those punks\n"
"won't find the switch\n"
"that opens the door.{page_break}"
"Heh heh! It's hidden too\n"
"well in the wall!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaDonpaResting"
msgid "09285"
msgstr ""
"Donpa is supposed to be\n"
"old. I wonder what he's\n"
"fighting with in the{page_break}"
"fortress.{page_break}"
"That's why he's been in\n"
"poor form and spends his\n"
"time resting. What are{page_break}"
"you going to do?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaWhereIsDodonpa"
msgid "09286"
msgstr ""
"Where could Dodonpa be?\n"
"He's not in his room,\n"
"but he couldn't have left.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaHammetBuysDrink"
msgid "09287"
msgstr ""
"Whee! Thanks to Hammet\n"
"we can enjoy food\n"
"and drink all day long!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaHammetMoneyTree"
msgid "09288"
msgstr ""
"With Hammet here, we can\n"
"milk as much money as\n"
"we want out of Kalay.{page_break}"
"He's a money tree for\n"
"us, hic!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaWhoFoughtDonpa"
msgid "09289"
msgstr ""
"Is there anyone in the\n"
"fortress who can face\n"
"Donpa in battle?{page_break}"
"No one is allowed into\n"
"the cave to find out.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaWifeSeeksDodonpa"
msgid "09290"
msgstr ""
"Dodonpa's wife was\n"
"looking for him, but she\n"
"can't find him anywhere.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaKalayBuysDrink"
msgid "09291"
msgstr ""
"We can eat all we like!\n"
"It was all bought with\n"
"the money from Kalay!{page_break}"
"I love gorging myself\n"
"for free!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaHammetKeepsEarnings"
msgid "09292"
msgstr ""
"As long as we have\n"
"Hammet, all of Kalay's\n"
"earnings will be ours.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaZZZZ"
msgid "09293"
msgstr "Z-z-z-z... Z-z-z-z...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaFatherSorryDodonpa"
msgid "09294"
msgstr ""
"Father...I'm so sorry\n"
"about Dodonpa.{page_break}"
"Someone will teach\n"
"him a lesson someday.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaShhhPleaseDont"
msgid "09295"
msgstr ""
"Shhh! Please don't\n"
"wake Donpa!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09296"
msgstr ""
"He's been driven to\n"
"despair after battling\n"
"a terrible foe.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09297"
msgstr ""
"It is all because\n"
"of that Dodonpa!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09298"
msgstr ""
"Are you the one{pause_20_skippable} who\n"
"Donpa said would come\n"
"to punish Dodonpa?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09299"
msgstr ""
"Donpa has waited a\n"
"very long time for you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09300"
msgstr ""
"Oh, you're not? Well...can\n"
"you do it anyway?\n"
"Someone has to do it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaDonpaKnowsCoddled"
msgid "09301"
msgstr ""
"Donpa knows that he\n"
"coddled Dodonpa too\n"
"much as a child.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09302"
msgstr ""
"It pains him so much.\n"
"He can't die with things\n"
"the way they are.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaMaybeDodonpasEyes"
msgid "09303"
msgstr ""
"Maybe if Dodonpa's eyes\n"
"are opened, Lunpa will\n"
"be a good place again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaSomeonePunishDodonpa"
msgid "09304"
msgstr ""
"If someone would punish\n"
"Dodonpa, I'm sure Donpa\n"
"would offer a reward.{page_break}"
"He might even give\n"
"that person Dodonpa's\n"
"ill-gotten goods.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaKnowWhereDodonpa"
msgid "09305"
msgstr ""
"Do you know where\n"
"Dodonpa is?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09306"
msgstr ""
"Really? That's fine,\n"
"as long as he's in the\n"
"fortress.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09307"
msgstr ""
"Sigh. Don't tell me he's\n"
"gone off, trying to\n"
"relive his youth again...{page_break}"
"I take my eyes off him\n"
"for a minute, and he's off\n"
"chasing a new sweetheart.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaChildMustGrowUp"
msgid "09308"
msgstr ""
"Papa misbehaves and\n"
"makes Mama worry.{page_break}"
"I have to be good\n"
"so Mama won't have\n"
"to worry so much.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaPapaWatchesLadies"
msgid "09309"
msgstr ""
"Papa always gets friendly\n"
"with the ladies when\n"
"Mama's not lookin'.{page_break}"
"That's why Mama always\n"
"keeps a sharp eye on\n"
"Papa.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaChildTooResponsible"
msgid "09310"
msgstr ""
"Dodonpa's child is so well\n"
"behaved, I can't believe\n"
"he's his father's son!{page_break}"
"It's a pity that child\n"
"can't have an\n"
"innocent childhood.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaDonpappaSuccessor"
msgid "09311"
msgstr ""
"We've already decided\n"
"that Donpappa will be\n"
"Dodonpa's successor!{page_break}"
"At least that tradition\n"
"won't change!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaDonpappaProtectsFortress"
msgid "09312"
msgstr ""
"When my Papa's gone, I,\n"
"Donpappa, shall protect\n"
"Lunpa myself.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaDaughterWillNotMarryPapa"
msgid "09313"
msgstr ""
"I'm not going to marry\n"
"anyone like my Papa\n"
"when I grow up!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaDonpappaJudges"
msgid "09314"
msgstr ""
"Being watched by Donpappa\n"
"makes me feel like I'm\n"
"being judged.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09315"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1} pulled the\n"
"switch.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaTimeEat"
msgid "09316"
msgstr "Is it time to eat?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09317"
msgstr "...Who are you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09318"
msgstr "Hammet...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09319"
msgstr "{actor_name:3}, is that you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09320"
msgstr ""
"These people... Are\n"
"they friends of yours?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09321"
msgstr ""
"Then it would appear your\n"
"journey has begun,\n"
"{actor_name:3}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09322"
msgstr ""
"I am a little late,\n"
"but I have come to\n"
"save you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09323"
msgstr ""
"You shouldn't have risked\n"
"yourself, {actor_name:3}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09324"
msgstr "Hold it right there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09325"
msgstr "Dodonpa!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09326"
msgstr ""
"Sorry to interrupt your\n"
"teary little reunion,\n"
"Hammet!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09327"
msgstr ""
"This must be your little\n"
"rat, {actor_name:3}{em_dash}you always did\n"
"claim he'd rescue you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09328"
msgstr ""
"Look at him.\n"
"He's just a child!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09329"
msgstr ""
"But to think these kids\n"
"could get this far!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09330"
msgstr ""
"Hey, yeah! If we're just\n"
"kids, what does that\n"
"make your pathetic thugs?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09331"
msgstr ""
"What kind of scum takes\n"
"ransom money and then\n"
"doesn't free his hostage?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09332"
msgstr ""
"I see. So, you've been\n"
"extorting money from\n"
"Layana, have you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09333"
msgstr ""
"Now that we've found\n"
"Hammet, we'll be taking\n"
"him home!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09334"
msgstr ""
"I'm afraid I can't let\n"
"you do that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09335"
msgstr ""
"Hammet is what I like to\n"
"call my little money\n"
"tree.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09336"
msgstr "You dirty scoundrel!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09337"
msgstr ""
"Name-calling won't help\n"
"you! I'm not giving\n"
"Hammet up!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09338"
msgstr "Dodonpa pulled a lever.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09339"
msgstr ""
"This little trap here\n"
"marks the end of your\n"
"good fortune!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaPrepareBecomeMonster"
msgid "09340"
msgstr ""
"Prepare to become\n"
"monster fodder!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaBackMoreGuess"
msgid "09341"
msgstr ""
"Back for more? I guess\n"
"you didn't learn your\n"
"lesson!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaDodonpaPulledLever"
msgid "09342"
msgstr "Dodonpa pulled a lever.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09343"
msgstr ""
"Go ahead-keep trying!\n"
"You'll never win!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09344"
msgstr ""
"Prepare to become\n"
"monster fodder!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaUhnnGetOff"
msgid "09345"
msgstr "Uhnn! Get it off me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09346"
msgstr ""
"How did Dodonpa get\n"
"trapped under the\n"
"monster?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09347"
msgstr ""
"He tried to pull\n"
"another dirty trick\n"
"on you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09348"
msgstr ""
"When Dodonpa saw his\n"
"monster was losing, he\n"
"tried to get behind you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09349"
msgstr ""
"Just a second longer, and\n"
"you'd have been history!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09350"
msgstr "You dirty snake!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09351"
msgstr ""
"Dodonpa, you are\n"
"rotten to the core!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09352"
msgstr ""
"Yeah, OK! I'm {text_effect:2}sorry{reset_text_style}!\n"
"Now, get this thing\n"
"off of me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09353"
msgstr ""
"\"Get this thing\n"
"off of me\"!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09354"
msgstr ""
"I don't know. That thing\n"
"looks awfully heavy\n"
"for us kids to lift.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09355"
msgstr ""
"What should we do,\n"
"{actor_name:1}? Should we try\n"
"to move it?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09356"
msgstr ""
"I agree.{page_break}"
"What do you think,\n"
"Hammet?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09357"
msgstr ""
"I think we have to\n"
"try, at least.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaAbleGet"
msgid "09358"
msgstr ""
"There. You should be\n"
"able to get up now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09359"
msgstr "I... I can't.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09360"
msgstr ""
"Did you break your\n"
"leg or something?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09361"
msgstr ""
"It's not broken...{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"I should be able to\n"
"stand after a bit.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09362"
msgstr "Thank goodness...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09363"
msgstr ""
"What do you mean,\n"
"\"thank goodness\"!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09364"
msgstr ""
"Didn't he just\n"
"try to kill us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09365"
msgstr ""
"Can't we just forgive\n"
"and forget?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09366"
msgstr ""
"Dodonpa kidnapped\n"
"you, remember!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09367"
msgstr "Oh, that's right...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09368"
msgstr "Get a grip, you guys!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09369"
msgstr ""
"But Hammet is safe now,\n"
"isn't he?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09370"
msgstr ""
"Yeah, but do you really\n"
"think Dodonpa will reform\n"
"if Hammet forgives him?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09371"
msgstr "Hmm... I wonder...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09372"
msgstr "How about it, Dodonpa?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09373"
msgstr ""
"He already said\n"
"he wouldn't do anything!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09374"
msgstr ""
"Of course, he's going\n"
"to say that! He wants\n"
"us to forgive him!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09375"
msgstr ""
"What do you think we\n"
"should do with him,\n"
"{actor_name:2}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09376"
msgstr ""
"We should lock him up\n"
"here, just like he did\n"
"to Hammet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09377"
msgstr ""
"No! How can you\n"
"be so cruel!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09378"
msgstr ""
"Oh? And yet you have\n"
"no problem being that\n"
"cruel to Hammet!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09379"
msgstr ""
"What should we do,\n"
"{actor_name:1}? Should we\n"
"lock Dodonpa up?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09380"
msgstr ""
"Serves the little\n"
"punk right!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09381"
msgstr ""
"Just leave him here\n"
"like this for a while!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaDad"
msgid "09382"
msgstr "Dad!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09383"
msgstr ""
"Dodonpa... You{pause_20_skippable} pitiful\n"
"wretch.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09384"
msgstr ""
"I always told you that\n"
"if you did evil to\n"
"others...{page_break}"
"others would do evil\n"
"to you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09385"
msgstr ""
"You must right all of\n"
"the misdeeds you've\n"
"done!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09386"
msgstr ""
"I feel bad for spoiling\n"
"you. Look at the\n"
"trouble it has caused...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09387"
msgstr ""
"See! It's all your fault\n"
"that all this happened!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09388"
msgstr ""
"Yes, which is why this\n"
"is going to hurt you\n"
"more than it does me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09389"
msgstr ""
"You're not serious,\n"
"are you, Dad?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09390"
msgstr "I most certainly am!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09391"
msgstr ""
"You're going to spend some\n"
"time here thinking about\n"
"all that you've done!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09392"
msgstr ""
"Dodonpa has caused you\n"
"all sorts of trouble,\n"
"hasn't he?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09393"
msgstr "No, not at all!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09394"
msgstr ""
"I must apologize deeply\n"
"for all of this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09395"
msgstr ""
"Thank you, Donpa,\n"
"but you do not\n"
"need to apologize.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09396"
msgstr "Then you{pause_20_skippable} forgive me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09397"
msgstr ""
"I am sorry about the\n"
"trouble, but I do have\n"
"one request.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09398"
msgstr "A request?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09399"
msgstr ""
"I don't know how you\n"
"got in here, but please\n"
"leave by the same means.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09400"
msgstr ""
"Huh? Donpa, didn't you\n"
"just say you're going\n"
"to lock up Dodonpa?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09401"
msgstr ""
"So we shouldn't\n"
"have to sneak around,\n"
"should we?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09402"
msgstr ""
"Some of Dodonpa's\n"
"henchmen are still\n"
"loyal to him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09403"
msgstr ""
"I'm ashamed to say it,\n"
"but they won't listen\n"
"to any of my orders.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09404"
msgstr ""
"This new gang of thieves\n"
"will attack Hammet if they\n"
"find him in the fortress.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09405"
msgstr ""
"And they may come to\n"
"check his cell, right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09406"
msgstr ""
"I see. Then they'd free\n"
"Dodonpa, wouldn't they?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09407"
msgstr ""
"And then he'd head\n"
"straight for Kalay\n"
"seeking his revenge!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09408"
msgstr ""
"I see. Yes, you're\n"
"right.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09409"
msgstr ""
"It would be terrible\n"
"if Kalay were attacked.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09410"
msgstr ""
"That's why you must\n"
"go while you still\n"
"can!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09411"
msgstr "You mean immediately?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09412"
msgstr ""
"I heard of your intrusion,\n"
"so I spread some rumors\n"
"through the fortress.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09413"
msgstr "Rumors?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09414"
msgstr ""
"I said brigands had snuck\n"
"in to kidnap Hammet, but\n"
"failed and ran off.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09415"
msgstr ""
"Why in the world did\n"
"you do that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09416"
msgstr ""
"Now, they won't let\n"
"anyone down here\n"
"at all.{page_break}"
"Plus, many of Dodonpa's\n"
"men have left to find\n"
"the intruders.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09417"
msgstr ""
"Donpa, you are a\n"
"shrewd one!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09418"
msgstr ""
"I just thought I'd\n"
"try to help however\n"
"I could...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09419"
msgstr ""
"With Dodonpa's henchmen\n"
"gone, this is our\n"
"chance to escape, right?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09420"
msgstr ""
"Why did I even bother\n"
"asking? Let's get\n"
"a move on!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09421"
msgstr ""
"The next time you meet\n"
"Dodonpa, he will be a\n"
"changed man.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09422"
msgstr ""
"I get it already! I\n"
"won't do anything wrong!\n"
"Come on, let me go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaGaretRefusesToReturn"
msgid "09423"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}! Don't be stupid!\n"
"We can't go in there,\n"
"remember?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillageVillagerAReopened"
msgid "09424"
msgstr ""
"A large contingent of\n"
"Dodonpa's henchmen have\n"
"left the fortress.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillagerBShivers"
msgid "09425"
msgstr ""
"It's gotten colder...\n"
"I'm shiverin' just\n"
"standin' here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillageVillagerCReopened"
msgid "09426"
msgstr ""
"They say there were\n"
"intruders in the\n"
"fortress.{page_break}"
"Just daring to try\n"
"such a thing is\n"
"impressive!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillagerDAsksAboutCommotion"
msgid "09427"
msgstr ""
"Do you want to know what\n"
"caused the commotion\n"
"at the fortress?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09428"
msgstr ""
"Someone snuck into the\n"
"fortress to save the\n"
"merchant Hammet!{page_break}"
"In the end, they\n"
"failed, so they just\n"
"ran away.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09429"
msgstr ""
"They're foolhardy to\n"
"invade such a well-\n"
"guarded fortress!{page_break}"
"But it would be pretty\n"
"neat if they got away\n"
"with it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillageVillagerEReopened"
msgid "09430"
msgstr ""
"Dodonpa's henchmen have\n"
"gotten their share\n"
"of bumps and bruises!{page_break}"
"They've been acting\n"
"real tough, lately, but\n"
"they're nothing special.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillageVillagerFReopened"
msgid "09431"
msgstr ""
"Apparently, Donpa told\n"
"Dodonpa's henchmen\n"
"about the intruders.{page_break}"
"I guess when it comes\n"
"right down to it, Donpa\n"
"is on Dodonpa's side.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillageVillagerGReopened"
msgid "09432"
msgstr ""
"They say that Dodonpa's\n"
"henchmen were defeated.{page_break}"
"Hearing that makes me\n"
"feel like all my problems\n"
"have washed away!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillageVillagerHReopened"
msgid "09433"
msgstr ""
"The fortress was under\n"
"strict guard.{page_break}"
"Just who were those\n"
"people that snuck\n"
"inside?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaGuardsWarnPartyAway"
msgid "09434"
msgstr ""
"Don't come any closer\n"
"to the fortress!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaLeftGuardRecognizesHammet"
msgid "09435"
msgstr ""
"I've seen that man\n"
"with you before.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaLeftGuardDismissesThought"
msgid "09436"
msgstr ""
"Nah, that's impossible.\n"
"I must be thinking of\n"
"somebody else.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaRightGuardWondersHow"
msgid "09437"
msgstr ""
"How did the warriors\n"
"from Kalay get into\n"
"the fortress?{page_break}"
"Man, did we get in\n"
"trouble for that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09438"
msgstr ""
"I'm sure I've seen\n"
"that man with them\n"
"before!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillageVillagerAReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09439"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what Dodonpa's\n"
"henchmen are up to?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillageVillagerBReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09440"
msgstr ""
"Look how far winter\n"
"has come already!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillageVillagerCReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09441"
msgstr ""
"Whoever snuck into the\n"
"fortress is in for some\n"
"trouble. Poor guys.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillageVillagerDReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09442"
msgstr ""
"I'm amazed anyone could\n"
"sneak into such a well-\n"
"guarded fortress!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillageVillagerEReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09443"
msgstr ""
"It's really funny to see\n"
"Dodonpa's henchmen\n"
"in such a panic!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillageVillagerFReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09444"
msgstr ""
"No matter how evil he is,\n"
"he's still Donpa's son.{page_break}"
"I guess Donpa would\n"
"still do anything for\n"
"Dodonpa, huh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillageVillagerGReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09445"
msgstr ""
"I was so mad when\n"
"Dodonpa's thugs took my\n"
"candy away.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillageVillagerHReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09446"
msgstr ""
"That is the only way into\n"
"or out of the fortress.{page_break}"
"I don't see how anyone\n"
"could get in there\n"
"without being seen.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaLeftGuardGlimpsedMerchant"
msgid "09447"
msgstr ""
"Hmmm. That guy who's\n"
"following them sure\n"
"looks like that merchant.{page_break}"
"But I only caught a\n"
"glimpse of him, so\n"
"I'm not real sure.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaRightGuardReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09448"
msgstr ""
"I don't get it. We were\n"
"on guard the whole time!\n"
"Nobody got by us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsFirstHomeAReopened"
msgid "09449"
msgstr ""
"Apparently, a traveling\n"
"merchant stopped by on\n"
"business recently.{page_break}"
"He wasn't allowed\n"
"into the village,\n"
"of course.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsFirstHomeBReopened"
msgid "09450"
msgstr ""
"The merchant who comes\n"
"every winter was the\n"
"one arguing at the gate.{page_break}"
"Sigh. I'd like to buy\n"
"something, but no one's\n"
"allowed into the village!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsFirstHomeAReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09451"
msgstr ""
"That poor merchant.\n"
"They won't let him into\n"
"the village now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsFirstHomeBReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09452"
msgstr ""
"That's one stubborn\n"
"merchant.{page_break}"
"He's still hanging\n"
"around the outskirts\n"
"of town.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsSecondHomeAReopened"
msgid "09453"
msgstr ""
"I saw a strange,\n"
"shimmering creature go\n"
"into the fortress.{page_break}"
"Do you know\n"
"what it was?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsSecondHomeBReopened"
msgid "09454"
msgstr ""
"I don't care what they\n"
"say, I don't believe it!{page_break}"
"A shimmering creature\n"
"going into the\n"
"fortress!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsSecondHomeAReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09455"
msgstr ""
"Could that shimmering\n"
"beast be the cause\n"
"of all the commotion?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsSecondHomeBReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09456"
msgstr ""
"Monsters hardly ever\n"
"come into town.{page_break}"
"Now, they expect me to\n"
"believe one snuck into\n"
"the fortress?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsThirdHomeAReopened"
msgid "09457"
msgstr ""
"What!? The eruption of\n"
"Mt. Aleph released\n"
"hordes of monsters?{page_break}"
"I get the feeling things\n"
"are going to get worse\n"
"before they get better.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsThirdHomeBReopened"
msgid "09458"
msgstr ""
"Gramps has been really\n"
"cryptic lately.{page_break}"
"He told me Mt. Aleph's\n"
"eruption was an omen of\n"
"a great flood. I hate that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsThirdHomeAReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09459"
msgstr ""
"I heard hordes of\n"
"monsters appeared right\n"
"before the great flood.{page_break}"
"I hope the recent\n"
"troubles aren't a sign\n"
"of another flood!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsThirdHomeBReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09460"
msgstr ""
"Great floods don't\n"
"happen every day,\n"
"you know!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaWeaponMerchantReopened"
msgid "09461"
msgstr ""
"The end is near! Doom is\n"
"upon us! To arms!\n"
"To arms!{page_break}"
"Once they're gone, they're\n"
"gone, so buy 'em\n"
"while they last!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaWeaponMerchantReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09462"
msgstr ""
"All those weapons, but I\n"
"doubt Dodonpa's henchmen\n"
"can use them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaArmorMerchantReopened"
msgid "09463"
msgstr ""
"What do you think?\n"
"I've got some incredible\n"
"products here, huh?{page_break}"
"Buy whatever you like!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaArmorMerchantReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09464"
msgstr ""
"Once I sell this armor,\n"
"I'm closing shop...\n"
"It's kind of a pity...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaItemMerchantReopened"
msgid "09465"
msgstr ""
"The weapons and armor\n"
"vendors are looking\n"
"desperate.{page_break}"
"The stuff they're\n"
"selling now is the last\n"
"of their stock.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaIsntWeaponsVendors"
msgid "09466"
msgstr ""
"It isn't just the weapons\n"
"vendors whose inventory\n"
"is falling!{page_break}"
"We're almost out of\n"
"products too!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInnkeeperOffersRoom"
msgid "09467"
msgstr ""
"Do you want rest in\n"
"our inn?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09468"
msgstr ""
"I see. In that case,\n"
"go ahead and stay.\n"
"I won't ask why.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09469"
msgstr ""
"Well, do as you like.{page_break}"
"Feel free to stay here\n"
"anytime you like.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInnClerkAsksAboutGuest"
msgid "09470"
msgstr "Are you Donpa's guest?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09471"
msgstr ""
"So, you're the one we\n"
"were told to give the\n"
"royal treatment to!{page_break}"
"Oh, you're supposed to\n"
"visit Donpa again once\n"
"the guests have left.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09472"
msgstr ""
"Really, you're not?\n"
"Well, then, who is Donpa's\n"
"guest?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsInnWorkerReopened"
msgid "09473"
msgstr ""
"What's with the boss?{page_break}"
"He told me to air out the\n"
"guest-room bedding and\n"
"change the sheets.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsChefReopened"
msgid "09474"
msgstr ""
"I just gave the boss a\n"
"letter Dodonpa sent from\n"
"the fortress.{page_break}"
"Now, suddenly, he wants me\n"
"to start cooking up a storm.\n"
"Are we expecting guests?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsInnkeeperReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09475"
msgstr ""
"I guess some really\n"
"important guests of\n"
"Donpa's are coming.{page_break}"
"All I know is five young\n"
"warriors are coming,\n"
"but I've never met them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsInnClerkReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09476"
msgstr ""
"I can't imagine Donpa's\n"
"guests being anyone\n"
"but these folks.{page_break}"
"If they don't show up,\n"
"all my work will have\n"
"been for nothing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsInnWorkerReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09477"
msgstr ""
"With the village closed,\n"
"I wonder if those guests\n"
"will even come.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsChefReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09478"
msgstr ""
"I heard Donpa was sick,\n"
"but he seemed to be\n"
"in pretty good shape.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaTemplePriestReopened"
msgid "09479"
msgstr ""
"A number of Dodonpa's\n"
"men set out not too\n"
"long ago.{page_break}"
"I wonder what sort of\n"
"evil deeds they'll\n"
"perpetrate this time.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsTemplePriestReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09480"
msgstr ""
"Please strike down\n"
"Dodonpa's henchmen with\n"
"a bolt from the blue...{page_break}"
"Oh no! I'm supposed to be\n"
"spreading good will,{page_break}"
"but now I've gone and\n"
"cursed them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillageWestGuardReopened"
msgid "09481"
msgstr ""
"Lunpa Fortress is a\n"
"mass of confusion\n"
"right now.{page_break}"
"If you don't want to get\n"
"hurt, be off with\n"
"you! Be off now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillageEastGuardReopened"
msgid "09482"
msgstr ""
"They never let the\n"
"merchants come into\n"
"the village!{page_break}"
"I don't know you guys\n"
"from Adam! You think I'm\n"
"going to let you in?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaVillageWestGuardReopenedThoughts"
msgid "09483"
msgstr ""
"These guys couldn't be\n"
"the ones that got into the\n"
"fortress, could they?{page_break}"
"This lazy-looking\n"
"mug? No way!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaEastGuardThinksMerchantHarmless"
msgid "09484"
msgstr ""
"That merchant was\n"
"desperate to do\n"
"business in the village.{page_break}"
"I'm sure he's around\n"
"somewhere, but I doubt\n"
"he's causin' any trouble!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaThinkSawSomeone"
msgid "09485"
msgstr ""
"I think I saw someone\n"
"just now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09486"
msgstr ""
"Yeah. I saw\n"
"something, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09487"
msgstr ""
"Do you think Dodonpa's\n"
"henchmen have found us?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09488"
msgstr ""
"If they have, we'll have\n"
"to take care of them\n"
"right now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09489"
msgstr ""
"Huh? You think there's\n"
"something else out there!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaMoment"
msgid "09490"
msgstr "Just a moment!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09491"
msgstr "Is that you, Bunza?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09492"
msgstr "Gasp! That voice!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09493"
msgstr "It's Hammet!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaDodonpaNeverIntention"
msgid "09494"
msgstr ""
"So, Dodonpa never had\n"
"any intention of\n"
"releasing Hammet?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09495"
msgstr ""
"That's right. That's why\n"
"{actor_name:3} and his friends\n"
"came to the rescue!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09496"
msgstr ""
"Once {actor_name:1} made up his\n"
"mind, we all decided\n"
"to come save Hammet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09497"
msgstr ""
"Hey, {actor_name:3}! Are you\n"
"saying this was all\n"
"{actor_name:1}'s idea?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09498"
msgstr ""
"N-No! I mean, you and\n"
"{actor_name:4} helped us, too!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09499"
msgstr ""
"Thank you, {actor_name:1},\n"
"{actor_name:2}, and {actor_name:4}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09500"
msgstr ""
"And, of course, you,\n"
"too, {actor_name:3}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09501"
msgstr ""
"You sure did a good\n"
"job finding this cave,\n"
"Bunza.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09502"
msgstr ""
"Yes! Impressive work\n"
"you did, Bunza!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09503"
msgstr ""
"It was pure\n"
"coincidence.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09504"
msgstr ""
"I really didn't want to\n"
"come to Lunpa.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09505"
msgstr ""
"Because we knew the\n"
"thieves had Hammet\n"
"imprisoned...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09506"
msgstr ""
"Then why did you come\n"
"here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09507"
msgstr ""
"I recalled what Hammet\n"
"told me about being\n"
"a successful merchant.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09508"
msgstr ""
"Really? He told you\n"
"that you should start\n"
"trading in Lunpa?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09509"
msgstr ""
"No, I meant his more\n"
"general words of wisdom...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09510"
msgstr ""
"\"Merchants must not\n"
"judge customers on their\n"
"appearances.\"{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09511"
msgstr ""
"\"Do not avoid a place\n"
"just because something\n"
"unpleasant may happen.\"{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09512"
msgstr ""
"\"As long as customers\n"
"await your goods,{page_break}"
"you must do everything\n"
"in your power to sell\n"
"to them!\"{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09513"
msgstr ""
"So, you came to serve the\n"
"villagers, even though\n"
"you despised Dodonpa?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09514"
msgstr ""
"Fate put this opportunity\n"
"before you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09515"
msgstr ""
"But why did you think a\n"
"Kalay merchant would be\n"
"permitted into Lunpa?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09516"
msgstr ""
"I didn't. And, in fact,\n"
"they would not let me in.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09517"
msgstr ""
"Yet, knowing that, you\n"
"still came?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09518"
msgstr ""
"But you know what?\n"
"There was that huge\n"
"commotion, right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09519"
msgstr ""
"He must mean the\n"
"activity caused by\n"
"Donpa's rumors!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09520"
msgstr ""
"It all came together\n"
"for me... That commotion\n"
"was related to Hammet!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09521"
msgstr ""
"I had to find out what\n"
"was going on...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09522"
msgstr ""
"And that's how you\n"
"found this cave?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09523"
msgstr ""
"I'll bet you couldn't\n"
"find any way to get that\n"
"gate open from this side.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09524"
msgstr ""
"But then all of a sudden,\n"
"it moved, so I hid\n"
"behind a rock.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09525"
msgstr ""
"We startled you, didn't\n"
"we, Bunza?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09526"
msgstr ""
"I am just glad you\n"
"were able to get Hammet\n"
"out safely!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09527"
msgstr ""
"Why do you say it\n"
"like that, Bunza?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09528"
msgstr ""
"Dodonpa's henchmen have\n"
"been combing the area...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09529"
msgstr ""
"Even if they aren't after\n"
"Hammet, if they find him...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09530"
msgstr ""
"They might capture\n"
"Hammet again! Let's get\n"
"out of here, quickly!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09531"
msgstr ""
"But we have to escape\n"
"without being seen by\n"
"Dodonpa's henchmen...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09532"
msgstr ""
"What should we do,\n"
"{actor_name:1}? Should we\n"
"stay and fight?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09533"
msgstr ""
"Saving Hammet from that\n"
"fortress was dangerous\n"
"enough...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09534"
msgstr ""
"Taking them all on is\n"
"more foolhardy than\n"
"invading their fortress.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaBunza"
msgid "09535"
msgstr ""
"Then what should we\n"
"do, Bunza?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09536"
msgstr "I have a wagon nearby.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09537"
msgstr "A wagon?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09538"
msgstr ""
"That's right. Let's all\n"
"go back to Kalay in my\n"
"wagon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09539"
msgstr ""
"Won't a wagon stand out?\n"
"If it were searched by\n"
"Dodonpa's henchmen...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09540"
msgstr ""
"There's no need to worry.\n"
"I've been here since\n"
"before the commotion.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09541"
msgstr ""
"Right. They've already\n"
"seen your wagon around...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09542"
msgstr ""
"That's correct, {actor_name:2}.\n"
"They don't suspect me\n"
"of being involved!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaLetsTakeWagon"
msgid "09543"
msgstr ""
"Then let's take that\n"
"wagon to Kalay!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09544"
msgstr ""
"Should we ride in the\n"
"wagon, too?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaGaretAsksIfNotRiding"
msgid "09545"
msgstr ""
"Huh? You don't want to\n"
"ride in Bunza's wagon?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaMiaAsksIfRidingAfter"
msgid "09546"
msgstr ""
"So, what? You've changed\n"
"your mind? You do want\n"
"to go with them?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaTotallyConfusedChanged"
msgid "09547"
msgstr ""
"Now I'm totally confused.\n"
"You changed your mind\n"
"again?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09548"
msgstr ""
"Stop wasting our time!\n"
"Are we riding in the\n"
"wagon?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaGaretAsksAboutUnfinishedBusiness"
msgid "09549"
msgstr ""
"Do you have some\n"
"unfinished business\n"
"in Lunpa?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInsistStick"
msgid "09550"
msgstr ""
"If you insist, then I'll\n"
"stick with you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09551"
msgstr ""
"Hey... I can't leave you\n"
"two here by yourselves!\n"
"I'll stay behind, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09552"
msgstr ""
"Hammet, I'm going to go\n"
"with {actor_name:1}, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09553"
msgstr ""
"Yes, {actor_name:3}, you should\n"
"accompany your friends\n"
"on this mission.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09554"
msgstr ""
"I'm disappointed we can't\n"
"travel home together,\n"
"but I understand.{page_break}"
"Be careful, {actor_name:3}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09555"
msgstr "Sigh. They've gone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09556"
msgstr ""
"I hope Hammet and Bunza\n"
"make it to Kalay safely.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09557"
msgstr ""
"They'll be okay. I'm\n"
"sure they'll make it\n"
"there in one piece.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09558"
msgstr ""
"Well. Let's get going\n"
"ourselves, {actor_name:1}!\n"
"We're off!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaBunzaAsksAboutUnfinishedBusiness"
msgid "09559"
msgstr ""
"Do you have any\n"
"unfinished business?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaDontUnfinishedBusiness"
msgid "09560"
msgstr ""
"If you don't have any\n"
"unfinished business, then\n"
"let's get on to Kalay!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09561"
msgstr ""
"Lady Layana will be\n"
"so happy, won't she?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09562"
msgstr ""
"Yes. I'd like to see\n"
"her as soon as\n"
"possible.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09563"
msgstr "Then, let's set off!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaGaretAsksAboutThingsTo"
msgid "09564"
msgstr ""
"Are you saying you still\n"
"have some things to do\n"
"here in Lunpa? {end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaGaretChecksNothingLeft"
msgid "09565"
msgstr ""
"Don't startle me! You\n"
"don't have anything\n"
"left to do, do you? {end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaMeaningWontRide"
msgid "09566"
msgstr ""
"Meaning...you won't ride\n"
"in the wagon?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09567"
msgstr ""
"I am sorry, {actor_name:1}, but\n"
"I cannot safely wait\n"
"here any longer.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09568"
msgstr ""
"So...do you intend\n"
"to stay and finish\n"
"your business?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaThankHelpDodonpa"
msgid "09569"
msgstr ""
"Thank you for your help\n"
"with Dodonpa.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09570"
msgstr ""
"I have a little something\n"
"for you, for your teaching\n"
"Dodonpa his lesson.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09571"
msgstr ""
"Give these people a\n"
"token of my gratitude.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09572"
msgstr ""
"Deep within there is an\n"
"interesting creature that\n"
"I fought once long ago.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09573"
msgstr ""
"I give this to you.\n"
"Please take good care\n"
"of it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaDonpaGrateful"
msgid "09574"
msgstr ""
"Donpa is very grateful\n"
"for what you have\n"
"done.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaWellWorriedDodonpa"
msgid "09575"
msgstr ""
"Well, now I'm worried\n"
"about Dodonpa really\n"
"turning over a new leaf!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaDifficultDonpaRight"
msgid "09576"
msgstr ""
"It must be difficult\n"
"for Donpa right now.{page_break}"
"It's so hard to teach\n"
"a child a lesson.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaFatherStayAngry"
msgid "09577"
msgstr ""
"What father can stay\n"
"angry at his children\n"
"for long?{page_break}"
"Actually, I'd like to\n"
"free Dodonpa from his\n"
"cell right now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaHammetStillInside"
msgid "09578"
msgstr ""
"The merchant from Kalay\n"
"is in here somewhere.\n"
"He's not going anywhere.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaDodonpaSecretlyInside"
msgid "09579"
msgstr ""
"Actually, Dodonpa's in\n"
"here, but only a few\n"
"people know that.{page_break}"
"As long as we're on\n"
"guard, no one will find\n"
"out.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaWrongTurnOver"
msgid "09580"
msgstr ""
"I was wrong! I'll turn\n"
"over a new leaf, Dad!\n"
"Please forgive me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaCantBelieveWhen"
msgid "09581"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe what you\n"
"did to me! When I get out\n"
"of here,{pause_20_skippable} I'll get you all!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09582"
msgstr ""
"The key doesn't work.\n"
"Maybe Donpa changed\n"
"the locks.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayWeveArrivedHammet"
msgid "09583"
msgstr "We've arrived, Hammet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09584"
msgstr "Arrived where?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09585"
msgstr ""
"Oh, didn't I tell you about\n"
"this entrance, {actor_name:3}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09586"
msgstr ""
"This underground passage\n"
"leads to Hammet Palace.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09587"
msgstr ""
"An{pause_20_skippable} underground{pause_20_skippable} "
"passage?{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"What for?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09588"
msgstr "Just to be safe.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09589"
msgstr ""
"I don't understand.\n"
"Why bring the wagon in\n"
"this way?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09590"
msgstr ""
"Because Dodonpa's\n"
"henchmen may be\n"
"here in Kalay...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09591"
msgstr ""
"Well then, Bunza, would\n"
"you please take them\n"
"to the town's entrance?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09592"
msgstr ""
"What?{pause_20_skippable} Why? We'll just go\n"
"this way with you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09593"
msgstr ""
"You can't. You must go\n"
"through town to the\n"
"Palace.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09594"
msgstr "I'm confused...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09595"
msgstr ""
"You have no reason to\n"
"hide, now, do you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09596"
msgstr ""
"Why shouldn't we just\n"
"go in this way?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09597"
msgstr ""
"That would raise\n"
"suspicions.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09598"
msgstr ""
"Wouldn't it be strange if\n"
"people who aren't even\n"
"supposed to be in town...{page_break}"
"suddenly walked out\n"
"of the Palace?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09599"
msgstr ""
"If anyone noticed, they\n"
"might learn of this\n"
"secret entrance.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09600"
msgstr "Now, do you understand?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09601"
msgstr ""
"In that case how\n"
"about this?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09602"
msgstr ""
"I think Hammet and Lady\n"
"Layana need time for\n"
"their reunion...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09603"
msgstr ""
"In that case, we will\n"
"gladly ride in the wagon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayDoWantGoCaveUp"
msgid "09604"
msgstr ""
"Do you want to go to\n"
"the cave up ahead?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09605"
msgstr ""
"I'd like to let you go, but\n"
"I cannot. You'd better\n"
"just turn around.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09606"
msgstr ""
"Good, because I wouldn't\n"
"be able to let you\n"
"anyway.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayPassageClosedByOrders"
msgid "09607"
msgstr ""
"Hammet and Lady Layana\n"
"have commanded that none\n"
"shall pass through here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayItsIvanHisCompanionsPerfect"
msgid "09608"
msgstr ""
"So! {pause_20_skippable} It's {actor_name:3} and\n"
"his companions...\n"
"Perfect timing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09609"
msgstr "So{pause_20_skippable}, it's you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09610"
msgstr ""
"I told you time and time\n"
"again not to go to Lunpa,\n"
"but you went anyway.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09611"
msgstr ""
"Please, Layana, don't be\n"
"so harsh on them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09612"
msgstr ""
"Naturally, I'm happy\n"
"that they rescued you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09613"
msgstr ""
"But this was something\n"
"that Kalay should have\n"
"handled alone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09614"
msgstr ""
"You had a more pressing\n"
"quest at hand, no?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09615"
msgstr ""
"Yes.{pause_20_skippable} Your mission is to\n"
"recover the Elemental\n"
"Stars.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09616"
msgstr ""
"Have you completely\n"
"forgotten your own\n"
"quest!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09617"
msgstr "Layana,{pause_20_skippable} you shouldn't...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09618"
msgstr ""
"I...{pause_20_skippable} I had to rescue\n"
"Hammet,{pause_20_skippable} no matter\n"
"the cost...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09619"
msgstr ""
"It's already done.\n"
"There is nothing\n"
"more to be said.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09620"
msgstr ""
"Hold on! We all wanted\n"
"to save Hammet as badly\n"
"as {actor_name:3} did.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09621"
msgstr ""
"It doesn't matter,\n"
"{actor_name:2}. I'm the one\n"
"at fault!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09622"
msgstr ""
"I made a mistake.\n"
"We will leave immediately\n"
"on {actor_name:5}'s trail!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09623"
msgstr ""
"Yes. That would be best.\n"
"Leave immediately.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09624"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}, we should be\n"
"going.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09625"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:3}, is that really\n"
"what you want?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09626"
msgstr ""
"Well, if {actor_name:3} says so...\n"
"Should we go,\n"
"{actor_name:1}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09627"
msgstr ""
"If both {actor_name:1} and\n"
"{actor_name:3} want to leave,\n"
"then I guess that's it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09628"
msgstr ""
"Take your Shaman's Rod\n"
"and go to Hesperia.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09629"
msgstr "To Hesperia...?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09630"
msgstr ""
"That is what the Jupiter\n"
"Adept said.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09631"
msgstr ""
"Hesperia...\n"
"Where is that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09632"
msgstr ""
"It is the continent\n"
"to the west of\n"
"Angara.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09633"
msgstr ""
"What are we going to\n"
"find in Hesperia if\n"
"we go?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09634"
msgstr "That, I do not know...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09635"
msgstr ""
"The continent to the\n"
"west? On the other side\n"
"of the sea?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09636"
msgstr ""
"Do not waste time\n"
"chattering. You must set\n"
"out immediately.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgHammetPalaceTakeYourShamansRodAndSet"
msgid "09637"
msgstr ""
"Take your Shaman's Rod\n"
"and set out for\n"
"Hesperia.{page_break}"
"And...{pause_20_skippable}be careful.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgHammetPalaceNoOneInKalayKnowsHammet"
msgid "09638"
msgstr ""
"No one in Kalay knows\n"
"Hammet has returned.{page_break}"
"We will have to hide\n"
"Hammet in the Palace for\n"
"quite a while.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgHammetPalaceIHearHammetWasSavedBy"
msgid "09639"
msgstr ""
"I hear Hammet was saved\n"
"by you people...\n"
"Thank you so much!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgHammetPalaceTheySayHammetsReturnIsSupposed"
msgid "09640"
msgstr ""
"They say Hammet's return\n"
"is supposed to be\n"
"a secret for now.{page_break}"
"The villagers are worried,\n"
"so I'd like to tell them,\n"
"but we can't...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgHammetPalaceILeftTheDoorToThe"
msgid "09641"
msgstr ""
"I left the door to the\n"
"underground passage\n"
"open, so go have a look.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgHammetPalaceIWonderIfAnyOfDodonpas"
msgid "09642"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if any of\n"
"Dodonpa's thugs{pause_20_skippable} have come\n"
"here after Hammet...{page_break}"
"That is the only thing\n"
"that really has me\n"
"frightened.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgHammetPalaceTheSecretPassageIsLockedBecause"
msgid "09643"
msgstr ""
"The secret passage is\n"
"locked because Hammet's\n"
"treasure is in there.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgHammetPalaceLayanasWordsPainHerMoreThan"
msgid "09644"
msgstr ""
"Layana's words pain her\n"
"more than they can know.{page_break}"
"Surely, {actor_name:1} and\n"
"his friends understand\n"
"Layana's feelings.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgHammetPalaceImSoHappyHammetMadeIt"
msgid "09645"
msgstr ""
"I'm so happy Hammet made\n"
"it back safely, I could\n"
"cry...{page_break}"
"{actor_name:1}, {actor_name:3}...\n"
"We all must thank you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgHammetPalaceImSoRelievedHammetMadeIt"
msgid "09646"
msgstr ""
"I'm so relieved Hammet\n"
"made it back safely.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgHammetPalaceICantLetOnToThe"
msgid "09647"
msgstr ""
"I can't let on to the\n"
"townspeople when I\n"
"speak to them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgHammetPalaceLayanaOrderedTheDoorToThe"
msgid "09648"
msgstr ""
"Layana ordered the door\n"
"to the underground\n"
"path opened.{page_break}"
"This represents our\n"
"gratitude toward {actor_name:1}\n"
"and his friends{page_break}"
"...for saving Hammet.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgHammetPalaceWeWillNeverLetDodonpasHenchmen"
msgid "09649"
msgstr ""
"We will never let\n"
"Dodonpa's henchmen get\n"
"Hammet again...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgHammetPalaceTheKeyToTheSecretPassage"
msgid "09650"
msgstr ""
"The key to the secret\n"
"passage is also the key to\n"
"Hammet's treasure room.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayLayanaWasVeryHardOn"
msgid "09651"
msgstr ""
"Layana was very hard\n"
"on all of you, wasn't\n"
"she?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09652"
msgstr ""
"I think she went too\n"
"far, telling you all\n"
"to leave...{page_break}"
"But she is the one who\n"
"most regrets parting\n"
"with {actor_name:3}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09653"
msgstr ""
"Her words were hard,\n"
"but you know how painful\n"
"they were for her to say.{page_break}"
"Layana will be very\n"
"happy to hear that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgKalayTreasureBeyondDoors"
msgid "09654"
msgstr ""
"The things beyond these\n"
"doors belong to you all.\n"
"Please take them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaThisIsSuhallaDontTryCrossing"
msgid "09655"
msgstr ""
"This is Suhalla.{page_break}"
"Don't try crossing the\n"
"desert. The sandstorms\n"
"are too fierce.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaTryingGetLalivero"
msgid "09656"
msgstr ""
"Are you trying to get\n"
"to Lalivero?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09657"
msgstr ""
"Making it through the\n"
"sandstorms is impossible.\n"
"Don't bother.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09658"
msgstr ""
"Didn't you come from\n"
"Angara?{page_break}"
"Anytime Angarans come\n"
"to Suhalla, they're always\n"
"going to Lalivero.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaWeGondowansWillNeverTrustAnyone"
msgid "09659"
msgstr ""
"We Gondowans will never\n"
"trust anyone from\n"
"Angara! You know why?{page_break}"
"{actor_name:7}, the holy child of\n"
"Lalivero, was taken away\n"
"as a hostage to Tolbi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaItHasBeenSaidForAges"
msgid "09660"
msgstr ""
"It has been said for ages\n"
"that desert spirits only\n"
"create sandstorms...{page_break}"
"when they are angry.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaYouCantGetToSouthernGondowan"
msgid "09661"
msgstr ""
"You can't get to southern\n"
"Gondowan from here,\n"
"can you?{page_break}"
"There are many natural\n"
"obstacles. There is no\n"
"way to cross them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaTheWorkersSayTherereHugeFestivals"
msgid "09662"
msgstr ""
"The workers say there're\n"
"huge festivals in Tolbi.\n"
"I'd like to see one.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaTheSandstormsSuddenlyIncreasedIHope"
msgid "09663"
msgstr ""
"The sandstorms suddenly\n"
"increased...{page_break}"
"I hope no one gets\n"
"caught in one and\n"
"gets injured.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaTheSuhallaHasLongBeenKnown"
msgid "09664"
msgstr ""
"The Suhalla has long been\n"
"known for its sandstorms.\n"
"There are too many now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaThePeopleOfLaliveroHaveBeen"
msgid "09665"
msgstr ""
"The people of Lalivero\n"
"have been worked hard by\n"
"Angara's soldiers.{page_break}"
"No one would dare make\n"
"Suhallans work like that!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaTheRulerOfTolbiTookA"
msgid "09666"
msgstr ""
"The ruler of Tolbi took a\n"
"girl named {actor_name:7} hostage\n"
"to control Lalivero.{page_break}"
"We'll never trust\n"
"anyone from Angara!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaIKnowTheDesertSpiritsWill"
msgid "09667"
msgstr ""
"I know the desert spirits\n"
"will exact their vengeance\n"
"on Babi for this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaSouthernGondowanIsGuardedByThe"
msgid "09668"
msgstr ""
"Southern Gondowan is\n"
"guarded by the\n"
"natural terrain.{page_break}"
"We are constantly\n"
"worried about an\n"
"invasion from Angara...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaIveHeardThatTolbisColossoIs"
msgid "09669"
msgstr ""
"I've heard that Tolbi's\n"
"Colosso is a\n"
"warriors' festival, but...{page_break}"
"I wonder what a\n"
"warriors' festival\n"
"is like...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaNoneOfTheGrownUpsIn"
msgid "09670"
msgstr ""
"None of the grown-ups in\n"
"Suhalla go into the desert\n"
"during a sandstorm.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsMyFatherLovesPeopleSoMuch"
msgid "09671"
msgstr ""
"My father loves people\n"
"so much, he can't help but\n"
"aid anyone in trouble.{page_break}"
"But I love my father\n"
"despite his faults.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsLetMeKnowIfYouHave"
msgid "09672"
msgstr ""
"Let me know if you\n"
"have any problems.{page_break}"
"I'll do anything I\n"
"can to help.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsWhenISeePeopleInTrouble"
msgid "09673"
msgstr ""
"When I see people in\n"
"trouble, I just can't\n"
"sit still.{page_break}"
"I guess I'm just\n"
"my father's child!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsIWantToHelpPeopleSo"
msgid "09674"
msgstr ""
"I want to help people\n"
"so badly, I can't sit\n"
"idly by!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsTolbiProbablyIgnoresSmallVillagesLike"
msgid "09675"
msgstr ""
"Tolbi probably ignores\n"
"small villages like\n"
"Suhalla, doesn't it?{page_break}"
"Now that I think about\n"
"it, that's probably for\n"
"the best.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsIfYouHeadEastAcrossSuhalla"
msgid "09676"
msgstr ""
"If you head east across\n"
"Suhalla, Lalivero is\n"
"so close you can see it{page_break}"
"across the Nol River, but\n"
"you can't get across the\n"
"river delta.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsSuhallaIsADesertVillageI"
msgid "09677"
msgstr ""
"Suhalla is a desert\n"
"village. I guess it will\n"
"never be like Lalivero.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsGoodThingItsNotEasyTo"
msgid "09678"
msgstr ""
"Good thing it's not easy\n"
"to get to Lalivero!{page_break}"
"If it were, Suhalla would\n"
"be completely\n"
"left behind.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaOursOnlyStore"
msgid "09679"
msgstr ""
"Ours is the only store\n"
"in Suhalla.{page_break}"
"This is a small village,\n"
"so one store is enough.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsAVillageThisSmallCantSupport"
msgid "09680"
msgstr ""
"A village this small\n"
"can't support many\n"
"shops.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaSighNothinMaybe"
msgid "09681"
msgstr ""
"Sigh. Nothin' to do...{page_break}"
"Maybe we'll see business\n"
"once Tolbi's festival\n"
"ends.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsIWonderIfAnyCustomersCan"
msgid "09682"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if any customers\n"
"can get through those\n"
"sandstorms...{page_break}"
"First, they'd have to\n"
"want to cross through\n"
"the desert.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsOnceTheFestivalEndsTheTravelers"
msgid "09683"
msgstr ""
"Once the festival ends,\n"
"the travelers will head\n"
"for Lalivero.{page_break}"
"If they just get caught\n"
"in the sandstorms, they'll\n"
"be my customers!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsForSomeReasonAnyoneWhoGets"
msgid "09684"
msgstr ""
"For some reason, anyone\n"
"who gets caught in a\n"
"sandstorm winds up here.{page_break}"
"They all give up trying\n"
"to cross the desert and\n"
"take shelter in Suhalla.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaGetSickThinkingAboutLalivero"
msgid "09685"
msgstr ""
"I get sick thinking about\n"
"Lalivero being under\n"
"Tolbi's rule.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsTheHolyChildActorWillSave"
msgid "09686"
msgstr ""
"The holy child, {actor_name:7},\n"
"will save those deluded\n"
"Laliverans.{page_break}"
"That is what they\n"
"believe in Lalivero.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaWelcomeToSuhallaIBetThe"
msgid "09687"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to Suhalla. I\n"
"bet the sandstorms\n"
"were terrible...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaTheDesertIsEnvelopedInSandstorms"
msgid "09688"
msgstr ""
"The desert is enveloped\n"
"in sandstorms! It's\n"
"frightening!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaSoldiersFromTolbiWereCaughtIn"
msgid "09689"
msgstr ""
"Soldiers from Tolbi were\n"
"caught in the sandstorms,\n"
"and nearly all perished!{page_break}"
"The survivors are in\n"
"that house.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaWeWereBroughtHereByThe"
msgid "09690"
msgstr ""
"We were brought here\n"
"by the sandstorms. It\n"
"all happened so fast!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaThisSandstormIsTheFaultOf"
msgid "09691"
msgstr ""
"This sandstorm is the\n"
"fault of the Angarans!{page_break}"
"If you all hadn't built that\n"
"thing in Lalivero, the\n"
"spirits wouldn't be angry!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaBroughtSuhallaSandstorm"
msgid "09692"
msgstr ""
"You were brought to\n"
"Suhalla by the\n"
"sandstorm, right?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09693"
msgstr ""
"Everyone who gets caught\n"
"in the sandstorms winds\n"
"up in Suhalla.{page_break}"
"You should be glad you\n"
"weren't blown away to\n"
"some strange place!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09694"
msgstr ""
"I don't care what anyone\n"
"says, there shouldn't\n"
"be so many sandstorms!{page_break}"
"What in the world\n"
"could be going on in\n"
"the Suhalla desert?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaWhyAreTheSandstormsAttackingHumans"
msgid "09695"
msgstr ""
"Why are the sandstorms\n"
"attacking humans?{page_break}"
"It's as if the\n"
"sandstorms are\n"
"actually alive!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaThoseSoldiersKeptMumblingAboutMonsters"
msgid "09696"
msgstr ""
"Those soldiers kept\n"
"mumbling about monsters...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaIBetTheseWarriorsWereBrought"
msgid "09697"
msgstr ""
"I bet these warriors\n"
"were brought here by a\n"
"sandstorm.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaIWonderWhyThereAreSo"
msgid "09698"
msgstr ""
"I wonder why there\n"
"are so many sandstorms?{page_break}"
"It wasn't this bad{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"until only recently.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaTheSoldiersFromTolbiWereCollapsing"
msgid "09699"
msgstr ""
"The soldiers from Tolbi\n"
"were collapsing, like\n"
"after a battle.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaAfterYouGetSwallowedByA"
msgid "09700"
msgstr ""
"After you get swallowed\n"
"by a sandstorm, you\n"
"have a few moments{page_break}"
"before you get blown back\n"
"here, but still there's\n"
"nothing you can do...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaLatelyAllTheSandstormsHaveBeen"
msgid "09701"
msgstr ""
"Lately, all the sandstorms\n"
"have been incredibly\n"
"fierce.{page_break}"
"What could the desert\n"
"spirits be so angry\n"
"about?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaIfYouFightTheStormsYoull"
msgid "09702"
msgstr ""
"If you fight the storms,\n"
"you'll enrage the spirits,\n"
"and they'll take your life.{page_break}"
"I bet that's what\n"
"happened to the\n"
"soldiers from Tolbi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaGrownUpsSayTheSandstormsAttack"
msgid "09703"
msgstr ""
"Grown-ups say the\n"
"sandstorms attack people.{page_break}"
"But, it doesn't make\n"
"sense that a storm would\n"
"attack anything!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaTheySayTheSoldiersWereRavaged"
msgid "09704"
msgstr ""
"They say the soldiers\n"
"were ravaged by a\n"
"sandstorm...{page_break}"
"but I think it must\n"
"have been a monster...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsTheWoundedAreSleepingSoDont"
msgid "09705"
msgstr ""
"The wounded are sleeping,\n"
"so don't raise your\n"
"voice!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsIAmAmazedTheseSoldiersSurvived"
msgid "09706"
msgstr ""
"I am amazed these\n"
"soldiers survived their\n"
"wounds...{page_break}"
"They must have been\n"
"in good shape!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaIodem"
msgid "09707"
msgstr "Iodem...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09708"
msgstr ""
"You soldiers were\n"
"supposed to be heading\n"
"for Babi Lighthouse!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09709"
msgstr ""
"Iodem... What are\n"
"you doing here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09710"
msgstr ""
"Babi ordered me to go to\n"
"the lighthouse with\n"
"{actor_name:1}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09711"
msgstr ""
"You were escorting {actor_name:7}\n"
"to Lalivero, no?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09712"
msgstr "We've disgraced Tolbi...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09713"
msgstr ""
"What has happened to\n"
"{actor_name:7}? Where is {actor_name:7}!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09714"
msgstr ""
"I don't know. When we\n"
"awoke, we were here in\n"
"these beds.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09715"
msgstr ""
"If anything has happened\n"
"to {actor_name:7}, what will\n"
"become of the lighthouse?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09716"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} was the sole\n"
"reason Lalivero aided\n"
"us in its construction.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09717"
msgstr ""
"We entrusted you with\n"
"{actor_name:7} to speed up the\n"
"construction.{page_break}"
"Was that a mistake?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09718"
msgstr ""
"Iodem...{pause_20_skippable} I know that, at\n"
"the very least, {actor_name:7}\n"
"wasn't in the sandstorm.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09719"
msgstr "Is this true!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09720"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} was entrusted to\n"
"our care, so we shielded\n"
"her from any risk.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09721"
msgstr ""
"You acted properly,\n"
"then, but where is\n"
"{actor_name:7} now?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09722"
msgstr ""
"Probably not far from the\n"
"edge of the sandstorm\n"
"that hit us...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09723"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}, we must go to\n"
"the desert and find\n"
"{actor_name:7}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09724"
msgstr ""
"If you're going to the\n"
"desert...beware of\n"
"that cyclone!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09725"
msgstr ""
"At first{pause_20_skippable}, we couldn't\n"
"avoid getting caught\n"
"in the sandstorms.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09726"
msgstr ""
"But there were others\n"
"who were able to make it\n"
"through the storms.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09727"
msgstr ""
"Who knows how they got\n"
"it, but they used water\n"
"to stop the cyclones.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09728"
msgstr ""
"Water? You can stop the\n"
"sandstorms with water...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09729"
msgstr ""
"I think I understand.\n"
"Now get some rest...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09730"
msgstr ""
"Wait, Iodem...{pause_20_skippable} There is\n"
"more. You must not meet\n"
"our fate...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09731"
msgstr ""
"The sandstorms{pause_20_skippable} are\n"
"caused{pause_20_skippable} by monsters.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09732"
msgstr "Can this be?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09733"
msgstr ""
"The others...{pause_20_skippable} They slayed\n"
"the beasts{pause_20_skippable}... That's\n"
"how they got through.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09734"
msgstr ""
"Wh{pause_20_skippable}-Who{pause_20_skippable}{em_dash}what are "
"they?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09735"
msgstr ""
"When the storms stopped,\n"
"they would move ahead,\n"
"{pause_20_skippable}but a new storm always...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09736"
msgstr ""
"They had strange powers.\n"
"We had to bring barrels{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"filled with water...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09737"
msgstr ""
"But carrying the barrels\n"
"exhausted us...and then{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"the beast...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09738"
msgstr ""
"That's enough...\n"
"Get some rest!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09739"
msgstr ""
"They are dangerous, those\n"
"others. Slay that beast\n"
"and take up the trail...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09740"
msgstr ""
"Thank you for your help.\n"
"You have dispatched your\n"
"duties with honor.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09741"
msgstr ""
"Could these others be\n"
"the ones you are\n"
"following, {actor_name:1}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09742"
msgstr ""
"You took the same\n"
"impression from their\n"
"tale as I did...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09743"
msgstr ""
"I don't know why...\n"
"but that is the sense\n"
"I get from this tale...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09744"
msgstr ""
"We must find {actor_name:7} as\n"
"quickly as we can!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09745"
msgstr ""
"Then, we shall get through\n"
"the Suhalla and pursue\n"
"your opponents.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsWhyWereTheyHeadedTowardEastern"
msgid "09746"
msgstr ""
"Why were they headed\n"
"toward eastern\n"
"Gondowan?{page_break}"
"I have a bad feeling about\n"
"this. Please! You must\n"
"overtake them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsWhereIsActorWhatHasHappened"
msgid "09747"
msgstr ""
"Where is {actor_name:7}...\n"
"What has happened\n"
"to {actor_name:7}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsTheseOldSoldiersMustRestUntil"
msgid "09748"
msgstr ""
"These old soldiers must\n"
"rest until their wounds\n"
"heal.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsWhoCouldHaveDoneThisTo"
msgid "09749"
msgstr ""
"Who could have done\n"
"this to such powerful\n"
"soldiers?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsAColumnOfWaterShotUp"
msgid "09750"
msgstr ""
"A column of water shot\n"
"up when they were caught\n"
"in the sandstorm.{page_break}"
"Then the sand was gone.{page_break}"
"But it was so much more\n"
"water than we could ever\n"
"hold in our barrels...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsActorWasNotFarBehindUs"
msgid "09751"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} was not far\n"
"behind us. She should\n"
"still be safe.{page_break}"
"{actor_name:7} must be in the\n"
"desert somewhere...\n"
"If not, maybe they...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsDoNotApproachTheLargeCyclones"
msgid "09752"
msgstr ""
"Do not approach the\n"
"large cyclones in the\n"
"middle of the Suhalla.{page_break}"
"The Suhallans call those\n"
"death storms. They are\n"
"pure evil.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsDeathStormsHuhThereWasA"
msgid "09753"
msgstr ""
"Death storms, huh?\n"
"There was a saying about\n"
"those big cyclones...{page_break}"
"Ummm, What...\n"
"What was it?\n"
"...I can't remember.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsOnceYouGetSweptUpIn"
msgid "09754"
msgstr ""
"Once you get swept up in\n"
"a death storm, you can\n"
"never be rescued.{page_break}"
"Countless people are\n"
"missing because of\n"
"them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsYeWhoSeekSomethingAboutEyes"
msgid "09755"
msgstr ""
"\"Ye who seek...\"\n"
"Something about eyes of\n"
"truth... What was it?{page_break}"
"\"When ye take thy\n"
"treasure, a creature of\n"
"darkness...\"{page_break}"
"Oh, fiddle-faddle.\n"
"I forget.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaArentSurprisedFind"
msgid "09756"
msgstr ""
"Aren't you surprised\n"
"to find so few shops?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09757"
msgstr ""
"I bet you are! Suhalla\n"
"is a small village...\n"
"Ours is the only shop!{page_break}"
"We don't have anything\n"
"great, but feel free to\n"
"look around.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09758"
msgstr ""
"It's really something\n"
"to have an equipment\n"
"shop...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsWeveHadMoreCustomersLatelyBecause"
msgid "09759"
msgstr ""
"We've had more customers\n"
"lately because of the\n"
"increase in sandstorms.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaBusyEverSince"
msgid "09760"
msgstr ""
"We've been busy ever\n"
"since the surge of\n"
"sandstorms!{page_break}"
"We are happy about it,\n"
"but we feel bad for\n"
"the poor travelers.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsItWillTakeTimeForThe"
msgid "09761"
msgstr ""
"It will take time for the\n"
"storms to die down, so\n"
"make yourselves at home.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsWeWentIntoTheSuhallaTo"
msgid "09762"
msgstr ""
"We went into the Suhalla\n"
"to go build the lighthouse,\n"
"but the storms caught us.{page_break}"
"Sigh. Now we can't\n"
"reach Babi Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsTheSandstormsAreSoBadWeve"
msgid "09763"
msgstr ""
"The sandstorms are so\n"
"bad, we've given up trying\n"
"to reach Babi Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaSupposeFolkBlown"
msgid "09764"
msgstr ""
"I suppose you folk were\n"
"blown here on your way\n"
"to Babi Lighthouse?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09765"
msgstr ""
"If you follow the northern\n"
"mountain, you can get\n"
"back to Tolbi.{page_break}"
"I'm giving up, too...\n"
"Let's head back\n"
"that way.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09766"
msgstr ""
"I set out for Babi\n"
"Lighthouse to open\n"
"a business there,{page_break}"
"but then I was blown\n"
"back here again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsTheSandstormsAreSendingCustomersOur"
msgid "09767"
msgstr ""
"The sandstorms are\n"
"sending customers our\n"
"way!{page_break}"
"I hope those winds keep\n"
"right on blowing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsPleaseGreatSandstormsSendUsMore"
msgid "09768"
msgstr ""
"Please, great sandstorms!\n"
"Send us more\n"
"customers!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsEvenIfWeCantGoIt"
msgid "09769"
msgstr ""
"Even if we can't go, it\n"
"won't affect construction\n"
"of the lighthouse much.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsSoShallWeGiveUpOn"
msgid "09770"
msgstr ""
"So, shall we give up on\n"
"Babi Lighthouse and\n"
"head back to Tolbi?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsWhenThatCycloneThrewUsInto"
msgid "09771"
msgstr ""
"When that cyclone threw\n"
"us into the air, I thought\n"
"we were done for!{page_break}"
"I'm happy just to be\n"
"alive!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaWonderWhySandstorms"
msgid "09772"
msgstr ""
"I wonder why we're\n"
"having all these\n"
"sandstorms...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaInteriorsIShudderToThinkSandstormsWill"
msgid "09773"
msgstr ""
"I shudder to think\n"
"sandstorms will get\n"
"me if I leave town.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaSandstorm"
msgid "09774"
msgstr "A sandstorm!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09775"
msgstr ""
"There'll be trouble\n"
"if we get caught up\n"
"in one of those...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09776"
msgstr ""
"But something is wrong...\n"
"Why are there so many?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09777"
msgstr ""
"If we don't get past\n"
"here, we'll never make\n"
"it to Babi Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09778"
msgstr ""
"We must step carefully\n"
"if we hope to escape\n"
"the desert.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaNowhereFound"
msgid "09779"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} is nowhere to\n"
"be found.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09780"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what\n"
"happened...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09781"
msgstr ""
"Should we search the\n"
"desert once more or\n"
"press on to Lalivero?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09782"
msgstr ""
"What do you say, {actor_name:1}?\n"
"Should we keep going?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09783"
msgstr ""
"Ah, yes. I had forgotten\n"
"about your foes...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09784"
msgstr ""
"But I must carry out\n"
"Babi's orders...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09785"
msgstr ""
"Our guard gate\n"
"lies ahead.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09786"
msgstr ""
"We can leave {actor_name:7} to\n"
"the soldiers at the\n"
"gate.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09787"
msgstr ""
"Well, perhaps we should\n"
"head there first, then.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgWorldMapLook"
msgid "09788"
msgstr "Look at this!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09789"
msgstr "What happened?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09790"
msgstr "Babi's ship...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09791"
msgstr ""
"Hm... Perhaps it\n"
"is time...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09792"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}{pause_20_skippable}, take this...\n"
"Try to use it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09793"
msgstr "You got the Black Orb.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgWorldMapNowUseOnShip"
msgid "09794"
msgstr ""
"Now use it...\n"
"on the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgWorldMapIsaacWhereGoingSaidUse"
msgid "09795"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}, where you going?\n"
"I said to use the Orb\n"
"on Babi's ship!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgWorldMapMatter"
msgid "09796"
msgstr "What's the matter?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09797"
msgstr ""
"Strange... Nothing\n"
"happened. What does\n"
"it mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09798"
msgstr ""
"Could Babi{pause_20_skippable} have\n"
"been wrong?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09799"
msgstr "No. Not Babi...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09800"
msgstr ""
"I was wrong{em_dash}it is\n"
"not yet time.{page_break}"
"We must press on to\n"
"Babi Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09801"
msgstr ""
"I will take that back{pause_20_skippable},\n"
"for now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09802"
msgstr ""
"You returned the\n"
"Black Orb.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09803"
msgstr ""
"We will return to\n"
"the ship later.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgWorldMapWreckageShipScuttledOffCoast"
msgid "09804"
msgstr ""
"The wreckage of a ship\n"
"scuttled off the coast.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaTravelPapersRequired"
msgid "09805"
msgstr ""
"Only those with travel\n"
"papers may pass through.{page_break}"
"If you do not have them\n"
"you must turn back\n"
"at once.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaWantGoBabi"
msgid "09806"
msgstr ""
"Do you want to go to\n"
"Babi Lighthouse?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09807"
msgstr ""
"Show me your travel\n"
"papers, and I'll let\n"
"you pass!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09808"
msgstr ""
"What! You don't have\n"
"travel papers? Then I\n"
"cannot let you pass!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09809"
msgstr ""
"Hmmph!{pause_20_skippable} You don't want\n"
"to see Babi Lighthouse?\n"
"You're a strange one!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaObeyBabiOrders"
msgid "09810"
msgstr ""
"I never ask why I\n"
"must protect this\n"
"place!{page_break}"
"I simply obey Babi's\n"
"orders...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaSeeColossoNextYear"
msgid "09811"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if this year's\n"
"Colosso is over yet...{page_break}"
"Sigh. I'd like to see\n"
"Colosso next year...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaMeaning"
msgid "09812"
msgstr ""
"What is the meaning\n"
"of this!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09813"
msgstr ""
"Uh! {pause_20_skippable}Is...{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"Is that Iodem...?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09814"
msgstr ""
"What has happened\n"
"to the gate?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09815"
msgstr ""
"There was a strange\n"
"group... No papers...\n"
"They wanted to pass...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09816"
msgstr "Uhh... Io{pause_20_skippable}dem...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09817"
msgstr ""
"We tried to hold them\n"
"back...{pause_20_skippable}but they were\n"
"too powerful!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09818"
msgstr ""
"They{pause_20_skippable} had strange\n"
"powers...{pause_20_skippable} We were\n"
"no match for them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09819"
msgstr "It must have been {actor_name:5}!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09820"
msgstr ""
"Yeah... No one else\n"
"is capable of this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09821"
msgstr ""
"Don't you know the work\n"
"of your own foe's hand?\n"
"Who else could it be?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09822"
msgstr ""
"After we find {actor_name:7},\n"
"we must track down the\n"
"monsters that did this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09823"
msgstr ""
"We must get to Babi\n"
"Lighthouse as soon as\n"
"possible!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09824"
msgstr ""
"Yes{pause_20_skippable}, but we cannot\n"
"leave the soldiers\n"
"like this...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09825"
msgstr ""
"We're okay.{pause_20_skippable} Don't worry\n"
"about us! Get after\n"
"them{pause_20_skippable}, please...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09826"
msgstr "But that would be...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09827"
msgstr ""
"We were bested in\n"
"battle, but we will{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"survive...{pause_20_skippable} Now go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09828"
msgstr ""
"If they have done anything\n"
"at the lighthouse...\n"
"It would be our...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09829"
msgstr ""
"He's right. We've got\n"
"to stop them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09830"
msgstr ""
"We're going after them,\n"
"right, {actor_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaSendHelpFromTower"
msgid "09831"
msgstr ""
"Ohhh!{pause_20_skippable} It's no use...\n"
"I don't think I can\n"
"get up.{page_break}"
"Send help once you\n"
"reach Babi Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaPityColossoVictor"
msgid "09832"
msgstr ""
"It's a pity a Colosso\n"
"victor should end up\n"
"like this...{page_break}"
"Next time I see them,\n"
"I'll be sure to settle\n"
"the score!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaAshamedBeforeIodem"
msgid "09833"
msgstr ""
"Curses! It's a disgrace\n"
"to be seen by Iodem\n"
"like this...{page_break}"
"I'd rather crawl into\n"
"a hole and hide.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgSuhallaSurvivedAttack"
msgid "09834"
msgstr ""
"I thought I was dead!\n"
"I'm lucky even to be alive\n"
"right now...{page_break}"
"The strange ones with the\n"
"wild hair... Their power\n"
"was too much for us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaTravelingPriest"
msgid "09835"
msgstr ""
"I have been traveling\n"
"the lands spreading\n"
"good will.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLunpaInteriorsTravelingPriestThoughts"
msgid "09836"
msgstr ""
"Cliffs, deserts...\n"
"Gondowan is a desolate\n"
"wasteland.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgFieldVenusLighthouseWasAttackedBy"
msgid "09837"
msgstr ""
"Venus Lighthouse was...{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"attacked by{pause_20_skippable} "
"strange...{pause_20_skippable}{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"wanderers...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusLighthouseIodemBeHappyTheEntranceTo"
msgid "09838"
msgstr ""
"Iodem, be{pause_20_skippable} happy. The\n"
"entrance to Venus\n"
"Lighthouse is open...{page_break}"
"After{pause_20_skippable} years of study...\n"
"our dreams have{pause_20_skippable} at\n"
"last come{pause_20_skippable} true!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusLighthouseOhhhHowCouldTheyAttackMere"
msgid "09839"
msgstr ""
"Ohhh! How could they\n"
"attack mere scholars?\n"
"Those barbarians!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusIveWaitedLongSeeIts"
msgid "09840"
msgstr ""
"I've waited so long to see\n"
"what it's like inside Venus\n"
"Lighthouse, but...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09841"
msgstr ""
"I can't even move\n"
"without feeling terrible,\n"
"terrible pain.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusLighthouseHowHowDidTheyOpenThe"
msgid "09842"
msgstr ""
"How... How did they\n"
"open the door to\n"
"Venus Lighthouse?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusLighthouseTheyAreAlreadyHeadedForBabi"
msgid "09843"
msgstr ""
"They are already...\n"
"headed for{pause_20_skippable} Babi\n"
"Lighthouse...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusLighthouseBabisSoldiersAreAllColossoVictors"
msgid "09844"
msgstr ""
"Babi's soldiers are\n"
"all Colosso victors...{page_break}"
"How could anyone beat\n"
"all of us?\n"
"Who were they?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusLighthouseUhnnnIfOnlyICouldMove"
msgid "09845"
msgstr ""
"Uhnnn... If only I could\n"
"move...{page_break}"
"The lighthouse is open\n"
"at last, but{pause_20_skippable}{pause_20_skippable} at what\n"
"cost?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusLighthouseTheirPowersWereSoStrangeWho"
msgid "09846"
msgstr ""
"Their powers were so...\n"
"strange...\n"
"Who were they...?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusLighthouseIMustGetInsideVenusLighthouse"
msgid "09847"
msgstr ""
"I must get inside{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"Venus Lighthouse... Must\n"
"find the connection...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusLighthouseTheYoungBoySeemedToGlow"
msgid "09848"
msgstr ""
"The young boy seemed to\n"
"glow for an instant...{page_break}"
"Then the entrance to\n"
"Venus Lighthouse opened.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusLighthouseTheyWerentInVenusLighthouseVery"
msgid "09849"
msgstr ""
"They weren't in Venus\n"
"Lighthouse very long.{page_break}"
"They were heading north\n"
"toward Babi Lighthouse\n"
"when I last saw them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusLighthouseIThoughtIRecognizedOneOf"
msgid "09850"
msgstr ""
"I thought I recognized\n"
"one of them...{page_break}"
"An alchemist who served\n"
"Babi... Was it Kraden?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusLighthouseKradenToldThemToStopBut"
msgid "09851"
msgstr ""
"Kraden told them to stop,\n"
"but they attacked anyway.{page_break}"
"Attacking scholars...\n"
"how vicious!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusLighthouseKradenWentInsideButThenCame"
msgid "09852"
msgstr ""
"Kraden went inside, but\n"
"then came back and said\n"
"this isn't the entrance.{page_break}"
"But we've searched the\n"
"lighthouse, and there's\n"
"no other entrance.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusThoughtIdExploreAfterDoor"
msgid "09853"
msgstr ""
"I thought I'd explore\n"
"after the door opened.{page_break}"
"While I was searching\n"
"this room, Kraden and the\n"
"others appeared.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09854"
msgstr ""
"They did something to\n"
"the statue that made\n"
"the floor light up.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusLighthouseIfKradenHadntBeenThereWe"
msgid "09855"
msgstr ""
"If Kraden hadn't been\n"
"there, we surely would\n"
"have been killed.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusLighthouseKradenSaidSomethingAboutThisBeing"
msgid "09856"
msgstr ""
"Kraden said something\n"
"about this being the\n"
"exit...{page_break}"
"I wonder what he's\n"
"discovered...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusLighthouseIWonderWhatMysteriesTheStatue"
msgid "09857"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what mysteries\n"
"the statue holds...{page_break}"
"Kraden said the statue\n"
"indicated the true\n"
"path, but how?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusThereWordsCarvedIntoRelief"
msgid "09858"
msgstr ""
"There are words carved\n"
"into the relief...{page_break}"
"If ye seek to climb\n"
"Venus Lighthouse, first\n"
"seek the power within.{page_break}"
"To obtain this power, see\n"
"with the eyes of truth.\n"
"Then the way shall open.{page_break}"
"But the path I reveal is\n"
"not the beginning.{page_break}"
"The true beginning lies\n"
"down ancient pathways\n"
"on distant soils.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09859"
msgstr "="

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09860"
msgstr "="

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09861"
msgstr "="

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09862"
msgstr "="

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09863"
msgstr ""
"The true road can only\n"
"be known by he who bears\n"
"a true heart.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusStatueSpeaksIsaacSoulYe"
msgid "09864"
msgstr ""
"The statue speaks to\n"
"{actor_name:1}'s soul...{page_break}"
"Ye who seek to climb\n"
"Venus Lighthouse, I\n"
"shall grant thy wish.{page_break}"
"The path long closed\n"
"shall not be opened here.{page_break}"
"That path begins far,\n"
"far away, on the soil\n"
"of an ancient people,{page_break}"
"with the sunrise to\n"
"your left as you gaze\n"
"upon the lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTunnelRuinsStatueSpeaksIsaacSoulYe"
msgid "09865"
msgstr ""
"The statue speaks to\n"
"{actor_name:1}'s soul...{page_break}"
"Ye who seek to climb\n"
"Venus Lighthouse must\n"
"seek the lady's leave.{page_break}"
"Then the way shall open.\n"
"The lady will keep safe\n"
"at her feet{page_break}"
"the place that you seek\n"
"as she awaits your\n"
"arrival.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTunnelRuinsStatueSpeaksAfterAnswer"
msgid "09866"
msgstr ""
"The statue speaks to\n"
"{actor_name:1}'s soul...{page_break}"
"Ye who seek to climb\n"
"Venus Lighthouse, the\n"
"lady knows your desires.{page_break}"
"Here, your path shall\n"
"not be opened.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTunnelRuinsStatueSeemsSpeakYourSoul"
msgid "09867"
msgstr ""
"The statue seems to\n"
"speak to your soul...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTunnelRuinsRedShinesNorthwestOfMe"
msgid "09868"
msgstr ""
"Red shines\n"
"northwest\n"
"of me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTunnelRuinsYellowShinesNortheastOfMe"
msgid "09869"
msgstr ""
"Yellow shines\n"
"northeast\n"
"of me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTunnelRuinsRedShinesDueWestOfMe"
msgid "09870"
msgstr ""
"Red shines\n"
"due west\n"
"of me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTunnelRuinsVioletShinesSoutheastOfMe"
msgid "09871"
msgstr ""
"Violet shines\n"
"southeast\n"
"of me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgTunnelRuinsVioletPointsSoutheast"
msgid "09872"
msgstr ""
"Violet shines\n"
"southeast\n"
"of me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusHmmmWeCantPushBlock"
msgid "09873"
msgstr ""
"Hmmm. We can't push the\n"
"block farther than this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09874"
msgstr ""
"It'd be great if we\n"
"could carry that block and\n"
"drop it to the ground.{page_break}"
"Can our Psynergy help\n"
"us at all?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiSeemsLocked"
msgid "09875"
msgstr "It seems to be locked.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroMoreTolbisSoldiersLayDefeated"
msgid "09876"
msgstr ""
"More of Tolbi's soldiers\n"
"lay defeated...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09877"
msgstr ""
"Is this more of\n"
"their work?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09878"
msgstr ""
"That voice... It's\n"
"Iodem...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09879"
msgstr "You survived!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09880"
msgstr ""
"We suffered great\n"
"losses...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09881"
msgstr ""
"Were you fighting{pause_20_skippable} a\n"
"group of six people?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09882"
msgstr "There were...{pause_20_skippable}seven...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09883"
msgstr "You've survived as well!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09884"
msgstr ""
"There were seven? Is\n"
"this the same group you\n"
"were following before?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09885"
msgstr ""
"I'm certain of it.\n"
"One of them must have\n"
"been...{actor_name:7}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09886"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7}, you say...\n"
"Is this true!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09887"
msgstr ""
"The scholar Kraden was\n"
"protecting her. I'm\n"
"sure it was {actor_name:7}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09888"
msgstr ""
"Did you hear that, {actor_name:1}?\n"
"What do they want with\n"
"{actor_name:7}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09889"
msgstr "{actor_name:7}... They all...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09890"
msgstr ""
"Once they finished with\n"
"us, they headed for\n"
"Babi Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09891"
msgstr ""
"What do they hope to find\n"
"at Babi Lighthouse?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09892"
msgstr ""
"They spoke of the ruins{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"beneath the lighthouse...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09893"
msgstr ""
"Ruins? Of course!\n"
"The foundations of the\n"
"lighthouse!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09894"
msgstr ""
"And Faran, the master\n"
"of the Lalivero, followed\n"
"them into the ruins...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09895"
msgstr "I see. Faran, too...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09896"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}! We must head for\n"
"Babi Lighthouse as well.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09897"
msgstr ""
"Are you concerned\n"
"about these soldiers?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09898"
msgstr ""
"We're fine...\n"
"You must hurry to\n"
"the lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09899"
msgstr ""
"The lighthouse... {actor_name:7}...\n"
"If anything happens...\n"
"Just hurry...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09900"
msgstr ""
"Even the soldiers insist,\n"
"{actor_name:1}! Come on!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroUhhnnWeWereTakenBySurprise"
msgid "09901"
msgstr ""
"{text_effect:4}Uhhnn...{reset_text_style} We were\n"
"taken by surprise...{page_break}"
"But why...\n"
"{actor_name:7}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroTheyWereTerribleWeWereNo"
msgid "09902"
msgstr ""
"They were terrible!\n"
"We were no match...\n"
"They're horrible!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroOhhTheyTookShebaHeaded"
msgid "09903"
msgstr ""
"{text_effect:4}Ohh...{reset_text_style} They took {actor_name:7}\n"
"and headed for the\n"
"ruins.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroActorIsOurOnlyHopeIf"
msgid "09904"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} is our only hope.\n"
"If something happens to\n"
"her, Lalivero is finished.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroThisAllHappenedBecauseTolbiTook"
msgid "09905"
msgstr ""
"This all happened because\n"
"Tolbi took {actor_name:7}\n"
"away from us...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroFaranFollowedActorImSureHell"
msgid "09906"
msgstr ""
"Faran followed {actor_name:7}.\n"
"I'm sure he'll\n"
"rescue her.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroTheRumblingAtTheRuinsMust"
msgid "09907"
msgstr ""
"The rumbling at the\n"
"ruins must have been\n"
"a warning...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroThereWasAnEarthquakeAtThe"
msgid "09908"
msgstr ""
"There was an earthquake\n"
"at the ruins before\n"
"this happened.{page_break}"
"I wonder if {actor_name:7} and\n"
"the others are okay...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroIfIWereBiggerIWould"
msgid "09909"
msgstr ""
"If I were bigger, I\n"
"would have saved\n"
"{actor_name:7} myself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroIBetActorCanUseHer"
msgid "09910"
msgstr ""
"I bet {actor_name:7} can use\n"
"her powers to escape\n"
"them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseWeHaventBeenOrderedToStart"
msgid "09911"
msgstr ""
"We haven't been ordered\n"
"to start working yet...\n"
"Do we get today off?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseThereWereStrangeFolkGoingTo"
msgid "09912"
msgstr ""
"There were strange folk\n"
"going to the ruins...\n"
"Faran followed them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseItsOddThatBabiWouldBuild"
msgid "09913"
msgstr ""
"It's odd that Babi would\n"
"build a lighthouse in\n"
"a place like this.{page_break}"
"Maybe he thought\n"
"using the ruins as the\n"
"foundation would be easy.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseCuttingTheseStonesAndStackingThem"
msgid "09914"
msgstr ""
"Cutting these stones and\n"
"stacking them on the\n"
"ruins isn't easy.{page_break}"
"Build it faster, you\n"
"say? Try building it\n"
"yourself, then!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroIfOnlyTheyDidntHaveActor"
msgid "09915"
msgstr ""
"If only they didn't\n"
"have {actor_name:7}...{page_break}"
"But even without her\n"
"as a hostage, we couldn't\n"
"have beaten them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroTheyUsedFireOnUsThats"
msgid "09916"
msgstr ""
"They used fire on us!\n"
"That's just not right!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroCursesWeCouldntStopActorAnd"
msgid "09917"
msgstr ""
"Curses! We couldn't stop\n"
"{actor_name:7} and the others...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroWhatDoTheyPlanToDo"
msgid "09918"
msgstr ""
"What do they plan to do\n"
"with {actor_name:7} in the ruins...{page_break}"
"No... I must not\n"
"think such horrible\n"
"things...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroWeNeverShouldHaveLetTolbi"
msgid "09919"
msgstr ""
"We never should have\n"
"let Tolbi take {actor_name:7}\n"
"away from us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroFaranStillDoesNotReturnWhat"
msgid "09920"
msgstr ""
"Faran still does not\n"
"return... What could\n"
"be happening?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroWeHaveSeenManyOmensOf"
msgid "09921"
msgstr ""
"We have seen many omens\n"
"of bad things to come.{page_break}"
"We saw one when {actor_name:7}\n"
"was taken from Lalivero,\n"
"too...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroTheStonesWeStackedForThe"
msgid "09922"
msgstr ""
"The stones we stacked\n"
"for the lighthouse\n"
"won't fall, will they?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroITriedToStepInFront"
msgid "09923"
msgstr ""
"I tried to step in front\n"
"of them to save her...{page_break}"
"But my heart was\n"
"trembling...\n"
"I couldn't stop them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroTheyAllHaveALessonComing"
msgid "09924"
msgstr ""
"They all have a lesson\n"
"coming to them.{page_break}"
"They'll learn why {actor_name:7}\n"
"is called the holy\n"
"child of Lalivero!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseThereWasABigFightThat"
msgid "09925"
msgstr ""
"There was a big fight\n"
"that ended in some\n"
"hostages being taken.{page_break}"
"Tragic, I know, but\n"
"anything that gets me off\n"
"work can't be all bad!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseIfFaranWentAfterThemThen"
msgid "09926"
msgstr ""
"If Faran went after them,\n"
"then this is serious!{page_break}"
"If this keeps up, we\n"
"won't be able to\n"
"build the lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseWhyWouldTheyWantToRush"
msgid "09927"
msgstr ""
"Why would they want to\n"
"rush construction on\n"
"the lighthouse?{page_break}"
"Maybe they hope to rule\n"
"the seas and control\n"
"more distant lands...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseNowThatIThinkOfIt"
msgid "09928"
msgstr ""
"Now that I think of it,\n"
"we did find a strange\n"
"cave in the quarry.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsOfCourseIHaveSeenActor"
msgid "09929"
msgstr ""
"Of course I have seen\n"
"{actor_name:7}{possessive_suffix} power...\n"
"It's incredible!{page_break}"
"How could one with\n"
"such power ever be\n"
"taken hostage?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsThereAreSomeWhoDoNot"
msgid "09930"
msgstr ""
"There are some who do\n"
"not believe {actor_name:7}\n"
"has any powers...{page_break}"
"Doubting {actor_name:7}?\n"
"That is foolish!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsCouldFaranHaveTrickedUsAll"
msgid "09931"
msgstr ""
"Could Faran have\n"
"tricked us all?{page_break}"
"If {actor_name:7} does have mystic\n"
"powers, she couldn't have\n"
"been taken hostage.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsIfActorCantUseHerPowers"
msgid "09932"
msgstr ""
"If {actor_name:7} can't use her\n"
"powers in a time like\n"
"this, they're useless!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsActorCameFlyingToTheRuins"
msgid "09933"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} came flying to\n"
"the ruins like a\n"
"shooting star.{page_break}"
"She created a massive\n"
"depression in the\n"
"center of the ruins.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsEvenActorCouldntHaveEscapedSix"
msgid "09934"
msgstr ""
"Even {actor_name:7} couldn't\n"
"have escaped six of\n"
"them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsTheySayAManNamedIodem"
msgid "09935"
msgstr ""
"They say a man named\n"
"Iodem is coming from\n"
"Tolbi.{page_break}"
"I guess he plans to\n"
"make us do even\n"
"more work!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsNoOnesCalledMeSoMaybe"
msgid "09936"
msgstr ""
"No one's called me, so\n"
"maybe I'll take a nap...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsActorSaidTheCaveAtThe"
msgid "09937"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} said the cave\n"
"at the ruins leads\n"
"to the southeast.{page_break}"
"But it couldn't possibly\n"
"lead all the way to\n"
"Venus Lighthouse...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsTheRuinsThatFormTheLighthouse"
msgid "09938"
msgstr ""
"The ruins that form the\n"
"lighthouse foundation\n"
"are riddled with caves.{page_break}"
"If you could get through\n"
"the caves, I'm sure you'd\n"
"solve the ruins' riddle.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsWeReceivedActorFromTheSky"
msgid "09939"
msgstr ""
"We received {actor_name:7} from\n"
"the sky and raised her\n"
"lovingly...{page_break}"
"I know Faran will\n"
"rescue that child.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsIJustKnowThatFatherWill"
msgid "09940"
msgstr ""
"I just know that Father\n"
"will save my elder\n"
"sister, {actor_name:7}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsHisWifeSeemsVeryCalmConsidering"
msgid "09941"
msgstr ""
"His wife seems very calm,\n"
"considering.{page_break}"
"Deep down, she must be\n"
"worried about {actor_name:7}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsActorIfThePowerThatYou"
msgid "09942"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7}, if the power that you\n"
"showed us is real, then\n"
"please escape!{page_break}"
"If you don't, I...might\n"
"start to doubt that\n"
"power of yours.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsActorIsTheSaviorOfLalivero"
msgid "09943"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} is the savior\n"
"of Lalivero. There's no\n"
"mistake about it.{page_break}"
"I don't know of anyone\n"
"other than {actor_name:7} with\n"
"power like that.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsALegendarySaviorWillAppearIn"
msgid "09944"
msgstr ""
"A legendary savior\n"
"will appear in the sky...{page_break}"
"I was a fool for believing\n"
"that savior was {actor_name:7}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsIdLikeToBelieveInActor"
msgid "09945"
msgstr ""
"I'd like to believe in\n"
"{actor_name:7}...{page_break}"
"Please, {actor_name:7}, use your\n"
"power to escape from\n"
"them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsEvenThoughSheFellOutOf"
msgid "09946"
msgstr ""
"Even though she fell\n"
"out of the sky, she\n"
"wasn't even bruised!{page_break}"
"They can't hurt\n"
"{actor_name:7}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsIfSomethingHappensToActorWhat"
msgid "09947"
msgstr ""
"If something happens to\n"
"{actor_name:7}, what will become\n"
"of Lalivero?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsWhenIodemGetsHereHesGoing"
msgid "09948"
msgstr ""
"When Iodem gets here,\n"
"he's going to have\n"
"some explaining to do.{page_break}"
"I wonder if I should\n"
"flee Lalivero...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsItsBeenSoLongSinceI"
msgid "09949"
msgstr ""
"It's been so long since I\n"
"had a nap, I'd forgotten\n"
"how nice they are!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsIWonderHowActorKnewAbout"
msgid "09950"
msgstr ""
"I wonder how {actor_name:7}\n"
"knew about the caves\n"
"at the ruins?{page_break}"
"Her visions...\n"
"they can't be true.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsThoseCavesAreTooDangerousFor"
msgid "09951"
msgstr ""
"Those caves are too\n"
"dangerous for me to\n"
"explore.{page_break}"
"If only I were a warrior.\n"
"Then I'd go find the\n"
"treasure in the caves!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsItsSoPainfulToEvenThink"
msgid "09952"
msgstr ""
"It's so painful to\n"
"even think of anything\n"
"bad happening to {actor_name:7}.{page_break}"
"I would take her place\n"
"if I could.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsIJustWishSomeoneWouldPlease"
msgid "09953"
msgstr ""
"I just wish someone\n"
"would please rescue my\n"
"sister, {actor_name:7}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsThatCoupleRaisedActorAsThough"
msgid "09954"
msgstr ""
"That couple raised {actor_name:7}\n"
"as though she were\n"
"their own child.{page_break}"
"When someone like {actor_name:7}\n"
"is kidnapped, it worries\n"
"us all!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroTakenHostageFaran"
msgid "09955"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} was taken\n"
"hostage, and Faran\n"
"went after them?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09956"
msgstr ""
"Oh my! What's everyone\n"
"else in Lalivero doing?{page_break}"
"If I didn't have to\n"
"watch my shop, I'd go\n"
"rescue {actor_name:7} myself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09957"
msgstr ""
"What are you, a shut-in?\n"
"That's all anyone\n"
"has been talking about!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsTheLaliveransAreATimidPeople"
msgid "09958"
msgstr ""
"The Laliverans are a\n"
"timid people, so you can't\n"
"count on them here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroWarriorRightPlease"
msgid "09959"
msgstr ""
"You're a warrior, right?\n"
"Please rescue {actor_name:7}!{page_break}"
"I'll give you a discount\n"
"on my goods if you\n"
"rescue her.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsICantRescueActorIfI"
msgid "09960"
msgstr ""
"I can't  rescue {actor_name:7}!\n"
"If I only had courage...\n"
"Maybe then...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroGuessPeopleAngara"
msgid "09961"
msgstr ""
"I guess it was people\n"
"from Angara who took\n"
"{actor_name:7} hostage.{page_break}"
"Everyone knows that\n"
"continent is full of\n"
"thugs and barbarians.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsIfAnythingHappensToActorIll"
msgid "09962"
msgstr ""
"If anything happens to\n"
"{actor_name:7}...{page_break}"
"I'll never do business\n"
"with anyone from\n"
"Angara again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroWantStayLet"
msgid "09963"
msgstr ""
"If you want to stay, I'll\n"
"let you, because it\n"
"means money for me.{page_break}"
"But if you're a warrior...\n"
"You ought to be\n"
"rescuing {actor_name:7}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroImSorry"
msgid "09964"
msgstr "Oh, I'm sorry...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09965"
msgstr ""
"I'm so worried about\n"
"{actor_name:7}, I can't\n"
"concentrate.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09966"
msgstr ""
"But no matter how much\n"
"I worry, there isn't\n"
"anything I can do.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09967"
msgstr ""
"...Now, to work,\n"
"to work!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsWorkingLikeThisKeepsMyMind"
msgid "09968"
msgstr ""
"Working like this\n"
"keeps my mind occupied.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsWeMustObeyTolbiThatsWhat"
msgid "09969"
msgstr ""
"We must obey Tolbi...\n"
"That's what led to\n"
"this happening to {actor_name:7}.{page_break}"
"Babi is responsible\n"
"for all of it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsWhyDidThisHaveToHappen"
msgid "09970"
msgstr ""
"Why did this have to\n"
"happen to {actor_name:7}? If\n"
"only it were a dream.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsHousecleaningChangingSheetsItsAllDone"
msgid "09971"
msgstr ""
"Housecleaning...\n"
"changing sheets...\n"
"It's all done, right?{page_break}"
"I'm just not myself...\n"
"Sometimes I don't even\n"
"know what I'm doing...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsOnceThisIncidentIsOverI"
msgid "09972"
msgstr ""
"Once this incident is over,\n"
"I hope Tolbi's soldiers\n"
"all leave town...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09973"
msgstr ""
"You mustn't keep\n"
"me from my work!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroBabiIsntBuilding"
msgid "09974"
msgstr ""
"Babi isn't building a\n"
"lighthouse{em_dash}it's a\n"
"tower...{page_break}"
"Maybe he is trying to\n"
"elevate himself to\n"
"the level of the gods.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsIBetBabisTowerWillBe"
msgid "09975"
msgstr ""
"I bet Babi's tower\n"
"will be struck down!{page_break}"
"After all, \"pride\n"
"goeth before a fall!\"{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroBabisMostPreciousBelongingIsKept"
msgid "09976"
msgstr ""
"Babi's most precious\n"
"belonging is kept here.{page_break}"
"No one may enter!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroIWonderWhatBabisMostPrecious"
msgid "09977"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what Babi's\n"
"most precious\n"
"belonging is...{page_break}"
"If I don't even know, how\n"
"can I be interested\n"
"in guarding it?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseTheyWereTerribleWeWereAbsolutely"
msgid "09978"
msgstr ""
"They were{pause_20_skippable} terrible!\n"
"We were absolutely\n"
"no match for them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseOnlyTwoOfThoseSixEver"
msgid "09979"
msgstr ""
"Only two of those six\n"
"ever attacked anyone...{page_break}"
"but just those two\n"
"completely overwhelmed\n"
"us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseTheyJustKickedUsOutOf"
msgid "09980"
msgstr ""
"They just kicked us out\n"
"of their way and went\n"
"on to the lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseTheySetFireToEverythingThats"
msgid "09981"
msgstr ""
"They set fire to\n"
"everything! That's why the\n"
"ground is scorched.{page_break}"
"Using fire as a\n"
"weapon is so cowardly!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseWereTheOnesWhoAttackedBut"
msgid "09982"
msgstr ""
"We're the ones who\n"
"attacked, but we took\n"
"all the damage.{page_break}"
"What were we thinking,\n"
"trying to fight those\n"
"guys?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseTheOtherFourDidntSeemTo"
msgid "09983"
msgstr ""
"The other four didn't\n"
"seem to have any fight\n"
"left in them at all.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseWhatCouldTheyBePlanningFor"
msgid "09984"
msgstr ""
"What could they be\n"
"planning for\n"
"Babi Lighthouse?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseNoneOfThemHadAnyTorches"
msgid "09985"
msgstr ""
"None of them had\n"
"any torches.{page_break}"
"It's like that\n"
"fire just appeared\n"
"out of nowhere!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiYoureSureTheyWentThrough"
msgid "09986"
msgstr ""
"You're sure they went\n"
"through this door?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09987"
msgstr ""
"Yes, they opened the\n"
"stone door and entered!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09988"
msgstr "Well? Does the door open?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09989"
msgstr ""
"It's hopeless.\n"
"It won't budge...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09990"
msgstr ""
"Of course not!\n"
"I told you, this\n"
"door doesn't open!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09991"
msgstr ""
"If it did open, we would\n"
"have gone in long ago\n"
"to study the ruins.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09992"
msgstr ""
"But I'm certain they\n"
"went through this door!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09993"
msgstr ""
"And I'm saying no one\n"
"has ever gone through\n"
"here...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09994"
msgstr "Oh! Iodem...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09995"
msgstr "Faran!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09996"
msgstr ""
"I am{pause_20_skippable} so sorry about\n"
"{actor_name:7}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09997"
msgstr ""
"Why did this sort of\n"
"thing have to happen?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09998"
msgstr ""
"Are {actor_name:5} and the\n"
"others beyond\n"
"this door?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "09999"
msgstr ""
"Yes. Beyond the door\n"
"that no normal man\n"
"can open...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10000"
msgstr ""
"If they got through, then\n"
"we can, too. Right?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10001"
msgstr "Will you go for us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10002"
msgstr ""
"There is no one else\n"
"who can go after\n"
"them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10003"
msgstr ""
"Iodem, just who are\n"
"these people?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10004"
msgstr ""
"They come from the far\n"
"north.{page_break}"
"They have chased the ones\n"
"who took {actor_name:7} all\n"
"the way here.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10005"
msgstr ""
"They've been chasing that\n"
"fearsome group?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10006"
msgstr ""
"Yes. They are most\n"
"fearsome.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10007"
msgstr ""
"Such awful power... And\n"
"what they're trying to\n"
"do seems very dangerous.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10008"
msgstr ""
"We're the only ones who\n"
"can stop them.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10009"
msgstr ""
"You think you can\n"
"stop them?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10010"
msgstr ""
"You seem quite sure of\n"
"yourself, but what do you\n"
"think you can do?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10011"
msgstr ""
"Hmph! Not with that\n"
"attitude, you can't!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10012"
msgstr ""
"I have never heard such\n"
"harsh words from you,\n"
"Faran.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10013"
msgstr ""
"What do you expect when,\n"
"in the midst of such\n"
"dangers...{page_break}"
"you ask me to leave\n"
"{actor_name:7}'s fate in the\n"
"hands of children?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10014"
msgstr ""
"If you want me to trust\n"
"them, they must give me\n"
"reason to trust them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10015"
msgstr ""
"First, you will have to\n"
"demonstrate your\n"
"powers to us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10016"
msgstr ""
"Can you follow the same\n"
"paths that they took?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10017"
msgstr ""
"Your confidence means\n"
"nothing unless you show\n"
"that you can do it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10018"
msgstr ""
"Well, you have no choice...\n"
"You will have to try.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10019"
msgstr ""
"Iodem asks only that\n"
"you stand back\n"
"and watch.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10020"
msgstr ""
"Now, show me what you\n"
"can do.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseIAmCountingOnYouIsaac"
msgid "10021"
msgstr ""
"I am counting on you,\n"
"{actor_name:1}! Prove your worth\n"
"by opening that door!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseWhenISawThemTheyHad"
msgid "10022"
msgstr ""
"When I saw them, they\n"
"had already gone through\n"
"to the other side.{page_break}"
"It's the truth!\n"
"You have to believe me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseIAmSorryButNotEven"
msgid "10023"
msgstr ""
"I am sorry, but not even\n"
"{actor_name:7} has ever passed\n"
"through here.{page_break}"
"There is no way this\n"
"door will open.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseThisAllStartedWhenActorWas"
msgid "10024"
msgstr ""
"This all started when\n"
"{actor_name:7} was dragged\n"
"off to Tolbi.{page_break}"
"If anything happens to\n"
"{actor_name:7}, the good folk of\n"
"Lalivero won't sit idly by!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseIfYouCanOpenThisDoor"
msgid "10025"
msgstr ""
"If you can open this door,\n"
"I will trust Iodem once\n"
"more...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseIDoNotMeanToDoubt"
msgid "10026"
msgstr ""
"I do not mean to doubt\n"
"your abilities, {actor_name:1},\n"
"but I am very worried!{page_break}"
"If this door doesn't\n"
"open...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseNobodyThinksTheDoorCanBe"
msgid "10027"
msgstr ""
"Nobody thinks the door\n"
"can be opened, and I'm\n"
"starting to doubt myself.{page_break}"
"It's not like I\n"
"actually saw them go\n"
"through...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseIDontKnowWhatTheyreWaiting"
msgid "10028"
msgstr ""
"I don't know what they're\n"
"waiting for. If they're\n"
"going to open the door,{page_break}"
"they'd better\n"
"do it now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseThisIsAllAHugeWaste"
msgid "10029"
msgstr ""
"This is all a huge waste\n"
"of time!{page_break}"
"If we don't find\n"
"{actor_name:7} soon, her life\n"
"may be in danger...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseIHopeTheyCanOpenThe"
msgid "10030"
msgstr ""
"I hope they can open the\n"
"door, but I won't believe\n"
"it until I see it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiTheDoor"
msgid "10031"
msgstr "The door!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10032"
msgstr ""
"I don't believe it!\n"
"The door opened!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10033"
msgstr ""
"Incredible! It really\n"
"does open.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10034"
msgstr ""
"How in the world did you\n"
"open the door?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10035"
msgstr ""
"I don't know how to\n"
"explain it...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10036"
msgstr ""
"We did it because{pause_20_skippable}{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"we're us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10037"
msgstr ""
"It would take too long\n"
"to explain.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10038"
msgstr ""
"There's no time for\n"
"an explanation,\n"
"anyway.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10039"
msgstr ""
"That's right. We must\n"
"rescue {actor_name:7}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10040"
msgstr ""
"Let's go, Faran. We've\n"
"got to save {actor_name:7}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10041"
msgstr "Hey, the door's closing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10042"
msgstr "Why did it close?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10043"
msgstr ""
"I don't know...\n"
"Why does anything\n"
"close?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10044"
msgstr ""
"It closed to prevent\n"
"people with no Psynergy\n"
"from entering!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10045"
msgstr ""
"It would be perilous for\n"
"those without Psynergy to\n"
"try to get through.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10046"
msgstr ""
"I agree! You'll have\n"
"to let us handle it\n"
"from here!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10047"
msgstr ""
"What? You're telling us\n"
"to stay back?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10048"
msgstr ""
"Since we can't even open\n"
"the door, we'd just be\n"
"getting in your way.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10049"
msgstr ""
"It won't stop you, but if\n"
"we can't open the door,\n"
"we can't go with you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10050"
msgstr "This is true...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10051"
msgstr ""
"But we can't leave {actor_name:7}\n"
"in their hands just\n"
"because it's dangerous.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10052"
msgstr ""
"They have greater power\n"
"than you can even\n"
"imagine.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10053"
msgstr ""
"And without such power,\n"
"this door will not open\n"
"for us?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10054"
msgstr "That is how it seems.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10055"
msgstr ""
"The power they just\n"
"displayed is but a fraction\n"
"of their true might.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10056"
msgstr ""
"Without that sort of\n"
"power, we would just\n"
"get in their way.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10057"
msgstr ""
"I understand. {actor_name:7}'s\n"
"life is in your hands.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10058"
msgstr ""
"Do not fail us. You must\n"
"bring {actor_name:7} safely\n"
"back!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10059"
msgstr ""
"Make haste, {actor_name:1}.\n"
"All our hopes lie with\n"
"you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseIBegOfYouIsaacPlease"
msgid "10060"
msgstr ""
"I beg of you, {actor_name:1}.\n"
"Please bring {actor_name:7}\n"
"back!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseICantBelieveThisDoorActually"
msgid "10061"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe this\n"
"door actually opened!\n"
"What are you?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseItTakesGreatCourageToContinue"
msgid "10062"
msgstr ""
"It takes great courage\n"
"to continue on in the\n"
"face of danger...{page_break}"
"We will be here\n"
"awaiting your safe\n"
"return.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseImVeryInterestedInWhatLies"
msgid "10063"
msgstr ""
"I'm very interested in\n"
"what lies beyond here.{page_break}"
"I know! Once this is\n"
"over, I'll go see\n"
"for myself!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseIAmNotAfraidOfDanger"
msgid "10064"
msgstr ""
"I am not afraid of\n"
"danger, but I do not\n"
"want to hinder you.{page_break}"
"I am counting on you\n"
"to save {actor_name:7} for us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseIfAnythingHappensToActorTolbi"
msgid "10065"
msgstr ""
"If anything happens to\n"
"{actor_name:7}, Tolbi will become\n"
"Lalivero's sworn enemy.{page_break}"
"That must be\n"
"prevented at all costs.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseIfThisDoorOpensMaybeWe"
msgid "10066"
msgstr ""
"If this door opens, maybe\n"
"we can get into other\n"
"parts of the ruins too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseIBetTheMonstersAroundHere"
msgid "10067"
msgstr ""
"I bet the monsters around\n"
"here are nothing\n"
"like what lies ahead!{page_break}"
"I'm happy to leave such\n"
"dangers to these\n"
"warriors.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseThisIsABigWasteOf"
msgid "10068"
msgstr ""
"This is a big waste\n"
"of time...{page_break}"
"{actor_name:7}'s life is in\n"
"danger! If they don't\n"
"find her soon...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiLighthouseIDontWantToHinderActors"
msgid "10069"
msgstr ""
"I don't want to hinder\n"
"{actor_name:7}'s rescue!{page_break}"
"From here on out,\n"
"I'm leaving everything\n"
"to these warriors...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgBabiTruthDoorOpenThoseSeeing"
msgid "10070"
msgstr ""
"The truth of this door\n"
"is open to those seeing\n"
"with their true heart.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusLongLastTime"
msgid "10071"
msgstr ""
"At long last, the time\n"
"has come to light Venus\n"
"Lighthouse's beacon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10072"
msgstr ""
"With the second beacon\n"
"lit, only two will remain.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10073"
msgstr ""
"No. Lighting Jupiter is\n"
"virtually the same as\n"
"lighting Mars.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10074"
msgstr ""
"That is true. Jupiter is\n"
"really all that remains.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10075"
msgstr ""
"That's right. Your dreams\n"
"are within your grasp\n"
"now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10076"
msgstr ""
"Why are you still here,\n"
"{actor_name:5}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10077"
msgstr ""
"I thought I ordered you\n"
"on ahead to the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10078"
msgstr ""
"I've already sent\n"
"{actor_name:6} and the others to\n"
"the dock at Idejima.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10079"
msgstr ""
"Then why did you come\n"
"back?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10080"
msgstr ""
"Because I have a\n"
"different promise to\n"
"keep.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10081"
msgstr "A promise, you say?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10082"
msgstr "You must mean {actor_name:7}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10083"
msgstr ""
"Yes, {actor_name:7}. Why haven't\n"
"you released her yet?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10084"
msgstr ""
"You promised to free\n"
"her once you got into\n"
"Venus Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10085"
msgstr ""
"And that's what brought\n"
"you back here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10086"
msgstr ""
"You promised not to\n"
"involve anyone who wasn't\n"
"related to this matter.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10087"
msgstr "{actor_name:7} is special.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10088"
msgstr "Of course...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10089"
msgstr ""
"Because {actor_name:7} is a\n"
"special Adept?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10090"
msgstr ""
"You guys learned\n"
"something from the\n"
"first two lighthouses.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10091"
msgstr "And what would that be?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10092"
msgstr ""
"In order to enter each\n"
"lighthouse, you needed an\n"
"Adept of that clan.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10093"
msgstr ""
"Right now, we have Fire,\n"
"Earth, and Water Adepts,{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"but no Wind Adept.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10094"
msgstr ""
"That does seem{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"to be the case.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10095"
msgstr ""
"Do we need {actor_name:7} to\n"
"get into the Jupiter\n"
"Lighthouse?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10096"
msgstr ""
"I'm sorry, {actor_name:5}, but we\n"
"cannot even enter without\n"
"a Wind Adept.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10097"
msgstr ""
"That being the case, I\n"
"guess I understand why\n"
"you can't set {actor_name:7} free.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10098"
msgstr ""
"It seems that you, too,\n"
"have learned something.{page_break}"
"If that is all, then\n"
"you should go, {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10099"
msgstr ""
"No. I cannot leave\n"
"{actor_name:7} behind!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10100"
msgstr ""
"I'm taking {actor_name:7}\n"
"to the ship!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10101"
msgstr ""
"What are you talking\n"
"about, {actor_name:5}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10102"
msgstr ""
"We don't know what will\n"
"happen when you light this\n"
"beacon.{page_break}"
"I won't leave {actor_name:7}\n"
"here to find out!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10103"
msgstr ""
"We told you that we'd\n"
"protect {actor_name:7}. Don't\n"
"you trust us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10104"
msgstr ""
"That's not what I'm\n"
"saying...{pause_20_skippable} It's just\n"
"best to be safe.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10105"
msgstr ""
"Don't tell us what's\n"
"best, {actor_name:5}. You're\n"
"not taking {actor_name:7}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10106"
msgstr ""
"Why not?{pause_20_skippable}{pause_20_skippable} What?{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"You don't trust me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10107"
msgstr ""
"How can we, after you\n"
"just demanded we free\n"
"{actor_name:7}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10108"
msgstr ""
"If we had trusted you\n"
"a moment ago, {actor_name:7}\n"
"would be free now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10109"
msgstr ""
"Come with me, {actor_name:7}!\n"
"I shall protect you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10110"
msgstr ""
"Are you ready to do\n"
"this, even though it\n"
"means fighting us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10111"
msgstr ""
"...I believe he is!{page_break}"
"He would not have\n"
"defied us if he lacked\n"
"the will to fight.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10112"
msgstr ""
"If it means protecting\n"
"{actor_name:7} from harm,\n"
"then I must.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10113"
msgstr ""
"You have seen what\n"
"we can do. You know\n"
"you can't stop us.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10114"
msgstr ""
"How can you protect\n"
"{actor_name:7}{pause_20_skippable}, when you can't\n"
"even protect yourself?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10115"
msgstr ""
"This rebellious attitude\n"
"is exactly why we've\n"
"never let you fight.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10116"
msgstr ""
"Haven't you been given\n"
"enough reason to fear\n"
"us in these travels?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10117"
msgstr ""
"You're no fighter, {actor_name:5}.\n"
"How can you hope to\n"
"stand against us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10118"
msgstr ""
"You've questioned us for\n"
"the last time!{pause_20_skippable} Let's see\n"
"what you can do!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10119"
msgstr ""
"It looks like they're\n"
"having a falling out\n"
"over {actor_name:7}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10120"
msgstr ""
"There's something more\n"
"to it, though...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10121"
msgstr ""
"It seems Saturos and\n"
"Menardi no longer\n"
"trust {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10122"
msgstr ""
"Looks like the perfect\n"
"opportunity has just\n"
"fallen into our laps!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10123"
msgstr ""
"Now's our only chance to\n"
"prevent them from\n"
"lighting the beacon!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10124"
msgstr ""
"There's not a moment to\n"
"spare!{pause_20_skippable} Let's move!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10125"
msgstr ""
"Don't chicken out now!\n"
"If we hesitate, they'll\n"
"light the beacon!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusIsaac"
msgid "10126"
msgstr "{actor_name:1}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10127"
msgstr ""
"So!{pause_20_skippable} You've come\n"
"to stop us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10128"
msgstr ""
"Look what your defiance\n"
"has brought us, {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10129"
msgstr ""
"I don't need you or\n"
"anyone to rescue\n"
"me, {actor_name:1}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10130"
msgstr ""
"I was just about to\n"
"settle things with\n"
"Saturos and Menardi...{page_break}"
"You can watch!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10131"
msgstr ""
"And then we'll show you\n"
"the true power of this\n"
"beacon's light!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10132"
msgstr ""
"But...{actor_name:7} has\n"
"nothing to do with this!\n"
"So set {actor_name:7} free!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10133"
msgstr ""
"Silence!{pause_20_skippable} You'd best tread\n"
"lightly, {actor_name:5}, or both\n"
"you and {actor_name:7} will suffer!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10134"
msgstr ""
"If anything happens\n"
"to {actor_name:7}, we will have\n"
"failed Faran...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10135"
msgstr ""
"We won't permit you\n"
"to lay a hand on\n"
"{actor_name:7} or {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10136"
msgstr ""
"Oh ho! So you're\n"
"worried about {actor_name:7},\n"
"too?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10137"
msgstr ""
"Don't worry. We won't\n"
"hurt {actor_name:7}...{pause_20_skippable}if you\n"
"meet our conditions.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10138"
msgstr ""
"What are you doing,\n"
"Saturos?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10139"
msgstr "Leave this to me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10140"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7}!{pause_20_skippable} Do you\n"
"remember the rod\n"
"connected to Hesperia?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10141"
msgstr "The Rod of Hesperia?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10142"
msgstr ""
"The rod required to\n"
"reach the Jupiter\n"
"Lighthouse!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10143"
msgstr "Ye{pause_20_skippable}-Yes...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10144"
msgstr ""
"Those who pursue us\n"
"bear a rod...\n"
"Is it the one?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10145"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7}! Stay where you\n"
"are! You can do it\n"
"from there!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10146"
msgstr "How about it, {actor_name:7}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10147"
msgstr "Well, {actor_name:7}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10148"
msgstr ""
".{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}Perhaps"
"{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10149"
msgstr ""
"\"Perhaps...\"{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"Perhaps what!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10150"
msgstr "Don't yell at her!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10151"
msgstr ""
"We're not yelling!{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"We just want a\n"
"straight answer.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10152"
msgstr "So, {actor_name:7}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10153"
msgstr ""
"Their minds are veiled.\n"
"I cannot see clearly...{pause_20_skippable}but\n"
"I think...{pause_20_skippable}it's the one.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10154"
msgstr ""
"It's a waste to\n"
"make her try again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10155"
msgstr "So, what do we do?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10156"
msgstr ""
"Do you know the terms\n"
"we will require before we\n"
"agree not to harm {actor_name:7}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10157"
msgstr ""
"You're smarter than\n"
"I thought if you've\n"
"already figured it out.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10158"
msgstr ""
"I want the rod that\n"
"will get us into\n"
"Jupiter Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10159"
msgstr ""
"If you give us the\n"
"Shaman's Rod, {actor_name:7} will\n"
"not be harmed. Agreed?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10160"
msgstr ""
"The Shaman's Rod?{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"If it means saving {actor_name:7},\n"
"I will give it to you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10161"
msgstr ""
"He wants the Shaman's\n"
"Rod. If it will save\n"
"{actor_name:7}, I'll give it up.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10162"
msgstr ""
"What?{pause_20_skippable} But Hammet gave\n"
"that to you, {actor_name:3}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10163"
msgstr ""
"Don't you care\n"
"what happens to\n"
"{actor_name:7}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10164"
msgstr ""
"Then you will give\n"
"us {text_effect:2}the rod!{reset_text_style}{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10165"
msgstr ""
"Well done, Saturos!\n"
"We finally have\n"
"the Shaman's Rod!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10166"
msgstr "Go get it, {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10167"
msgstr "Why me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10168"
msgstr ""
"To ensure your\n"
"loyalty to us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10169"
msgstr "Go on, {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusIsaacHandedOverShamansRod"
msgid "10170"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1} handed over\n"
"the Shaman's Rod.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10171"
msgstr ""
"What should I do\n"
"with the rod?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10172"
msgstr "Keep it safe!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10173"
msgstr ""
"Where do you think\n"
"you're going, {actor_name:7}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10174"
msgstr ""
"We gave you the rod.\n"
"Now, release {actor_name:7}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10175"
msgstr ""
"Whatever do\n"
"you mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10176"
msgstr ""
"You said you'd free\n"
"{actor_name:7} if we gave\n"
"you the rod.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10177"
msgstr "Those{pause_20_skippable} were your terms.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10178"
msgstr ""
"We gave you the rod,\n"
"so release {actor_name:7}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10179"
msgstr ""
"You seem to have{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"misunderstood. I said we\n"
"wouldn't harm {actor_name:7}...{page_break}"
"but I never said\n"
"we'd let her go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10180"
msgstr ""
"You're altering the\n"
"bargain?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10181"
msgstr ""
"Ha ha! We can't help it\n"
"if you misinterpreted\n"
"Saturos's terms!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10182"
msgstr ""
"Besides, if we were to\n"
"release {actor_name:7}, she'd\n"
"be in quite a fix.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10183"
msgstr "What do you mean?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10184"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} can't get\n"
"back to Lalivero\n"
"alone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10185"
msgstr ""
"What do you mean? We're\n"
"going to take{pause_20_skippable} "
"{actor_name:7}.{pause_20_skippable}.{pause_20_skippable}.\n"
"Oh no...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10186"
msgstr ""
"That's right.{pause_20_skippable} You\n"
"won't be going back.\n"
"This is it for you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10187"
msgstr "Excuse me?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10188"
msgstr ""
"Enough!{pause_20_skippable} You're the\n"
"ones who aren't going\n"
"anywhere!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10189"
msgstr ""
"Bring it on, whelp! You\n"
"won't live long enough to\n"
"regret your stupidity!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10190"
msgstr ""
"Prepare to experience\n"
"first-hand the horror\n"
"of a master Fire Adept!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusBeatEm"
msgid "10191"
msgstr ""
"We did it!\n"
"We beat 'em!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10192"
msgstr ""
"All right, {actor_name:7}...{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"Let's go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10193"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5}! What are\n"
"you doing?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10194"
msgstr ""
"I cannot give up\n"
"{actor_name:7}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10195"
msgstr ""
"What!?{pause_20_skippable} But we just\n"
"saved you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10196"
msgstr ""
"I never asked you\n"
"to help us...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10197"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5}, you're not one\n"
"of them. You're free to\n"
"go now...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10198"
msgstr ""
"So why are you\n"
"doing this?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10199"
msgstr ""
"The four beacons must\n"
"still be lit...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10200"
msgstr ""
"You're going to light\n"
"the beacons!? That's\n"
"ridiculous!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10201"
msgstr ""
"I felt you'd say that.{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"But{pause_20_skippable} I'm going to do it\n"
"anyway!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10202"
msgstr ""
"So, wait... If he means to\n"
"light the beacons, then\n"
"he's our enemy, right?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10203"
msgstr ""
"Do what you will, {actor_name:1},{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"but if you try to stop\n"
"me, I'll fight you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10204"
msgstr ""
"Friend or enemy, you\n"
"won't stop me from taking\n"
"{actor_name:7} with me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10205"
msgstr ""
"I hope{pause_20_skippable} you don't\n"
"think{pause_20_skippable} you've\n"
"finished us off.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10206"
msgstr ""
"You may not be\n"
"finished, but you\n"
"can barely stand.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10207"
msgstr ""
"Right now, {pause_20_skippable}yes...{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"But we'll be back\n"
"on our feet...{page_break}"
"as soon as we do\n"
"{pause_20_skippable}{pause_20_skippable}THIS!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10208"
msgstr ""
"Oh, no!{pause_20_skippable} He threw\n"
"the Elemental Star\n"
"into the lighthouse!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10209"
msgstr ""
"How could this happen...\n"
"We couldn't keep them\n"
"from lighting the beacon!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10210"
msgstr "That's not all...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10211"
msgstr ""
"The energy of the\n"
"beacon will restore\n"
"our power.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10212"
msgstr ""
"How can it restore\n"
"their power? Venus is the\n"
"earth elemental, right?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10213"
msgstr ""
"Then why would Venus\n"
"give power to Fire\n"
"Adepts?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10214"
msgstr ""
"Have you forgotten\n"
"everything we've learned?\n"
"Venus is earth.{page_break}"
"It shouldn't be a\n"
"source of power\n"
"for Fire Adepts!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10215"
msgstr ""
"Fire and earth share{pause_20_skippable} a\n"
"symbiotic relationship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10216"
msgstr ""
"This light will restore\n"
"our Psynergy!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10217"
msgstr ""
"We'll fight you as many\n"
"times as it takes.\n"
"We won't lose.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10218"
msgstr ""
"You may have beaten\n"
"the two of us...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10219"
msgstr ""
"But{pause_20_skippable} now, you face the\n"
"true might of Fire\n"
"Clan of the north!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10220"
msgstr ""
"Fire Clan of\n"
"the north?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10221"
msgstr ""
"Bear witness to the\n"
"true strength of the\n"
"northern wilds!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10222"
msgstr ""
"Oh, give it up!\n"
"We beat you once,\n"
"we'll do it again!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10223"
msgstr ""
"Go, {actor_name:5}!\n"
"Take {actor_name:7} and go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10224"
msgstr "I can...{pause_20_skippable}go?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10225"
msgstr ""
"We may not have the\n"
"strength to protect {actor_name:7}\n"
"after this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10226"
msgstr ""
"You must take {actor_name:7} to\n"
"the ship without fail!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10227"
msgstr ""
"What are you waiting for?\n"
"Go! Now!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10228"
msgstr ""
"No. I cannot leave\n"
"you to fight them\n"
"alone.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10229"
msgstr ""
"Are you saying you\n"
"don't want to lose to\n"
"{actor_name:1}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10230"
msgstr ""
"I wonder if\n"
"that's true...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10231"
msgstr "What was that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10232"
msgstr ""
"Wouldn't you be just a\n"
"little sad to see your\n"
"childhood friend perish?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10233"
msgstr "What are you saying?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10234"
msgstr ""
"I'm saying you're\n"
"here to protect this\n"
"brat from your past.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10235"
msgstr ""
"Do you really think\n"
"that I{pause_20_skippable} would help\n"
"them?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10236"
msgstr ""
"Let's just say that\n"
"I wouldn't put it\n"
"past you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10237"
msgstr ""
"And you, Saturos?{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"Do you agree?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10238"
msgstr ""
"I wouldn't say that...{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"But it would be best not\n"
"to raise our suspicion.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10239"
msgstr ""
"Now, who's telling whom\n"
"what's best? Fine! I'll\n"
"take {actor_name:7} for you!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10240"
msgstr "Come on,{pause_20_skippable} {actor_name:7}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10241"
msgstr ""
"Wait, {actor_name:5}! I won't\n"
"let you go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10242"
msgstr ""
"Heh heh... {actor_name:5} is the\n"
"least of your worries\n"
"right now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10243"
msgstr "Oh my{em_dash}{pause_20_skippable}they're glowing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10244"
msgstr ""
"It's time you learned{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"what true power is!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10245"
msgstr ""
"Their Psynergy is\n"
"overflowing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10246"
msgstr ""
"Hya ha ha!{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"It's too late\n"
"to run!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10247"
msgstr ""
"Uh-oh...\n"
"They're fusing!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10248"
msgstr ""
"They've merged into one\n"
"another! Everyone\n"
"get back!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusPairDefeated"
msgid "10249"
msgstr ""
"How...{pause_20_skippable} How...\n"
"did we lose?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10250"
msgstr ""
"We are superior in\n"
"every way{pause_20_skippable}, but still\n"
"we were defeated...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10251"
msgstr "We did it! We won!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10252"
msgstr ""
"We beat them...{pause_20_skippable}but have\n"
"we really won?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10253"
msgstr ""
"Even though we couldn't\n"
"stop the beacon from\n"
"being lit?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10254"
msgstr ""
"All our efforts were\n"
"for naught.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10255"
msgstr ""
"What are you\n"
"talking about?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10256"
msgstr ""
"We did everything\n"
"we could!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10257"
msgstr ""
"Sure we couldn't save\n"
"the Venus Lighthouse,\n"
"but...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10258"
msgstr ""
"We beat them! They're\n"
"gone! You saw them fall\n"
"down into the pit...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10259"
msgstr ""
"So we don't have to\n"
"worry about any more\n"
"beacons being lit!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10260"
msgstr ""
"But {actor_name:5} is gone,\n"
"and he's taken {actor_name:7}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10261"
msgstr ""
"What's with you guys?\n"
"{actor_name:1}... What are you\n"
"lookin' at?!?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10262"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10263"
msgstr "Did you{pause_20_skippable}{pause_20_skippable} finish them?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10264"
msgstr ""
"No one knew their power\n"
"better than I did.\n"
"If you destroyed them...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10265"
msgstr ""
"Then I am no match\n"
"for you now, {actor_name:1}...{page_break}"
"I must go...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10266"
msgstr "Come, {actor_name:7}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10267"
msgstr "Wait, {actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10268"
msgstr "Why do you run from us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10269"
msgstr ""
"They fell into the\n"
"lighthouse. It's all\n"
"over!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10270"
msgstr ""
"Poor fools...{pause_20_skippable} If you think\n"
"it's over, you are\n"
"sadly mistaken!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10271"
msgstr ""
"If you plan to light the\n"
"other beacons, you will\n"
"still need...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10272"
msgstr ""
"The Elemental Stars?\n"
"We have them!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10273"
msgstr ""
"They're gone, {actor_name:5}!\n"
"You don't have to light\n"
"the beacons anymore...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10274"
msgstr ""
"Yes, I do.{pause_20_skippable} If I don't\n"
"light the beacons...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10275"
msgstr "What will happen?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10276"
msgstr ""
"It's no use talking\n"
"about it...{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"Just wait and see!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10277"
msgstr ""
"If you won't release\n"
"{actor_name:7}, we'll have\n"
"to take her back!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10278"
msgstr "The lighthouse...!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10279"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}!{pause_20_skippable} They're too\n"
"far away! We can't reach\n"
"{actor_name:5}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10280"
msgstr ""
"That's not all! There's\n"
"light coming from\n"
"down below!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusNoooo"
msgid "10281"
msgstr "Noooo!{pause_20_skippable} {actor_name:7}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10282"
msgstr ""
"Hold on, {actor_name:7}!\n"
"Take my hand!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10283"
msgstr "I can't...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10284"
msgstr ""
"You must try!\n"
"If you don't,\n"
"you'll fall!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10285"
msgstr ""
"Look down...{pause_20_skippable}{pause_20_skippable} The\n"
"foundations of the\n"
"lighthouse are crumbling!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusWhyHappeningProtectVenusLighthouse"
msgid "10286"
msgstr ""
"Why is this happening?\n"
"Is it to protect\n"
"Venus Lighthouse?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10287"
msgstr ""
"I'm{pause_20_skippable} "
"slipping...{pause_20_skippable}{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"I can't{pause_20_skippable}{pause_20_skippable} hold on{pause_20_skippable} "
"any longer.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10288"
msgstr ""
"Nooo!{pause_20_skippable} Don't let go!\n"
"You can't! You'll...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10289"
msgstr ""
"Good-bye, {actor_name:5},\n"
"{pause_20_skippable}{pause_20_skippable}and thank you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10290"
msgstr ""
"{text_effect:2}{actor_name:7}!!!{reset_text_style}{pause_20_skippable} No!\n"
"I won't let you die!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10291"
msgstr "!!!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10292"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} fell after that\n"
"last tremor...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10293"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} didn't dive into\n"
"the sea after her,\n"
"did he?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10294"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe he\n"
"did that from so\n"
"high up!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10295"
msgstr ""
"You idiot, {actor_name:5}!{pause_20_skippable} I can't\n"
"believe he said he'd\n"
"light the other beacons.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10296"
msgstr ""
"We would have had to\n"
"fight him if this hadn't\n"
"happened...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10297"
msgstr ""
"But he sacrificed\n"
"himself to save {actor_name:7}.\n"
"He's not like Saturos.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10298"
msgstr ""
"I'm at a loss, {actor_name:1}.\n"
"We have to decide\n"
"what to do next.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10299"
msgstr ""
"What to do?{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"What {text_effect:2}can{reset_text_style} we do?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10300"
msgstr ""
"What about {actor_name:6} and\n"
"the others at Idejima?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10301"
msgstr ""
"Oh yeah!{pause_20_skippable} I completely\n"
"forgot about {actor_name:6}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10302"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}! Listen up!{pause_20_skippable} We've\n"
"got to find {actor_name:6}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10303"
msgstr ""
"Look at that!{pause_20_skippable} {actor_name:1}\n"
"has finally come back\n"
"to his senses!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10304"
msgstr ""
"Shouldn't we go find\n"
"{actor_name:6} and the others\n"
"right away?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10305"
msgstr ""
"It's about time you\n"
"started agreeing with\n"
"me!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10306"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}, you'll have to tell\n"
"{actor_name:6} about {actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10307"
msgstr ""
"I know it will be hard,\n"
"but you'll be there to\n"
"comfort her.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10308"
msgstr ""
"After all this, you don't\n"
"have the guts to tell\n"
"{actor_name:6} about {actor_name:5}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10309"
msgstr ""
"If you don't tell her\n"
"what happened to {actor_name:5},\n"
"then who will?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10310"
msgstr ""
"You're going to have\n"
"to find a way to\n"
"console {actor_name:6}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10311"
msgstr "What's the matter, {actor_name:2}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10312"
msgstr ""
"I was just thinkin'...{pause_20_skippable}{pause_20_skippable}\n"
"How the heck are we\n"
"supposed to get down?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10313"
msgstr ""
"Good point.{pause_20_skippable} This is\n"
"going to make leaving\n"
"very difficult...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10314"
msgstr "It's back to normal!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10315"
msgstr ""
"That was odd...\n"
"What's going on\n"
"around here?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10316"
msgstr ""
"I don't think we'll\n"
"ever know.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10317"
msgstr ""
"At least now, we can\n"
"go search for {actor_name:6}\n"
"and the others.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10318"
msgstr ""
"All right{pause_20_skippable}, let's go,\n"
"{actor_name:1}!{pause_20_skippable} It's time to find\n"
"{actor_name:6}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgVenusDespiteLongTiring"
msgid "10319"
msgstr ""
"But despite a long and\n"
"tiring search, {actor_name:6} was\n"
"nowhere to be found.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroHowDidSearchForSheba"
msgid "10320"
msgstr ""
"How did the search for\n"
"{actor_name:7} turn out?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10321"
msgstr ""
"We were{pause_20_skippable} unable to\n"
"find any sign of her.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10322"
msgstr ""
"The seas are too rough\n"
"to search.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10323"
msgstr ""
"And there's no sign\n"
"of her on land...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10324"
msgstr ""
"Tolbi is responsible for\n"
"{actor_name:7}'s fate.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10325"
msgstr ""
"No apology can reflect\n"
"the sorrow I feel at\n"
"your loss, Faran...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10326"
msgstr ""
"All we can do for\n"
"{actor_name:7} now is...\n"
"hope.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10327"
msgstr ""
"But tell me, what of\n"
"{actor_name:6} and the\n"
"others?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10328"
msgstr ""
"The same. We've searched\n"
"all over, but they're\n"
"nowhere to be found.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10329"
msgstr ""
"The ground tore apart\n"
"from the shock of the\n"
"lighthouse, and the ship...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10330"
msgstr ""
"Apparently, everything at\n"
"Idejima, including the\n"
"ship, was swept away...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10331"
msgstr ""
"So, Idejima itself\n"
"was washed out\n"
"to sea?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10332"
msgstr ""
"Incredible... Then the\n"
"cave, too, has been\n"
"flooded?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10333"
msgstr ""
"But we think {actor_name:6}\n"
"and the others are\n"
"still alive.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10334"
msgstr ""
"They may have been\n"
"washed out to sea\n"
"with Idejima.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10335"
msgstr ""
"We have decided to\n"
"continue searching for\n"
"{actor_name:6}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10336"
msgstr ""
"Haven't we,\n"
"{actor_name:1}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroDoNotWorryAboutSheba"
msgid "10337"
msgstr ""
"Do not worry about\n"
"{actor_name:7}. I just hope you\n"
"are able to find {actor_name:6}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10338"
msgstr ""
"You need not worry about\n"
"{actor_name:7}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10339"
msgstr ""
"We will find {actor_name:7}\n"
"without fail...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10340"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} has been in\n"
"dangerous situations\n"
"before and lived.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10341"
msgstr ""
"But this time, I believe\n"
"it was nothing short\n"
"of a miracle...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10342"
msgstr ""
"Who knew the sea would\n"
"rise up to the lighthouse\n"
"just as she fell?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10343"
msgstr ""
"Can you really call\n"
"that a miracle?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10344"
msgstr ""
"Do you think it was just\n"
"good luck?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10345"
msgstr ""
"Let's call it mere\n"
"coincidence, for now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10346"
msgstr ""
"Nothing is coincidental\n"
"when it comes to this\n"
"child.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10347"
msgstr ""
"So, you believe...\n"
"{actor_name:7} survived...?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10348"
msgstr "Yes. I am sure of it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10349"
msgstr ""
"Just because {actor_name:7}\n"
"...was an Adept?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10350"
msgstr ""
"An Adept...\n"
"What is that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10351"
msgstr "Well, it's...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10352"
msgstr ""
"It's someone with abilities\n"
"like theirs.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10353"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}, you and your\n"
"friends are truly amazing.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10354"
msgstr ""
"You were able to enter\n"
"the ancient ruins and get\n"
"to Venus Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10355"
msgstr ""
"But {actor_name:7} was\n"
"different. She couldn't\n"
"enter the ruins.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10356"
msgstr ""
"That's just because\n"
"{actor_name:7}'s abilities\n"
"are different from theirs.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10357"
msgstr ""
"No matter how many times\n"
"I explain that to Faran...\n"
"He doesn't get it!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10358"
msgstr "{actor_name:2}, don't be rude...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10359"
msgstr ""
"Unfortunately, we don't\n"
"have time to talk.\n"
"We've got to go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10360"
msgstr ""
"That's right. I didn't\n"
"mean to keep you...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10361"
msgstr ""
"That didn't come\n"
"out right...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10362"
msgstr ""
"We mean that while we're\n"
"talking, {actor_name:6} and the\n"
"others are lost at sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10363"
msgstr ""
"I understand your\n"
"desire to leave as\n"
"soon as possible.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10364"
msgstr ""
"The seas have been very\n"
"rough since the beacon\n"
"was lit. Be careful!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10365"
msgstr "You, too. Farewell.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10366"
msgstr ""
"Take care...\n"
"and farewell!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10367"
msgstr ""
"Thank you very much. I\n"
"hope your search for\n"
"{actor_name:7} yields success.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroTellOthers"
msgid "10368"
msgstr ""
"But tell me, what of\n"
"{actor_name:6} and the\n"
"others?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10369"
msgstr ""
"The same. We've searched\n"
"all over, but they're\n"
"nowhere to be found.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10370"
msgstr ""
"The ground tore apart\n"
"from the shock of the\n"
"lighthouse...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10371"
msgstr ""
"And then Idejima was\n"
"swept out to sea...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10372"
msgstr ""
"My goodness... Then...\n"
"{actor_name:6} and the others\n"
"must have...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10373"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:5} said at the\n"
"lighthouse that he sent\n"
"{actor_name:6} ahead to the ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10374"
msgstr ""
"But we think they\n"
"survived.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10375"
msgstr ""
"They may have been\n"
"washed out to sea\n"
"with Idejima...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10376"
msgstr ""
"So, we have decided to\n"
"continue searching for\n"
"{actor_name:6}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10377"
msgstr ""
"Haven't we,\n"
"{actor_name:1}?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10378"
msgstr ""
"You will find {actor_name:6}.\n"
"I know it...\n"
"Farewell.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroPleaseWaitForMeOutside"
msgid "10379"
msgstr ""
"Please wait for me\n"
"outside Faran's house.\n"
"I wish to speak with you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10380"
msgstr ""
"So, there are good folk\n"
"like {actor_name:1} and his\n"
"companions in Angara.{page_break}"
"Ah... If only I were\n"
"younger... I would travel\n"
"to Angara myself...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsIMustExplainTheirPromiseTo"
msgid "10381"
msgstr ""
"I must explain their\n"
"promise to Lord Babi,\n"
"before it's too late!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroWhereGoingIsaacIodemAsked"
msgid "10382"
msgstr ""
"Where are you going,\n"
"{actor_name:1}? Iodem asked us\n"
"to wait. Did you forget?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10383"
msgstr ""
"We're going to need\n"
"to work on your memory,\n"
"{actor_name:1}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10384"
msgstr ""
"I know we need to leave,\n"
"but we should hear\n"
"what Iodem has to say.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10385"
msgstr ""
"We can delay our\n"
"departure a little\n"
"longer. Let's wait.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10386"
msgstr ""
"Thank you for waiting\n"
"for me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10387"
msgstr ""
"As you no doubt have\n"
"guessed, I need to speak\n"
"with you about Lemuria.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10388"
msgstr ""
"Yes, the island of the\n"
"ancients far out\n"
"to sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10389"
msgstr ""
"When you could not find\n"
"{actor_name:6}, you returned to\n"
"Venus Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10390"
msgstr ""
"Yeah. The base of the\n"
"lighthouse was flooded,\n"
"so we couldn't get out.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10391"
msgstr ""
"And that's when you\n"
"gazed out to sea, as you\n"
"promised Babi you would.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10392"
msgstr ""
"Yes... And we saw an\n"
"area wrapped in mist.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10393"
msgstr ""
"I remembered how Babi\n"
"said Lemuria was always\n"
"covered in mist.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10394"
msgstr ""
"I am not sure, but I\n"
"am beginning to think\n"
"that may be Lemuria...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10395"
msgstr ""
"If it is, then\n"
"Babi's life...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10396"
msgstr "...could be saved? Yes.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10397"
msgstr ""
"Then I guess we have\n"
"no choice but to go...{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10398"
msgstr ""
"Good. Then it's settled.\n"
"I'll make arrangements for\n"
"you to leave at once.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10399"
msgstr ""
"You swore an oath.\n"
"It is meaningless unless\n"
"you go immediately.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10400"
msgstr ""
"But...we have to find\n"
"{actor_name:6} first...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10401"
msgstr ""
"That is the other reason\n"
"I wanted to see you...\n"
"to give you this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10402"
msgstr ""
"Iodem takes out\n"
"the Black Orb.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10403"
msgstr "Oh, isn't that...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10404"
msgstr ""
"You will need it to\n"
"sail Babi's ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroBabiToldMeShipAncients"
msgid "10405"
msgstr ""
"Babi told me the ship of\n"
"the ancients is an\n"
"incredible vessel.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10406"
msgstr ""
"It will make your search\n"
"for {actor_name:6} easier.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10407"
msgstr "We appreciate it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10408"
msgstr ""
"But I want you to find\n"
"Lemuria as soon as\n"
"possible.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10409"
msgstr ""
"We promised Babi we\n"
"would find Lemuria.\n"
"We will not fail him.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgGotBlackOrb"
msgid "10410"
msgstr "{actor_name:1} got the Black Orb.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10411"
msgstr ""
"The ship is docked at\n"
"the edge of town. You will\n"
"know it when you see it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10412"
msgstr ""
"Farewell! And bring back\n"
"news of Lemuria!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10413"
msgstr ""
"Right on, {actor_name:1}!\n"
"We finally get to see\n"
"the ocean!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10414"
msgstr "To sea we go!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10415"
msgstr "It is time to depart.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroThoughtShipWeSawAt"
msgid "10416"
msgstr ""
"I thought the ship we saw\n"
"at Idejima was Babi's...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10417"
msgstr ""
"His ship is here\n"
"in Lalivero.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10418"
msgstr ""
"So the ship at the\n"
"peninsula was Saturos's\n"
"ship!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10419"
msgstr ""
"Perhaps, but we have\n"
"no way of finding\n"
"that out now...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10420"
msgstr "Yes...{pause_20_skippable} They're gone...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10421"
msgstr ""
"But now we can sail\n"
"the ship of the ancients!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10422"
msgstr ""
"It certainly will aid us\n"
"in our search for {actor_name:6}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroWhereGoingArentWeTaking"
msgid "10423"
msgstr ""
"Where are you going?\n"
"Aren't we taking\n"
"Babi's ship?{page_break}"
"Then we should head to\n"
"that wharf the soldier\n"
"in town was guarding.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroWasToldLetInIf"
msgid "10424"
msgstr ""
"I was told to let you\n"
"in if you showed up...{page_break}"
"The door is open.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroApparentlyAShipHasBeenDocked"
msgid "10425"
msgstr ""
"Apparently, a ship has\n"
"been docked here all\n"
"this time...{page_break}"
"It must be a very\n"
"special ship.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroThisSureSeemsLikeAStrange"
msgid "10426"
msgstr ""
"This sure seems like a\n"
"strange place for Babi\n"
"to moor his yacht.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroHaHaIThoughtTheyHad"
msgid "10427"
msgstr ""
"Ha ha! I thought they had\n"
"done me in for sure,\n"
"but I'm all better now.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroIWillNeverLetMyGuard"
msgid "10428"
msgstr ""
"I will never let my\n"
"guard down again.{page_break}"
"We will be the ones to\n"
"protect Lalivero from\n"
"danger...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroWhereCouldActorBeNowIm"
msgid "10429"
msgstr ""
"Where could {actor_name:7} be\n"
"now? I'm so worried.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroLeavingLalivero"
msgid "10430"
msgstr ""
"Are you leaving\n"
"Lalivero?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10431"
msgstr ""
"I do not know where you\n"
"are headed, but wherever\n"
"it is, you will do fine.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10432"
msgstr ""
"You are staying?{page_break}"
"Splendid! Me and all the\n"
"Laliverans will feel\n"
"much safer.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroISawTheBeaconOfVenus"
msgid "10433"
msgstr ""
"I saw the beacon of\n"
"Venus Lighthouse\n"
"light up...{page_break}"
"It was one of the most\n"
"beautiful sights I\n"
"have ever seen...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroTheExplosionInTheVenusRuins"
msgid "10434"
msgstr ""
"The explosion in the\n"
"Venus ruins caused Babi\n"
"Lighthouse to crumble.{page_break}"
"The works of man can\n"
"never withstand such\n"
"mystical power.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroThePeninsulaBehindVenusLighthouseIs"
msgid "10435"
msgstr ""
"The peninsula behind\n"
"Venus Lighthouse\n"
"is flooded...{page_break}"
"The powers of the\n"
"ancients are fierce!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroICantBelieveYouEscapedVenus"
msgid "10436"
msgstr ""
"I can't believe you\n"
"escaped Venus Lighthouse.{page_break}"
"What? The tunnel under\n"
"the lighthouse is not\n"
"flooded? So that's how{page_break}"
"you came back, huh?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroIfYouDefeatedThatEvilBunch"
msgid "10437"
msgstr ""
"If you defeated that evil\n"
"bunch, you must be\n"
"mighty warriors!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroActorJumpedIntoTheOceanFrom"
msgid "10438"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} jumped into the\n"
"ocean from atop the\n"
"lighthouse? Unbelievable!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroNoTrespassingDangerBeyondThisPoint"
msgid "10439"
msgstr ""
"No trespassing.\n"
"Danger beyond\n"
"this point.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroIAmAllHealedNowBut"
msgid "10440"
msgstr ""
"I am all healed now, but\n"
"I lost all my confidence\n"
"after being beaten.{page_break}"
"Even if I return to\n"
"Tolbi, I will never\n"
"fight again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroIWantedToBeAPart"
msgid "10441"
msgstr ""
"I wanted to be a part\n"
"of the battle at\n"
"Venus Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroIfActorUsedHerGreatPowers"
msgid "10442"
msgstr ""
"If {actor_name:7} used her great\n"
"powers{pause_20_skippable}, then she must\n"
"still be alive.{page_break}"
"But surviving such\n"
"rough seas must be\n"
"very difficult.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroAfterEverythingThatsHappenedLaliveroNo"
msgid "10443"
msgstr ""
"After everything that's\n"
"happened, Lalivero no\n"
"longer feels safe.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroVenusLighthouseHasBeenTheSymbol"
msgid "10444"
msgstr ""
"Venus Lighthouse has been\n"
"the symbol of Lalivero\n"
"since the olden days...{page_break}"
"The lighting of the beacon\n"
"may be a sign of good\n"
"things to come...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroIodemOfTolbiDoesntSeemToo"
msgid "10445"
msgstr ""
"Iodem of Tolbi doesn't\n"
"seem too disappointed\n"
"about Babi Lighthouse...{page_break}"
"It must have just\n"
"been another whim of\n"
"that tyrant, Babi...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroTheOceanIsSoRoughSince"
msgid "10446"
msgstr ""
"The ocean is so rough\n"
"since the peninsula\n"
"was washed away.{page_break}"
"They say one strange\n"
"event invites another...\n"
"leading to great disaster.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroVenusLighthouseIsStillStandingStrong"
msgid "10447"
msgstr ""
"Venus Lighthouse is\n"
"still standing strong\n"
"despite what happened.{page_break}"
"It must have been\n"
"built by the gods...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroYouMustBeGreatWarriorsTo"
msgid "10448"
msgstr ""
"You must be great\n"
"warriors to defeat\n"
"them...{page_break}"
"Can I become\n"
"your apprentice?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroActorWouldBeFineEvenAfter"
msgid "10449"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} would be fine{em_dash}\n"
"even after falling from\n"
"such a height...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsTheContinentBrokeApartAroundThe"
msgid "10450"
msgstr ""
"The continent broke apart\n"
"around the lighthouse,\n"
"and the lands beyond it{page_break}"
"are now far from the\n"
"continent of Gondowan.\n"
"Will they ever return?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsWhatHappenedToThoseLivingOn"
msgid "10451"
msgstr ""
"What happened to those\n"
"living on the other\n"
"side of the lighthouse?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsIShudderToThinkWhatWould"
msgid "10452"
msgstr ""
"I shudder to think what\n"
"would happen if our town\n"
"was washed out to sea.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsWereLuckyThatWeLiveNorth"
msgid "10453"
msgstr ""
"We're lucky that we live\n"
"north of the lighthouse.{page_break}"
"If we didn't, we\n"
"wouldn't have made it.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsEveryoneSaysThatActorIsOkay"
msgid "10454"
msgstr ""
"Everyone says that\n"
"{actor_name:7} is okay...\n"
"Is that true?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsIRealizedHowThoughtlessIWas"
msgid "10455"
msgstr ""
"I realized how thoughtless\n"
"I was after what\n"
"happened...{page_break}"
"Lalivero needs {actor_name:7}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsIfSheIsIndeedTheChild"
msgid "10456"
msgstr ""
"If she is indeed the\n"
"child of the gods,\n"
"she will survive.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsWeWantToBelieveInSomething"
msgid "10457"
msgstr ""
"We want to believe in\n"
"something at times\n"
"like this.{page_break}"
"If we had {actor_name:7} now,\n"
"I could have relied on\n"
"her.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsActorShouldBeFineSheWas"
msgid "10458"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} should be fine.\n"
"She was fine when\n"
"she fell from the sky.{page_break}"
"The height of the\n"
"lighthouse is nothing\n"
"to her!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsActorWillWakeWhenTheBeacon"
msgid "10459"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:7} will wake when the\n"
"beacon in Venus\n"
"Lighthouse is lit.{page_break}"
"Then, Lalivero will be\n"
"free from Tolbi's\n"
"grip...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsSeeingActorDiveMustHaveBeen"
msgid "10460"
msgstr ""
"Seeing {actor_name:7} dive must\n"
"have been beautiful...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsICantWaitUntilActorIs"
msgid "10461"
msgstr ""
"I can't wait until\n"
"{actor_name:7} is back.{page_break}"
"All of Lalivero is\n"
"awaiting her return.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsBabiLighthouseCrumbledWhenAllThe"
msgid "10462"
msgstr ""
"Babi Lighthouse crumbled\n"
"when all the lands shook.{page_break}"
"No one can enter now\n"
"because it is too\n"
"dangerous inside.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsIAlwaysWantedABreakBut"
msgid "10463"
msgstr ""
"I always wanted a break,\n"
"but being on vacation\n"
"all the time is no fun.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsSoTheRuinsReallyAreConnected"
msgid "10464"
msgstr ""
"So the ruins really are\n"
"connected to Venus\n"
"Lighthouse. I knew it!{page_break}"
"What {actor_name:7} said was\n"
"true!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsYouFinallySolvedTheMysteryOf"
msgid "10465"
msgstr ""
"You finally solved\n"
"the mystery of the ruins...{page_break}"
"I had no idea these ruins\n"
"were connected to\n"
"Venus Lighthouse.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsWillTheyContinueOnOrQuit"
msgid "10466"
msgstr ""
"Will they continue on,\n"
"or quit now that Babi\n"
"Lighthouse has crumbled?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsImWorriedThatWeWontGet"
msgid "10467"
msgstr ""
"I'm worried that we won't\n"
"get paid now that the\n"
"construction has ended.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsWeCantPossiblyDigAHole"
msgid "10468"
msgstr ""
"We can't possibly dig a\n"
"hole from here to Venus\n"
"Lighthouse.{page_break}"
"It must have been very\n"
"difficult for those\n"
"who made this tunnel.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsTheMysteryOfTheRuinsShould"
msgid "10469"
msgstr ""
"The mystery of the\n"
"ruins should have\n"
"remained a mystery.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsFaranSaysKnowingHerPowersActor"
msgid "10470"
msgstr ""
"Faran says knowing her\n"
"powers, {actor_name:7} is alive\n"
"without a doubt.{page_break}"
"But I can't be as sure\n"
"as Faran until I see\n"
"her.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsYouAreLeavingAfterAllArent"
msgid "10471"
msgstr ""
"You are leaving after\n"
"all, aren't you...{page_break}"
"You are welcome in\n"
"Lalivero anytime.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsTheySayTheLighthouseCrumbledDown"
msgid "10472"
msgstr ""
"They say the lighthouse\n"
"crumbled down.\n"
"That's as it should be.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsYouWillFindJennaSomedayFarewell"
msgid "10473"
msgstr ""
"You will find {actor_name:6}\n"
"someday. Farewell.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsIsaacThatBoatBelongsToYou"
msgid "10474"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1}, that boat belongs\n"
"to you now.{page_break}"
"Do not hesitate to use\n"
"it any way you wish.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsIDontNeedFameOrFortune"
msgid "10475"
msgstr ""
"I don't need fame or\n"
"fortune...{pause_20_skippable} I just want\n"
"{actor_name:7} to be safe.{page_break}"
"{actor_name:7}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsWhyWontAnyoneStopIsaacAnd"
msgid "10476"
msgstr ""
"Why won't anyone stop\n"
"{actor_name:1} and his friends\n"
"from leaving us?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsTolbiIsToBeBlamedFor"
msgid "10477"
msgstr ""
"Tolbi is to be blamed\n"
"for what happened to\n"
"{actor_name:7}!{page_break}"
"Tolbi should be\n"
"cursed and destroyed!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsSoThereAreSomePeopleLike"
msgid "10478"
msgstr ""
"So there are some people\n"
"like {actor_name:1} and his\n"
"friends in Angara...{page_break}"
"If only I were a\n"
"little younger...\n"
"I'd go to Angara...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsPleaseUseThatShipToFind"
msgid "10479"
msgstr ""
"Please use that ship to\n"
"find Lemuria, the land\n"
"that Lord Babi sought.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroWentOceanLook"
msgid "10480"
msgstr ""
"I went to the ocean to\n"
"look for {actor_name:7} today,\n"
"but it was so rough.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsNoOneCouldPossiblySwimIn"
msgid "10481"
msgstr ""
"No one could\n"
"possibly swim in an\n"
"ocean that rough.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroWantedSendShips"
msgid "10482"
msgstr ""
"We wanted to send ships\n"
"out to sea to find {actor_name:7},\n"
"but we can't yet.{page_break}"
"The ships would\n"
"all capsize in the\n"
"rough waters.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsWhenWillTheOceanBeCalm"
msgid "10483"
msgstr ""
"When will the ocean\n"
"be calm again?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroImpossibleGoOcean"
msgid "10484"
msgstr ""
"It is impossible to go\n"
"out on the ocean now. Be\n"
"careful when you do.{page_break}"
"The Champa who rule the\n"
"seas are frightful\n"
"people. Beware.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsTheChampaArePeopleFromA"
msgid "10485"
msgstr ""
"The Champa are people\n"
"from a coastal village\n"
"in Angara.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroDidntKnowTime"
msgid "10486"
msgstr ""
"I didn't know it at the\n"
"time, but that loud noise\n"
"was the sound of the{page_break}"
"beacon being lit. The inn\n"
"guests all became\n"
"scared and ran outside.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsIMustSayItIsNice"
msgid "10487"
msgstr ""
"I must say, it is nice\n"
"to see the light of\n"
"the beacon at night.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsFishingIsSoDifficultNowadaysBecause"
msgid "10488"
msgstr ""
"Fishing is so difficult\n"
"nowadays because the\n"
"ocean is so rough.{page_break}"
"We have little to cook\n"
"when we can't fish.\n"
"That's no good for us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsWhyWouldTheLightingMakeSuch"
msgid "10489"
msgstr ""
"Why would the lighting\n"
"make such a loud\n"
"noise?{page_break}"
"Was that the noise\n"
"of that star-like thing\n"
"above the lighthouse?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsImSleepyTheseBrightNightsHave"
msgid "10490"
msgstr ""
"I'm sleepy. These bright\n"
"nights have been keeping\n"
"me up late.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsGeeWhatAmIGoingTo"
msgid "10491"
msgstr ""
"Gee... What am I\n"
"going to cook\n"
"for dinner tonight?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroBabiLighthouseStruck"
msgid "10492"
msgstr ""
"Babi Lighthouse was\n"
"struck down, just as I\n"
"knew it would be.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLaliveroInteriorsFirstTheLighthouseWasStruckDown"
msgid "10493"
msgstr ""
"First, the lighthouse was\n"
"struck down. Next, Babi\n"
"himself will be punished.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgFieldLooksLikeFinally"
msgid "10494"
msgstr ""
"It looks like it's\n"
"finally time to\n"
"leave Gondowan.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10495"
msgstr ""
"It's so strange...\n"
"We've been traveling\n"
"for so long,{page_break}"
"and yet it feels like\n"
"we've only just begun.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10496"
msgstr ""
"Now that I think about\n"
"it, so many things\n"
"have happened.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10497"
msgstr ""
"But our journey will be\n"
"over as soon as we\n"
"find {actor_name:6}, right?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10498"
msgstr ""
"The end of one journey,\n"
"but the beginning of\n"
"another? No way!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10499"
msgstr ""
"What did you say?\n"
"Our next journey?\n"
"What journey is that?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10500"
msgstr ""
"You didn't forget,\n"
"did you, {actor_name:2}?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10501"
msgstr "Our promise to Babi.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10502"
msgstr "Oh... Lemuria!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10503"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what kind of\n"
"place Lemuria is.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10504"
msgstr ""
"We have to find\n"
"{actor_name:6} before going\n"
"to Lemuria, don't we?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10505"
msgstr "Yeah. That's important.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10506"
msgstr ""
"Huh? {actor_name:6}'s going to be\n"
"very sad when I tell\n"
"her what you said!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10507"
msgstr ""
"At any rate, this will\n"
"be our first time on\n"
"the ocean.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10508"
msgstr ""
"So this is the ocean\n"
"Kraden wanted me to see.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10509"
msgstr ""
"The seas are very rough.\n"
"Do you think we will\n"
"be okay?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10510"
msgstr ""
"This is a Lemurian ship.\n"
"We'll be fine.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10511"
msgstr ""
"I guess it's hard\n"
"to say. Still, we must\n"
"go, just the same...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10512"
msgstr "Well... Shall we, then?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10513"
msgstr "To sea...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10514"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:6} is waiting\n"
"for us!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgWorldMapKradenHowLongWillIsland"
msgid "10515"
msgstr ""
"Oh, Kraden... How long\n"
"will this island\n"
"continue to drift?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10516"
msgstr ""
"I don't know...\n"
"I wish you could\n"
"tell me.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10517"
msgstr ""
"Sheesh... You're no help\n"
"in times like this.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10518"
msgstr "Hey, I'm hungry...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10519"
msgstr ""
"How can you think\n"
"about food?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10520"
msgstr ""
"I wonder what\n"
"happened to my\n"
"brother...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10521"
msgstr ""
"I can't be certain,{pause_20_skippable} but\n"
"it looks like they lit\n"
"the Venus beacon.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10522"
msgstr ""
"You don't have to tell me\n"
"that. That's how we wound\n"
"up adrift at sea, right?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10523"
msgstr ""
"You are so cranky\n"
"today, {actor_name:6}!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10524"
msgstr ""
"Well,{pause_20_skippable} I suppose you\n"
"must be worried about\n"
"{actor_name:5}.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10525"
msgstr ""
"{actor_name:1} and his friends\n"
"must have been\n"
"nearby, too.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10526"
msgstr "They probably were...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10527"
msgstr ""
"I miss them...\n"
"{actor_name:1}...\n"
"{actor_name:5}...{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10528"
msgstr ""
"There is something I\n"
"wish to show you.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10529"
msgstr "Walk this way.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10530"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}... {actor_name:7}...{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10531"
msgstr "{actor_name:5}! {actor_name:7}!{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10532"
msgstr "They... {pause_20_skippable}They're alive.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10533"
msgstr "They're alive!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10534"
msgstr ""
"What is this?\n"
"Alex, what happened?{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLobbyLinkDisconnected"
msgid "10535"
msgstr ""
"The link was\n"
"disconnected.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLobbyAwaitingOpponent"
msgid "10536"
msgstr "Awaiting your opponent...{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgLobbyNoteCantUse"
msgid "10537"
msgstr ""
"Note: you can't use\n"
"the sleep function in\n"
"battle stages!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLobbySavingBattleResults"
msgid "10538"
msgstr "Saving battle results.{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgLobbyBattleResultsSaved"
msgid "10539"
msgstr "Battle results were saved.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLobbySavingMonsterBattle"
msgid "10540"
msgstr ""
"Saving Monster Battle\n"
"results.{end_now}"

msgctxt "MsgLobbyMonsterBattleResults"
msgid "10541"
msgstr ""
"Monster Battle results\n"
"were saved.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLobbyWantParticipatePlease"
msgid "10542"
msgstr ""
"If you want to\n"
"participate, please\n"
"step into the circle!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgFieldWelcomeToBattleArenaWherePeople"
msgid "10543"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to Battle Arena,\n"
"where people craving\n"
"battle meet!{page_break}"
"Test your skills in\n"
"Linked Battles and\n"
"Monster Battles!{page_break}"
"Speak to the girl\n"
"at the counter if you\n"
"want a fight!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLobbyPleaseSpeakWhen"
msgid "10544"
msgstr ""
"Please speak to me\n"
"when you want to\n"
"fight in a battle.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10545"
msgstr "Would you like to apply?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10546"
msgstr ""
"Your opponent has\n"
"asked for a battle.{page_break}"
"Do you accept?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10547"
msgstr ""
"When you finish your\n"
"preparations, please\n"
"step into the circle!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10548"
msgstr ""
"You have asked for a\n"
"battle.{page_break}"
"We will call your name\n"
"if your opponent accepts.\n"
"Please wait.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10549"
msgstr ""
"You do not have an\n"
"opponent. Would you like\n"
"to battle a monster?{end_now}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10550"
msgstr ""
"Please wait until an\n"
"opponent arrives, then.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10551"
msgstr ""
"When you finish your\n"
"preparations, please\n"
"step into the circle!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "message"
msgid "10552"
msgstr ""
"The monster has finished\n"
"its preparations.{page_break}"
"Please finish your\n"
"preparations, then\n"
"enter the circle.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLobbyWonNumberBattle"
msgid "10553"
msgstr ""
"You won {argument_signed_number}\n"
"battle{plural_suffix}.{page_break}"
"Please speak to me\n"
"when you wish to\n"
"battle again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLobbyWonNumberBattleTold"
msgid "10554"
msgstr ""
"You won {argument_signed_number}\n"
"battle{plural_suffix}.{page_break}"
"I told you our\n"
"monsters were tough!\n"
"Please try again.{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLobbyGoodLuck"
msgid "10555"
msgstr "Good luck!{end_wait}"

msgctxt "MsgLobbyWonNumberBattleBroke"
msgid "10556"
msgstr ""
"You won {argument_signed_number}\n"
"battle{plural_suffix}.\n"
"You broke the record!{end_wait}"

